#: src/quick-start/installation.md:5
msgid ""
"**Depend on the engine crates** from your own Rust project through a Cargo git dependency. This is the intended path — your `Cargo.toml` names this repository and a commit, and the engine (lexer, parser, compiler, typed bytecode, VM) builds as part of _your_ build, ready to [embed](../reference/embedding.md)."
msgstr ""
"**依赖引擎 crate**——通过 Cargo git 依赖，从你自己的 Rust 项目。这是预期的路径——你的 `Cargo.toml` 写明这个仓库和一个提交，引擎（词法分析器、语法分析器、编译器、类型化字节码、VM）就作为_你的_构建的一部分编译出来，随时可以[嵌入](../reference/embedding.md)。"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:10
msgid ""
"**Build the `rut` CLI** from a checkout of this repository — the **temporary-run** lane: running module directories and bundles, `fmt`, `dump`, `pack`. The fastest way to poke at the language; not the way anyone ships."
msgstr ""
"**从这个仓库的检出构建 `rut` CLI**——**临时运行**车道：运行模块目录与捆绑包，`fmt`、`dump`、`pack`。是把玩这门语言最快的路；不是用来交付软件的路。"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:15
msgid ""
"Both lanes build the same engine, and the crates are not published to crates.io — the git dependency is the only consumption path."
msgstr "两条车道构建的是同一个引擎，而且这些 crate 没有发布到 crates.io——git 依赖是唯一的获取途径。"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:18
msgid "Use rut in your project"
msgstr "在你的项目中使用 rut"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:20
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:22
msgid ""
"**Rust (nightly)** — the repo pins an exact nightly in `rust-toolchain.toml` (because `rut-vm-threaded` uses incomplete features); `rustup` installs it on the first build. Any recent `rustup` works."
msgstr ""
"**Rust（nightly）**——仓库在 `rust-toolchain.toml` 里锁定了一个确切的 nightly（因为 `rut-vm-threaded` 使用了未完成的特性）；首次构建时 `rustup` 会安装它。任何较新的 `rustup` 都行。"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:26
msgid "**git** — to fetch the dependency."
msgstr "**git**——用于拉取依赖。"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:28
msgid ""
"**Node.js 20+** — only if you want to build or drive the wasm playground (the rest of the book does not need it)."
msgstr "**Node.js 20+**——仅当你要构建或驱动 wasm Playground 时才需要（本书的其余部分用不到它）。"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:31
msgid ""
"No checkout of this repository is needed — your `Cargo.toml` does everything."
msgstr "不需要检出这个仓库——你的 `Cargo.toml` 包办一切。"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:34
msgid "Depend on the crates"
msgstr "依赖这些 crate"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:36
msgid "Name the engine crates as git dependencies:"
msgstr "把引擎 crate 写成 git 依赖："


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:38 src/reference/embedding.md:19
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[dependencies]\n"
"rut-driver = { git = \"https://github.com/hpp2334/rut.git\", rev = \"<commit-hash>\" }\n"
"rut-core   = { git = \"https://github.com/hpp2334/rut.git\", rev = \"<commit-hash>\" }\n"
"rut-parser = { git = \"https://github.com/hpp2334/rut.git\", rev = \"<commit-hash>\" }\n"
"rut-vm     = { git = \"https://github.com/hpp2334/rut.git\", rev = \"<commit-hash>\" }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:46
msgid "Grab the current commit and drop it into every `rev`:"
msgstr "取到当前提交，填进每一个 `rev`："


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:52
msgid ""
"Pin **all** the rut crates to the **same** rev — cargo then resolves them to a single checkout, one consistent engine. These four are the minimal embedder set: the driver pipeline, binary decode, the parser's `Mode`, and verify + the VM itself."
msgstr ""
"把**所有** rut crate 锁定到**同一个** rev——cargo 随后会把它们解析到同一次检出，一个自洽的引擎。这四个是最小嵌入方集合：驱动器管线、二进制解码、语法分析器的 `Mode`，以及 verify 加 VM 本体。"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:57
msgid "Pin the nightly"
msgstr "锁定 nightly"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:59
msgid ""
"`rut-vm` depends on `rut-vm-threaded`, which uses the incomplete `#![feature(explicit_tail_calls)]` and `#![feature(rust_preserve_none_cc)]` — a stable toolchain refuses to build it. Give your project the same pin the repo uses (check this repo's `rust-toolchain.toml` for the current value):"
msgstr ""
"`rut-vm` 依赖 `rut-vm-threaded`，后者使用了未完成的 `#![feature(explicit_tail_calls)]` 和 `#![feature(rust_preserve_none_cc)]`——稳定版工具链拒绝编译它。给你的项目配上与仓库相同的锁定（当前值查看这个仓库的 `rust-toolchain.toml`）："


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:65
