#: src/quick-start/installation.md:145
msgid ""
"The binary embeds the whole engine: lexer, parser, compiler, typed bytecode, and the VM. It also carries the vendored packages from the repo's `rut/` directory (`core`, `pouch`, `ink`, `json`, …) — a program says `use ink::{ Logger };` and mounts the package through its manifest's `deps` row, since every rut program is a module directory ([your first rut program](first-program.md))."
msgstr ""
"这个二进制内嵌了整个引擎：词法分析器、语法分析器、编译器、类型化字节码和 VM。它还携带仓库 `rut/` 目录里自带的包（`core`、`pouch`、`ink`、`json` 等）——程序写一行 `use ink::{ Logger };`，再通过清单的 `deps` 行挂载这个包，因为每个 rut 程序都是一个模块目录（[你的第一个 rut 程序](first-program.md)）。"


#: src/quick-start/installation.md:152
