#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:3
msgid ""
"rut feels like TypeScript on the surface and Rust underneath the hood. This page walks one program through the whole toolchain — running, formatting, inspecting, and budgeting — so every later page can assume the workflow."
msgstr ""
"rut 表面感觉像 TypeScript，引擎盖之下是 Rust。本页带着一个程序走完整条工具链——运行、格式化、检视、预算控制——之后的每一页都可以默认这套工作流。"


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:8
msgid "Write and run"
msgstr "编写并运行"


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:10
msgid ""
"This chapter drives everything through the temporary-run `rut` CLI — the fastest lane for learning the language ([installation](installation.md)). A real project embeds the engine instead and calls it from Rust ([embedding and native modules](../reference/embedding.md)); the language, the types, and the workflow below are the same either way."
msgstr ""
"本章的一切都通过临时运行的 `rut` CLI 驱动——这是学这门语言最快的车道（[安装](installation.md)）。真实的项目则会嵌入引擎并从 Rust 调用它（[嵌入与原生模块](../reference/embedding.md)）；无论哪种方式，语言、类型和下面的工作流都是一样的。"


