"```"


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:26
msgid ""
"Every rut program is a **module directory**: a `rut.jsonc` naming the package and its dependencies, plus the source file the manifest points at. Create it and run the directory:"
msgstr "每个 rut 程序都是一个**模块目录**：一个 `rut.jsonc` 指名包与它的依赖，外加清单指向的那个源文件。创建它并运行这个目录："


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:32
msgid ""
"<<'EOF'\n"
"// hello/rut.jsonc — the manifest IS the program's door\n"
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"hello\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"lib\": \"./main.rut\" },\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    // the vendored logger package, from a dir at the repo root\n"
"    \"ink\": { \"path\": \"../rut/ink\" }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"EOF\n"
"# save the program above as hello/main.rut, then:\n"
"rut run hello\n"
msgstr ""


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:51
msgid "Three things to notice:"
msgstr "三个值得注意的点："


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:53
msgid ""
"**One directory with a `rut.jsonc` is one program.** The manifest is the runnable unit — `rut run <dir>` (or a packed `.rutbundle`) is the only run lane. Inside the package, one file is one module; cross-module code is reached through `use` paths (see the [modules tutorial](../tutorial/modules.md))."
msgstr ""
"**一个带 `rut.jsonc` 的目录就是一个程序。**清单是可运行单元——`rut run <dir>`（或打包好的 `.rutbundle`）是唯一的车道。在包内，一个文件就是一个模块；跨模块代码经由 `use` 路径到达（参见[模块教程](../tutorial/modules.md)）。"


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:58
msgid ""
"**`use ink::{ Logger };`** pulls `Logger` out of the `ink` package — and the manifest's `deps` row is what mounts it: a `use` line says _which_ names the program wants, the manifest says _where_ the package lives ([project structure](../reference/project-structure.md))."
msgstr ""
"**`use ink::{ Logger };`** 把 `Logger` 从 `ink` 包里取出来——而真正挂载它的是清单的 `deps` 行：一行 `use` 说明程序要_哪些_名字，清单说明包住在_哪里_（[项目结构](../reference/project-structure.md)）。"


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:62
msgid ""
"**`f\"hello, {name}!\"`** is a format literal: `{expr}` interpolates any expression, rendered through the value's display contract."
msgstr "**`f\"hello, {name}!\"`** 是格式化字面量：`{expr}` 插值任意表达式，并经由该值的 display 契约渲染。"


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:65
msgid "`pub fn main()` is the entry the CLI calls."
msgstr "`pub fn main()` 是 CLI 调用的入口。"


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:67
msgid "Values, briefly"
msgstr "值：速览"


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:69
msgid "Extend the file — rut infers, and every type is known at compile time:"
msgstr "扩展这个文件——rut 会推断，且每个类型在编译期都已知："


#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:71
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"hello\");\n"
"    let n = 10;            // i32 — the integer default\n"
"    let scale = 1.5;       // f32 — the float default\n"
"    let big: u64 = 10;     // u64 via annotation — fits the default\n"
"    let flags = [1, 2, 3]; // [i32] — a fixed heap cell\n"
"    let mut sum = 0;       // `mut` — this one is written to\n"
"    for (let x of flags) {\n"
"        sum += x * n;\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"sum={sum} scale={scale}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"hello\");\n"
"    let n = 10;            // i32 — the integer default\n"
"    let scale = 1.5;       // f32 — the float default\n"
"    let big: u64 = 10;     // u64 via annotation — fits the default\n"
"    let flags = [1, 2, 3]; // [i32] — a fixed heap cell\n"
"    let mut sum = 0;       // `mut` — this one is written to\n"
"    for (let x of flags) {\n"
"        sum += x * n;\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"sum={sum} scale={scale}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


