#: src/quick-start/playground.md:3
msgid ""
"The playground is the zero-install way to run rut: the whole engine — lexer, parser, compiler, VM — compiled to WebAssembly and served as a static page. It is deployed at **<https://playground.rut.hpp2334.com>**."
msgstr ""
"Playground 是零安装运行 rut 的方式：整个引擎——词法分析器、语法分析器、编译器、VM——被编译成 WebAssembly，作为一个静态页面提供服务。它部署在 **<https://playground.rut.hpp2334.com>**。"


#: src/quick-start/playground.md:8
msgid "The layout"
msgstr "页面布局"


#: src/quick-start/playground.md:10
msgid ""
"**Case list** — prepared programs, ordered the way the repo's own gate runs them: algorithms first (sieve, quicksort, matrix multiply), then language-surface tours (classes, closures & generics, structs, literals, checked arithmetic, str views, bytes, opaque, when, maps & sets, type aliases), then memory shapes (node cycle, tree, weak cache)."
msgstr ""
"**用例列表**——预先准备好的程序，排列顺序与仓库自家门禁运行它们的顺序一致：先是算法（筛法、快速排序、矩阵乘法），再是语言表面的巡礼（类、闭包与泛型、结构体、字面量、checked 算术、str 视图、bytes、opaque、when、映射与集合、类型别名），最后是内存形态（节点循环引用、树、弱引用缓存）。"


#: src/quick-start/playground.md:16
msgid ""
"**Editor** — the case's source, live-editable. The cases are read from the same `.rut` files the repository's native test gate compiles and runs, so what you edit is the real corpus, not a copy."
msgstr "**编辑器**——用例的源码，可实时编辑。用例读取自仓库原生测试门禁编译运行的同一批 `.rut` 文件，因此你编辑的是真实语料，不是副本。"


#: src/quick-start/playground.md:19
msgid ""
"**Output / AST / IR panes** — every run shows the program's real output plus the two compile views: the parsed AST and the typed IR the compiler lowers to. `rut dump <file>` prints the same structures from the CLI."
msgstr ""
"**输出 / AST / IR 面板**——每次运行都显示程序的真实输出，外加两个编译视图：解析出的 AST 和编译器最终下降到的类型化 IR。`rut dump <file>` 从 CLI 打印同样的结构。"


#: src/quick-start/playground.md:23
msgid ""
"**Budget control** — fuel is **off by default**: an explicit ▶ Run is uncapped, and a non-terminating program freezes the tab — that is what uncapped means. The checkbox arms the fuel box (seeded at 10,000,000; heap defaults to 4 MiB): a run that exhausts its fuel parks on the out-of-fuel trap, and the Resume control adds fuel and continues the _same_ frame — structured-concurrency-grade resumption, not a restart. Auto-runs (case selection, edits) keep an internal 1M watchdog slice so a stray loop parks instead of freezing the page."
msgstr ""
"**预算控制**——燃料**默认关闭**：显式的 ▶ Run 不设上限，不终止的程序会冻住标签页——不设上限就是这个意思。复选框启用燃料框（初始 10,000,000；堆默认 4 MiB）：耗尽燃料的运行会停在燃料耗尽的陷阱上，Resume 控件追加燃料并继续_同一个_帧——结构化并发级别的恢复，不是重启。自动运行（选择用例、编辑）保留内部 1M 燃料的看门狗份额，让迷失的循环停驻，而不是冻住页面。"


#: src/quick-start/playground.md:33
msgid "No silent fallback"
msgstr "无静默回退"


#: src/quick-start/playground.md:35
msgid ""
"The page probes the wasm artifact at boot. If the engine or the syntax-highlighting module is missing or invalid, you get a full-page error naming the exact build command — the panes never mount in a degraded mode. On the deployed site this never happens; when you run a local build (below), the preflight exists so a stale artifact cannot masquerade as a working playground."
msgstr ""
"页面在启动时会探测 wasm 产物。如果引擎或语法高亮模块缺失或无效，你会看到一个整页错误，写明确切的构建命令——各面板绝不会以降级模式挂载。在部署的站点上这永远不会发生；当你运行本地构建（见下）时，这道预检是为了让陈旧的产物无法冒充可用的 Playground。"


#: src/quick-start/playground.md:42
msgid "Running it locally"
msgstr "在本地运行"


#: src/quick-start/playground.md:47
msgid ""
"# builds rut.wasm + rut-lsp.wasm, copies to public/\n"
