#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:3
msgid ""
"Every value in rut has a type, and every type is known at compile time. This chapter covers the primitive types, how literals infer their types, how bindings work, and the one rule that organizes everything else: **primitives copy, every other value is a shared cell**."
msgstr ""
"rut 里的每个值都有一个类型，而且每个类型在编译期都已知。本章覆盖基本类型、字面量如何推断类型、绑定如何工作，以及组织其余一切的那条规则：**基本类型复制，其余所有值都是共享单元**。"


