#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:28
msgid "Variables: `let` and `let mut`"
msgstr "变量：`let` 与 `let mut`"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:30
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"vars\");\n"
"    let a = 10;          // an immutable binding\n"
"    let mut b = 10;      // a mutable binding\n"
"    b = 20;              // OK — b may be reassigned\n"
"    // a = 30;           // ERROR: a is not `mut`\n"
"    log.info(f\"a={a} b={b}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"vars\");\n"
"    let a = 10;          // an immutable binding\n"
"    let mut b = 10;      // a mutable binding\n"
"    b = 20;              // OK — b may be reassigned\n"
"    // a = 30;           // ERROR: a is not `mut`\n"
"    log.info(f\"a={a} b={b}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:47
msgid ""
"`mut` is permission to write _through that name_: reassigning the binding, assigning to a field (`p.x = 3`), or assigning to an element (`xs[0] = 7`). Sharing is not gated by `mut` — two bindings can name the same value, and what `mut` controls is only who may write."
msgstr ""
"`mut` 是_经由那个名字写入_的许可：重新赋值这个绑定、给字段赋值（`p.x = 3`）、或给元素赋值（`xs[0] = 7`）。共享不以 `mut` 为门槛——两个绑定可以指同一个值，而 `mut` 控制的只是谁可以写。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:52
msgid ""
"Every type has a zero value: `0` for numbers, `false` for `bool`, the empty string, `nil` for nullables. Omit a field in a struct literal and it takes the field's initializer if there is one, else the type's zero value (see [structs, enums, and classes](types.md))."
msgstr ""
"每个类型都有零值：数字是 `0`，`bool` 是 `false`，字符串是空串，可空类型是 `nil`。在结构体字面量里省略一个字段，若该字段有初始化器，就取初始化器，否则取该类型的零值（参见[结构体、枚举与类](types.md)）。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:57
msgid "Numbers"
msgstr "数字"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:59
msgid ""
"An unsuffixed integer literal defaults to `i32`; an unsuffixed float defaults to `f32`. The default is also a _ceiling_: a literal adapts to the expected type only while it fits the default."
msgstr ""
"不带后缀的整数字面量默认为 `i32`；不带后缀的浮点字面量默认为 `f32`。默认值同时也是_上限_：只有当字面量装得进默认类型时，它才会适配到期望的类型。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:63
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"numbers\");\n"
"    let a = 10;                        // i32\n"
"    let b = 10u8;                      // u8 via suffix\n"
"    let c: u64 = 10;                   // u64 via annotation — 10 fits\n"
"    let big = 18446744073709551615u64; // past the i32 default: suffix required\n"
"    let d = 1.5;                       // f32\n"
"    let d64: f64 = 1.5;                // f64 via annotation\n"
"    let hex = 0xFF_u32;                // 0x / 0b / 0o bases, _ separators\n"
"    log.info(f\"a={a} d={d} d64={d64} hex={hex} big={big}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"numbers\");\n"
"    let a = 10;                        // i32\n"
"    let b = 10u8;                      // u8 via suffix\n"
"    let c: u64 = 10;                   // u64 via annotation — 10 fits\n"
"    let big = 18446744073709551615u64; // past the i32 default: suffix required\n"
"    let d = 1.5;                       // f32\n"
"    let d64: f64 = 1.5;                // f64 via annotation\n"
"    let hex = 0xFF_u32;                // 0x / 0b / 0o bases, _ separators\n"
"    log.info(f\"a={a} d={d} d64={d64} hex={hex} big={big}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:83
msgid ""
"Conversions are explicit casts: `expr as T`. Casts truncate like C — they never trap."
msgstr "转换是显式的：`expr as T`。`as` 转换像 C 一样截断——绝不触发陷阱。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:86
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"casts\");\n"
"    let cast = 300 as u8;   // 44 — keeps the low 8 bits\n"
"    log.info(f\"cast={cast}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"casts\");\n"
"    let cast = 300 as u8;   // 44 — keeps the low 8 bits\n"
"    log.info(f\"cast={cast}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:100
msgid "Arithmetic has two sharp edges:"
msgstr "算术有两处锋利的边缘："


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:102
msgid ""
"**Mixed widths do not mix.** Both operands must have the same width — convert one side first. `let mut total = 0.0;` makes an `f32`, and adding an `f64` to it is a type error; annotate `let mut total: f64 = 0.0;` when you mean double precision."
msgstr ""
"**不同宽度不能混用。**两个操作数必须有相同的宽度——先把其中一侧转换过去。`let mut total = 0.0;` 得到一个 `f32`，给它加上 `f64` 是类型错误；要双精度时，请标注 `let mut total: f64 = 0.0;`。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:106
msgid ""
"**Overflow, division by zero, and out-of-bounds indexing trap.** For the explicit non-trapping ladder (`wrapping_add`, `saturating_mul`, `checked_add`), see [the standard library](stdlib.md)."
msgstr ""
"**溢出、除以零和越界索引都会触发陷阱。**显式的非陷阱阶梯（`wrapping_add`、`saturating_mul`、`checked_add`）见[标准库](stdlib.md)。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:110
msgid "Text: plain, raw, and format strings"
msgstr "文本：普通、原始与格式化字符串"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:112
msgid ""
"Three literal forms. A plain string is always inert — no interpolation ever happens implicitly."
msgstr "三种字面量形式。普通字符串永远是惰性的——绝不会隐式发生插值。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:115
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"text\");\n"
"    let name = \"rut\";\n"
"    let s = \"hi\\tname\";              // plain: escapes processed\n"
"    let raw = r\"C:\\temp\\log.txt\";    // raw: every byte is literal\n"
"    let t = f\"hi {name}!\";           // format: placeholders evaluated\n"
"    log.info(f\"{s} | {raw} | {t}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"text\");\n"
"    let name = \"rut\";\n"
"    let s = \"hi\\tname\";              // plain: escapes processed\n"
"    let raw = r\"C:\\temp\\log.txt\";    // raw: every byte is literal\n"
"    let t = f\"hi {name}!\";           // format: placeholders evaluated\n"
"    log.info(f\"{s} | {raw} | {t}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:132
msgid ""
"Plain and format strings share the same escapes (`\\t \\n \\r \\\\ \\\"` and `\\u{...}`). In an f-string, `{ expr }` splices any expression — identifiers, calls, arithmetic — except nested string literals (bind one to a variable first). `{{` and `}}` are literal braces:"
msgstr ""
"普通字符串与格式化字符串共享同一套转义（`\\t \\n \\r \\\\ \\\"` 和 `\\u{...}`）。在 f-string 里，`{ expr }` 可以拼进任何表达式——标识符、调用、算术——但不能嵌套字符串字面量（先把字符串绑定到一个变量）。`{{` 与 `}}` 是字面量的花括号："


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:137
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"text\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"open{{close}} braces\");   // prints: open{close} braces\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"text\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"open{{close}} braces\");   // prints: open{close} braces\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:150
msgid ""
"What an f-string can render: integers (decimal), floats (shortest round-trip decimal: `3.5`, `0.1`), `bool` (`true`/`false`), `str` (contents), and enum members (their name: `Color.Green` renders `Green`). Composite values — structs, classes, arrays, vecs — are a compile error inside an f-string; write a `to_string()`\\-style method and call it, or use a debug dump for development."
msgstr ""
"f-string 能渲染的东西：整数（十进制）、浮点数（最短往返十进制：`3.5`、`0.1`）、`bool`（`true`/`false`）、`str`（内容），以及枚举成员（它们的名字：`Color.Green` 渲染为 `Green`）。复合值——结构体、类、数组、vec——在 f-string 里是编译错误；写一个 `to_string()` 风格的方法并调用它，或者在开发时用调试转储。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:157
msgid "Sequences and buffers"
msgstr "序列与缓冲区"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:159
msgid "The fixed array `[T]` is built from a literal or a repeat:"
msgstr "定长数组 `[T]` 由字面量或重复表达式构建："


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:161
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"arrays\");\n"
"    let arr = [1, 2, 3];         // [i32] — fixed length\n"
"    let zero: [u8] = [0u8; 34];  // 34 slots of 0\n"
"    log.info(f\"len={arr.len()} first={arr[0]} zero.len={zero.len()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"arrays\");\n"
"    let arr = [1, 2, 3];         // [i32] — fixed length\n"
"    let zero: [u8] = [0u8; 34];  // 34 slots of 0\n"
"    log.info(f\"len={arr.len()} first={arr[0]} zero.len={zero.len()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:176
msgid ""
"The growable sequence is `Vec<T>` (from the `pouch` package — `use pouch::{ Vec };`): `Vec.new()`, `Vec.from([..])`, `Vec<i32>.filled(0, 1024)`, `push`, `pop`, `len`. Indexing and `for..of` work the same on both. See [the standard library](stdlib.md) for the full surface."
msgstr ""
"可增长序列是 `Vec<T>`（来自 `pouch` 包——`use pouch::{ Vec };`）：`Vec.new()`、`Vec.from([..])`、`Vec<i32>.filled(0, 1024)`、`push`、`pop`、`len`。索引和 `for..of` 在两者身上的工作方式相同。完整表面见[标准库](stdlib.md)。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:182
msgid ""
"`bytes` is the binary primitive. `s.encode()` turns text into octets, `b.decode()` reads it back (lossy UTF-8), `bytes.zeroed(n)` and `bytes.from(a)` build buffers directly:"
msgstr ""
"`bytes` 是二进制基本类型。`s.encode()` 把文本变成八位组，`b.decode()` 把它读回来（有损 UTF-8），`bytes.zeroed(n)` 与 `bytes.from(a)` 直接构建缓冲区："


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:186
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"bytes\");\n"
"    let b = \"rut runs\".encode();\n"
"    let ok = b.decode() == \"rut runs\";   // true — content comparison\n"
"    log.info(f\"len={b.len()} roundtrip={ok}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"bytes\");\n"
"    let b = \"rut runs\".encode();\n"
"    let ok = b.decode() == \"rut runs\";   // true — content comparison\n"
"    log.info(f\"len={b.len()} roundtrip={ok}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:201
msgid "Sharing: the one rule"
msgstr "共享：唯一法则"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:203
msgid ""
"Primitives and `fn` values **copy** on assignment, argument passing, and return. **Every other value is a shared cell**: `let q = p` is an O(1) handle move, and a write through any alias is visible through all of them."
msgstr ""
"基本类型与 `fn` 值在赋值、传参和返回时**复制**。**其余每个值都是共享单元**：`let q = p` 是一次 O(1) 的句柄移动，经由任何一个别名做出的写入，经由所有别名都可见。"


#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:208
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32 }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"sharing\");\n"
"    let mut p = Point { x: 1, y: 2 };\n"
"    let q = p;          // q and p name ONE cell\n"
"    p.x = 4;            // q.x is 4 now\n"
"    log.info(f\"q.x={q.x} same cell: {q == p}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32 }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"sharing\");\n"
"    let mut p = Point { x: 1, y: 2 };\n"
"    let q = p;          // q and p name ONE cell\n"
"    p.x = 4;            // q.x is 4 now\n"
"    log.info(f\"q.x={q.x} same cell: {q == p}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


