#: src/tutorial/values-and-variables.md:328
msgid "Next: [control flow and `when`](control-flow.md)."
msgstr "下一章：[控制流与 when](control-flow.md)。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:3
msgid ""
"rut has the classic structured statements — `if`/`else`, `while`, `for` — and exactly one match construct: `when`, an exhaustive pattern _expression_. There is no `switch`, no `case`, no fallthrough. The full rules live in [the reference on control flow](../reference/control-flow.md)."
msgstr ""
"rut 有经典的结构化语句——`if`/`else`、`while`、`for`——以及恰好一个匹配构造：`when`，一个穷尽式的模式_表达式_。没有 `switch`，没有 `case`，没有贯穿。完整的规则见[控制流参考](../reference/control-flow.md)。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:8
msgid "`if` and `else`"
msgstr "`if` 与 `else`"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:10
msgid "Braces are always required, whatever the body length:"
msgstr "无论主体多长，花括号都不可省："


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:12
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"flow\");\n"
"    for (let hits of [0, 5, 12]) {\n"
"        let mut first = false;\n"
"        let mut warm = false;\n"
"        let mut hot = false;\n"
"        if (hits == 0) {\n"
"            first = true;\n"
"        } else if (hits < 10) {\n"
"            warm = true;\n"
"        } else {\n"
"            hot = true;\n"
"        }\n"
"        log.info(f\"hits={hits} first={first} warm={warm} hot={hot}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"flow\");\n"
"    for (let hits of [0, 5, 12]) {\n"
"        let mut first = false;\n"
"        let mut warm = false;\n"
"        let mut hot = false;\n"
"        if (hits == 0) {\n"
"            first = true;\n"
"        } else if (hits < 10) {\n"
"            warm = true;\n"
"        } else {\n"
"            hot = true;\n"
"        }\n"
"        log.info(f\"hits={hits} first={first} warm={warm} hot={hot}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:39
msgid ""
"The condition must be a `bool` — there is no truthiness coercion, and no parenthesized-assignment footgun."
msgstr "条件必须是 `bool`——没有真值强转，也没有把赋值误写进括号条件的经典陷阱。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:42
msgid "Loops"
msgstr "循环"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:44
msgid "**`while`** repeats until its condition is false:"
msgstr "**`while`** 在条件为假之前不断重复："


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:46
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"sieve\");\n"
"    let i = 2;\n"
"    let limit = 12;\n"
"    let mut marks = [0; 16];\n"
"    let mut m = i * i;\n"
"    while (m <= limit) {\n"
"        marks[m] = 1;\n"
"        m += i;\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"marks[4]={marks[4]} marks[5]={marks[5]} stopped at m={m}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"sieve\");\n"
"    let i = 2;\n"
"    let limit = 12;\n"
"    let mut marks = [0; 16];\n"
"    let mut m = i * i;\n"
"    while (m <= limit) {\n"
"        marks[m] = 1;\n"
"        m += i;\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"marks[4]={marks[4]} marks[5]={marks[5]} stopped at m={m}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:67
msgid ""
"**`for..of`** iterates anything with elements: fixed arrays, `Vec`s, `str` (yielding one-codepoint `str`s), and `bytes` (yielding `u8`s):"
msgstr "**`for..of`** 迭代任何有元素的东西：定长数组、`Vec`、`str`（产出单码点的 `str`）和 `bytes`（产出 `u8`）："


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:70
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"loops\");\n"
"    let mut n = 0;\n"
"    for (let w of [\"rut\", \"runs\", \"rut\"]) {\n"
"        // w is a str\n"
"    }\n"
"    for (let c of \"héllo\") {\n"
"        n += 1;             // 5 iterations — codepoints, not the 6 bytes\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"n={n}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"loops\");\n"
"    let mut n = 0;\n"
"    for (let w of [\"rut\", \"runs\", \"rut\"]) {\n"
"        // w is a str\n"
"    }\n"
"    for (let c of \"héllo\") {\n"
"        n += 1;             // 5 iterations — codepoints, not the 6 bytes\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"n={n}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:90
msgid "The loop variable is always spelled `let` and is fresh each iteration."
msgstr "循环变量永远写作 `let`，并且每次迭代都是崭新的。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:92
msgid ""
"**Indexed `for`** is the C shape. The induction variable is _loop-owned_: the update clause (and the body) may assign it without `mut`."
msgstr "**索引式 `for`** 是 C 的形状。归纳变量为_循环所拥有_：更新子句（以及循环体）不需要 `mut` 就能为它赋值。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:95
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"loops\");\n"
"    let xs = [3, 1, 4];\n"
"    let n = xs.len();\n"
"    let mut total = 0;\n"
"    for (let i = 0; i < n; i += 1) {\n"
"        total += xs[i];\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"total={total}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"loops\");\n"
"    let xs = [3, 1, 4];\n"
"    let n = xs.len();\n"
"    let mut total = 0;\n"
"    for (let i = 0; i < n; i += 1) {\n"
"        total += xs[i];\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"total={total}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:114
msgid ""
"**`break` and `continue`** work in every loop form; there are no labels and no `do..while`."
msgstr "**`break` 与 `continue`** 在每一种循环形式里都能用；没有标签，也没有 `do..while`。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:117 src/reference/lexical-structure.md:44
msgid "`return`"
msgstr "`return`"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:119
msgid ""
"`return expr;` exits the function. If the function returns nothing, the arrow is omitted and `return;` (or falling off the end) returns:"
msgstr "`return expr;` 退出函数。如果函数不返回任何东西，箭头就省掉，`return;`（或执行到函数末尾）即返回："


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:122
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use pouch::{ Vec };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn swap(mut xs: Vec<i32>, a: i32, b: i32) {\n"
"    let t = xs[a];\n"
"    xs[a] = xs[b];\n"
"    xs[b] = t;\n"
"    // no return — the function's type is nil\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"swap\");\n"
"    let xs = Vec<i32>.from([1, 2, 3]);\n"
"    swap(xs, 0, 2);\n"
"    log.info(f\"first={xs[0]} last={xs[2]}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use pouch::{ Vec };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn swap(mut xs: Vec<i32>, a: i32, b: i32) {\n"
"    let t = xs[a];\n"
"    xs[a] = xs[b];\n"
"    xs[b] = t;\n"
"    // no return — the function's type is nil\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"swap\");\n"
"    let xs = Vec<i32>.from([1, 2, 3]);\n"
"    swap(xs, 0, 2);\n"
"    log.info(f\"first={xs[0]} last={xs[2]}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:145
msgid "`when` — the one match"
msgstr "`when`——唯一的匹配"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:147
msgid ""
"`when (value) { pattern -> body, ... }` is an expression: the first matching arm produces the value. No fallthrough — exactly one arm runs."
msgstr ""
"`when (value) { pattern -> body, ... }` 是一个表达式：第一个匹配的分支产出那个值。没有贯穿——恰好只有一个分支运行。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:150
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn classify(n: i32) -> str {\n"
"    return when (n) {\n"
"        0       -> \"zero\",\n"
"        1, 2, 3 -> \"small\",     // comma-separated alternatives\n"
"        else    -> \"big\",       // the wildcard\n"
"    };\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"when\");\n"
"    for (let n of [0, 2, 9]) {\n"
"        log.info(f\"{n}: {classify(n)}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn classify(n: i32) -> str {\n"
"    return when (n) {\n"
"        0       -> \"zero\",\n"
"        1, 2, 3 -> \"small\",     // comma-separated alternatives\n"
"        else    -> \"big\",       // the wildcard\n"
"    };\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"when\");\n"
"    for (let n of [0, 2, 9]) {\n"
"        log.info(f\"{n}: {classify(n)}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:175
msgid "The arm body before the `,` is an expression; arms can also be blocks:"
msgstr "`,` 之前的分支体是一个表达式；分支也可以是块："


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:177
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Green, Yellow, Red }\n"
"\n"
"fn go()    { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"go\"); }\n"
"fn brake() { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"brake\"); }\n"
"fn stop()  { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"stop\"); }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let l = Light.Yellow;\n"
"    when (l) {\n"
"        Light.Green  -> { go(); },\n"
"        Light.Yellow -> { brake(); },\n"
"        Light.Red    -> { stop(); },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Green, Yellow, Red }\n"
"\n"
"fn go()    { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"go\"); }\n"
"fn brake() { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"brake\"); }\n"
"fn stop()  { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"stop\"); }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let l = Light.Yellow;\n"
"    when (l) {\n"
"        Light.Green  -> { go(); },\n"
"        Light.Yellow -> { brake(); },\n"
"        Light.Red    -> { stop(); },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:200
msgid ""
"Used as a statement, a `when` must produce nothing — the block arms above are statement arms."
msgstr "作为语句使用时，`when` 必须不产出任何东西——上面的块分支就是语句分支。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:203 src/reference/control-flow.md:63
msgid "Patterns"
msgstr "模式"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:205
msgid ""
"v1 patterns are: enum members (`Light.Red`), literals (integers, floats, `bool`, `str`), comma-separated alternatives, and `else`. There are no ranges, no destructuring, and no guards — an `if` inside the arm body does that job."
msgstr ""
"v1 的模式有：枚举成员（`Light.Red`）、字面量（整数、浮点数、`bool`、`str`）、逗号分隔的多选一，以及 `else`。没有范围，没有解构，也没有守卫——分支体内的 `if` 承担这份工作。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:210
msgid "Exhaustiveness is enforced"
msgstr "穷尽性是强制检查的"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:212
msgid ""
"**Enum scrutinee:** either cover every member or add `else`. A partial `when` over an enum is a compile error — when you add a member later, the compiler finds every `when` you must extend."
msgstr ""
"**枚举被匹配值：**要么覆盖每个成员，要么加上 `else`。对枚举的残缺 `when` 是编译错误——日后你新增成员时，编译器会找出每一个你必须扩展的 `when`。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:215
msgid ""
"**Any other scrutinee:** `else` is mandatory (integers and strings cannot be enumerated)."
msgstr "**其他任何被匹配值：**`else` 是强制的（整数和字符串无法穷举）。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:218
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Green, Yellow, Red }\n"
"\n"
"fn go()    { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"go\"); }\n"
"fn brake() { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"brake\"); }\n"
"fn stop()  { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"stop\"); }\n"
"\n"
"fn drive(l: Light) {\n"
"    when (l) {\n"
"        Light.Green  -> { go(); },\n"
"        Light.Yellow -> { brake(); },\n"
"        Light.Red    -> { stop(); },   // all members: no else needed\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn describe(n: i32) -> str {\n"
"    return when (n) {\n"
"        0    -> \"zero\",\n"
"        else -> \"not zero\",            // non-enum scrutinee: else REQUIRED\n"
"    };\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    drive(Light.Red);\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"light\");\n"
"    log.info(describe(0));\n"
"    log.info(describe(7));\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Green, Yellow, Red }\n"
"\n"
"fn go()    { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"go\"); }\n"
"fn brake() { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"brake\"); }\n"
"fn stop()  { Logger.new(\"light\").info(\"stop\"); }\n"
"\n"
"fn drive(l: Light) {\n"
"    when (l) {\n"
"        Light.Green  -> { go(); },\n"
"        Light.Yellow -> { brake(); },\n"
"        Light.Red    -> { stop(); },   // all members: no else needed\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn describe(n: i32) -> str {\n"
"    return when (n) {\n"
"        0    -> \"zero\",\n"
"        else -> \"not zero\",            // non-enum scrutinee: else REQUIRED\n"
"    };\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    drive(Light.Red);\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"light\");\n"
"    log.info(describe(0));\n"
"    log.info(describe(7));\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:256
msgid "`when` over a `bool` reads nicely as a two-arm check:"
msgstr "对 `bool` 的 `when` 读起来像一个双分支检查："


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:258
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32 }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"nullable\");\n"
"    let p: ?Point = Point { x: 1, y: 2 };\n"
"    when (p != nil) {\n"
"        true -> { log.info(f\"point {p.x} {p.y}\"); },\n"
"        else -> { log.info(\"point: nil\"); },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32 }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"nullable\");\n"
"    let p: ?Point = Point { x: 1, y: 2 };\n"
"    when (p != nil) {\n"
"        true -> { log.info(f\"point {p.x} {p.y}\"); },\n"
"        else -> { log.info(\"point: nil\"); },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:277
msgid ""
"Duplicate patterns — and arms made unreachable by an earlier one — are compile errors."
msgstr "重复的模式——以及被更早的模式弄得不可达的分支——都是编译错误。"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:280
msgid "One type across the arms"
msgstr "各分支共用一个类型"


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:282
msgid ""
"All arm expressions must agree: that shared type is the `when`'s type. A `when` that builds a value usually reads best wrapped in a function — the function's return type then pins every arm:"
msgstr ""
"所有分支表达式必须一致：那个共享的类型就是 `when` 的类型。构建值的 `when` 通常包进一个函数里读起来最好——函数的返回类型随之钉住每个分支："


#: src/tutorial/control-flow.md:286
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Green, Yellow, Red }\n"
"\n"
"fn light_for(i: i32) -> Light {\n"
"    return when (i) {\n"
"        0    -> Light.Green,\n"
"        1    -> Light.Yellow,\n"
"        else -> Light.Red,\n"
"    };\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"light\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{light_for(0)} {light_for(1)} {light_for(5)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
