#: src/tutorial/traits.md:103
msgid ""
"**Widening is implicit** at any position that expects the trait: an annotated binding, a field, an argument, a return."
msgstr "**加宽是隐式的**，出现在任何期望该 trait 的位置：带标注的绑定、字段、实参、返回值。"


#: src/tutorial/traits.md:106
