#: src/tutorial/traits.md:216
msgid "Type tests: `is`"
msgstr "类型测试：`is`"


#: src/tutorial/traits.md:218
msgid "`expr is Type` answers with a `bool` and never traps:"
msgstr "`expr is Type` 以一个 `bool` 作答，且从不触发陷阱："


#: src/tutorial/traits.md:220
msgid "**Concrete RHS** — `p is Circle`: an exact-type test."
msgstr "**具体类型在右侧**——`p is Circle`：精确类型测试。"


#: src/tutorial/traits.md:221
msgid ""
"**Trait RHS** — `p is Shape`: a capability probe (\"does this value's type have an impl of `Shape`?\")."
msgstr "**trait 在右侧**——`p is Shape`：能力探测（“这个值的类型有没有 `Shape` 的 impl？”）。"


#: src/tutorial/traits.md:224
