#: src/tutorial/errors.md:184
msgid ""
"Use it when continuing would be a lie: a broken invariant, an impossible state, a caller error that is a programming mistake. Data problems — a bad byte in a file, a missing key, a network error — are _values_ and belong in the answer channel, so callers can recover."
msgstr ""
"当继续下去等于撒谎时使用它：被破坏的不变式、不可能出现的状态、属于编程失误的调用方错误。数据问题——文件里的坏字节、缺失的键、网络错误——则是_值_，属于应答通道，调用方才能恢复。"


