msgstr ""
"`x is T` 不取回即可探查盒。这是 rut 唯一具有 `any` 形状的值，在被取回之前它什么也做不了——参见 [opaque 参考](../reference/opaque.md)。"


#: src/tutorial/errors.md:235
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use json::{ decodeJson, encodeJson };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"json\");\n"
"\n"
"    // a successful decode: (value, nil)\n"
"    let (n, e) = decodeJson<i64>(\"42\");\n"
"    if (e == nil) {\n"
"        log.info(f\"n={n}\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        let why = e;\n"
"        log.info(f\"decode failed at {why.at}: {why.expected}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    // encode answers the same shape: (?str, ?EncodeJsonError)\n"
"    let (s, ee) = encodeJson<[i64]>([1, 2, 3]);\n"
"    if (ee == nil) {\n"
"        let text = s;\n"
"        log.info(f\"s={text}\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        log.info(\"encode failed\");\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    // a bad decode: the (nil, err) half answers the failure\n"
"    let (bad, be) = decodeJson<i64>(\"[1,2,3]\");\n"
"    if (be == nil) {\n"
"        log.info(\"unexpected success\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        let why = be;\n"
"        log.info(f\"rejected at {why.at}: got '{why.got}', wanted {why.expected}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use json::{ decodeJson, encodeJson };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"json\");\n"
"\n"
"    // a successful decode: (value, nil)\n"
"    let (n, e) = decodeJson<i64>(\"42\");\n"
"    if (e == nil) {\n"
"        log.info(f\"n={n}\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        let why = e;\n"
"        log.info(f\"decode failed at {why.at}: {why.expected}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    // encode answers the same shape: (?str, ?EncodeJsonError)\n"
"    let (s, ee) = encodeJson<[i64]>([1, 2, 3]);\n"
"    if (ee == nil) {\n"
"        let text = s;\n"
"        log.info(f\"s={text}\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        log.info(\"encode failed\");\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    // a bad decode: the (nil, err) half answers the failure\n"
"    let (bad, be) = decodeJson<i64>(\"[1,2,3]\");\n"
"    if (be == nil) {\n"
"        log.info(\"unexpected success\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        let why = be;\n"
"        log.info(f\"rejected at {why.at}: got '{why.got}', wanted {why.expected}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/errors.md:277
msgid "Next: [modules and packages](modules.md)."
msgstr "下一章：[模块与包](modules.md)。"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:3
msgid ""
"A rut file is a module: one namespace, one visibility scope. A directory with a `rut.jsonc` is a _package_ — the unit you depend on and share. This chapter walks up those two levels. The reference pages are [modules and visibility](../reference/modules-and-visibility.md), [project structure and rut.jsonc](../reference/project-structure.md), and [dependency kinds](../reference/dependency-kinds.md)."
msgstr ""
"一个 rut 文件就是一个模块：一个命名空间，一个可见性作用域。带有 `rut.jsonc` 的目录则是一个_包_——你依赖并分享的单位。本章沿这两个层级向上走。参考页是[模块与可见性](../reference/modules-and-visibility.md)、[项目结构与 rut.jsonc](../reference/project-structure.md)和[依赖种类](../reference/dependency-kinds.md)。"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:10
msgid "What lives at module scope"
msgstr "模块作用域里有什么"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:12
msgid ""
"Module scope contains **declarations only**: `use`, `let`, `fn`, `struct`, `class`, `enum`, `trait`, `impl`. Every statement lives inside a function — and **loading a module executes nothing**. There is no load-time side-effect ordering to reason about; the host loads your module and calls its entry point (conventionally `pub fn main`)."
msgstr ""
"模块作用域只包含**声明**：`use`、`let`、`fn`、`struct`、`class`、`enum`、`trait`、`impl`。每条语句都住在函数体内——而且**加载模块不执行任何东西**。没有需要推理的加载期副作用顺序；宿主加载你的模块并调用它的入口点（惯例是 `pub fn main`）。"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:18
msgid ""
"Module-level `let` initializers must be load-time literals — `42`, `\"app\"`, `true`. Arithmetic, record literals, and calls to user functions are not accepted in this build (there is no mutable module state; programs build their state in `main`)."
msgstr ""
"模块级 `let` 的初始化器必须是加载期字面量——`42`、`\"app\"`、`true`。算术、记录字面量和对用户函数的调用在当前构建中不被接受（不存在可变的模块状态；程序在 `main` 里构建自己的状态）。"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:23
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use pouch::{ Vec };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: f32; y: f32 }\n"
"\n"
"let version = 1;                       // fine: a literal\n"
"let app_name = \"app\";                  // any literal works\n"
"\n"
"fn main_body() { /* statements live here */ }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"app\");\n"
"    let origin = Point { x: 0, y: 0 }; // record literals live in function bodies\n"
"    log.info(f\"{app_name} v{version} origin.x={origin.x}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use pouch::{ Vec };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: f32; y: f32 }\n"
"\n"
"let version = 1;                       // fine: a literal\n"
"let app_name = \"app\";                  // any literal works\n"
"\n"
"fn main_body() { /* statements live here */ }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"app\");\n"
"    let origin = Point { x: 0, y: 0 }; // record literals live in function bodies\n"
"    log.info(f\"{app_name} v{version} origin.x={origin.x}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:45 src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:105
