#: src/tutorial/modules.md:58
msgid ""
"The same forms apply to types, module `let`s, and class members. Structs are the exception: a struct is an open record — all members public, always, and its impl methods take no visibility annotation (they are as public as the type)."
msgstr ""
"同样的形式适用于类型、模块级 `let` 和类成员。结构体是例外：结构体是开放的记录——所有成员永远公开，其 impl 方法也不带可见性标注（它们与类型一样公开）。"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:63
msgid "`use` — naming other modules"
msgstr "`use`——命名其他模块"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:65
msgid "`use` imports names with Rust-like paths:"
msgstr "`use` 以类 Rust 的路径导入名字："


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:73
msgid ""
"Builtin names — the primitives, `str`/`bytes` members, `panic`, `Vec`\\-free array grammar, `opaque` — are **ambient**: no `use` needed. The exceptions are core's import-gated pair, `Disposal`/`DisposalContext` — they resolve only through `use core::{ .. }`, like any package name. Package names from your manifest are imported the same way; an unused name in a `use` is a lint, not an error."
msgstr ""
"内置名字——基本类型、`str`/`bytes` 的成员、`panic`、不依赖 `Vec` 的数组语法、`opaque`——都是**环境自带**的：无需 `use`。例外是 core 的导入把守对：`Disposal`/`DisposalContext`——它们只能像任何包名一样，经 `use core::{ .. }` 解析。清单里的包名也以同样的方式导入；`use` 里未被使用的名字只是一个 lint，不是错误。"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:81
msgid ""
"Within one module, everything is visible — including declarations later in the file. Order never matters."
msgstr "在同一模块内，一切彼此可见——包括文件中靠后的声明。顺序从不重要。"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:84
msgid "Packages: `rut.jsonc`"
msgstr "包：`rut.jsonc`"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:86
msgid ""
"A package is a directory with a manifest. The small but complete case — one library package and one app:"
msgstr "包是带有清单的目录。小而完整的案例——一个库包加一个应用："


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:99
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"// greet/pkg/rut.jsonc\n"
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"greet\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"lib\": \"./greet.rut\" },\n"
"\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    // the toolchain tree's pouch package\n"
"    \"pouch\": { \"path\": \"../../rut/pouch\" }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:112
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"// greet/pkg/greet.rut\n"
"use pouch::{ Vec };\n"
"\n"
"pub struct Greeting {\n"
"    to: str;\n"
"    lines: Vec<str>;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl Greeting {\n"
"    pub fn new(to: str) -> Self {\n"
"        return Self { to: to, lines: Vec.new() };\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    pub fn add(mut self, line: str) {\n"
"        self.lines.push(line);\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    pub fn render(self) -> str {\n"
"        let mut out = f\"dear {self.to},\";\n"
"        for (let line of self.lines) {\n"
"            out = f\"{out} {line}\";\n"
"        }\n"
"        return out;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn shout(msg: str) -> str {   // module-private: no `pub`, never importable\n"
"    return f\"{msg}!\";\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
