msgstr "一个包，多个文件"


#: src/tutorial/modules.md:191
msgid ""
"A package's body can be split across files. The manifest splices them, base first, in listed order — into **one module**: one namespace, one visibility scope. A name private to one file is visible to every other file of the same package:"
msgstr ""
"包的主体可以拆分到多个文件。清单把它们拼接起来——基文件在前，按列出的顺序——拼成**一个模块**：一个命名空间，一个可见性作用域。对其中一个文件私有的名字，对同一个包的每个其他文件都可见："


