#: src/tutorial/stdlib.md:228
msgid ""
"Every `out = f\"{out}{chunk}\"` loop copies the whole prefix each time; the builder appends into one growable cell and copies once, at `build()`."
msgstr ""
"每个 `out = f\"{out}{chunk}\"` 循环都要把整个前缀复制一遍；构建器在一个可增长的单元里追加，只在 `build()` 时复制一次。"


#: src/tutorial/stdlib.md:232
msgid "`calc` — float math"
msgstr "`calc`——浮点数学"


