#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:20 src/reference/opaque.md:9
msgid "The surface"
msgstr "语言表面"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:22
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ RunContext };\n"
"use async_host::{ launch_future, sleep };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"async fn countdown(cx: RunContext, log: Logger, n: u32) -> nil {\n"
"    for (let i = n; i > 0; i -= 1) {\n"
"        log.info(f\"{i}\");\n"
"        await sleep(1000);             // the only suspension spelling\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() -> nil {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"countdown\");\n"
"    launch_future(countdown(log, 3));  // the other consume: launch\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rutuse core::{ RunContext };use async_host::{ launch_future, sleep };use ink::{ Logger };async fn countdown(cx: RunContext, log: Logger, n: u32) -> nil {    for (let i = n; i > 0; i -= 1) {        log.info(f\"{i}\");        await sleep(1000);             // the only suspension spelling    }}pub fn main() -> nil {    let log = Logger.new(\"countdown\");    launch_future(countdown(log, 3));  // the other consume: launch}```"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:46
msgid "The rules:"
msgstr "规则如下："


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:48
msgid ""
"**The first parameter is the context.** `async fn f(cx: RunContext, ..)` — the engine mints it at call sites and per drive, the way it mints `self`. It carries the frame edge: `checkpoint()` reads the resume state, `cancelled()` reads the task's abort flag. The spelled `RunContext` name is core's, imported like any package name: `use core::{ RunContext }` — the engine's weave itself never needs the import, only source that names the trait does."
msgstr ""
"**第一个参数是上下文。**`async fn f(cx: RunContext, ..)`——引擎在调用点和每次驱动时铸造它，如同铸造 `self`。它携带帧边：`checkpoint()` 读取恢复状态，`cancelled()` 读取任务的取消标志。拼写的 `RunContext` 名字属于 core，像任何包名一样导入：`use core::{ RunContext }`——引擎的织造本身从不需要导入，需要它的是点名该 trait 的源码。"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:55
msgid ""
"**Calling does not run.** `async fn f(..) -> T` describes a value that widens to `Future<T>`; it runs when awaited or launched."
msgstr ""
"**调用不等于运行。**`async fn f(..) -> T` 描述的是一个宽化为 `Future<T>` 的值；它只在被 await 或被启动时运行。"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:57
msgid ""
"**One consume law.** A future is consumed by `await` _or_ by `launch_future` — exactly one. The launch returns its own receipt type, which is not a future and cannot be launched or awaited again."
msgstr ""
"**单次消费法则。**future 只由 `await` _或_ `launch_future` 消费——恰好其一。启动返回它自己的回执类型，它不是 future，不能再次被启动或 await。"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:60
msgid ""
"**`await` targets engine-woven futures** (async-fn results and `sleep`). Hand-written futures are _launcher-drivable_ — the driving loop finds their `Future::yield` in the vtable — which is how the standard `sleep` itself is built over the open trait surface."
msgstr ""
"**`await` 只面向引擎织入的 future**（async fn 的结果与 `sleep`）。手写的 future 是_可被启动器驱动_的——驱动循环在 vtable 里找到它们的 `Future::yield`——标准 `sleep` 本身正是构建在这个开放的 trait 表面之上。"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:65 src/reference/async.md:112
msgid "What the compiler emits"
msgstr "编译器产出什么"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:67
msgid ""
"An `async fn` compiles to one hidden frame — an ordinary heap cell — with a woven `Future::yield` that the driving loop calls once per resumption:"
msgstr "`async fn` 编译为一个隐藏帧——一个普通的堆单元——带一个织入的 `Future::yield`，驱动循环在每次恢复时调用它一次："


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:85
msgid ""
"The state field _is_ the program counter: resume dispatch is a jump table over the checkpoint enum. Because locals are mirrored into the frame cell, parking releases only staging registers and no liveness analysis decides which locals survive a suspension. The whole weave rides existing bytecode — no new opcodes, no new runtime machinery."
msgstr ""
"state 字段_就是_程序计数器：恢复分派是检查点枚举上的一张跳转表。由于局部变量被镜像进帧单元，停车只释放暂存寄存器，没有任何活跃性分析来决定哪些局部变量能在暂停中幸存。整个织造骑在既有字节码上——没有新操作码，没有新运行时机制。"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:91
msgid "Cancellation is drop"
msgstr "取消即 drop"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:93
msgid ""
"`handle.abort()` flags the frame's cancellation and re-enqueues it. The probe at its next checkpoint branches to the drop path: locals release in reverse binding order, `Disposal` impls run at refcount zero, and any pending `sleep` dies with the frame. Cancellation **never interrupts mid-expression** — the checkpoint probe is the only place a cancellation becomes observable, so a cancelled function dies at a known-clean boundary. This is the same machinery that frees any heap object (see [memory](memory.md)); coroutine frames get no special case."
msgstr ""
"`handle.abort()` 标记帧的取消并将其重新入队。下一个检查点处的探测会分支到 drop 路径：局部变量按绑定的逆序释放，`Disposal` impl 在引用计数归零时运行，任何挂起的 `sleep` 随帧一同消亡。取消**从不在表达式中途打断**——检查点探测是取消变得可观察的唯一位置，所以被取消的函数死在一个已知干净的边界上。这与释放任何堆对象用的是同一套机制（参见[内存](memory.md)）；协程帧没有特权。"


