#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:117
msgid ""
"`sleep(ms)` arms a deadline on the VM's **virtual clock** (`vm.now_ms()` / `vm.set_now()`). A test host advances the clock by hand and gets fully deterministic schedules — a UI host just maps it to wall time."
msgstr ""
"`sleep(ms)` 在 VM 的**虚拟时钟**（`vm.now_ms()` / `vm.set_now()`）上设一个截止时间。测试宿主手动推进时钟，得到完全确定性的调度——UI 宿主只需把它映射到墙钟时间。"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:121
msgid ""
"Each queue entry owns one reference; a completed drive re-enqueues the awaiting frame through a one-directional edge pair, so wake wiring never forms a cycle."
msgstr "每个队列条目持有一个引用；一次完成的驱动通过单向边对把等待中的帧重新入队，因此唤醒连线永远不会形成循环引用。"


#: src/core-concepts/async-model.md:124
msgid ""
"Fuel accounting rides the ordinary per-op budget: a drive that runs out parks the frame at its checkpoint and resumes there later."
msgstr "燃料核算走普通的每操作预算：燃料耗尽的驱动把帧停在它的检查点上，稍后从那里恢复。"


