#: src/examples/index.md:23
msgid ""
"All Cargo commands run from the repository root. The runnable crates share one session pattern — compile the module, verify the binary, bind host fns, then drive it through typed `vm.call` sites — so the pages cross-link often: [00 — Todolist](00-todolist.md) establishes the pattern and [06 — GitHub viewer CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md) stretches it the farthest."
msgstr ""
"所有 Cargo 命令都从仓库根目录运行。可运行的 crate 共享同一套会话模式——编译模块、校验二进制、绑定宿主 fn，然后经由带类型的 `vm.call` 站点驱动它——所以各页频繁互相链接：[00 — 待办清单](00-todolist.md)确立这一模式，[06 — GitHub 查看器 CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md)把它拉伸到最远。"


#: src/examples/index.md:30
msgid "The three dependency kinds"
msgstr "三种依赖类型"


#: src/examples/index.md:32
msgid ""
"Every package carries a `rut.jsonc` manifest (see [Project structure and rut.jsonc](../reference/project-structure.md)), and a manifest relates a package to other packages through **three tables**, all visible in the examples:"
msgstr ""
"每个包都带一份 `rut.jsonc` 清单（参见[项目结构与 rut.jsonc](../reference/project-structure.md)），清单通过**三张表**把一个包与其他包关联起来——在示例中全部可见："


#: src/examples/index.md:37
msgid ""
"**`deps`** — ordinary dependencies, transitively mounted. The common case: `03-plugin`'s `plugin/rut.jsonc` declares `server = { path = \"../server\" }`, and [05 — Todolist web](05-todolist-web.md)'s `biz` package declares `ui` (which itself pulls the collection packages)."
msgstr ""
"**`deps`**——普通依赖，传递式挂载。常见情形：`03-plugin` 的 `plugin/rut.jsonc` 声明 `server = { path = \"../server\" }`，而[05 — Web 待办清单](05-todolist-web.md)的 `biz` 包声明 `ui`（后者自己再拉取集合包）。"


#: src/examples/index.md:42
msgid ""
"**`peer-deps`** — required by default: the _consumer_ supplies the peer and the peer is never pulled transitively. Marking a peer `optional = true` flips it to a presence relation: its integration file (impl-only code the peer makes compilable) mounts only when the peer is anywhere in the program's closure. The in-tree example is the std `json` package's serde-model impls — `impl JsonSerialize for Vec<T>` is written in json but must not force every json consumer to mount the collection packages, so those live as optional peers and as `dev-deps` for json's own tests. [02 — Digest](02-digest.md) consumes json _light_; [06 — GitHub viewer CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md) calls `assemble_peers` and mounts the impl groups for real because the collections are in its closure."
msgstr ""
"**`peer-deps`**——默认必填：_消费方_提供对等包，而对等包永远不会被传递式拉取。把对等包标为 `optional = true` 会把它翻转成一种存在关系：它的集成文件（对等包使之可编译的纯 impl 代码）只在该对等包出现在程序闭包中的任何位置时才挂载。树内的例子是 std `json` 包的 serde 模型 impl——`impl JsonSerialize for Vec<T>` 写在 json 里，但绝不能强迫 json 的每个消费者都挂载集合包，所以那些 impl 作为可选对等包存在，并作为 json 自身测试的 `dev-deps`。[02 — 摘要](02-digest.md)轻量地消费 json；[06 — GitHub 查看器 CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md) 调用 `assemble_peers` 真正挂载 impl 组，因为集合包在它的闭包里。"


#: src/examples/index.md:54
msgid ""
"**`dev-deps`** — mounted only while building the package itself, never in a consumer's world. json develops against the real collection packages through the both-kinds pairing while its consumers mount it without them."
msgstr ""
"**`dev-deps`**——只在构建包本身时挂载，绝不进入消费者的世界。json 透过这种双类型配对对着真实的集合包开发，而它的消费者挂载它时并不带这些包。"


#: src/examples/index.md:59
msgid ""
"The full rules — the loud missing-required-peer error, the silence of absent optional peers, dedup-by-origin at the splice, and what bundle format the packer emits — are on [Dependency kinds](../reference/dependency-kinds.md)."
msgstr ""
"完整的规则——缺必填对等包的响亮错误、可选对等包缺席时的静默、拼接处按来源去重，以及打包器产出什么捆绑包格式——都在[依赖类型](../reference/dependency-kinds.md)。"


