#: src/examples/00-todolist.md:197
msgid ""
"State lives rut-side in one `opaque` container the host holds and re-passes; plain values cross, instances never do."
msgstr "状态活在 rut 一侧的一个 `opaque` 容器里，宿主持有并反复回传它；普通值跨越，实例永不跨越。"


#: src/examples/00-todolist.md:199
msgid "Erasure is `opaque(v)`; recovery is `opaque.downcast<T> -> ?T`."
msgstr "擦除是 `opaque(v)`；恢复是 `opaque.downcast<T> -> ?T`。"


#: src/examples/00-todolist.md:200
msgid ""
"Budgets (fuel + heap) are the embedder's call, and every embedder mistake comes back as a named trap."
msgstr "预算（燃料 + 堆）由嵌入方说了算，嵌入方的每个失误都会以一个指名道姓的陷阱回来。"


#: src/examples/00-todolist.md:202
msgid ""
"The same file works as a library: entries are compilation roots, so a module with no `main` still emits every entry."
msgstr "同一个文件也能当库用：入口是编译根，所以没有 `main` 的模块仍然产出每个入口。"


#: src/examples/00-todolist.md:205
msgid ""
"Next: [01 — Sort](01-sort.md) scales the pattern to five algorithms and shows what recursion costs in fuel. The crossing rules behind this page are in [the host boundary](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md)."
msgstr ""
"下一篇：[01 — 排序](01-sort.md)把这个模式扩展到五种算法，并展示递归的燃料账单。本页背后的跨越规则在[宿主边界](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md)。"


#: src/examples/01-sort.md:3
msgid ""
"The second runnable host example, in the shape of [00 — Todolist](00-todolist.md): five sorting algorithms in rut — insertion, bubble, and selection (loop-shaped), plus quicksort and merge sort (recursion, in-place vs. out-of-place) — driven from Rust through **one** `entry fn` dispatcher. Where 00 is about the boundary, this one is about the language: recursion, `when` on strings, the mut-binding law, wrapping arithmetic, and visible fuel budgets."
msgstr ""
"第二个可运行的宿主示例，形状同[00 — 待办清单](00-todolist.md)：rut 写的五种排序算法——插入、冒泡、选择（循环形态），外加快速排序与归并排序（递归，就地 vs 非就地）——从 Rust 经由**一个** `entry fn` 分派器驱动。00 讲的是边界，这一篇讲的是语言：递归、对字符串的 `when`、mut 绑定法则、回绕算术，以及看得见的燃料预算。"


#: src/examples/01-sort.md:15
msgid ""
"# every algorithm, edge cases, cross-agreement\n"
msgstr ""
"# 每种算法、边界情形、交叉一致性\n"


#: src/examples/01-sort.md:18
msgid ""
"The run sorts a hand-picked input, then fills the bank with a deterministic pseudo-random vector and runs the full sweep, printing fuel per algorithm:"
msgstr "运行先排序一个人工挑选的输入，然后用确定性伪随机向量填满银行并跑完整遍，逐算法打印燃料："


#: src/examples/01-sort.md:22
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"pushed: [5, 2, 9, 2]\n"
"after insertion: [2, 2, 5, 9]\n"
"fill(16, seed=42), each algorithm:\n"
"  insertion true  fuel   2335  [208, 320, 353, ..., 854, 893]\n"
"  bubble    true  fuel   3895  [208, 320, 353, ..., 854, 893]\n"
"  selection true  fuel   3353  [208, 320, 353, ..., 854, 893]\n"
"  quick     true  fuel   2241  [208, 320, 353, ..., 854, 893]\n"
"  merge     true  fuel   4358  [208, 320, 353, ..., 854, 893]\n"
"sort(bogus) = Res(Err(Str(\"unknown algorithm: bogus\")))\n"
"fuel used: 21142 of Some(5000000)\n"
