"pushed: [5, 2, 9, 2]\n"
"after insertion: [2, 2, 5, 9]\n"
"fill(16, seed=42), each algorithm:\n"
"  insertion true  fuel   2335  [208, 320, 353, ..., 854, 893]\n"
