#: src/examples/02-digest.md:3
msgid ""
"The byte-level example, in the shape of [00 — Todolist](00-todolist.md) and [01 — Sort](01-sort.md) — with a twist: this time the embedder is also the **oracle**. `digest.rut` is a byte-level library written in pure rut:"
msgstr ""
"字节级示例，形状同[00 — 待办清单](00-todolist.md)和[01 — 排序](01-sort.md)——带一个转折：这一次嵌入方同时还是 **oracle**。`digest.rut` 是一个纯 rut 写成的字节级库："


#: src/examples/02-digest.md:8
msgid ""
"**encodings** — hex (encode/decode, case-insensitive) and base64 (standard + URL-safe alphabets, padding, invalid-input rejection)"
msgstr "**编码**——hex（编码/解码，大小写不敏感）与 base64（标准 + URL 安全字母表、填充、非法输入拒绝）"


#: src/examples/02-digest.md:10
msgid ""
"**crypto digests** — MD5, SHA-1, SHA-256, SHA-512 behind one `when`\\-on-string dispatcher"
msgstr "**加密摘要**——MD5、SHA-1、SHA-256、SHA-512，藏在一个 `when`\\-按字符串分派的分派器背后"


#: src/examples/02-digest.md:12
msgid "**hashmap hash keys** — CRC-32, FNV-1a 32/64, djb2, sdbm"
msgstr "**hashmap 哈希键**——CRC-32、FNV-1a 32/64、djb2、sdbm"


#: src/examples/02-digest.md:13
msgid ""
"**JSON** — decode to an `opaque` tree, encode back, round-trip, with numbers stored as verbatim lexemes so round-trips are exact"
msgstr "**JSON**——解码为 `opaque` 树、编码回去、往返一致，数字按原样词素存储，往返因此分毫不差"


#: src/examples/02-digest.md:16
msgid ""
"Nothing in the rut file trusts itself: the Rust host cross-checks every algorithm against independent crates (the RustCrypto hash family, `base64`, `crc32fast`, `serde_json`) on canonical test vectors _and_ on deterministic pseudo-random inputs at every padding-edge length, plus a 64 KiB stress blob. `digest.rut` knows nothing about the crates; only the host compares."
msgstr ""
"rut 文件里没有任何东西信任自己：Rust 宿主把每个算法与独立的 crate（RustCrypto 哈希家族、`base64`、`crc32fast`、`serde_json`）交叉验证，既对规范测试向量，也对每一个填充边缘长度上的确定性伪随机输入，外加一个 64 KiB 的压力数据块。`digest.rut` 对那些 crate 一无所知；做比较的只有宿主。"


#: src/examples/02-digest.md:27
msgid ""
"# the oracle, asserted\n"
msgstr ""
"# 被 assert 的 oracle\n"


#: src/examples/02-digest.md:30
msgid "The run prints one verified row per check — abridged:"
msgstr "运行对每项检查打印一行已验证的结果——节选："


#: src/examples/02-digest.md:32
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"hex([114, 117, 116, 33]) = 72757421\n"
"b64([102, 111, 111, 98, 97, 114], url=false) = Zm9vYmFy  OK\n"
"digests, rut vs crates:\n"
"  md5     empty         fuel    8419  d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e  OK\n"
"  sha256  \"abc\"         fuel   18866  ba7816bf...f20015ad  OK\n"
"  md5     1 KiB lcg(42) fuel  113117  d6c1961991b0106647e36ca4ba12d345  OK\n"
"sample_doc -> {\"name\":\"rut\",\"version\":0.2,\"tags\":[\"tiny\",\"fast\",\"verified\"],...}\n"
"serde_json parses it: OK\n"
"hash keys over that JSON text:\n"
"  crc32   eccc5960  OK\n"
"  fnv1a64 8ba697141da02e83  OK\n"
"hex_dec(\"zz\")   = \"hex: invalid character at index 0\"\n"
"json_dec(\"{,}\") = \"json: expected a key string at index 1\"\n"
"digest(\"md4\")   = \"unknown algorithm: md4\"\n"
"every row agrees: OK\n"
"fuel used: 1014105 of Some(50000000)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
