#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:3
msgid ""
"A Rust chat-room **server** with a rut **moderator plugin** — the first example built on two things at once: **re-entrant `vm.call`** (the host calls rut, and a host fn called _by_ rut calls back into rut while the first call is still parked) and **both `opaque` directions** (rut hands the host a handle to its own state; the host hands rut a handle to the server's event bus). It is also the packaging example: the plugin loads from a **module directory** and from a **`.rutbundle`** packed from that directory at runtime — the two forms of one contract ([Module bundles](../reference/bundles.md))."
msgstr ""
"一个 Rust 聊天室**服务器**配一个 rut **审核插件**——第一个同时建立在两件事之上的示例：**重入的 `vm.call`**（宿主调用 rut，而被 rut 调用的宿主 fn 在第一次调用还停着时又回调进 rut）与 **`opaque` 双向**（rut 递给宿主一个指向自己状态的句柄；宿主递给 rut 一个指向服务器事件总线的句柄）。它也是打包示例：插件从**模块目录**加载，也从运行时由该目录打包出的 **`.rutbundle`** 加载——同一契约的两种形态（[模块捆绑包](../reference/bundles.md)）。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:18
msgid ""
"# transcript asserted + bundle round-trip gates\n"
msgstr ""
"# 对话记录断言 + 捆绑包往返门禁\n"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:21
msgid ""
"The demo drives one scripted session twice — once against the directory, once against the packed bundle — and prints both transcripts plus the round-trip proof. Abridged:"
msgstr "演示把同一段脚本化会话跑两遍——一遍对着目录，一遍对着打包后的捆绑包——并打印两份对话记录加往返证明。节选："


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:37
msgid ""
"The test suite asserts the transcript exactly, proves every line crossed the nested render (`emits == renders`), and gates the bundle form: round-trip equality, byte-determinism, and refusal on an unknown format version or CRC corruption."
msgstr ""
"测试套件逐字断言对话记录，证明每一行都穿过了嵌套 render（`emits == renders`），并为捆绑包形态设门禁：往返相等、逐字节确定性，以及对未知格式版本或 CRC 损坏的拒绝。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:44
msgid "The layering: callbacks at the edges, classes in the middle"
msgstr "分层：回调在边缘，类在中间"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:46
msgid "Four layers, and neither business layer ever touches the crossing protocol:"
msgstr "四层，两个业务层都不触碰跨越协议："


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:56
msgid ""
"The moderator rules themselves are plain rut — flood control (three consecutive messages from one sender mutes them), muted users rejected on rejoin, a `!stats` command, tick heartbeats:"
msgstr "审核规则本身就是普通的 rut——刷屏控制（同一发送者连续三条消息即被禁言）、被禁言用户重进即拒、一条 `!stats` 命令、tick 心跳："


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:60
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"pub fn on_msg(mut self, user: str, text: str) {\n"
"    if (self.is_muted(user)) {\n"
"        self.say(\"muted\", user);\n"
"    } else if (text == \"!stats\") {\n"
"        self.say(\"direct\", f\"{user}: {self.stats()}\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        if (user == self.last_sender) {\n"
"            self.streak += 1;\n"
"        } else {\n"
"            self.last_sender = user;\n"
"            self.streak = 1;\n"
"        }\n"
"        if (self.streak == 3) {\n"
"            self.muted.push(user);\n"
"            self.mutes += 1;\n"
"            self.say(\"system\", f\"{user} muted for flooding\");\n"
"        } else {\n"
"            self.msgs += 1;\n"
"            self.say(\"broadcast\", f\"<{user}> {text}\");\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"pub fn on_msg(mut self, user: str, text: str) {\n"
"    if (self.is_muted(user)) {\n"
"        self.say(\"muted\", user);\n"
"    } else if (text == \"!stats\") {\n"
"        self.say(\"direct\", f\"{user}: {self.stats()}\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        if (user == self.last_sender) {\n"
"            self.streak += 1;\n"
"        } else {\n"
"            self.last_sender = user;\n"
"            self.streak = 1;\n"
"        }\n"
"        if (self.streak == 3) {\n"
"            self.muted.push(user);\n"
"            self.mutes += 1;\n"
"            self.say(\"system\", f\"{user} muted for flooding\");\n"
"        } else {\n"
"            self.msgs += 1;\n"
"            self.say(\"broadcast\", f\"<{user}> {text}\");\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:85
msgid ""
"Every bus write funnels through one private `say(topic, payload)` — the business logic never spells a crossing."
msgstr "每一次总线写入都汇入同一个私有的 `say(topic, payload)`——业务逻辑从不拼写跨越。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:88
msgid "The handshake: both opaque directions meet"
msgstr "握手：两个 opaque 方向会师"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:90
msgid ""
"Closures cannot cross the boundary in either direction, so callbacks register **by name**: the plugin hands the host the export names it wants wired to each topic, and returns the handle to its own state (`init` is the entire handshake — bus box in, state handle out):"
msgstr ""
"闭包无法沿任一方向跨越边界，所以回调**按名注册**：插件把自己想接到各 topic 的导出名交给宿主，并返回指向自己状态的句柄（`init` 就是全部握手——总线盒进，状态句柄出）："


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:95
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"entry fn init(bus: opaque) -> opaque {\n"
"    subscribe(bus, \"join\", \"on_join\");\n"
"    subscribe(bus, \"msg\", \"on_msg\");\n"
"    subscribe(bus, \"leave\", \"on_leave\");\n"
"    subscribe(bus, \"tick\", \"on_tick\");\n"
"    let mod_: ?Moderator = Moderator.new(bus);\n"
"    return opaque(mod_);\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"entry fn init(bus: opaque) -> opaque {\n"
"    subscribe(bus, \"join\", \"on_join\");\n"
"    subscribe(bus, \"msg\", \"on_msg\");\n"
"    subscribe(bus, \"leave\", \"on_leave\");\n"
"    subscribe(bus, \"tick\", \"on_tick\");\n"
"    let mod_: ?Moderator = Moderator.new(bus);\n"
"    return opaque(mod_);\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:106
msgid ""
"rut's moderator state comes back as a **rut-constructed** `opaque` — the host holds the handle and passes it back on every event."
msgstr "rut 的审核状态以一个 **rut 构造的** `opaque` 返回——宿主持有句柄，并在每个事件上回传。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:108
msgid ""
"the host's `EventBus` goes in as a **host-constructed** `Opaque<EventBus>` — `subscribe` and `emit` are that box's callbacks, reached only through the borrow guards ([Value boundary and borrows](../reference/value-boundary.md), [Embedding and native modules](../reference/embedding.md))."
msgstr ""
"宿主的 `EventBus` 以一个**宿主构造的** `Opaque<EventBus>` 进入——`subscribe` 与 `emit` 是这个盒的回调，只能透过借用守卫触及（[值边界与借用](../reference/value-boundary.md)、[嵌入与原生模块](../reference/embedding.md)）。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:114
msgid "The re-entrant call: `emit` re-enters rut mid-op"
msgstr "重入调用：`emit` 在操作中途重新进入 rut"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:116
msgid ""
"The host binds the two `server` rows over its bus. The `emit` body is the interesting one — while the emitting handler is still parked mid-op, it makes a **nested** `vm.call(\"render_line\")` to format the wire line:"
msgstr ""
"宿主把 `server` 的两行绑定到自己的总线上。`emit` 的函数体是有趣的那个——当正在发事件的处理器还停在操作中途时，它发起一次**嵌套的** `vm.call(\"render_line\")` 来格式化线上的一行："


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:122 src/reference/embedding.md:60
#: src/reference/host-fns.md:157
msgid "\"server\""
msgstr ""


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:123 src/reference/embedding.md:61
#: src/reference/host-fns.md:160
msgid "\"emit\""
msgstr ""


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:127
msgid "\"render_line\""
msgstr "\"render_line\""


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:138
msgid ""
"(The comment above this code in the source is worth reading too.) The bus stays mutably borrowed _across_ the nested call — the value boundary's borrow guard is what makes that sound: a second `emit` fired from inside `render_line` would trap on the guard instead of racing. On the rut side, `render_line` is the one-line entry the host re-enters — pure string work, so it runs on its own (the line it prints below is the transcript's broadcast row):"
msgstr ""
"（源码里这段代码上方的注释也值得一读。）总线在嵌套调用_期间_保持可变借用——值边界的借用守卫正是让这一切健全的机制：从 `render_line` 内部再发一次 `emit` 会在守卫上触发陷阱，而不是形成竞争。rut 一侧，`render_line` 是宿主重入的那行入口——纯字符串工作，所以它能独立运行（下面打印的那一行就是对话记录里的 broadcast 行）："


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:146
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"entry fn render_line(topic: str, payload: str) -> str {\n"
"    return f\"[{topic}] {payload}\";\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"bus\");\n"
"    log.info(render_line(\"broadcast\", \"<ada> hello world\"));\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"entry fn render_line(topic: str, payload: str) -> str {\n"
"    return f\"[{topic}] {payload}\";\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"bus\");\n"
"    log.info(render_line(\"broadcast\", \"<ada> hello world\"));\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:163
msgid "The packaging: one directory, two load forms"
msgstr "打包：一个目录，两种加载形态"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:165
msgid ""
"The plugin is a **module directory** — a manifest naming the entry plus its deps, loadable as-is and packable unchanged ([Project structure and rut.jsonc](../reference/project-structure.md)):"
msgstr ""
"插件是一个**模块目录**——一份清单写明入口及其依赖，可以原样加载、原样打包（[项目结构与 rut.jsonc](../reference/project-structure.md)）："


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:169
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"// plugin/rut.jsonc\n"
"{\n"
"  \"format\": \"rutbundle\",\n"
"  \"format_version\": 9,\n"
"  \"name\": \"plugin\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"lib\": \"./plugin.rut\" },\n"
"\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    \"server\": { \"path\": \"../server\" }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:183
msgid ""
"`server/` is the interesting dependency: a **pure declaration surface** — a host package whose manifest points at a `.d.rut` decl file, with the Rust embedder binding the bodies ([Host fns and declaration files](../reference/host-fns.md)):"
msgstr ""
"`server/` 是有意思的那个依赖：一个**纯声明表面**——一个宿主包，其清单指向一个 `.d.rut` 声明文件，函数体由 Rust 嵌入方绑定（[宿主 fn 与声明文件](../reference/host-fns.md)）："


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:194
msgid ""
"`main.rs` packs the same directory with `rut_driver::pack_dir` — a v9 **compiled** bundle: the plugin rides as a `.rutc` binary, its host pkg `server` as a source group — writes `plugin.rutbundle` to temp, and loads it back through the identical `Plugin::load`. The transcript equality print is the proof. The CLI drives the same loader for any self-contained module:"
msgstr ""
"`main.rs` 用 `rut_driver::pack_dir` 打包同一个目录——一个 v9 **编译**捆绑包：插件以 `.rutc` 二进制随行，其宿主包 `server` 以源码组随行——把 `plugin.rutbundle` 写进临时目录，再经完全相同的 `Plugin::load` 加载回来。对话记录相等的打印就是证明。CLI 对任何自包含模块都驱动同一个加载器："


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:201
msgid ""
"# a module directory (rut.jsonc)\n"
msgstr ""
"# 一个模块目录（rut.jsonc）\n"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:202
msgid ""
"# -> mod.rutbundle\n"
msgstr ""
"# -> mod.rutbundle\n"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:203
msgid ""
"# the packed form\n"
msgstr ""
"# 打包形态\n"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:206
msgid ""
"The Rust side mirrors the rut layering: business code calls typed methods (`p.join(\"ada\")`, `p.msg(...)`), and `vm.call` happens in exactly one dispatcher that looks up the subscribed export name per topic — unknown topics are dropped, not trapped, so a server keeps running when a plugin didn't subscribe."
msgstr ""
"Rust 一侧镜像 rut 的分层：业务代码调用带类型的方法（`p.join(\"ada\")`、`p.msg(...)`），而 `vm.call` 只发生在一个分派器里，它按 topic 查订阅的导出名——未知 topic 被丢弃而不是触发陷阱，所以插件没订阅时服务器照常运转。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:214
msgid ""
"**One directory is one module**; the manifest names the entry and the deps, and the same directory packs to a `.rutbundle` unchanged."
msgstr "**一个目录就是一个模块**；清单写明入口与依赖，同一目录原样打包成 `.rutbundle`。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:216
msgid ""
"**Registration by name, not by closure** — callbacks never cross the boundary as values, in either direction."
msgstr "**按名注册，而非按闭包**——回调永不作为值跨越边界，任一方向都不例外。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:218
msgid ""
"**Re-entrancy is sound by construction**: a host fn can call back into rut mid-op, and the borrow guard turns a would-be data race into a loud trap."
msgstr "**重入在构造上就是健全的**：宿主 fn 可以在操作中途回调进 rut，而借用守卫把本会成为数据竞争的东西变成一声响亮的陷阱。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:221
msgid ""
"**Both `opaque` directions** compose: rut-state-out, host-state-in, and neither side can inspect what the other erased."
msgstr "**`opaque` 两个方向**可组合：rut 状态出、宿主状态进，双方都无法窥视对方擦除了什么。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:223
msgid ""
"The layering discipline — adapters own the crossing protocol, business logic stays pure — is what keeps a plugin auditable."
msgstr "分层纪律——适配器独占跨越协议，业务逻辑保持纯粹——正是插件可审计的缘由。"


#: src/examples/03-plugin.md:226
msgid ""
"The crossing rules this example lives on are in [the host boundary](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md); the load forms are specified in [Module bundles](../reference/bundles.md)."
msgstr ""
"本示例赖以立足的跨越规则在[宿主边界](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md)；加载形态规定在[模块捆绑包](../reference/bundles.md)。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:3
msgid ""
"A **parse-only** example: `examples/04-custom-async/custom_async.rut` is a single rut file with no Cargo harness — you cannot run it today, and that is a deliberate disclosure, not an oversight. What it shows is the async vocabulary from the _user_ side: a hand-written future type, an `impl` of the engine's built-in `Future` trait, and a user-written launcher with per-checkpoint stats and cancellation audits. The runnable harness that would drive it end to end is the follow-up work; the file is kept in the repo now because the parser's conformance suite compiles every example, so this vocabulary is checked to stay parseable ([Async and await](../reference/async.md))."
msgstr ""
"一个**仅解析**的示例：`examples/04-custom-async/custom_async.rut` 是单个 rut 文件，没有 Cargo 骨架——今天你没法运行它，而这是刻意的明示，不是疏忽。它展示的是从_用户_一侧看到的异步词汇：一个手写的 future 类型、一个引擎内置 `Future` trait 的 `impl`，以及一个带逐检查点统计与取消审计的用户自写启动器。能端到端驱动它的可运行骨架是后续工作；这个文件如今仍留在仓库里，因为解析器一致性套件会编译每个示例，所以这套词汇被持续检查着保持可解析（[异步与 await](../reference/async.md)）。"


