"There is no harness. The file is exercised by the parser conformance test, which walks every `.rut` file in `examples/`:"
msgstr "没有骨架。这个文件由解析器一致性测试操练，该测试遍历 `examples/` 里的每个 `.rut` 文件："


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:21
msgid ""
"# parses every example, incl. this one\n"
msgstr ""
"# 解析每个示例，包括本例\n"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:24
msgid ""
"To _read_ the same machinery running, see [06 — GitHub viewer CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md): its brain is an `async fn` driven by the standard launcher this file re-spells by hand."
msgstr ""
"想_读_同一套机制运行起来的样子，见[06 — GitHub 查看器 CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md)：它的大脑是一个 `async fn`，由本文件手工重新拼写的标准启动器驱动。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:31
msgid "The audit log — the example's reason to exist"
msgstr "审计日志——这个示例存在的理由"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:33
msgid ""
"`CustomFuture` is a stage machine, but the _point_ of the file is the accounting around it: every launch, resumption, cancellation, and completion lands in one module-owned record the embedder can read after the run:"
msgstr ""
"`CustomFuture` 是一台阶段机器，但这个文件的_要点_在围绕它的记账上：每次启动、恢复、取消和完成都落进一条模块私有的记录，嵌入方可以在运行结束后读取："


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:38
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"struct AuditLog {\n"
"    launches: u32;      // futures this log saw started\n"
"    yields: u32;        // resumptions driven — one per checkpoint\n"
"    cancels: u32;       // cancellation probes that answered true\n"
"    checkpoints: u32;   // high-water mark of the context ledger\n"
"    finished: u32;      // runs that walked every step they booked\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"struct AuditLog {\n"
"    launches: u32;      // futures this log saw started\n"
"    yields: u32;        // resumptions driven — one per checkpoint\n"
"    cancels: u32;       // cancellation probes that answered true\n"
"    checkpoints: u32;   // high-water mark of the context ledger\n"
"    finished: u32;      // runs that walked every step they booked\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:48
msgid ""
"The launcher takes a shared `?AuditLog`, so the embedder holds one cell and reads the whole run's story out of it afterwards — `summary` renders the one-line audit."
msgstr "启动器持有一个共享的 `?AuditLog`，嵌入方因此握着一个单元，之后从中读出整场运行的故事——`summary` 渲染单行审计。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:52
msgid "The machine — what `async fn` weaves, spelled out"
msgstr "机器——`async fn` 织出的东西，摊开在明处"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:54
msgid ""
"When you write `async fn`, the engine weaves a hidden frame whose shape is exactly this: a stage counter, the payload the stages carry, and a done flag. `CustomFuture` spells that shape out in source, so you can see what the keyword hides. The machine itself is plain rut — only the _driving harness_ is missing — so the block below adds a `main` that advances it by hand; that is as far as one can run it today:"
msgstr ""
"当你写下 `async fn`，引擎会织出一个隐藏帧，其形状正是如此：一个阶段计数器、各阶段携带的载荷、一个 done 标志。`CustomFuture` 把这个形状在源码里拼写出来，让你看清关键字背后藏着什么。机器本身就是普通 rut——缺的只是_驱动骨架_——所以下面的代码块补了一个手动推进它的 `main`；这是今天能跑到的最远处："


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:62
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct CustomFuture {\n"
"    steps: u32;      // checkpoints booked before the run finishes\n"
"    stage: str;      // what the current stage does (the audit's label)\n"
"    done: bool;      // the last stage ran\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl CustomFuture {\n"
"    fn new(steps: u32, stage: str) -> Self {\n"
"        return Self { steps: steps, stage: stage, done: false };\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    /// One stage of work — what one resumption advances. `false` when\n"
"    /// no stages are left: the runner's completion signal.\n"
"    fn advance(mut self) -> bool {\n"
"        if (self.done) {\n"
"            return false;\n"
"        }\n"
"        if (self.steps == 0) {\n"
"            self.done = true;\n"
"            return false;\n"
"        }\n"
"        self.steps -= 1;\n"
"        return true;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"future\");\n"
"    let mut f = CustomFuture.new(3, \"poll\");\n"
"    let mut polls = 0;\n"
"    while (f.advance()) {\n"
"        polls += 1;\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"3 steps took {polls} advancing polls, then advance() answered false (done={f.done})\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct CustomFuture {\n"
"    steps: u32;      // checkpoints booked before the run finishes\n"
"    stage: str;      // what the current stage does (the audit's label)\n"
"    done: bool;      // the last stage ran\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl CustomFuture {\n"
"    fn new(steps: u32, stage: str) -> Self {\n"
"        return Self { steps: steps, stage: stage, done: false };\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    /// One stage of work — what one resumption advances. `false` when\n"
"    /// no stages are left: the runner's completion signal.\n"
"    fn advance(mut self) -> bool {\n"
"        if (self.done) {\n"
"            return false;\n"
"        }\n"
"        if (self.steps == 0) {\n"
"            self.done = true;\n"
"            return false;\n"
"        }\n"
"        self.steps -= 1;\n"
"        return true;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"future\");\n"
"    let mut f = CustomFuture.new(3, \"poll\");\n"
"    let mut polls = 0;\n"
"    while (f.advance()) {\n"
"        polls += 1;\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"3 steps took {polls} advancing polls, then advance() answered false (done={f.done})\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:106
msgid "The trait surface: a user impl of a built-in trait"
msgstr "trait 表面：内置 trait 的用户 impl"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:108
msgid ""
"`Future` is an engine-named built-in trait — the engine weaves it for every `async fn`'s hidden frame — but built-in traits are engine _named_, not engine _closed_. A hand-written machine registers through the ordinary nominal path, one impl block, and rides the same drive law ([Traits and dispatch](../core-concepts/traits-and-dispatch.md)). `Future` and `RunContext` are `pub builtin` core names — the impl names them, so the file imports them (`use core::{ Future, RunContext }`):"
msgstr ""
"`Future` 是引擎点名的内置 trait——引擎为每个 `async fn` 的隐藏帧织入它——但内置 trait 是引擎_点名_，不是引擎_封闭_。手写的状态机经普通的名义路径注册，一个 impl 块，走同一条驱动法则（[trait 与分派](../core-concepts/traits-and-dispatch.md)）。`Future` 与 `RunContext` 是 `pub builtin` 的 core 名字——impl 点名它们，因此文件导入它们（`use core::{ Future, RunContext }`）："


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:116
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ Future, RunContext };\n"
"\n"
"impl Future<nil> for CustomFuture {\n"
"    fn yield(self, cx: RunContext) {\n"
"        // the ledger view: the frame's resume state, read as data\n"
"        let at = cx.checkpoint();\n"
"        // the cancellation probe: a cancelled frame stops advancing —\n"
"        // the audit sees it as \"died here, did not advance\" — and runs\n"
"        // its drop path instead of the next stage\n"
"        if (cx.cancelled()) {\n"
"            self.done = true;\n"
"            self.stage = f\"{self.stage}@{at}:cancelled\";\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rutuse core::{ Future, RunContext };impl Future<nil> for CustomFuture {    fn yield(self, cx: RunContext) {        // the ledger view: the frame's resume state, read as data        let at = cx.checkpoint();        // the cancellation probe: a cancelled frame stops advancing —        // the audit sees it as \"died here, did not advance\" — and runs        // its drop path instead of the next stage        if (cx.cancelled()) {            self.done = true;            self.stage = f\"{self.stage}@{at}:cancelled\";        }    }}```"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:134
msgid ""
"The receiver **is** the frame — the machine's fields are its state — and the context is the only handle a resumption needs. The frozen context protocol reads as data: `checkpoint` answers this frame's resume state, `cancelled` answers the task's abort flag. Cancellation is a value the frame inspects, not an exception it catches."
msgstr ""
"接收者**就是**帧——机器的字段就是它的状态——而上下文是一次恢复所需的唯一句柄。冻结的上下文协议按数据来读：`checkpoint` 回答本帧的恢复状态，`cancelled` 回答任务的中止标志。取消是帧检查的一个值，不是它捕获的异常。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:140
msgid "The user launcher"
msgstr "用户启动器"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:142
msgid ""
"The engine's standard launcher set (`launch_future`, `LaunchedFutureHandle`, `sleep`) is ordinary code any module may re-spell — that is the point of `launch_custom`. It supplies the driving and the audit over the same `Future` surface, so the machine never knows which launcher started it:"
msgstr ""
"引擎的标准启动器套装（`launch_future`、`LaunchedFutureHandle`、`sleep`）是任何模块都可以重新拼写的普通代码——这正是 `launch_custom` 的意义所在。它在同一 `Future` 表面上提供驱动与审计，所以机器永远不知道是哪个启动器启动了它："


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:158
msgid ""
"The returned `CustomLaunched` receipt is deliberately **not** a future — it cannot be awaited, and it is not re-launchable (that is a type error, never a runtime check). Its one real member is the cancel edge, which flags the task and lets the loop's re-drive run the probe:"
msgstr ""
"返回的 `CustomLaunched` 回执刻意**不是** future——它不能被 await，也不能再次启动（那是类型错误，绝不是运行时检查）。它唯一真正的成员是取消边：标记任务，让循环的再驱动去跑那个探测："


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:182
msgid ""
"Alongside sits `audit_drive`, the audit twin of the engine loop's drive columns: run a stage, count the resumption, stop on completion."
msgstr "旁边还坐着 `audit_drive`，引擎循环各驱动列的审计孪生：跑一个阶段，记一次恢复，完成即停。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:185
msgid "Scope, honestly"
msgstr "范围，如实相告"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:187
msgid "Two boundaries to keep straight when you read this file:"
msgstr "读这个文件时要分清两条边界："


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:189
msgid ""
"**User futures are launcher-drivable** — the driving loop finds the `Future::yield` row in the vtable, exactly as it does for woven frames."
msgstr "**用户 future 可被启动器驱动**——驱动循环在 vtable 里找到 `Future::yield` 行，与对待织入帧完全一样。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:192
msgid ""
"**`await` targets engine-woven futures only** in the current build (async-fn results and `sleep`); awaiting an arbitrary user impl, and joining concurrent futures, land with the next async milestone."
msgstr ""
"**`await` 只面向引擎织入的 future**（当前构建中：async fn 的结果与 `sleep`）；await 任意的用户 impl，以及 join 并发的 future，要等下一个异步里程碑。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:196
msgid ""
"So today the file is a parse-checked design corpus and a teaching document: the shape of the weave, the shape of a launcher, and the proof that the future trait is a user-extensible surface — not a runnable demo. When you want the runnable version of the same story, read [06 — GitHub viewer CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md), and for the model behind it, [the async model](../core-concepts/async-model.md)."
msgstr ""
"所以今天这个文件是一份解析受检的设计语料和教学文档：织造的形状、启动器的形状，以及 future trait 是用户可扩展表面这份证明——不是可运行的演示。想要同一个故事的可运行版本，去读[06 — GitHub 查看器 CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md)；想看背后的模型，去读[异步模型](../core-concepts/async-model.md)。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:205
msgid ""
"`async fn` compiles to a hidden frame implementing `Future` — this file spells that frame out in user source."
msgstr "`async fn` 编译为实现 `Future` 的隐藏帧——本文件在用户源码里把这个帧拼写出来。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:207
msgid ""
"Built-in traits are engine-named, not engine-closed: `impl Future<nil> for YourType` registers through the ordinary path."
msgstr "内置 trait 是引擎命名的，不是引擎封闭的：`impl Future<nil> for YourType` 走普通路径注册。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:209
msgid ""
"Cancellation is data the frame reads (`cx.cancelled()`), and every checkpoint is observable (`cx.checkpoint()`)."
msgstr "取消是帧读取的数据（`cx.cancelled()`），而每个检查点都可观察（`cx.checkpoint()`）。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:211
msgid ""
"A launcher is just code: driving + audit over the public `Future` surface, re-spellable by any module."
msgstr "启动器只是代码：公共 `Future` 表面上的驱动 + 审计，任何模块都可重新拼写。"


#: src/examples/04-custom-async.md:213
msgid ""
"The file is parse-only by disclosure; the runnable harness is follow-up work — the machine itself is plain rut (it ran above), but nothing launches or drives it as a future yet."
msgstr "本文件按明示仅限解析；可运行骨架是后续工作——机器本身是普通 rut（它在上面跑过了），但还没有任何东西把它作为 future 启动或驱动。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:3
msgid ""
"One page app — a todolist with a simulated server — where **every DOM move and every timer goes through ten declared host crossings**, and the page's brain is a rut project of **two packages**. `ui` is the framework: an atom store (the jotai shape, in rut), a widget type, a keyed diff, and a component vocabulary. `biz` is the domain: the todolist machine expressed as store mutations, plus the app shell. The host — web-sys on wasm32 in the browser, a fake-DOM twin on native in the tests — owns the loop; rut owns the state. Pure rut: no event loop, no async keywords on the rut side; every asynchronous fact enters through a door named for its event."
msgstr ""
"一个整页应用——带模拟服务器的待办清单——其中**每一次 DOM 移动、每一个定时器都穿过十条已声明的宿主跨越**，而页面的大脑是一个**双包**的 rut 项目。`ui` 是框架：一个原子存储（jotai 的形态，用 rut 写）、一个部件类型、一个键控 diff，以及一套组件词汇。`biz` 是领域：表达为存储变更的待办清单机器，加上应用外壳。宿主——浏览器里是 wasm32 上的 web-sys，测试里是原生的假 DOM 孪生——拥有循环；rut 拥有状态。纯 rut：rut 一侧没有事件循环，没有 async 关键字；每个异步事实都经由一扇以自身事件命名的门进入。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:17
msgid ""
"# the twin + the law (95 tests), from the repo root\n"
msgstr ""
"# 孪生 + 法则（95 个测试），从仓库根目录\n"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:19
msgid ""
"# the through-the-artifact gate (node tier + browser tier)\n"
msgstr ""
"# 穿过产物的门禁（node 层 + 浏览器层）\n"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:22
msgid ""
"`cargo test` runs the whole story on the **fake-DOM twin** — a HashMap element tree with real DOM semantics and a virtual timer clock — over the same rut sources the browser runs. The e2e script builds nothing silently and skips nothing silently: tier 1 (plain node) drives the real wasm artifact through the loader's own ABI on a fake DOM; tier 2 (when geckodriver + Firefox exist) types and clicks the live page."
msgstr ""
"`cargo test` 在**假 DOM 孪生**上跑完整故事——一棵带真实 DOM 语义的 HashMap 元素树加一个虚拟定时器时钟——跑在与浏览器相同的 rut 源码上。e2e 脚本不悄悄构建任何东西，也不悄悄跳过任何东西：tier 1（纯 node）在假 DOM 上经加载器自己的 ABI 驱动真实的 wasm 产物；tier 2（当 geckodriver + Firefox 存在时）在活页面上打字、点击。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:30
msgid "To open the page yourself:"
msgstr "自己打开这个页面："


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:40
msgid ""
"What you'll see: type a title — the status line echoes the typing and the counts never move (the draft is not a counts dependency). Press Add — an italic _pending_ line paints immediately, the counts line flips to `1 in flight`, and ~400 ms later the committed row replaces it. Toggle a row — the title goes italic for ~250 ms, then the check fills and the title strikes through. The row animates because the keyed diff **kept the node alive** — nothing is cleared and rebuilt, ever."
msgstr ""
"你会看到：输入一个标题——状态行回显输入，计数纹丝不动（草稿不是计数的依赖）。按 Add——一行斜体的_待定_立即绘制出来，计数行翻成 `1 in flight`，约 400 毫秒后提交的行取而代之。切换一行的状态——标题斜体约 250 毫秒，然后勾选填上、标题划线。行之所以有动画，是因为键控 diff **让节点保活**——任何东西都不会被清空重建，永远。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:51
msgid "The ABI is the page: `main` plus the doors"
msgstr "ABI 就是页面：`main` 加各扇门"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:53
msgid ""
"`rut/biz/app.rut` — the boot turn builds the app container and returns it as an `opaque` (rut has no mutable module state, so the host holds the state and re-passes it every turn — the [00 — Todolist](00-todolist.md) pattern at page scale):"
msgstr ""
"`rut/biz/app.rut` ——启动回合构建应用容器并把它作为 `opaque` 返回（rut 没有可变的模块状态，所以宿主持有状态并每回合回传——[00 — 待办清单](00-todolist.md)模式在页面尺度上的应用）："


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:58
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"entry fn main() -> opaque {\n"
"    let boot: World = world_boot(\"booted — type a title, press Add\");\n"
"    let root = AppRoot {\n"
"        world: boot,\n"
"        t1: t1_mount(\"app\"),\n"
"    };\n"
"    paint(root);\n"
"    return opaque(root);\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"entry fn main() -> opaque {\n"
"    let boot: World = world_boot(\"booted — type a title, press Add\");\n"
"    let root = AppRoot {\n"
"        world: boot,\n"
"        t1: t1_mount(\"app\"),\n"
"    };\n"
"    paint(root);\n"
"    return opaque(root);\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:70
msgid ""
"Every asynchronous fact enters through a door named for its event — `on_click`/`on_input` for DOM events, `on_timer` for the clock. Each door re-passes the container and answers the entry-err pair: `(opaque(c), \"\")` on a clean turn, `(nil, why)` on a soft failure the pump reports _while keeping the page alive_."
msgstr ""
"每个异步事实都经由一扇以自身事件命名的门进入——DOM 事件走 `on_click`/`on_input`，时钟走 `on_timer`。每扇门都回传容器并回答入口-err 对偶：干净回合回答 `(opaque(c), \"\")`，软失败回答 `(nil, why)`，由泵在_保住页面性命_的同时上报。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:76
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"fn dom_event(mut r: AppRoot, id: str, detail: str) -> (?opaque, str) {\n"
"    let booked = t1_event(r.t1, id, detail);\n"
"    let req = opaque.downcast<Req>(booked);\n"
"    if (req != nil) {\n"
"        tim_after(req.latency, req.tag);\n"
"    }\n"
"    paint(r);\n"
"    return (opaque(r), \"\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"fn dom_event(mut r: AppRoot, id: str, detail: str) -> (?opaque, str) {\n"
"    let booked = t1_event(r.t1, id, detail);\n"
"    let req = opaque.downcast<Req>(booked);\n"
"    if (req != nil) {\n"
"        tim_after(req.latency, req.tag);\n"
"    }\n"
"    paint(r);\n"
"    return (opaque(r), \"\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:88
msgid ""
"The \"server\" is a request table, not a scheduler: adding never touches the list — the machine books a request and the app books one `tim_after(latency, tag)`; the list changes only when the timer's turn runs the answer mutation (per-kind latency, so deadline-ordered commits are visible across kinds)."
msgstr ""
"这个\"服务器\"是一张请求表，不是调度器：添加从不触碰列表——机器登记一个请求，应用登记一次 `tim_after(latency, tag)`；列表只在定时器的回合运行应答变更时才改变（按类型各异的延迟，因此按截止时间排序的提交在不同类型间可见）。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:94
msgid "The ten crossings"
msgstr "十次跨越"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:96
msgid ""
"`web.d.rut` (flat at the example root, registered by hand in both lanes) declares the whole host surface. Elements cross as `opaque` handles; everything else is strings, ints, and bools — no app names, no data shipping, no callbacks ([the host boundary](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md)):"
msgstr ""
"`web.d.rut`（平铺在示例根目录，两条通道都手工注册）声明了全部宿主表面。元素以 `opaque` 句柄跨越；其余一切都是字符串、整数和布尔——没有应用专名，没有数据搬运，没有回调（[宿主边界](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md)）："


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:115
msgid ""
"A wiring bug is loud: a missing id traps (`web::ui_get: no element '#x'`), a kind mismatch names both sides. The host never grew an app-specific crossing — the entire widget system fits over these ten rows, unchanged."
msgstr ""
"接线错误是响亮的：缺失的 id 触发陷阱（`web::ui_get: no element '#x'`），类型不匹配会点名双方。宿主从未长出任何应用专属的跨越——整个部件系统就架在这十行之上，分毫未改。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:120
msgid "The store: jotai's shape over private traits"
msgstr "存储：私有 trait 之上的 jotai 形态"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:122
msgid ""
"`rut/ui/store.rut` is the kernel. Handles are keys, not objects — `Source<T>`, `Derived<T>`, `Mutation<A, R>` carry ids and have no logic of their own beyond routing through their store. The machinery traits are **module-private**, so the domain package cannot name them even to import them — which is how \"a derived cell is not writable\" is enforced at the type level ([Traits and dispatch](../core-concepts/traits-and-dispatch.md)):"
msgstr ""
"`rut/ui/store.rut` 是内核。句柄是键，不是对象——`Source<T>`、`Derived<T>`、`Mutation<A, R>` 只携带 id，除经由所属存储路由之外没有任何自己的逻辑。机制 trait 是**模块私有的**，领域包连 import 它们的名字都拿不到——\"派生单元不可写\"就是这样在类型层面强制执行的（[trait 与分派](../core-concepts/traits-and-dispatch.md)）："


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:130
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"trait Readable<T> {\n"
"    fn atom_id(self) -> u32;\n"
"    fn materialize(self, st: Store) -> nil; // first touch: the seed lands\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"trait Writable<A, R> {\n"
"    fn atom_id(self) -> u32;\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"trait Readable<T> {\n"
"    fn atom_id(self) -> u32;\n"
"    fn materialize(self, st: Store) -> nil; // first touch: the seed lands\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"trait Writable<A, R> {\n"
"    fn atom_id(self) -> u32;\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:141
msgid ""
"Freshness is **pull-on-read**: a write bumps a generation, and a `get` recomputes a stale derived at most once per write-set. There is no flush step anywhere. Dependencies are **discovered, never declared** — the `ctx.get` calls inside a derive closure ARE the dependency list, re-recorded on every recompute. The domain's counts line is the worked example (`rut/biz/world.rut`):"
msgstr ""
"新鲜度是**读时拉取**：一次写入 bumps 一个代数，`get` 至多在每个写集内把过期的派生重算一次。任何地方都没有冲刷步骤。依赖是**发现的，不是声明的**——derive 闭包内部的 `ctx.get` 调用就是依赖列表，每次重算都重新记录。领域的计数行就是完整的示范（`rut/biz/world.rut`）："


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:148
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"let counts$ = store.derive(fn (ctx) -> str {\n"
"    let items = ctx.get(items$);\n"
"    let reqs = ctx.get(reqs$);\n"
"    let mut open = 0;\n"
"    for (let t of items) {\n"
"        if (t.done == false) {\n"
"            open += 1;\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"    let done_n = items.len() - open;\n"
"    return f\"{open} open | {done_n} done | {reqs.len()} in flight\";\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"let counts$ = store.derive(fn (ctx) -> str {\n"
"    let items = ctx.get(items$);\n"
"    let reqs = ctx.get(reqs$);\n"
"    let mut open = 0;\n"
"    for (let t of items) {\n"
"        if (t.done == false) {\n"
"            open += 1;\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"    let done_n = items.len() - open;\n"
"    return f\"{open} open | {done_n} done | {reqs.len()} in flight\";\n"
"});\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:163
msgid ""
"Writes go through mutation fns — `add_m`, `toggle_m`, `remove_m`, `answer_m` — multi-step write programs that run in the one write lane; the machine's counters are sources too, because with no domain container there is nowhere else for state to live."
msgstr ""
"写入经由变更 fn——`add_m`、`toggle_m`、`remove_m`、`answer_m`——运行在唯一写车道上的多步写程序；机器的计数器也是 source，因为没有领域容器，状态就无处可住。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:168
msgid "Widgets are data; the diff does the DOM"
msgstr "部件是数据；diff 负责 DOM"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:170
msgid ""
"`view(r)` is a pure function from app state to a `Widget` tree — it runs no crossing and reads nothing (reads are reactive _props_, resolved at the render door). `t1_render` diffs the new tree against the previous one held in `T1Root` and fires only deltas: match children by key, patch in place, re-append on reorder, retire gone keys' listeners. Nothing changed = nothing fires ([HashMaps and sets](../reference/builtin-generic-types.md) carry the path-keyed tables):"
msgstr ""
"`view(r)` 是从应用状态到 `Widget` 树的纯函数——它不做任何跨越，也不读取任何东西（读取是响应式的 _props_，在渲染门上解析）。`t1_render` 把新树与 `T1Root` 持有的上一棵树做 diff，只触发增量：按键匹配子节点、就地打补丁、重排时重新追加、为消失的键注销监听器。没有变化 = 什么都不触发（路径为键的表由[HashMap 与集合](../reference/builtin-generic-types.md)承载）："


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:179
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"pub struct T1Root {\n"
"    parent: opaque; // the mounted root element\n"
"    prev: ?Widget = nil; // the previous tree — the diff's left side\n"
"    els: HashMap<str, opaque>; // path -> live handle (ops application)\n"
"    regs: HashMap<str, Ev>; // listener id (as crossed) -> the\n"
"    // widget's event wiring (a data-shaped binding)\n"
"    lids: HashMap<str, i64>; // path -> listener id (retirement)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"pub struct T1Root {\n"
"    parent: opaque; // the mounted root element\n"
"    prev: ?Widget = nil; // the previous tree — the diff's left side\n"
"    els: HashMap<str, opaque>; // path -> live handle (ops application)\n"
"    regs: HashMap<str, Ev>; // listener id (as crossed) -> the\n"
"    // widget's event wiring (a data-shaped binding)\n"
"    lids: HashMap<str, i64>; // path -> listener id (retirement)\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:190
msgid ""
"Event wiring rides the widgets as **data, not closures** — a row's toggle mutation carries its argument bound (`.on_row(w.toggle_row, t.id)`), and the framework resolves a firing listener id to that wiring. Styling is a token contract: the stylesheet keys only the lowered `t1-*` tokens, and the app spells no class."
msgstr ""
"事件接线以**数据而非闭包**的形式骑在部件上——一行的 toggle 变更带着已绑定的实参（`.on_row(w.toggle_row, t.id)`），框架把触发的监听器 id 解析到那份接线。样式是一份 token 契约：样式表只认_lower_ 之后的 `t1-*` token，应用不写任何 class。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:196
msgid "Two packages, two manifests"
msgstr "两个包，两份清单"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:198
msgid ""
"A real project is not one file — but the package boundary is also the privacy boundary, which is why there are exactly two ([Project structure and rut.jsonc](../reference/project-structure.md)):"
msgstr ""
"真实的项目不止一个文件——但包边界同时是隐私边界，这正是只有两个包的原因（[项目结构与 rut.jsonc](../reference/project-structure.md)）："


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:202
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"// rut/biz/rut.jsonc — the project root\n"
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"app\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"lib\": \"./biz.rut\", \"libs\": [\"./domain.rut\", \"./world.rut\", \"./app.rut\"] },\n"
"\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    \"ui\":      { \"path\": \"../ui\" },\n"
"    \"pouch\":   { \"path\": \"../../../../rut/pouch\" },\n"
"    \"nmapset\": { \"path\": \"../../../../rut/nmapset\" }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:216
msgid ""
"`entry.libs` splices several files into ONE module (base first, array order), so a name private to `store.rut` is visible to `components.rut` and to nothing outside `ui` — single-file privacy, kept at package scale. `ui` is marked `inline = true` (its generic exports splice by law), and the native lane mounts the _directory_ — the manifest, not a Rust fn, is the module list. The wasm lane mounts the same packages by hand as a mirror, and a test pins both lanes to byte-identical binaries."
msgstr ""
"`entry.libs` 把多个文件拼接成一个模块（基文件在前，按数组顺序），所以 `store.rut` 私有的名字对 `components.rut` 可见，对 `ui` 之外的一切不可见——单文件隐私，保持在包尺度。`ui` 被标为 `inline = true`（它的泛型导出依法拼接），原生通道挂载_目录_——清单就是模块列表，而不是某个 Rust fn。wasm 通道作为镜像手工挂载同样的包，并且有一个测试把两条通道钉在逐字节相同的二进制上。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:227
msgid ""
"The page ABI is `main` plus doors named for their events; state lives in the container the host re-passes every turn."
msgstr "页面 ABI 就是 `main` 加各扇以其事件命名的门；状态活在宿主每回合回传的容器里。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:229
msgid ""
"Ten thin crossings carried an entire reactive framework — the host stayed generic and never learned the word \"todo\"."
msgstr "十条薄跨越扛起了整个响应式框架——宿主保持通用，从未学会\"todo\"这个词。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:231
msgid ""
"The store is jotai's shape in rut: discovered deps, pull-on-read freshness, mutations as the write lane, and type-level non-writability through private traits."
msgstr "存储是 rut 里的 jotai 形态：发现的依赖、读时拉取的新鲜度、作为写车道的变更，以及透过私有 trait 达成的类型级不可写。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:234
msgid ""
"Widgets are values; the keyed diff is the only thing that speaks DOM, and patch-in-place is what makes the UI animatable."
msgstr "部件是值；键控 diff 是唯一会讲 DOM 的东西，而就地打补丁正是 UI 可动画的原因。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:236
msgid ""
"Soft failures are data (`(nil, why)` and the pump keeps draining); a panic alone kills the page, loud."
msgstr "软失败是数据（`(nil, why)`，泵继续排空）；只有 panic 才杀死页面，而且死得响亮。"


#: src/examples/05-todolist-web.md:239
msgid ""
"The async shape this page _simulates_ (the request table + timers) is the real thing in [06 — GitHub viewer CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md); the store's building blocks are in [the swappable packages](../reference/stdlib.md)."
msgstr ""
"本页_模拟_的异步形态（请求表 + 定时器）在[06 — GitHub 查看器 CLI](06-github-viewer-cli.md)里是真家伙；存储的构件在[可替换的包](../reference/stdlib.md)。"


#: src/examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md:3
msgid ""
"`rgh` lists and downloads files from public GitHub repositories over the jsDelivr CDN — no GitHub API, no tokens. Its **brain is a rut async free fn**: argv carving, the URL building, the tree JSON decode, the human-size formatter, every message and exit code run in the VM. The Rust half is a pure embedder: mount packages, bind host bodies, launch the brain, pump the driving loop to idle, exit with the brain's i32 (`0` ok, `1` runtime error, `2` usage). This is the worked example for the std `http` lane's redesigned face — `HttpClient`, builder-style construction, and async-only send with true streaming."
msgstr ""
"`rgh` 经由 jsDelivr CDN 列出并下载公开 GitHub 仓库中的文件——不用 GitHub API，不用令牌。它的**大脑是一个 rut 异步自由函数**：argv 切分、URL 构建、树状 JSON 解码、人性化尺寸格式化，每一条消息与每一个退出码都在 VM 里运行。Rust 那一半是纯粹的嵌入方：挂载包、绑定宿主函数体、启动大脑、把驱动循环泵送到空闲、带着大脑的 i32 退出（`0` 正常，`1` 运行时错误，`2` 用法错误）。这是 std `http` 链路重塑后新面孔的完整示范——`HttpClient`、builder 式构建，以及只异步的 send 加真正的流式传输。"


