msgid ""
"The character-level rules of rut source: files, comments, identifiers, the keyword set, and the enforced naming conventions."
msgstr "rut 源码的字符级规则：文件、注释、标识符、关键字集合，以及强制执行的命名约定。"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:6
msgid "Source model"
msgstr "源码模型"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:8
msgid ""
"Files are UTF-8, extension `.rut`. Both LF and CRLF line endings are accepted (CRLF is normalized); a leading BOM is skipped."
msgstr "文件为 UTF-8 编码，扩展名 `.rut`。LF 与 CRLF 行尾均可接受（CRLF 会被规范化）；开头的 BOM 会被跳过。"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:10
msgid "Comments:"
msgstr "注释："


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:11
msgid "`// line comment`"
msgstr "`// line comment`"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:12
msgid "`/* block comment */` — block comments do **not** nest"
msgstr "`/* block comment */` —— 块注释**不**嵌套"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:13
msgid ""
"`/// doc comment` (also `/** ... */`) — attaches to the following declaration and is kept for tooling; it is not semantic"
msgstr "`/// doc comment`（也有 `/** ... */`）—— 附着于其后的声明，保留给工具链使用；不具语义"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:15
msgid ""
"There is no off-side rule: statements end with `;` (required), blocks are braced."
msgstr "没有 off-side rule（靠缩进划分结构）：语句以 `;` 结尾（必需），代码块用花括号包裹。"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:18
msgid "Identifiers and `$`"
msgstr "标识符与 `$`"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:20
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"ident := (letter | \"_\" | \"$\") (letter | digit | \"_\" | \"$\")*\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"ident := (letter | \"_\" | \"$\") (letter | digit | \"_\" | \"$\")*\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:24
msgid ""
"`$` is an ordinary identifier character, valid anywhere in a name: `on_mount$`, `viewport_size$`, `$temp`, `$x1`, even `$` alone. There is no `$` punctuation token and no `$`\\-interpolation (f-string holes use `{ }` — see [Literals and inference](literals-and-inference.md))."
msgstr ""
"`$` 是普通的标识符字符，可出现在名称的任意位置：`on_mount$`、`viewport_size$`、`$temp`、`$x1`，甚至单独一个 `$`。不存在 `$` 标点记号，也不存在 `$`\\- 插值（f-string 的占位用 `{ }` —— 参见[字面量与推断](literals-and-inference.md)）。"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:29
msgid ""
"The **trailing** `$` is a naming convention, not a lexical category: it marks _dispatch-inverted_ members — anything a runtime fires or owns rather than you calling it. Event props (`on_click$`), lifecycle hooks (`on_mount$`, `before_destroy$`), subscription updates (`on_update$`), watch controls (`start$`, `stop$`), engine atoms (`viewport_size$`), and mutation handles generally. Never on functions _you_ call, widget builders, or types."
msgstr ""
"**尾部的** `$` 是命名约定，而非词法类别：它标记 _分派反转_（dispatch-inverted）成员 —— 由运行时触发或持有、而非由你调用的成员。事件属性（`on_click$`）、生命周期钩子（`on_mount$`、`before_destroy$`）、订阅更新（`on_update$`）、监视控制（`start$`、`stop$`）、引擎原子（`viewport_size$`），以及泛指的各种变更句柄。绝不要用在 _你_ 调用的函数、widget 构建器或类型上。"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:37
msgid "Keywords"
msgstr "关键字"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:39
msgid "The keyword set is exactly:"
msgstr "关键字集合恰好为："


