#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:78
msgid ""
"The list is short and closed. Words that are keywords in JavaScript or Rust — `switch`, `match`, `null`, `var`, `const`, `delete`, `new`, … — are ordinary identifiers here: `let null = 5;` and `fn match()` are legal rut."
msgstr ""
