#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:83
msgid "Naming conventions (enforced)"
msgstr "命名约定（强制执行）"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:85
msgid ""
"**Types are PascalCase** — user types and parameterized builtins: `Vec<T>`, `[T]`, `Weak<T>`, `opaque`, `Task<T>`, `Point`, `Drawable`. Scalars and simple buffers stay lowercase: `i32`, `u8`, `f32`, `bool`, `str`, `bytes`."
msgstr ""
"**类型采用 PascalCase** —— 用户类型与参数化的内置类型：`Vec<T>`、`[T]`、`Weak<T>`、`opaque`、`Task<T>`、`Point`、`Drawable`。标量与简单缓冲区保持小写：`i32`、`u8`、`f32`、`bool`、`str`、`bytes`。"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:89
msgid ""
"**Functions and methods are lower_snake_case** — `unwrap_or(d)`, `push(v)`, `checked_add(y)`, `spawn_worker(..)`."
msgstr ""
"**函数与方法采用 lower_snake_case** —— `unwrap_or(d)`、`push(v)`、`checked_add(y)`、`spawn_worker(..)`。"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:91
msgid ""
"**Construction is a method call, never a type-call.** User classes construct through their own class methods: `Rect.new(3, 4)`, `Rect.from(other)`, `Version.parse(s)` — see [Classes and constructors](classes.md). Only builtin surfaces keep call forms: `bytes.zeroed(n)`, `opaque(v)`, the repeat `[v; n]`, and `Vec<T>.from(..)` (see [Builtin generic types](builtin-generic-types.md))."
msgstr ""
"**构造是方法调用，绝不是类型调用。** 用户类通过自己的类方法进行构造：`Rect.new(3, 4)`、`Rect.from(other)`、`Version.parse(s)` —— 参见[类与构造器](classes.md)。只有内置接口面保留调用形式：`bytes.zeroed(n)`、`opaque(v)`、重复形式 `[v; n]`，以及 `Vec<T>.from(..)`（参见[内置泛型类型](builtin-generic-types.md)）。"


#: src/reference/lexical-structure.md:98
msgid ""
"The trailing-`$` marker is kept meaningful by this style rule alone; the compiler attaches no semantics to it."
msgstr "尾部 `$` 标记仅靠这条风格规则保持其意义；编译器不为它附加任何语义。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:3
msgid ""
"Module scope contains **declarations only** — every statement lives inside a function, and **loading a module executes nothing**. Visibility is private by default, with package-scoped forms for libraries."
msgstr "模块作用域**只包含声明** —— 每条语句都位于函数之内，并且**加载模块不执行任何代码**。可见性默认为私有，并为库提供包级作用域的形式。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:7
msgid "Module structure"
msgstr "模块结构"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:9
msgid "Allowed at module scope:"
msgstr "模块作用域允许的内容："


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:11 src/reference/structs.md:6
msgid "Declaration"
msgstr "声明"


