msgid "`type X = A;` (see [Type aliases and union bounds](type-aliases.md))"
msgstr "`type X = A;`（参见[类型别名与联合约束](type-aliases.md)）"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:21
msgid ""
"Anything else — calls, any statement — is a compile error: _statements are not allowed at module scope — modules contain declarations only_."
msgstr "其他任何内容 —— 调用、任何语句 —— 都是编译错误：_模块作用域不允许出现语句 —— 模块只包含声明_。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:25
msgid ""
"`host fn` / `host struct` and `builtin` declarations are signature-only native surfaces: `host` rows live in declaration files (`.d.rut`) and `builtin` rows in the engine's own `core` surface, never as executable bodies in `.rut`."
msgstr ""
"`host fn` / `host struct` 与 `builtin` 声明是只有签名的原生接口面：`host` 条目位于声明文件（`.d.rut`）中，`builtin` 条目位于引擎自身的 `core` 接口中，绝不会以可执行体的形式出现在 `.rut` 里。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:30
msgid "Uses"
msgstr "use 的用法"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:32
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use pouch::{ Vec };\n"
"use ink::Logger;\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"uses\");\n"
"    let v = Vec<i32>.new();\n"
"    log.info(f\"{v.len()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use pouch::{ Vec };\n"
"use ink::Logger;\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"uses\");\n"
"    let v = Vec<i32>.new();\n"
"    log.info(f\"{v.len()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:47
msgid ""
"The package is **one bare identifier**; the names are one or more idents. rut is fully statically typed: the compiler resolves every used name and knows from usage whether it lands in type position (`Vec` in an annotation) or value position (`Logger.new(..)`), so there is nothing for the user to annotate. An unreferenced use name is a lint, not an error."
msgstr ""
"包名是**单个裸标识符**；名称则是一个或多个标识符。rut 是完全静态类型的：编译器会解析每个被使用的名称，并根据用法判断它处于类型位置（注解中的 `Vec`）还是值位置（`Logger.new(..)`），因此用户无需编写任何注解。未被引用的 use 名称只是一条 lint，不是错误。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:54
msgid ""
"The engine's builtin names — the primitives, `opaque`, `panic`, `type_id<T>()`, `str(x)` — are **ambient**: no `use` is needed for them. The gated names resolve only through `use core::{ .. }`: the const `NAN`, the `Disposal`/ `DisposalContext` pair, and every builtin trait (`Iterator`, `Future`, `RunContext`) — the engine's weave never needs the import, only source that spells a trait name does ([Host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md)). Package code (`pouch`, `ink`, `nmapset`, ...) mounts only through `use`."
msgstr ""
"引擎的内置名字——基本类型、`opaque`、`panic`、`type_id<T>()`、`str(x)`——都是**环境自带**的：无需 `use`。受把守的名字只能经 `use core::{ .. }` 解析：常量 `NAN`、`Disposal`/`DisposalContext` 对，以及每一个内置 trait（`Iterator`、`Future`、`RunContext`）——引擎的织造从不需要导入，需要它的是拼写了 trait 名字的源码（[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)）。包代码（`pouch`、`ink`、`nmapset`……）只能经 `use` 挂载。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:65
msgid "Module-level `let`"
msgstr "模块级 `let`"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:67
msgid ""
"Initializers must be **load-time expressions**: literals, enum members, builtin operators over load-time expressions, struct literals whose fields are load-time expressions, fixed-array literals whose elements are, `type_id<T>()`, and builtin zero allocations (`[nil; n]` with a const `n`). Calls to user functions are not load-time expressions."
msgstr ""
"初始化式必须是**加载期表达式**：字面量、枚举成员、作用于加载期表达式的内置运算符、字段均为加载期表达式的结构体字面量、元素均为加载期表达式的定长数组字面量、`type_id<T>()`，以及内置的零值分配（`[nil; n]`，其中 `n` 为常量）。对用户函数的调用不是加载期表达式。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:78
msgid ""
"There is no mutable module state: program state is constructed in `main`, or held by the embedder and passed across the boundary. **No user code runs at load.**"
msgstr "不存在可变的模块状态：程序状态在 `main` 中构造，或由嵌入方持有并跨边界传入。**加载期间不会运行任何用户代码。**"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:82
msgid "Entry points"
msgstr "入口点"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:84
msgid ""
"The embedder loads a module and then explicitly calls an entry function — conventionally `pub fn main`, sync or async. `entry fn` publishes a function to the _embedder_; `entry` is orthogonal to visibility and does not combine with `pub`. Consequences of declarations-only loading: no use side-effect ordering, no load-order bugs, deterministic and cheap loads."
msgstr ""
"嵌入方加载模块后会显式调用一个入口函数 —— 惯例是 `pub fn main`，同步或异步均可。`entry fn` 把函数发布给 _嵌入方_；`entry` 与可见性正交，且不与 `pub` 组合。只含声明的加载带来的结果：不存在 use 副作用的顺序问题，不存在加载顺序 bug，加载行为确定且开销低。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:91
msgid "Bindings: `let` vs `let mut`"
msgstr "绑定：`let` 与 `let mut`"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:93
msgid ""
"`let x = e;` binds immutably — no reassignment, no field assignment through `x`, and no `mut self` method calls on it. It is a **read-only view of the shared object**."
msgstr ""
"`let x = e;` 以不可变方式绑定 —— 不能重新赋值，不能通过 `x` 给字段赋值，也不能对它调用 `mut self` 方法。它是**共享对象的只读视图**。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:96
msgid ""
"`let mut x = e;` may be reassigned and grants write access **to the object it holds**. Every non-primitive is a shared cell (see [By-reference and nullable](by-reference-and-nullable.md)), so that write is visible through every other handle: `mut` is _permission_, never a copy. Every assignment path must run through a `mut` binding."
msgstr ""
"`let mut x = e;` 可以重新赋值，并授予**对其所持有对象**的写访问权。每个非基本类型值都是共享单元（参见[按引用与可空](by-reference-and-nullable.md)），因此这一写入会透过其他所有句柄可见：`mut` 是 _权限_，绝不是复制。每条赋值路径都必须经过 `mut` 绑定。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:101
msgid ""
"Parameters may declare `mut name` — the callee's permission to mutate **the caller's object**: `fn step(mut p: Point)` moves the caller's point; `fn area(p: Point)` promises not to."
msgstr ""
"参数可以声明 `mut name` —— 这是被调用方**改动调用方对象**的许可：`fn step(mut p: Point)` 会移动调用方的点；`fn area(p: Point)` 则承诺不这样做。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:107
msgid ""
"Modules form a tree per package (files in directories; the package root is the root module). Every declaration — and every class member — carries a visibility:"
msgstr "每个包内的模块构成一棵树（文件存放于目录中；包根即根模块）。每个声明 —— 以及每个类成员 —— 都带有一种可见性："


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:113
msgid "**public** — nameable by any rut module (other packages included)"
msgstr "**public** —— 可被任何 rut 模块命名（包括其他包）"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:114
msgid "visible everywhere inside this **package's module tree**"
msgstr "在本**包的模块树**内随处可见"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:115
msgid "visible to the **parent module** only"
msgstr "仅对**父模块**可见"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:116
msgid "`pub(self) fn ..`"
msgstr "`pub(self) fn ..`"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:116
msgid "module-private — **the default**"
msgstr "模块私有 —— **默认值**"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:118
msgid ""
"Unannotated = `pub(self)`: nothing leaks unless it says `pub`. There is no `private` keyword — the unannotated default _is_ the private spelling."
msgstr ""
"未加注解即等同 `pub(self)`：除非显式写明 `pub`，否则任何东西都不会泄漏。没有 `private` 关键字 —— 未加注解的默认形式 _就是_ 私有的书写方式。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:121
msgid ""
"Applies uniformly: `let`, `enum`, `struct`, `class`, `trait`, `impl` (an impl exports with its target type), `fn`, `type` aliases. On a `class` declaration it means the _type name_ is visible."
msgstr ""
"统一适用于：`let`、`enum`、`struct`、`class`、`trait`、`impl`（impl 随其目标类型一起导出）、`fn`、`type` 别名。用在 `class` 声明上时，它意味着 _类型名_ 可见。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:124
msgid ""
"**Class members take the same forms**: an unannotated field or method is module-private; `pub` (optionally scoped) exposes it. See [Classes and constructors](classes.md)."
msgstr "**类成员采用同样的形式**：未加注解的字段或方法是模块私有的；`pub`（可带作用域）将其公开。参见[类与构造器](classes.md)。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:127
msgid ""
"Dataclass members are **always public** — no visibility dial (see [Structs](structs.md)). Trait method signatures and impl methods are as visible as their trait (see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md))."
msgstr ""
"数据类成员**始终公开** —— 没有可见性调节项（参见[结构体](structs.md)）。trait 方法签名与 impl 方法的可见性与其 trait 一致（参见[trait 与分派](traits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/modules-and-visibility.md:130
msgid ""
"Visibility is checked at compile time; it has no runtime representation. Only `pub` names enter a module's export table; a non-exported declaration is _known_ inside its module but _nameable_ nowhere else — which is how libraries hide implementation surfaces behind exported ones."
msgstr ""
"可见性在编译期检查；它没有运行时表示。只有 `pub` 名称会进入模块的导出表；未导出的声明在其模块内部是 _已知_ 的，但在其他任何地方都 _无法命名_ —— 库正是借此把实现细节隐藏在导出接口之后。"


