#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:34
msgid "Size and members"
msgstr "大小与成员"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:36
msgid ""
"`.len()` is the sequence member shared by every sequence: `[T]`, `Vec<T>`, `str` (codepoints), `bytes` (octets). There is no `.length` property or `.count()` variant anywhere in the language."
msgstr ""
"`.len()` 是所有序列共享的序列成员：`[T]`、`Vec<T>`、`str`（码点数）、`bytes`（字节数）。这门语言中任何地方都没有 `.length` 属性或 `.count()` 变体。"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:40
msgid ""
"`str` members: `len()`, `code()`, `code_at(i)`, `encode() -> bytes`, `slice(from, to) -> str`, `starts_with(from, head) -> bool`, `scan(from, set) -> i64`. `bytes` members: `len()`, `decode() -> str` (UTF-8, lossy), `clone() -> bytes`; type-methods `bytes.zeroed(n) -> bytes` and `bytes.from(a: [u8]) -> bytes`. `str.encode()` and `bytes.decode()` convert between text and octets."
msgstr ""
"`str` 成员：`len()`、`code()`、`code_at(i)`、`encode() -> bytes`、`slice(from, to) -> str`、`starts_with(from, head) -> bool`、`scan(from, set) -> i64`。`bytes` 成员：`len()`、`decode() -> str`（UTF-8，有损）、`clone() -> bytes`；类型方法有 `bytes.zeroed(n) -> bytes` 与 `bytes.from(a: [u8]) -> bytes`。`str.encode()` 与 `bytes.decode()` 在文本与字节之间转换。"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:48
msgid "One regime: primitives by value, everything else shared"
msgstr "一种体制：基本类型按值，其余一切共享"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:50
msgid ""
"Primitives (`u8..u64`, `i8..i64`, `f32`/`f64`, `bool`) and `fn` values copy on assignment, passing, and return — plain slot moves. **Every other type is a refcounted heap cell handle**: assignment shares, and mutation through any alias is visible through all of them — struct and class instances, `str`, `bytes`, `Vec`, `[T]`, enums, `opaque` boxes, trait-typed values, `?T` boxes alike. Writing is gated by the `mut`\\-binding law (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)), never by the sharing."
msgstr ""
"基本类型（`u8..u64`、`i8..i64`、`f32`/`f64`、`bool`）与 `fn` 值在赋值、传参和返回时复制 —— 就是普通的槽位移动。**其他所有类型都是引用计数堆单元的句柄**：赋值即共享，透过任何一个别名做出的修改会透过所有别名可见 —— 结构体与类实例、`str`、`bytes`、`Vec`、`[T]`、枚举、`opaque` 盒、trait 类型的值、`?T` 盒皆然。写入由 `mut`\\- 绑定法则把关（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)），而不是由共享本身把关。"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:59
msgid ""
"There is no eager copy and no `own(x)`: **`bytes.clone()` is the one copy escape hatch**. There is no `&`/`*` syntax anywhere. `==` on cells is **identity** (the raw slot compare); `str`/`bytes` compare by content — the full table is in [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md)."
msgstr ""
"没有急切复制，也没有 `own(x)`：**`bytes.clone()` 是唯一的复制逃生口**。任何地方都没有 `&`/`*` 语法。单元上的 `==` 是**同一性**（identity）比较（原始槽位比较）；`str`/`bytes` 按内容比较 —— 完整表格见[Rc、dispose 与同一性](rc-dispose-identity.md)。"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:65
msgid ""
"No `box<T>`, no loans: a loan needs an exclusivity proof, and rut has no borrow checker. The construct is rejected, not deferred. The only borrows anywhere are host-side, call-scoped ones at the embedding boundary."
msgstr ""
"没有 `box<T>`，也没有借用（loan）：借用需要独占性证明，而 rut 没有借用检查器。这一构造被直接拒绝，而非推迟。全语言中仅有的借用是宿主一侧、调用作用域内的借用，出现在嵌入边界上。"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:70
msgid "Tuples and the answer channel"
msgstr "元组与应答通道"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:72
msgid ""
"Tuples are first-class values: type `(A, B)`, value `(a, b)`, numeric field access `.0`, `.1`, .., destructuring:"
msgstr "元组是一等值：类型写作 `(A, B)`，值写作 `(a, b)`，数字字段访问 `.0`、`.1`、..，以及解构："


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:80
msgid ""
"**`(?T, err)` — concretely `(value, ok)` / `(T, str)` — is the answer channel** for results and errors. The convention is law:"
msgstr "**`(?T, err)` —— 具体为 `(value, ok)` / `(T, str)` —— 是结果与错误的应答通道**。这一约定就是法则："


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:83
msgid "empty err + a value = **success**"
msgstr "空 err + 一个值 = **成功**"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:84
msgid "empty err + `nil` = **\"not found\"** (a legitimately absent value)"
msgstr "空 err + `nil` = **“未找到”**（值合理地不存在）"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:85
msgid "non-empty err = **failed**"
msgstr "非空 err = **失败**"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:87
msgid ""
"`checked_add`/`checked_sub`/`checked_mul` return `(value, ok)` — `false` exactly on overflow, `value` the wrapped bits either way."
msgstr ""
"`checked_add`/`checked_sub`/`checked_mul` 返回 `(value, ok)` —— 恰好在溢出时为 `false`；无论是否溢出，`value` 都是回绕后的位。"


