msgid ""
"Overflow in `+ - * <<` **traps** in debug and release. Wrapping escapes are compiler-lowered methods, ambient on every integer primitive (no `use`):"
msgstr ""
"`+ - * <<` 的溢出在 debug 与 release 下**都会陷阱**。回绕逃生口是编译器降格（lower）的方法，环境自带于每个整数基本类型（无需 `use`）："


