msgid "Division by zero traps; `int / int` is integer division."
msgstr "除以零会陷阱；`int / int` 是整数除法。"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:103
msgid ""
"**Mixed-width arithmetic is an error** — both operands must have equal width; convert first with `as`."
msgstr "**混合位宽的算术运算是错误** —— 两个操作数必须位宽相等；先用 `as` 转换。"


#: src/reference/primitive-types.md:105
msgid ""
"Conversions are the numeric cast `expr as T`, truncating like C/Rust — see [Literals and inference](literals-and-inference.md). There are no implicit numeric conversions at all."
msgstr ""
"转换使用数值类型转换 `expr as T`，像 C/Rust 一样截断 —— 参见[字面量与推断](literals-and-inference.md)。完全不存在隐式数值转换。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:3
msgid ""
"The built-in sequence and wrapper surfaces: the heap array `[T]`, the nullable `?T`, the growable `Vec<T>`, `Weak<T>`, and the keyed collections."
msgstr "内置的序列与包装接口面：堆数组 `[T]`、可空 `?T`、可增长的 `Vec<T>`、`Weak<T>`，以及键控集合。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:7
msgid "`[T]` — the heap array"
msgstr "`[T]` —— 堆数组"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:9
msgid ""
"`[T]` is the spelling of the fixed array: **runtime length, non-growable**. The type is grammar, resolved directly — no `use` names it."
msgstr "`[T]` 是定长数组的写法：**长度在运行期确定，不可增长**。该类型属于语法本身，直接解析 —— 无需 `use` 引入。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:13
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let xs: [i32] = [1, 2, 3];   // the literal allocates the cell\n"
"    let ys: [?Point] = [nil; 4]; // the repeat: a VALUE and a count\n"
"    log.info(f\"{xs.len()} {ys.len()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let xs: [i32] = [1, 2, 3];   // the literal allocates the cell\n"
"    let ys: [?Point] = [nil; 4]; // the repeat: a VALUE and a count\n"
"    log.info(f\"{xs.len()} {ys.len()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:30
msgid ""
"Construction is the **repeat expression** `[v; n]` — a value and a count; there is no type-in-expression form. A scalar/`nil` fill is the memset-class op; a ref fill retains the cell handle `n` times — every slot aliases the one cell (the sharing law: the repeat never copies)."
msgstr ""
"构造使用**重复表达式** `[v; n]` —— 一个值和一个数量；不存在类型出现在表达式中的形式。标量/`nil` 填充属于 memset 类操作；引用填充会把单元句柄保留 `n` 次 —— 每个槽都是同一单元的别名（共享法则：重复构造绝不复制）。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:35
msgid ""
"`[T]` is a cell handle — shared like every non-primitive: assignment aliases, mutation is visible through every handle."
msgstr "`[T]` 是单元句柄 —— 与所有非基本类型一样共享：赋值产生别名，修改透过每个句柄可见。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:37
msgid ""
"`a[i]`, `a[i] = x`, `.len()`, and `for (x of a)` are compiler-lowered to the fused array ops — never a per-element call. Out-of-bounds traps."
msgstr ""
"`a[i]`、`a[i] = x`、`.len()` 与 `for (x of a)` 会被编译器降格为融合的数组操作 —— 绝不是逐元素调用。越界会陷阱。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:40
msgid ""
"Fixed-length windows: `v.slice(from, to)` — see [String slicing and views](string-views.md)."
msgstr "定长窗口：`v.slice(from, to)` —— 参见[字符串切片与视图](string-views.md)。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:43
msgid ""
"The old `Array<T>` name is removed: the array type is spelled `[T]`, construction is the repeat `[v; n]`."
msgstr "旧的 `Array<T>` 名称已移除：数组类型写作 `[T]`，构造用重复形式 `[v; n]`。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:48
msgid ""
"`?T` is a nil-able cell: a one-slot box whose payload is a `T` or the null slot. `nil` is its null literal — and the empty type's one value: a context-free `nil` has type `nil`, while nullable positions (`let p: ?T = nil`, `p == nil`, `left: nil` in a literal) type it as `?T`. Dereferencing `nil` is the `NilDeref` trap — never a silent read."
msgstr ""
"`?T` 是可为 nil 的单元：一个单槽盒，其载荷是一个 `T` 或空槽。`nil` 是它的空字面量 —— 也是空类型的唯一值：无上下文的 `nil` 类型为 `nil`，而在可空位置（`let p: ?T = nil`、`p == nil`、字面量中的 `left: nil`）它会被定为 `?T`。对 `nil` 解引用是 `NilDeref` 陷阱 —— 绝不会无声地读取。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:54
msgid ""
"The spelling is **prefix-only and binds tightest** — `?` applies to the type term that follows:"
msgstr "其写法**仅为前缀且结合最紧** —— `?` 作用于紧随其后的类型项："


