msgstr "链式"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:62
msgid "the same runtime box, unwrapped transitively at use sites"
msgstr "同一个运行时盒，在使用点传递性地逐层解包"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:64
msgid ""
"Coercions: **`T → ?T` boxes** (the box _aliases_ the payload's cell — a share; primitives copy bits), **`?T → T` derefs** (a field-0 read plus nil check). Both are implicit at the expected-type position; the funnel is transitive through `??T`."
msgstr ""
"强制转换：**`T → ?T` 装盒**（盒 _别名_ 载荷的单元 —— 即共享；基本类型复制位），**`?T → T` 解引用**（一次字段 0 读取加 nil 检查）。两者在期望类型位置都是隐式的；这一漏斗经过 `??T` 传递。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:68
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:78
msgid ""
"Auto-deref covers every value position: `p.x`, `p.m(..)`, `p[i]`, `for (x of p)`, arithmetic on `p`'s payload."
msgstr "自动解引用覆盖所有值位置：`p.x`、`p.m(..)`、`p[i]`、`for (x of p)`、对 `p` 载荷的算术运算。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:70
msgid ""
"`p == nil` / `p != nil` compare against the null slot; `?T == ?T` is slot identity (see [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md))."
msgstr ""
"`p == nil` / `p != nil` 与空槽比较；`?T == ?T` 是槽位同一性（参见[Rc、dispose 与同一性](rc-dispose-identity.md)）。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:72
msgid ""
"A `?T` binding IS the cell reference — writes through it hit the shared cell (gated by `mut`, see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md))."
msgstr ""
"`?T` 绑定本身就是单元引用 —— 透过它写入会命中共享单元（受 `mut` 把关，参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:75
msgid ""
"When the cell's refcount reaches zero, the engine runs the type's `Disposal` impl (`dispose(self, cx)`) — the cell-death hook, not a per-value attach ([the Rc heap](rc-heap.md))."
msgstr ""
"单元引用计数归零时，引擎运行该类型的 `Disposal` impl（`dispose(self, cx)`）——这是单元死亡的钩子，不是逐值挂载（[Rc 堆与析构器](rc-heap.md)）。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:78
msgid ""
"Across the host boundary `?T` crosses nil-flattened when its element crosses."
msgstr "跨越宿主边界时，`?T` 的跨越方式是 nil 展平：元素跨越的同时它随之展平。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:81
msgid ""
"The removed pointer spellings diagnose: `*T` and postfix `T?` point at `?T`; expression `*x`/`&x` point at the sharing law (\"pass `x` directly\"). See [By-reference and nullable](by-reference-and-nullable.md)."
msgstr ""
"已移除的指针写法会给出诊断：`*T` 与后缀 `T?` 指向 `?T`；表达式 `*x`/`&x` 指向共享法则（“直接传 `x`”）。参见[按引用与可空](by-reference-and-nullable.md)。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:85
msgid "`Vec<T>` — the growable sequence"
msgstr "`Vec<T>` —— 可增长序列"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:87
msgid ""
"`Vec<T>` is a library class (package `pouch`) over the non-growable `[T]`: a `buf: [?T]` backing plus a live `len`. Loads yield the `?T` (uses auto-deref), stores take the coerced handle — reads and writes alias the stored cells, and binding an element copies nothing."
msgstr ""
"`Vec<T>` 是构建在不可增长的 `[T]` 之上的库类（包 `pouch`）：一个 `buf: [?T]` 后备存储加上一个活跃的 `len`。读取产出 `?T`（使用自动解引用），写入接受强制转换后的句柄 —— 读写都是所存单元的别名，绑定一个元素不会复制任何东西。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:92
msgid "Construction"
msgstr "构造"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:94
msgid "`Vec.new()`"
msgstr "`Vec.new()`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:94
msgid "empty"
msgstr "空"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:95
msgid "`Vec.with_capacity(n)`"
msgstr "`Vec.with_capacity(n)`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:95
msgid "reserve `n` slots"
msgstr "预留 `n` 个槽"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:96
msgid "`Vec.filled(v, n)`"
msgstr "`Vec.filled(v, n)`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:96
msgid "`n` slots of `v`"
msgstr "`n` 个槽都放 `v`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:97
msgid "`Vec.from(arr)`"
msgstr "`Vec.from(arr)`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:97
msgid "copy a `[T]`"
msgstr "复制一个 `[T]`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:99
msgid ""
"Explicit type arguments may be spelled at the call: `Vec<i32>.from([1, 2, 3])`. There is no `Vec<T>(..)` type-call — construction is always a method call (see [Classes and constructors](classes.md))."
msgstr ""
"显式类型实参可以写在调用处：`Vec<i32>.from([1, 2, 3])`。不存在 `Vec<T>(..)` 类型调用 —— 构造总是方法调用（参见[类与构造器](classes.md)）。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:106
msgid "`push(v)`"
msgstr "`push(v)`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:106
msgid "append; amortized O(1) growth"
msgstr "追加；均摊 O(1) 增长"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:107
msgid "`pop() -> T`"
msgstr "`pop() -> T`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:107
msgid "remove and return the last element; traps on empty — guard with `len() > 0`"
msgstr "移除并返回最后一个元素；空时陷阱 —— 用 `len() > 0` 守护"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:108
msgid "`v[i]`, `v[i] = x`"
msgstr "`v[i]`, `v[i] = x`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:108
msgid "element access; out-of-bounds traps"
msgstr "元素访问；越界陷阱"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:109 src/reference/stdlib.md:313
msgid "`len() -> i32`"
msgstr "`len() -> i32`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:109
msgid "live length"
msgstr "活跃长度"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:110
msgid "`for (x of v)`"
msgstr "`for (x of v)`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:110
msgid "iteration; `x` is the shared element"
msgstr "迭代；`x` 是共享的元素"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:111 src/reference/stdlib.md:181
msgid "`slice(from, to) -> ?Vec<T>`"
msgstr "`slice(from, to) -> ?Vec<T>`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:111
msgid "fixed-length window (compiler-lowered) — writes through it hit the parent"
msgstr "定长窗口（编译器降格）—— 透过它写入会命中父序列"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:112
msgid "`as_array() -> [T]`"
msgstr "`as_array() -> [T]`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:112
msgid "copy the live elements into a fresh, exactly-sized array"
msgstr "把活跃元素复制到一个全新的、大小恰好的数组"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:113 src/reference/stdlib.md:180
msgid "`freeze() -> bytes`"
msgstr "`freeze() -> bytes`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:113
msgid "`Vec<u8>` only: copy the live octets into the immutable `bytes`"
msgstr "仅限 `Vec<u8>`：把活跃字节复制进不可变的 `bytes`"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:115
msgid ""
"`Vec<u8>` is the mutable binary builder; `bytes` is the binary type that crosses the host boundary (see [Primitive types](primitive-types.md))."
msgstr "`Vec<u8>` 是可变的二进制构建器；`bytes` 是跨越宿主边界的二进制类型（参见[基本类型](primitive-types.md)）。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:119
msgid "`Weak<T>` — the weak reference"
msgstr "`Weak<T>` —— 弱引用"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:121
msgid ""
"`Weak<T>` is a builtin class whose box holds an _unretained_ word to a referent — a weak never keeps anything alive."
msgstr "`Weak<T>` 是一个内置类，其盒持有一个指向被引用对象的 _未保留_（unretained）字 —— 弱引用绝不会让任何东西存活。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:124
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Tile { v: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let tile = Tile { v: 7 };\n"
"    let w = Weak.new(tile);        // the class-method construction\n"
"    let got: ?Tile = w.upgrade();  // the live referent, or nil once dead\n"
"    log.info(f\"{got.v}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Tile { v: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let tile = Tile { v: 7 };\n"
"    let w = Weak.new(tile);        // the class-method construction\n"
"    let got: ?Tile = w.upgrade();  // the live referent, or nil once dead\n"
"    log.info(f\"{got.v}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:142
msgid ""
"`Weak.new(v)` traps on a `nil` `v`; `T` must be a reference type (`Weak<i32>` diagnoses — primitives move by value). `Weak<?U>` is legal and `upgrade()` answers `??U`."
msgstr ""
"`Weak.new(v)` 在 `v` 为 `nil` 时陷阱；`T` 必须是引用类型（`Weak<i32>` 会被诊断报错 —— 基本类型按值移动）。`Weak<?U>` 合法，且 `upgrade()` 应答 `??U`。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:145
msgid ""
"The referent's death nulls every weak box before any user code runs; `upgrade()` answers `nil` deterministically from then on."
msgstr "被引用对象的死亡会在任何用户代码运行之前把每个弱盒置为 nil；从那一刻起 `upgrade()` 确定性地应答 `nil`。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:147
msgid ""
"A weak edge closes no cycle: strong cycles still leak — see [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md)."
msgstr "弱边不闭合任何循环：强循环仍会泄漏 —— 参见[Rc、dispose 与同一性](rc-dispose-identity.md)。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:150
msgid "Keyed collections"
msgstr "键控集合"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:152
msgid ""
"`HashMap<K, V>` and `HashSet<T>` (package `nmapset`) wrap a native key table. Admission is the compile-time **union bound** `K requires i8 | i16 | i32 | i64 | u8 | u16 | u32 | u64 | bool | str | bytes` — a key type outside the set fails at the instantiation (escape hatch: encode it canonically to `bytes`). Float keys are absent by design: floats have no stable equality contract. The API is `new`/`with_capacity`/`put`/`get`/`has`/`remove`/`len`; `get` answers `?V` — `nil` is absent, and a hit returns the **stored cell**, not a copy (the aliasing law)."
msgstr ""
"`HashMap<K, V>` 与 `HashSet<T>`（包 `nmapset`）包装了一个原生键表。准入条件是编译期**联合约束** `K requires i8 | i16 | i32 | i64 | u8 | u16 | u32 | u64 | bool | str | bytes` —— 集合之外的键类型在实例化时失败（逃生口：把它规范地编码成 `bytes`）。浮点键被有意排除：浮点数没有稳定的相等契约。API 是 `new`/`with_capacity`/`put`/`get`/`has`/`remove`/`len`；`get` 应答 `?V` —— `nil` 表示不存在，命中时返回**存储的单元**而非副本（别名法则）。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:162
msgid "Absence and errors"
msgstr "缺失与错误"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:164
msgid ""
"There are no `Option`/`Result` builtins — the spellings diagnose with their replacements:"
msgstr "没有 `Option`/`Result` 内置物 —— 这些写法会连同替代方案一起报错："


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:167
msgid ""
"**Absence** is `nil` on a nullable: a lookup returns `?V`, and `nil` means \"not found\"."
msgstr "**缺失**是可空类型上的 `nil`：查找返回 `?V`，`nil` 表示“未找到”。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:169
msgid ""
"**Errors** are the answer channel: `(?T, err)` — see [Primitive types](primitive-types.md)."
msgstr "**错误**走应答通道：`(?T, err)` —— 参见[基本类型](primitive-types.md)。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:171
msgid ""
"**Type-erased recovery** is `opaque.downcast<T>(o) -> ?T` — see [opaque — erasure and downcast](opaque.md)."
msgstr ""
"**类型擦除后的恢复**是 `opaque.downcast<T>(o) -> ?T` —— 参见[opaque —— 擦除与向下转型](opaque.md)。"


#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:174
msgid ""
"`==` on the removed sum spellings is a compile error. Compare structurally: `when`, a `nil`/`!= nil` guard, or the payload."
msgstr "在已移除的 sum 写法上使用 `==` 是编译错误。请做结构化比较：`when`、`nil`/`!= nil` 守卫，或检查载荷。"


#: src/reference/enums.md:3
msgid ""
"`enum` — simple named integer sets. This is the entire feature: rut has **no data-carrying enums**. Heterogeneous data goes through traits (see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md)); absence goes through `?T` (see [Builtin generic types](builtin-generic-types.md))."
msgstr ""
"`enum` —— 简单的命名整数集合。这就是全部特性：rut **没有携带数据的枚举**。异构数据走 trait（参见[trait 与分派](traits.md)）；缺失走 `?T`（参见[内置泛型类型](builtin-generic-types.md)）。"


#: src/reference/enums.md:8
msgid "Syntax"
msgstr "语法"


#: src/reference/enums.md:15
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Color { Red, Green, Blue }              // 0, 1, 2\n"
"enum Direction { Up = 1, Down, Left, Right } // 1, 2, 3, 4\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{Color.Blue} {Direction.Right}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Color { Red, Green, Blue }              // 0, 1, 2\n"
"enum Direction { Up = 1, Down, Left, Right } // 1, 2, 3, 4\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{Color.Blue} {Direction.Right}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/enums.md:31
msgid ""
"An enum is a distinct named type over fixed-width integer constants. Members are the enum's values: implicit numbering continues from the last value (starting at 0); an explicit initializer (a possibly negative integer literal) resets the counter."
msgstr ""
"枚举是定义在定宽整数常量之上的独立命名类型。成员就是枚举的值：隐式编号从上一个值继续（从 0 开始）；显式初始化式（一个可带负号的整数字面量）会重置计数器。"


#: src/reference/enums.md:35
msgid "No data payloads, no methods, no computed members — ever."
msgstr "没有数据载荷，没有方法，没有计算型成员 —— 永远没有。"


#: src/reference/enums.md:37
msgid "Using members"
msgstr "使用成员"


#: src/reference/enums.md:39
msgid "Members are named through the enum and compare as equal singletons:"
msgstr "成员通过枚举来命名，并作为相等的单例进行比较："


#: src/reference/enums.md:41
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Red, Yellow, Green }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let l = Light.Yellow;\n"
"    log.info(f\"{l == Light.Yellow}\");   // true — members are immortal singleton cells\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Red, Yellow, Green }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let l = Light.Yellow;\n"
"    log.info(f\"{l == Light.Yellow}\");   // true — members are immortal singleton cells\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/enums.md:57
msgid ""
"An enum value renders as its member name in format strings: `f\"{Color.Red}\"` is `\"Red\"`."
msgstr "枚举值在格式化字符串中渲染为它的成员名：`f\"{Color.Red}\"` 是 `\"Red\"`。"


#: src/reference/enums.md:59
msgid "Enums are ordinary shared values: binding shares the singleton."
msgstr "枚举是普通的共享值：绑定即共享该单例。"


#: src/reference/enums.md:61
msgid "Exhaustive `when`"
msgstr "穷尽的 `when`"


#: src/reference/enums.md:63
msgid ""
"`when` over an enum must be **exhaustive**: cover every member (then `else` is optional) or add an explicit `else` arm — a partial `when` is a compile error. See [Control flow and when](control-flow.md)."
msgstr ""
"对枚举的 `when` 必须**穷尽**：覆盖每个成员（此时 `else` 可省略）或添加显式的 `else` 分支 —— 不完整的 `when` 是编译错误。参见[控制流与 when](control-flow.md)。"


#: src/reference/enums.md:67
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Green, Yellow, Red }\n"
"\n"
"fn go() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"go\"); }\n"
"fn brake() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"brake\"); }\n"
"fn stop() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"stop\"); }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let l = Light.Yellow;\n"
"    when (l) {\n"
"        Light.Green  -> { go(); },\n"
"        Light.Yellow -> { brake(); },\n"
"        Light.Red    -> { stop(); },   // all members: no else needed\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Green, Yellow, Red }\n"
"\n"
"fn go() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"go\"); }\n"
"fn brake() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"brake\"); }\n"
"fn stop() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"stop\"); }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let l = Light.Yellow;\n"
"    when (l) {\n"
"        Light.Green  -> { go(); },\n"
"        Light.Yellow -> { brake(); },\n"
"        Light.Red    -> { stop(); },   // all members: no else needed\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/enums.md:90
msgid "Boundaries"
msgstr "边界"


#: src/reference/enums.md:92
msgid ""
"Where another language would use a union of literals (`\"left\" | \"right\"`), rut uses an enum; where it would use a union of _shapes_, rut uses a trait-typed value (see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md))."
msgstr ""
"其他语言会用字面量联合（`\"left\" | \"right\"`）的场合，rut 用枚举；会用 _形状_ 联合的场合，rut 用 trait 类型的值（参见[trait 与分派](traits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/enums.md:96
msgid ""
"The `|` spelling exists only for bound-only union aliases and `requires` bounds (see [Type aliases and union bounds](type-aliases.md)) — a compile-time admission gate, never a runtime union value."
msgstr ""
"`|` 写法只用于仅约束的联合别名和 `requires` 约束（参见[类型别名与联合约束](type-aliases.md)）—— 它是编译期的准入门槛，绝不是运行期的联合值。"


#: src/reference/enums.md:99
msgid ""
"There is no enum↔int cast: `as` is the numeric cast only. Enum values cross the host boundary as their runtime identity plus the integer value."
msgstr "没有枚举↔整数转换：`as` 只是数值类型转换。枚举值跨越宿主边界时，以运行时同一性加上整数值的形式跨越。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:3
msgid ""
"Numeric suffixes, the default-width rule, casts, tuple literals, string literal forms, and the format-string desugaring."
msgstr "数字后缀、默认宽度规则、类型转换、元组字面量、字符串字面量形式，以及格式化字符串的脱糖。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:6
msgid "Inference and conversions"
msgstr "推断与转换"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:8
msgid ""
"Inference is bidirectional (literal ↔ expected type). A literal without context defaults to `i32` (integers) / `f32` (floats) — and **the default is also a ceiling**: an unsuffixed literal adapts to the expected type only while it fits that default."
msgstr ""
"推断是双向的（字面量 ↔ 期望类型）。没有上下文的字面量默认为 `i32`（整数）/ `f32`（浮点数）—— 而且**默认值同时也是上限**：不带后缀的字面量只有在适配该默认值的前提下才会顺应期望类型。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:13
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let a = 10;                // i32 (default)\n"
"    let b = 10u8;              // u8 via suffix\n"
"    let c: u64 = 10;           // u64 via annotation — fits the default\n"
"    let big = 18446744073709551615u64;  // past the i32 default: suffix REQUIRED\n"
"    // let bad = 13503953896175478587;  // ERROR — exceeds i32, add `u64`\n"
"    log.info(f\"{a} {b} {c} {big}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let a = 10;                // i32 (default)\n"
"    let b = 10u8;              // u8 via suffix\n"
"    let c: u64 = 10;           // u64 via annotation — fits the default\n"
"    let big = 18446744073709551615u64;  // past the i32 default: suffix REQUIRED\n"
"    // let bad = 13503953896175478587;  // ERROR — exceeds i32, add `u64`\n"
"    log.info(f\"{a} {b} {c} {big}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:31
msgid ""
"Past the ceiling the literal must declare itself with a suffix, so a dropped or doubled digit cannot silently re-base a constant. Floats: magnitude is the trigger, precision is not — `0.1` is fine anywhere; `1.0e300` needs `f64` even in an `f64` position."
msgstr ""
"超过上限时，字面量必须用后缀表明自己，这样掉一个或多打一位数字就不会悄悄改变常量的基数。浮点数：数量级是触发条件，精度不是 —— `0.1` 在哪里都可以；`1.0e300` 即使在 `f64` 位置也需要 `f64` 后缀。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:36
msgid ""
"Numeric literals: decimal and `0x` / `0b` / `0o`, `_` separators, suffixes `u8..u64 i8..i64 f32 f64` (`3.14159f32`, `0xFF_u32`)."
msgstr ""
"数字字面量：十进制与 `0x` / `0b` / `0o`、`_` 分隔符、后缀 `u8..u64 i8..i64 f32 f64`（`3.14159f32`、`0xFF_u32`）。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:39
msgid "The cast — `expr as T`"
msgstr "类型转换 —— `expr as T`"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:41
msgid "Conversions are casts, truncating like C/Rust:"
msgstr "转换即强制类型转换，像 C/Rust 一样截断："


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:43
msgid "int→int keeps the target's low bits (signed targets sign-extend);"
msgstr "整数→整数保留目标的低位（有符号目标做符号扩展）；"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:44
msgid ""
"float→int truncates toward zero and saturates at the target bounds (`NaN` → `0`);"
msgstr "浮点→整数向零截断并在目标边界处饱和（`NaN` → `0`）；"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:46
msgid "a conversion never traps (arithmetic still does)."
msgstr "转换绝不会陷阱（算术运算仍会）。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:48
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use calc::{ Math };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let cast = 300 as u8;      // 44\n"
"    let x = 3;\n"
"    let y = 4;\n"
"    log.info(f\"{cast} {Math.sqrt((x * x + y * y) as f64)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use calc::{ Math };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let cast = 300 as u8;      // 44\n"
"    let x = 3;\n"
"    let y = 4;\n"
"    log.info(f\"{cast} {Math.sqrt((x * x + y * y) as f64)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:65
msgid ""
"`as` binds tighter than `*`, is left-associative (`x as u32 as u64` chains), and its right-hand side is a naming position restricted to the numeric primitives. There are no implicit numeric conversions at all."
msgstr ""
"`as` 的结合比 `*` 更紧，左结合（`x as u32 as u64` 可以链式书写），其右侧是一个限定为数字基本类型的命名位置。完全不存在隐式数值转换。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:69
msgid "Fixed arrays and repeats"
msgstr "定长数组与重复"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:71
msgid ""
"`[e1, .., en]` has type `[T]` — pure data whose literal allocates the array cell; binding the value shares the cell. It infers `T` bidirectionally like any literal; at module scope it is a load-time expression when every element is (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md))."
msgstr ""
"`[e1, .., en]` 的类型是 `[T]` —— 纯数据，其字面量分配数组单元；绑定该值即共享单元。它像任何字面量一样双向推断 `T`；在模块作用域，当每个元素都是加载期表达式时，它就是加载期表达式（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:76
msgid ""
"`[v; n]` is the repeat: `n` slots of the **value** `v` — see [Builtin generic types](builtin-generic-types.md)."
msgstr "`[v; n]` 是重复形式：`n` 个槽都放**值** `v` —— 参见[内置泛型类型](builtin-generic-types.md)。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:81
msgid ""
"Tuples are first-class values: type `(T0, T1, ..)`, value `(a, b, ..)`, numeric fields `.0` / `.1` / .., and destructuring:"
msgstr "元组是一等值：类型 `(T0, T1, ..)`、值 `(a, b, ..)`、数字字段 `.0` / `.1` / ..，以及解构："


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:84
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn divmod(a: i32, b: i32) -> (i32, i32) {\n"
"    return (a / b, a % b);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let pair = (1, \"two\");         // (i32, str)\n"
"    let (n, s) = pair;\n"
"    log.info(f\"{n} {s} {divmod(7, 2).0}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn divmod(a: i32, b: i32) -> (i32, i32) {\n"
"    return (a / b, a % b);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let pair = (1, \"two\");         // (i32, str)\n"
"    let (n, s) = pair;\n"
"    log.info(f\"{n} {s} {divmod(7, 2).0}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


