msgstr "Rust 风格的占位符，在运行时求值"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:117
msgid "Raw and format do not combine (`rf\"...\"` does not parse)."
msgstr "原始与格式化不能组合（`rf\"...\"` 无法解析）。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:119
msgid "Format literals — `f\"...\"`"
msgstr "格式化字面量 —— `f\"...\"`"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:121
msgid ""
"`{ expr }` splices an expression's value: identifiers, paths, calls, arithmetic — any expression _except_ nested string literals (bind one to a name first). The lexer balances braces to find the closing `}`."
msgstr ""
"`{ expr }` 把表达式的值拼接进来：标识符、路径、调用、算术 —— 任何表达式都可以，_除了_ 嵌套的字符串字面量（先把后者绑定到一个名字）。词法分析器会平衡花括号以找到收尾的 `}`。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:124
msgid "`{{` and `}}` are literal braces. Escapes work exactly like plain strings."
msgstr "`{{` 与 `}}` 是字面意义的花括号。转义的处理与普通字符串完全一致。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:126
msgid ""
"The literal desugars at compile time to a concatenation of the literal chunks and one `str(x)` conversion per placeholder — a builtin per-type formatting call, no runtime parsing:"
msgstr "该字面量在编译期脱糖为字面量片段的拼接，每个占位符对应一次 `str(x)` 转换 —— 即按类型内建的格式化调用，运行时没有解析："


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:130
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"f\"a={a} b={f(b())}\"   ->   concat(\"a=\", str(a), \" b=\", str(f(b())))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"f\"a={a} b={f(b())}\"   ->   concat(\"a=\", str(a), \" b=\", str(f(b())))\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:134
msgid "Formattable types and their rendering:"
msgstr "可格式化的类型及其渲染："


