msgstr "枚举"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:142
msgid "member name (`Color.Red` → `\"Red\"`)"
msgstr "成员名（`Color.Red` → `\"Red\"`）"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:144
msgid ""
"Everything else — struct/class values, vecs and fixed arrays, `?T` boxes, `opaque`, tuples — is a **compile error** inside `f\"...\"` (preventing accidental implementation-detail printing). Write a `to_string() -> str` method on your type and call it explicitly, and route developer output through your host logger (for example the `ink` package's `Logger.debug(f\"...\")`)."
msgstr ""
"其余一切 —— struct/class 值、vec 与定长数组、`?T` 盒、`opaque`、元组 —— 在 `f\"...\"` 中都是**编译错误**（避免把实现细节意外打印出来）。请在你的类型上写一个 `to_string() -> str` 方法并显式调用它，并把开发者输出路由到宿主日志器（例如 `ink` 包的 `Logger.debug(f\"...\")`）。"


#: src/reference/literals-and-inference.md:151
msgid ""
"The accumulator idiom `out = f\"{out}{chunk}\"` is recognized by the compiler and appends in place — amortized O(1) instead of copying the whole prefix per step, linear in the total output. Core ships no string-builder class: when a reusable builder reads better (a tokenizer or encoder threading text through many calls), reach for the `strbuild` package's `StringBuilder` ([stdlib](stdlib.md)); when an accumulator binding reads better, the f-string shape IS the optimized path."
msgstr ""
"累加器惯用法 `out = f\"{out}{chunk}\"` 会被编译器识别并就地追加 —— 均摊 O(1)，而不是每步复制整个前缀，总输出量级为线性。core 不内置字符串构建类：当可复用的构建器更顺手（分词器或编码器在多次调用间穿线文本）时，用 `strbuild` 包的 `StringBuilder`（[标准库](stdlib.md)）；当累加器绑定更顺手时，f 字符串形状本身就是优化路径。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:3
msgid ""
"The structured statements, the indexed and iterating `for` forms, and `when` — the one match construct, an exhaustive pattern _expression_. Branching on a value is `when`: arms are `pattern -> body`, and the construct is exhaustive."
msgstr ""
"结构化语句、带索引与迭代的 `for` 形式，以及 `when` —— 唯一的匹配构造，一个穷尽式的模式 _表达式_。对值做分支用的是 `when`：分支写作 `pattern -> body`，而且该构造是穷尽的。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:8
msgid "Statements"
msgstr "语句"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:10
msgid "`if (cond) { .. } else if (..) { .. } else { .. }` — braces required."
msgstr "`if (cond) { .. } else if (..) { .. } else { .. }` —— 必须带花括号。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:11
msgid "`while (cond) { .. }`."
msgstr "`while (cond) { .. }`。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:12
msgid "`return expr?;` — `expr` is required unless the function returns `nil`."
msgstr "`return expr?;` —— 除非函数返回 `nil`，否则 `expr` 必填。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:14
msgid ""
"`break` / `continue` exist for loops; there are no labels and no `do..while`."
msgstr "`break` / `continue` 用于循环；没有标签，也没有 `do..while`。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:17
msgid "`for` — two forms"
msgstr "`for` —— 两种形式"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:19
msgid ""
"Iterating form — vecs, fixed arrays, slices, strings (one-codepoint `str`s per step), `bytes` (`u8` per step), and any type with a registered `Iterator` impl (see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md)):"
msgstr ""
"迭代形式 —— vec、定长数组、切片、字符串（每步一个单码点 `str`）、`bytes`（每步一个 `u8`），以及任何注册了 `Iterator` impl 的类型（参见[trait 与分派](traits.md)）："


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:28
msgid ""
"Indexed form — the induction variable is **loop-owned**: the update clause and the body may assign it without `mut`; it is not a normal binding:"
msgstr "索引形式 —— 归纳变量**为循环所拥有**：更新子句和循环体无需 `mut` 即可给它赋值；它不是普通绑定："


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:38
msgid ""
"`when (x) { pattern -> body, ... }` is an **expression**: the first matching arm's body produces its value. No fallthrough; exactly one arm runs."
msgstr ""
"`when (x) { pattern -> body, ... }` 是一个**表达式**：第一个匹配分支的体产出它的值。没有贯穿（fallthrough）；恰好执行一个分支。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:42
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn describe(n: i32) -> str {\n"
"    return when (n) {\n"
"        0         -> \"zero\",\n"
"        1, 2, 3   -> \"small\",   // comma-separated alternatives\n"
"        else      -> \"big\",     // non-enum scrutinee: else REQUIRED\n"
"    };\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{describe(0)} {describe(2)} {describe(10)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn describe(n: i32) -> str {\n"
"    return when (n) {\n"
"        0         -> \"zero\",\n"
"        1, 2, 3   -> \"small\",   // comma-separated alternatives\n"
"        else      -> \"big\",     // non-enum scrutinee: else REQUIRED\n"
"    };\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{describe(0)} {describe(2)} {describe(10)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:65
msgid "Pattern"
msgstr "模式"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:67
