msgstr "`0`, `3.5`, `true`, `\"text\"`"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:69
msgid "negative literal"
msgstr "负字面量"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:69
msgid "`-1`"
msgstr "`-1`"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:70
msgid "alternatives (comma list)"
msgstr "多选一（逗号列表）"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:70
msgid "`1, 2, 3`"
msgstr "`1, 2, 3`"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:71
msgid "wildcard `else` / `_`"
msgstr "通配 `else` / `_`"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:71
msgid "`else -> ..`"
msgstr "`else -> ..`"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:73
msgid ""
"Ranges, destructuring, binding patterns, and guards (`x if cond`) do not exist; patterns are enum members, literals, alternatives, and the wildcards only."
msgstr "不存在范围、解构、绑定模式和守卫（`x if cond`）；模式只有枚举成员、字面量、多选一和通配符。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:77 src/reference/opaque.md:44
msgid "The laws"
msgstr "法则"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:79
msgid ""
"**Exhaustiveness is always enforced.** An enum-typed scrutinee must cover every member (then `else` is optional) or add `else` — a partial `when` is a compile error. Any other scrutinee type (integers can't be enumerated): `else` is **mandatory**."
msgstr ""
"**始终强制穷尽性。** 枚举类型的被匹配值必须覆盖每个成员（此时 `else` 可省略）或添加 `else` —— 不完整的 `when` 是编译错误。任何其他被匹配值类型（整数无法枚举）：`else` 是**强制的**。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:83
msgid ""
"**All arms must agree on one type** — that is the `when`'s type. Used as a statement, that type must be `nil` (arm bodies that are evaluated for effect are written as block arms)."
msgstr ""
"**所有分支必须就同一个类型达成一致** —— 该类型就是 `when` 的类型。作为语句使用时，该类型必须是 `nil`（为副作用而求值的分支体写成块分支）。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:86
msgid ""
"Duplicate patterns, and arms made unreachable by earlier ones, are compile errors."
msgstr "重复的模式，以及被更早分支挡住而不可达的分支，都是编译错误。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:88
msgid ""
"Arms use `->`. Expression arms are comma-separated; block arms may omit the trailing comma (the corpus writes it)."
msgstr "分支使用 `->`。表达式分支以逗号分隔；块分支可以省略尾逗号（语料库中写了它）。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:90
msgid "`when` literal patterns match compile-time values, never runtime `==`."
msgstr "`when` 的字面量模式匹配编译期值，绝非运行期的 `==`。"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:92
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Green, Yellow, Red }\n"
"\n"
"fn go() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"go\"); }\n"
"fn brake() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"brake\"); }\n"
"fn stop() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"stop\"); }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let l = Light.Yellow;\n"
"    when (l) {\n"
"        Light.Green  -> { go(); },\n"
"        Light.Yellow -> { brake(); },\n"
"        Light.Red    -> { stop(); },   // every member: else optional\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"enum Light { Green, Yellow, Red }\n"
"\n"
"fn go() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"go\"); }\n"
"fn brake() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"brake\"); }\n"
"fn stop() { let log = Logger.new(\"t\"); log.info(\"stop\"); }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let l = Light.Yellow;\n"
"    when (l) {\n"
"        Light.Green  -> { go(); },\n"
"        Light.Yellow -> { brake(); },\n"
"        Light.Red    -> { stop(); },   // every member: else optional\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:115
msgid "A `when` is also the idiomatic nullable guard, together with `!= nil`:"
msgstr "`when` 也是惯用的可空守卫，与 `!= nil` 搭配："


#: src/reference/control-flow.md:117
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let p: ?Point = Point { x: 7, y: 0 };\n"
"    when (p != nil) {\n"
"        true -> { log.info(f\"{p.x}\"); },\n"
"        else -> { /* absent */ },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let p: ?Point = Point { x: 7, y: 0 };\n"
"    when (p != nil) {\n"
"        true -> { log.info(f\"{p.x}\"); },\n"
"        else -> { /* absent */ },\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/structs.md:3
msgid ""
"`struct` — the open data record: all fields public, constructed only by literal, sharing its cell like every non-primitive."
msgstr "`struct` —— 开放的数据记录：所有字段公开，只能用字面量构造，与所有非基本类型一样共享其单元。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:8
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point {\n"
"    x: f32;\n"
"    y: f32;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"struct Style {\n"
"    color: u32 = 0xff00ff;   // field initializer: literals may omit it\n"
"    width: f32 = 1;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let s = Style {};\n"
"    log.info(f\"{s.color} {s.width}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point {\n"
"    x: f32;\n"
"    y: f32;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"struct Style {\n"
"    color: u32 = 0xff00ff;   // field initializer: literals may omit it\n"
"    width: f32 = 1;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let s = Style {};\n"
"    log.info(f\"{s.color} {s.width}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/structs.md:32
msgid ""
"The keyword is `struct`. The removed spelling `dataclass` is a reserved word whose error names the replacement."
msgstr "关键字是 `struct`。已移除的写法 `dataclass` 是保留字，其报错信息会指明替代写法。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:35 src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:6
msgid "Reference semantics"
msgstr "引用语义"


#: src/reference/structs.md:37
msgid ""
"A struct value is a **heap cell handle** (see [By-reference and nullable](by-reference-and-nullable.md)): assignment, argument passing, and returning share the cell, and a mutation through any alias is visible through all of them."
msgstr ""
"结构体值是**堆单元句柄**（参见[按引用与可空](by-reference-and-nullable.md)）：赋值、传参和返回都共享该单元，透过任何别名做出的修改透过所有别名可见。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:42
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let mut p = Point { x: 1, y: 2 };\n"
"    let q = p;                       // SHARE: q and p name one cell (O(1))\n"
"    p.x = 4;                         // q.x is 4 now — sharing is the law\n"
"    log.info(f\"{q.x}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let mut p = Point { x: 1, y: 2 };\n"
"    let q = p;                       // SHARE: q and p name one cell (O(1))\n"
"    p.x = 4;                         // q.x is 4 now — sharing is the law\n"
"    log.info(f\"{q.x}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/structs.md:60
msgid ""
"Writing is gated by the `mut`\\-binding law (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)): field stores and `mut self` methods need a `let mut` binding (or a `mut` parameter). Parameters declare their intent: `fn nudge(mut pt: Point)` may write the caller's point; `fn length(pt: Point) -> f64` promises not to, and returns a fresh record instead:"
msgstr ""
"写入由 `mut`\\- 绑定法则把关（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）：字段存储和 `mut self` 方法需要 `let mut` 绑定（或 `mut` 参数）。参数声明其意图：`fn nudge(mut pt: Point)` 可以写入调用方的点；`fn length(pt: Point) -> f64` 承诺不这样做，而是返回一个全新的记录："


#: src/reference/structs.md:67
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"fn nudged(pt: Point) -> Point {     // builds a NEW record\n"
"    return Point { x: pt.x + 1, y: pt.y };\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let p2 = nudged(Point { x: 1, y: 2 });\n"
"    log.info(f\"{p2.x} {p2.y}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"fn nudged(pt: Point) -> Point {     // builds a NEW record\n"
"    return Point { x: pt.x + 1, y: pt.y };\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let p2 = nudged(Point { x: 1, y: 2 });\n"
"    log.info(f\"{p2.x} {p2.y}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/structs.md:87
msgid ""
"`==` on two struct values is a **cell-identity test** — `q == p` is true exactly when they name one cell; two separately built literals are never equal. Field-wise comparison is a trait contract of your own (declare and implement it — see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md))."
msgstr ""
"两个结构体值上的 `==` 是**单元同一性测试** —— `q == p` 为真当且仅当它们命名同一个单元；两个分别构造的字面量永不相等。按字段比较是你自己的 trait 契约（自行声明并实现 —— 参见[trait 与分派](traits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:93
msgid "Construction — the literal, everywhere"
msgstr "构造 —— 字面量，无处不在"


#: src/reference/structs.md:95
msgid ""
"`Name { field: expr, .. }` is the **only** construction. There is no `new`, no class methods, no type-call. The literal is available everywhere — function bodies and module-level `let` initializers alike — and it allocates the cell."
msgstr ""
"`Name { field: expr, .. }` 是**唯一的**构造方式。没有 `new`，没有类方法，没有类型调用。字面量在任何地方都可用 —— 函数体和模块级 `let` 初始化式皆可 —— 并且它分配单元。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:100
msgid "Fields may be given in any order, by name."
msgstr "字段可以按名称以任意顺序给出。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:101
msgid "The literal must initialize **every** field that has no initializer."
msgstr "字面量必须初始化**每个**没有初始化式的字段。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:102
msgid ""
"An omitted field with an initializer takes it; `{}` with all-default fields is legal."
msgstr "省略的、带初始化式的字段取其初始化式；全部字段都有默认值时，`{}` 合法。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:105
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"struct Style { color: u32 = 0xff00ff; width: f32 = 1; }\n"
"struct Rect { min: Point; max: Point; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let q = Point { x: 9, y: 9 };\n"
"    let s = Style {};                     // zero-value defaults fill the fields\n"
"    let r = Rect { min: Point { x: 0, y: 0 }, max: q };  // max shares q's cell\n"
"    log.info(f\"{s.color} {r.max.x}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"struct Style { color: u32 = 0xff00ff; width: f32 = 1; }\n"
"struct Rect { min: Point; max: Point; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let q = Point { x: 9, y: 9 };\n"
"    let s = Style {};                     // zero-value defaults fill the fields\n"
"    let r = Rect { min: Point { x: 0, y: 0 }, max: q };  // max shares q's cell\n"
"    log.info(f\"{s.color} {r.max.x}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/structs.md:125
msgid "All fields public, always"
msgstr "所有字段公开，始终如此"


#: src/reference/structs.md:127
msgid ""
"A struct is an open data record: member visibility in a struct body is a compile error (privacy needs construction control, which is the class's job — see [Classes and constructors](classes.md)). Structs also have no `static` members."
msgstr ""
"结构体是开放的数据记录：结构体体内出现成员可见性标注是编译错误（隐私需要控制构造，那是类的职责 —— 参见[类与构造器](classes.md)）。结构体也没有 `static` 成员。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:132
msgid "Methods live in impl blocks"
msgstr "方法位于 impl 块中"


#: src/reference/structs.md:134
msgid ""
"A struct body is **fields only** — a `fn` member in the body is a hard parse error. Inherent methods live in `impl S { .. }`, in the type's module only; trait impls in `impl I for S { .. }` (see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md)):"
msgstr ""
"结构体体**只有字段** —— 体内出现 `fn` 成员是硬性解析错误。固有方法位于 `impl S { .. }` 中，且只能写在该类型的模块内；trait impl 位于 `impl I for S { .. }`（参见[trait 与分派](traits.md)）："


#: src/reference/structs.md:139
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"impl Point {\n"
"    fn dist(self, other: Point) -> f32 { .. }   // inherent — the type's module\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl Hashable for Point {\n"
"    fn hash(self) -> u64 { .. }\n"
"    fn eq(self, other: Point) -> bool { .. }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"impl Point {\n"
"    fn dist(self, other: Point) -> f32 { .. }   // inherent — the type's module\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl Hashable for Point {\n"
"    fn hash(self) -> u64 { .. }\n"
"    fn eq(self, other: Point) -> bool { .. }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/structs.md:150
msgid ""
"Free functions over data remain the default idiom; methods are for tight helpers, impl blocks for trait contracts."
msgstr "作用于数据的自由函数仍是默认惯用法；方法用于紧密的辅助操作，impl 块用于 trait 契约。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:153
msgid "Limits, exhaustively:"
msgstr "限制，穷尽列举："


#: src/reference/structs.md:155
msgid "**no member visibility** — all fields are public, always;"
msgstr "**没有成员可见性** —— 所有字段永远公开；"


#: src/reference/structs.md:156
msgid ""
"**no class methods** — the literal is the only construction (open literal vs class-method-gated _is_ the struct/class distinction)."
msgstr "**没有类方法**——字面量是唯一的构造（开放字面量 vs 类方法把守_正是_ struct/class 的分界）。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:159
msgid ""
"Everything else class-shaped is allowed, including `impl` blocks. And the old \"no destructor\" limit is gone: a shared value dies exactly when its cell's refcount reaches zero, so cleanup is one `impl` away — implement `Disposal` for the type and the engine calls `dispose` at that moment (see [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md))."
msgstr ""
"其余类形态的东西都允许，包括 `impl` 块。而旧的“没有析构器”限制已经消失：共享值恰在其单元引用计数归零时死亡，所以清理只是一个 `impl` 之遥——为该类型实现 `Disposal`，引擎便会在那一刻调用 `dispose`（参见[Rc、dispose 与同一性](rc-dispose-identity.md)）。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:165
msgid "Traits and representation"
msgstr "trait 与表示"


#: src/reference/structs.md:167
msgid ""
"Widening a struct to a trait `I` **attaches the impl vtable to the same handle** — no allocation, no copy: the trait-typed value aliases the record, and mutations through it are visible to every other handle."
msgstr ""
"把结构体宽化到 trait `I` 会**把 impl vtable 附加到同一个句柄上** —— 不分配，不复制：trait 类型的值就是该记录的别名，透过它做出的修改对所有其他句柄可见。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:171
msgid ""
"Representation: one slot per field inside the cell, in declaration order — primitive fields widened into their slot, composite fields as cell-handle slots (see [Reified types and layout](reified-types.md)). Recursive shapes (`next: ?Node`) are legal because composite fields are pointer-sized."
msgstr ""
"表示：单元内每个字段一个槽，按声明顺序排列 —— 基本类型字段宽化进自己的槽，复合字段作为单元句柄槽（参见[具体化类型与布局](reified-types.md)）。递归形状（`next: ?Node`）是合法的，因为复合字段是指针大小的。"


#: src/reference/structs.md:176
msgid ""
"Structs are for small data (points, rects, colors, configs), but any size is allowed."
msgstr "结构体用于小型数据（点、矩形、颜色、配置），但任意大小都允许。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:3
msgid ""
"`class` — the sealed record: module-private fields by default, construction gated behind class methods, no inheritance."
msgstr "`class` —— 封闭的记录：字段默认模块私有，构造被把关在类方法之后，没有继承。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:6
msgid "Declaration and construction"
msgstr "声明与构造"


#: src/reference/classes.md:8
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"class Rect {\n"
"    w: f32;\n"
"    h: f32;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl Rect {\n"
"    pub fn new(w: f32, h: f32) -> Self {   // construction VALIDATES — it is\n"
"        if (w <= 0 || h <= 0) {            // just a function\n"
"            panic(\"Rect: negative extents\");\n"
"        }\n"
"        return Self { w: w, h: h };\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    pub fn from_square(s: f32) -> Self {   // named constructors are siblings\n"
"        return Rect.new(s, s);\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    pub fn area(self) -> f32 { return self.w * self.h; }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let r = Rect.from_square(3);\n"
"    log.info(f\"area={r.area()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"class Rect {\n"
"    w: f32;\n"
"    h: f32;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl Rect {\n"
"    pub fn new(w: f32, h: f32) -> Self {   // construction VALIDATES — it is\n"
"        if (w <= 0 || h <= 0) {            // just a function\n"
"            panic(\"Rect: negative extents\");\n"
"        }\n"
"        return Self { w: w, h: h };\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    pub fn from_square(s: f32) -> Self {   // named constructors are siblings\n"
"        return Rect.new(s, s);\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    pub fn area(self) -> f32 { return self.w * self.h; }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let r = Rect.from_square(3);\n"
"    log.info(f\"area={r.area()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/classes.md:42
msgid ""
"**Classes construct through their own class methods — nothing else is constructible.** There is no `constructor` keyword and no type-call: `Rect(3, 4)` does not parse as construction, and no outside literal exists:"
msgstr ""
"**类通过自己的类方法构造 —— 其他任何东西都不可构造。** 没有 `constructor` 关键字，也没有类型调用：`Rect(3, 4)` 不会被解析为构造，也不存在外部字面量："


#: src/reference/classes.md:47
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"let r = Rect.new(3, 4);            // the one construction surface\n"
"let v = Version.parse(\"1.2\");      // ?Version — nil on failure\n"
"// Rect { w: 1, h: 1 };            // ERROR: classes have no outside literal\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"let r = Rect.new(3, 4);            // the one construction surface\n"
"let v = Version.parse(\"1.2\");      // ?Version — nil on failure\n"
"// Rect { w: 1, h: 1 };            // ERROR: classes have no outside literal\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/classes.md:53
msgid ""
"`new` is not special syntax — just the conventional primary-constructor name (`from`, `parse`, `open`, `default` are its siblings); it is an ordinary identifier. Try-construction returns the nullable: a class method `fn parse(s: str) -> ?Version` answers `nil` on failure."
msgstr ""
"`new` 不是特殊语法 —— 只是约定俗成的主构造方法名（`from`、`parse`、`open`、`default` 是它的同辈）；它是一个普通标识符。尝试式构造返回可空类型：类方法 `fn parse(s: str) -> ?Version` 在失败时应答 `nil`。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:58
msgid ""
"**The `Self { field: expr, .. }` literal is the class-private construction** — legal anywhere inside the class body (class methods and instance methods alike); the class name spells it inside the body too (`Rect { .. }`). The literal must initialize every field without an initializer; field initializers run for omitted fields. Private fields are settable in the literal — inside the class body only. That privacy _is_ the seal: outside code can build a class value only by calling a class method that chooses to build one."
msgstr ""
"**`Self { field: expr, .. }` 字面量是类私有的构造方式** —— 在类体内的任何地方都合法（类方法和实例方法皆可）；在体内也可以用类名来写（`Rect { .. }`）。字面量必须初始化每个没有初始化式的字段；被省略的字段会运行其字段初始化式。私有字段可以在字面量中赋值 —— 但仅在类体内。这份隐私 _正是_ 密封性所在：外部代码只能通过调用一个愿意构建实例的类方法来构建类值。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:67
msgid ""
"**No implicit default construction.** A class whose fields all have initializers still needs an explicit `fn new() -> Self { return Self {}; }` if outsiders should build it. A class with no accessible constructing class method is **sealed** — constructible only inside its own body."
msgstr ""
"**没有隐式默认构造。** 一个所有字段都有初始化式的类，如果希望外部能构造它，仍然需要显式的 `fn new() -> Self { return Self {}; }`。没有任何可访问的构造类方法的类是**封闭的** —— 只能在自己的体内构造。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:73
msgid ""
"**No parameter properties**: parameters are parameters — the `Self { field: name }` literal makes the param→field mapping explicit."
msgstr "**没有参数属性**：参数就是参数 —— `Self { field: name }` 字面量把参数→字段的映射写明确。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:76
msgid ""
"**`async` class methods are allowed** — same function, `await` in the body. No partially constructed instance ever exists across an `await`: the `Self { .. }` literal is an ordinary expression, and locals live in the coroutine frame."
msgstr ""
"**允许 `async` 类方法** —— 还是同一个函数，体内可以 `await`。`await` 之间永远不会存在部分构造的实例：`Self { .. }` 字面量是普通表达式，局部变量生活在协程帧里。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:81
msgid "Methods: explicit `self`"
msgstr "方法：显式 `self`"


#: src/reference/classes.md:83
msgid ""
"**The receiver is explicit.** An instance method spells its receiver as the first parameter — `fn add(self, x: i32, y: i32)` — and the body reads fields through `self`. There is no `this` keyword. A method that mutates declares `mut self` and requires a `let mut` receiver (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md))."
msgstr ""
"**接收者是显式的。** 实例方法把接收者写为第一个参数 —— `fn add(self, x: i32, y: i32)` —— 体内透过 `self` 读取字段。没有 `this` 关键字。会做修改的方法声明 `mut self`，并要求 `let mut` 接收者（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:88
msgid ""
"A method **without** a `self` parameter is a **class method** — invoked on the class itself (`Rect.new(..)`, `Self.new(..)` inside the body). Presence or absence of `self` is the whole distinction; there is no separate \"static\" method form (`static fn` does not parse). Class methods are ordinary functions: they validate, default, cache, register, or hand out singletons."
msgstr ""
"**没有** `self` 参数的方法是**类方法** —— 在类本身上调用（`Rect.new(..)`，体内为 `Self.new(..)`）。有或没有 `self` 就是全部区别；没有单独的 \"static\" 方法形式（`static fn` 无法解析）。类方法就是普通函数：它们做校验、给默认值、缓存、注册或发放单例。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:94
msgid ""
"**No `get`/`set` accessor syntax anywhere** — a computed property is a method (`c.count()`), and a settable one takes an argument (`c.set_count(n)`). One member kind, one call convention."
msgstr ""
"**任何地方都没有 `get`/`set` 访问器语法** —— 计算属性就是一个方法（`c.count()`），可写的属性则接受一个参数（`c.set_count(n)`）。一种成员类别，一种调用约定。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:97
msgid ""
"**Static fields** are declared `static name: T = init;` in the class body, with the same visibility forms as fields."
msgstr "**静态字段**在类体内声明为 `static name: T = init;`，拥有与字段相同的可见性形式。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:100
msgid "Member visibility"
msgstr "成员可见性"


#: src/reference/classes.md:102
msgid ""
"Members follow the same visibility forms as declarations (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)): an unannotated field or method is **module-private**; `pub`, `pub(mod)`, `pub(super)`, `pub(self)` expose it to the form's audience. The construction surface is therefore explicit: `pub fn new(..)` builds; unannotated members stay the class's own business within its module."
msgstr ""
"成员遵循与声明相同的可见性形式（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）：未加注解的字段或方法是**模块私有**的；`pub`、`pub(mod)`、`pub(super)`、`pub(self)` 将其暴露给相应形式的受众。构造面因此是显式的：`pub fn new(..)` 负责构建；未加注解的成员仍是类在其模块内的私事。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:109
msgid "Reference semantics and equality"
msgstr "引用语义与相等"


#: src/reference/classes.md:111
msgid ""
"A class value is a **heap cell handle** like every non-primitive (see [By-reference and nullable](by-reference-and-nullable.md)): assignment shares, mutation is visible through aliases. `==` is cell identity; field-wise comparison is an opted-in trait contract."
msgstr ""
"类值是**堆单元句柄**，与所有非基本类型一样（参见[按引用与可空](by-reference-and-nullable.md)）：赋值即共享，修改透过别名可见。`==` 是单元同一性；按字段比较是需要显式加入的 trait 契约。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:116
msgid ""
"Reflection is opt-in: a class is walkable only where a serialization contract has been implemented for it by hand; structs are the open, auto-walkable records."
msgstr "反射是可选加入的：只有当某个序列化契约为一个类手工实现之后，它才是可遍历的；结构体才是开放的、可自动遍历的记录。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:120
msgid "No inheritance"
msgstr "没有继承"


#: src/reference/classes.md:122
msgid ""
"**No `extends` for classes** — no base-class constructors (`super(..)`), no method overriding, no `super.m()`, no `protected`."
msgstr ""
"**类没有 `extends`** —— 没有基类构造器（`super(..)`），没有方法重写，没有 `super.m()`，没有 `protected`。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:124
msgid ""
"Code sharing is composition (hold a helper object or struct in a field) or free functions; subtyping is only class→trait widening (see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md))."
msgstr "代码共享靠组合（在字段中持有一个辅助对象或结构体）或自由函数；子类型只有类→trait 宽化（参见[trait 与分派](traits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/classes.md:127
msgid ""
"Layout stays trivial: fields at fixed offsets — identical inside every cell payload (see [Reified types and layout](reified-types.md)) — no prefix layout, no fat pointers, and every object has exactly one concrete class forever. That keeps `is` a single descriptor check."
msgstr ""
"布局保持平凡：字段位于固定偏移 —— 在每个单元载荷内部完全一致（参见[具体化类型与布局](reified-types.md)）—— 没有前缀布局，没有胖指针，每个对象永远恰好只有一个具体类。这让 `is` 只需一次描述符检查。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:3
msgid ""
"One memory regime: every non-primitive value is a shared, refcounted heap cell; destruction is deterministic; `==` is identity for cells."
msgstr "一种内存体制：每个非基本类型值都是共享的、引用计数的堆单元；销毁是确定性的；`==` 对单元是同一性。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:8
msgid ""
"Every non-primitive value — struct and class records, `str`, `bytes`, `Vec`, `[T]`, enums, `opaque` boxes, trait-typed values, `?T` boxes, closures' captured cells — is a **heap cell handle**:"
msgstr ""
"每个非基本类型值 —— 结构体与类记录、`str`、`bytes`、`Vec`、`[T]`、枚举、`opaque` 盒、trait 类型的值、`?T` 盒、闭包捕获的单元 —— 都是**堆单元句柄**："


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:12
msgid ""
"assignment, argument passing, and returning copy the handle (retain/release), an O(1) move;"
msgstr "赋值、传参和返回复制句柄（retain/release），一次 O(1) 移动；"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:14
msgid "**mutation is visible through every alias**;"
msgstr "**修改透过每个别名可见**；"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:15
msgid ""
"writing is gated by the `mut`\\-binding law (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)), never by the sharing."
msgstr "写入由 `mut`\\- 绑定法则把关（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)），而不是由共享把关。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:19
msgid ""
"There is no eager copy of any composite. `own(x)` and `make_ptr(v)` are removed spellings — bindings share by reference. **`bytes.clone()` is the one copy escape hatch**: a one-shot deep copy of a buffer's octets. Every other type shares on binding; a divergent value of any other type is unreachable — build a new one instead."
msgstr ""
"任何复合值都没有急切复制。`own(x)` 与 `make_ptr(v)` 是已移除的写法 —— 绑定按引用共享。**`bytes.clone()` 是唯一的复制逃生口**：对缓冲区字节的一次性深复制。其他每个类型在绑定时都共享；任何其他类型的分歧值都不可达 —— 需要不同值就新建一个。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:25
msgid ""
"Recursive shapes (`next: ?Node`, trees, lists) are legal: composite fields and elements are pointer-sized handle slots, and the refcount walk sees every handle field via the compile-time field table (see [Reified types and layout](reified-types.md))."
msgstr ""
"递归形状（`next: ?Node`、树、链表）是合法的：复合字段与元素是指针大小的句柄槽，引用计数遍历经由编译期字段表看到每个句柄字段（参见[具体化类型与布局](reified-types.md)）。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:30
msgid "Disposal — the cell-death contract"
msgstr "Disposal——单元死亡契约"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:32
msgid ""
"Destructors are implemented, not attached. A type opts in with one `impl` block over the core trait `Disposal`:"
msgstr "析构器是实现出来的，不是挂上去的。一个类型用一个基于核心 trait `Disposal` 的 `impl` 块选择加入："


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:35
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Conn { log: Logger; url: str; }\n"
"\n"
"impl Disposal for Conn {\n"
"    fn dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext) {\n"
"        self.log.info(f\"closed {self.url}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let c = Conn { log: log, url: \"tcp://edge\" };\n"
"    log.info(\"main is done\");\n"
"}   // c's refcount reaches zero here; dispose runs at the call boundary\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Conn { log: Logger; url: str; }\n"
"\n"
"impl Disposal for Conn {\n"
"    fn dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext) {\n"
"        self.log.info(f\"closed {self.url}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let c = Conn { log: log, url: \"tcp://edge\" };\n"
"    log.info(\"main is done\");\n"
"}   // c's refcount reaches zero here; dispose runs at the call boundary\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:54
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"main is done\n"
"closed tcp://edge\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"main is done\n"
"closed tcp://edge\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:59
msgid ""
"`dispose` runs when the cell's refcount reaches **zero** — deterministic destruction, not a collector callback. The dying value arrives as `mut self`; the fields release after the body returns."
msgstr ""
"`dispose` 在单元引用计数达到**零**时运行——确定性析构，不是收集器回调。垂死的值以 `mut self` 到达；字段在函数体返回之后释放。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:62
msgid ""
"`cx: DisposalContext` is **engine-minted**, one per dispose call. It is empty today — the parameter exists so the context can grow additively without ever touching the trait signature."
msgstr ""
"`cx: DisposalContext` 是**引擎铸造的**，每次 dispose 调用一个。它今天还是空的——这个参数的存在，是为了让上下文可以增量成长而不必触碰 trait 签名。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:65
msgid ""
"`Disposal` and `DisposalContext` are the **import-gated** builtin surface: `use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext };` brings the pair in ([core and the swappable packages](stdlib.md)). Using either without the use line diagnoses `` `Disposal` is not in scope — `use core::{ Disposal }` ``."
msgstr ""
"`Disposal` 与 `DisposalContext` 是**导入把守**的内建表面：`use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext };` 把这一对带入（[core 与可换包](stdlib.md)）。不写 use 行就使用其中之一，会得到诊断 `` `Disposal` is not in scope — `use core::{ Disposal }` ``。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:70
msgid ""
"One impl per type, by trait coherence — there is no per-value attach and nothing to attach twice."
msgstr "每个类型一个 impl，由 trait 的一致性规则保证——没有逐值挂载，也没有可以挂载两次的东西。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:72
msgid ""
"The body runs at a call boundary, not re-entrantly inside the release; the full sequence — weak boxes nulled first, then `dispose`, then the recursive field walk — is [the Rc heap](rc-heap.md)'s destruction order."
msgstr ""
"函数体在调用边界运行，不在释放内部重入；完整序列——弱盒先置空，然后 `dispose`，然后递归的字段释放——正是 [Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)的销毁顺序。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:76
msgid ""
"The host side of the same law: a host payload's finalizer runs at cell death, before the payload's own Rust `Drop`."
msgstr "同一法则的宿主一侧：宿主载荷的 finalizer 在单元死亡时运行，早于载荷自身的 Rust `Drop`。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:79
msgid ""
"The old attach-a-cleanup builtin `on_drop(p, cleanup)` was removed — the per-call attach model is gone; a `Disposal` impl is the one cleanup spelling, and the removed name's diagnostic says the same."
msgstr ""
"旧的挂清理的内建 `on_drop(p, cleanup)` 已被移除——逐调用挂载的模型已消失；`Disposal` impl 是唯一的清理拼写，被移除名字的诊断信息说的也是同一件事。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:83
msgid ""
"Because every shared value now has a single knowable death — its refcount reaching zero — a struct can carry its own destructor: no wrapper class and no mint-site bookkeeping, just the impl."
msgstr "因为每个共享值现在都有一个单一可知的死亡——它的引用计数归零——结构体可以携带自己的析构器：不需要包装类，也不需要在铸造点记账，只需要那个 impl。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:89
msgid ""
"`Weak<T>` (see [Builtin generic types](builtin-generic-types.md)) demotes any handle to a non-keeping reference:"
msgstr "`Weak<T>`（参见[内置泛型类型](builtin-generic-types.md)）把任何句柄降级为不保留存活的引用："


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:92
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Tile { v: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let tile = Tile { v: 7 };\n"
"    let w = Weak.new(tile);        // does NOT keep the cell alive\n"
"    let got: ?Tile = w.upgrade();  // the live referent, or nil once dead\n"
"    log.info(f\"{got.v}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Tile { v: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let tile = Tile { v: 7 };\n"
"    let w = Weak.new(tile);        // does NOT keep the cell alive\n"
"    let got: ?Tile = w.upgrade();  // the live referent, or nil once dead\n"
"    log.info(f\"{got.v}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:110
msgid ""
"The referent's death nulls every weak box before any user code runs. A weak edge closes no cycle: strong cycles (two records holding each other, a container that holds its own observer) still leak to engine shutdown — the memory law is the program's; break cycles with `Weak`."
msgstr ""
"被引用对象的死亡会在任何用户代码运行之前把每个弱盒置为 nil。弱边不闭合任何循环：强循环（两个记录互相持有，一个容器持有自己的观察者）仍会一直泄漏到引擎关闭 —— 内存法则是程序自己的事；用 `Weak` 打破循环。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:115
msgid "Identity — `==`"
msgstr "同一性 —— `==`"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:117
msgid ""
"`a == b` is a builtin operator: no dispatch, no opting in, no element-wise story. `a != b` is its negation."
msgstr "`a == b` 是内置运算符：没有分派，不能选择加入，没有逐元素的说法。`a != b` 是它的否定。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:120
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:97
msgid "Operand type"
msgstr "操作数类型"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:120
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:97
msgid "Lowering"
msgstr "降格方式"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:122
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:99
msgid "numeric / `bool` primitives"
msgstr "数字 / `bool` 基本类型"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:122
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:99
msgid "value"
msgstr "值"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:122
msgid "compare, IEEE 754 for floats (`NaN != NaN`, `-0.0 == 0.0`)"
msgstr "数值比较，浮点遵循 IEEE 754（`NaN != NaN`、`-0.0 == 0.0`）"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:123
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:100
msgid "content (codepoints)"
msgstr "内容（码点）"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:123
#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:124
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:100
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:101
msgid "content compare"
msgstr "内容比较"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:124
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:101
msgid "content (octets)"
msgstr "内容（字节）"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:125
msgid ""
"everything else — records, arrays, `Vec`, enums, closures, trait objects, `opaque`, `?T`"
msgstr "其余一切 —— 记录、数组、`Vec`、枚举、闭包、trait 对象、`opaque`、`?T`"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:125
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:102
msgid "**cell identity**"
msgstr "**单元同一性**"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:125
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:102
msgid "the raw slot compare"
msgstr "原始槽位比较"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:127
msgid ""
"Identity is the only `==` sharing can defend: with aliasing everywhere, structural equality of two independently built cells is ambiguous, and identity is O(1) with no deep walk. `[1, 2] == [1, 2]` is **false** — two cells."
msgstr ""
"同一性是共享唯一能捍卫的 `==`：别名无处不在时，两个独立构造的单元的结构相等是有歧义的，而同一性是 O(1) 的，无需深度遍历。`[1, 2] == [1, 2]` 是 **false** —— 两个单元。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:131
msgid ""
"Enum members are immortal singletons, so `Flavor.Sour == Flavor.Sour` is `true` — the one place identity quietly behaves as value."
msgstr "枚举成员是不朽的单例，所以 `Flavor.Sour == Flavor.Sour` 是 `true` —— 这是同一性悄悄表现得像值的唯一场合。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:133
msgid ""
"`?T == ?T` is slot identity: two `nil`s are equal, a null and a box are not; `p == nil` derefs the nullable side and compares against the null slot."
msgstr "`?T == ?T` 是槽位同一性：两个 `nil` 相等，空槽与盒不相等；`p == nil` 会对可空一侧解引用并与空槽比较。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:136
msgid ""
"An **identity-compare lint** flags `==` between two obviously fresh composites (`Vec.from([..]) == Vec.from([..])`): \"always false — compare fields\". Asserting distinctness is legitimate and suppressible."
msgstr ""
"**同一性比较 lint** 会对两个明显崭新的复合值之间的 `==` 报警（`Vec.from([..]) == Vec.from([..])`）：“永远为 false —— 请比较字段”。断言两者不同是合法用例，可以抑制该 lint。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:140
msgid ""
"Field-wise comparison is a library trait contract (`hash` + `eq` implemented per type) — the mechanism value-keyed maps ride. It is not connected to `==`."
msgstr "按字段比较是库 trait 契约（每个类型分别实现 `hash` + `eq`）—— 值键控的映射依赖的正是这一机制。它与 `==` 没有任何关联。"


#: src/reference/rc-dispose-identity.md:143
msgid ""
"`when` literal patterns are unaffected: arms match compile-time values, never runtime `==`."
msgstr "`when` 的字面量模式不受影响：分支匹配编译期值，绝非运行期 `==`。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:3
msgid ""
"`trait` — methods only, no bodies, no defaults. Satisfaction is **nominal**: the impl block is the admission, and nothing else. Dispatch follows two positive rules, fixed at compile time per call site."
msgstr ""
"`trait` —— 只有方法，没有方法体，没有默认实现。满足是**名义性的**（nominal）：impl 块就是准入，别无其他。分派遵循两条肯定规则，在每个调用点于编译期固定。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:7
msgid "Traits"
msgstr "trait"


#: src/reference/traits.md:9
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"trait Shape {\n"
"    fn area(self) -> f64;        // bodiless signatures; async legal\n"
"    fn scale(v: f64);            // no-self methods legal (engine contracts)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"trait Shape {\n"
"    fn area(self) -> f64;        // bodiless signatures; async legal\n"
"    fn scale(v: f64);            // no-self methods legal (engine contracts)\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/traits.md:16
msgid ""
"**Methods only, no bodies.** No fields, no properties (there is no `get`/`set` syntax anywhere), and **no default implementations, ever** — one member kind, one dispatch candidate per call. Anything that reads like a property is a method."
msgstr ""
"**只有方法，没有方法体。** 没有字段，没有属性（任何地方都没有 `get`/`set` 语法），并且**永远没有默认实现** —— 一种成员类别，每次调用一个分派候选。任何读起来像属性的东西都是方法。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:20
msgid ""
"Methods are instance methods and spell the `self` receiver like every other method (`fn draw(self, g: Canvas) -> nil;`), except where an engine contract spells a receiver-less descriptor method (`Future`). `async fn` signatures are legal; an impl's method must match the trait's `async` spelling exactly."
msgstr ""
"方法是实例方法，并像所有其他方法一样写出 `self` 接收者（`fn draw(self, g: Canvas) -> nil;`），除非是引擎契约写出的无接收者描述符方法（`Future`）。`async fn` 签名合法；impl 的方法必须与 trait 的 `async` 写法完全一致。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:25
msgid "Trait members carry no `pub` — they are as visible as the trait."
msgstr "trait 成员不带 `pub` —— 它们的可见性与 trait 一致。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:26
msgid ""
"**No object-type keyword anywhere**: a trait name in _type position_ is the bare name — `d: Drawable`, `Vec<Widget>`, generic arguments included."
msgstr ""
"**任何地方都没有对象类型关键字**：_类型位置_ 上的 trait 名就是裸名 —— `d: Drawable`、`Vec<Widget>`，泛型实参也一样。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:29
msgid ""
"**No top trait.** The erased-storage type is the concrete primitive `opaque` (see [opaque — erasure and downcast](opaque.md)), reached by an explicit call, never by widening."
msgstr ""
"**没有顶层 trait。** 擦除存储类型是具体的基本类型 `opaque`（参见[opaque —— 擦除与向下转型](opaque.md)），只能通过显式调用到达，绝不能通过宽化。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:32
msgid ""
"**Intersection types (`A & B`) are never supported** — not deferred: heterogeneous needs compose a trait that declares both method sets."
msgstr "**交集类型（`A & B`）永不受支持** —— 不是推迟：异构需求请组合出一个同时声明两组方法的 trait。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:35
msgid "Impl blocks"
msgstr "impl 块"


#: src/reference/traits.md:37
msgid "Type bodies are fields only; methods live in impl blocks."
msgstr "类型体只有字段；方法位于 impl 块中。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:39
msgid "`impl T { .. }` (inherent)"
msgstr "`impl T { .. }` (inherent)"


#: src/reference/traits.md:39
msgid "`impl I for T { .. }` (trait)"
msgstr "`impl I for T { .. }` (trait)"


#: src/reference/traits.md:41
msgid "Lives in"
msgstr "位于"


#: src/reference/traits.md:41
msgid "`.rut`, **T's module only**"
msgstr "`.rut`，**仅在 T 的模块内**"


#: src/reference/traits.md:41
msgid "`.rut`, any module of **the trait's pkg or the type's pkg**"
msgstr "`.rut`，**trait 所在包或类型所在包**的任何模块"


#: src/reference/traits.md:42
msgid "Valid targets"
msgstr "有效目标"


#: src/reference/traits.md:42
msgid "local `struct`/`class`, or a `builtin class` this module declares"
msgstr "本地的 `struct`/`class`，或本模块声明的 `builtin class`"


#: src/reference/traits.md:42
msgid "any nominal type — **at least one of the pair must be local to this pkg**"
msgstr "任何名义类型 —— **两者中至少一个必须本地于本包**"


#: src/reference/traits.md:43
msgid "`pub(..)`"
msgstr "`pub(..)`"


#: src/reference/traits.md:43
msgid "classes only (structs are all-public)"
msgstr "仅类（结构体全公开）"


#: src/reference/traits.md:43
msgid "never — as visible as the trait"
msgstr "绝不 —— 与 trait 一样可见"


#: src/reference/traits.md:44
msgid "legal"
msgstr "合法"


#: src/reference/traits.md:44
msgid "legal — must match the trait's signature"
msgstr "合法 —— 必须与 trait 的签名一致"


#: src/reference/traits.md:45
msgid "no-`self` methods"
msgstr "无 `self` 方法"


#: src/reference/traits.md:45
msgid "legal (constructors)"
msgstr "合法（构造器）"


#: src/reference/traits.md:45
msgid "legal where the trait declares them"
msgstr "在 trait 声明它们的地方合法"


#: src/reference/traits.md:46
msgid "fields / empty body"
msgstr "字段 / 空体"


#: src/reference/traits.md:46
msgid "never / legal"
msgstr "绝不 / 合法"


#: src/reference/traits.md:46
msgid "never / legal (empty = the opt-in marker)"
msgstr "绝不 / 合法（空体 = 选择加入的标记）"


#: src/reference/traits.md:48
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"trait Shape { fn area(self) -> f64; }\n"
"trait Serializable {}\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; }\n"
"struct User { name: str; }\n"
"\n"
"impl Shape for Point {\n"
"    fn area(self) -> f64 { return self.x as f64; }\n"
"}\n"
"impl Serializable for User {}      // empty trait impl = the opt-in marker\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let p = Point { x: 5 };\n"
"    log.info(f\"{p.area()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"trait Shape { fn area(self) -> f64; }\n"
"trait Serializable {}\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; }\n"
"struct User { name: str; }\n"
"\n"
"impl Shape for Point {\n"
"    fn area(self) -> f64 { return self.x as f64; }\n"
"}\n"
"impl Serializable for User {}      // empty trait impl = the opt-in marker\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let p = Point { x: 5 };\n"
"    log.info(f\"{p.area()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/traits.md:73
msgid ""
"**Satisfaction is nominal.** A type that declares every member by shape is still not an `I` until some module writes `impl I for T`. There is no duck typing and no orphan rule beyond placement: for every `impl Trait for Type`, **at least one of `Type` or `Trait` must be defined in the current pkg** — both foreign is a compile error. Builtin types (`[T]`, the primitives, `?T`, `opaque`) are in no pkg: only a _local trait_ may be implemented for a builtin."
msgstr ""
"**满足是名义性的。** 一个按形状声明了全部成员的类型，在某些模块写出 `impl I for T` 之前仍不是 `I`。没有鸭子类型，除了位置之外也没有孤儿规则：对每个 `impl Trait for Type`，**`Type` 或 `Trait` 至少一个必须定义在当前包** —— 两者都是外来的就是编译错误。内置类型（`[T]`、各基本类型、`?T`、`opaque`）不属于任何包：只能为内置类型实现 _本地 trait_。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:80
msgid ""
"**One impl per `(trait, type)` pair, program-wide.** A duplicate — two modules, or two blocks in one — is a link error."
msgstr "**每个 `(trait, type)` 对全程序只有一个 impl。** 重复 —— 在两个模块中，或在同一模块里两个块中 —— 是链接错误。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:82
msgid ""
"**Bodies match the trait exactly**: receiver form (`self`/`mut self`), params, return type, `async` spelling. A missing signature is an error; so is any extra method in the block (put those in an inherent block)."
msgstr ""
"**方法体与 trait 完全一致**：接收者形式（`self`/`mut self`）、参数、返回类型、`async` 写法。缺失签名是错误；块中任何多余的方法也是错误（把它们放进固有块）。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:86
msgid ""
"Traits are implemented for classes, structs, **and primitives** (`impl Hashable for i32` registers like any trait impl), while an inherent `impl i32 { .. }` diagnoses — a primitive's inherent surface belongs to the engine."
msgstr ""
"trait 可以为类、结构体**和基本类型**实现（`impl Hashable for i32` 像任何 trait impl 一样注册），而固有的 `impl i32 { .. }` 会被诊断报错 —— 基本类型的固有面属于引擎。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:90
msgid ""
"**Generic traits and generic targets**: `trait Wrap<T>` gives each type-argument list its own instantiation (`Wrap<i32>` ≠ `Wrap<str>`); `impl Hashable for Pair<A, B>` binds the target's generic args as the impl's type parameters. Parameterized trait impls are legal: `impl Readable<T> for Source<T>` registers a **template** serving every concrete instantiation; a hand-written concrete impl shadows the template; repeated parameters (`impl W<T, T> for Pair2<T>`) are legal. Each trait-argument must be a concrete type or a bare name of one of the target's own parameters."
msgstr ""
"**泛型 trait 与泛型目标**：`trait Wrap<T>` 为每个类型实参列表提供自己的实例化（`Wrap<i32>` ≠ `Wrap<str>`）；`impl Hashable for Pair<A, B>` 把目标的泛型实参绑定为 impl 的类型参数。参数化的 trait impl 合法：`impl Readable<T> for Source<T>` 注册一个服务所有具体实例化的**模板**；手写的具体 impl 会遮蔽模板；重复的参数（`impl W<T, T> for Pair2<T>`）合法。每个 trait 实参必须是具体类型，或目标自身参数之一的裸名。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:99
msgid ""
"**The element is a type argument, not an associated type**: `impl Iterator<char> for Counter` — there are no associated `type` members."
msgstr "**元素是类型实参，不是关联类型**：`impl Iterator<char> for Counter` —— 不存在关联的 `type` 成员。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:102
msgid ""
"**`Self` in impl signatures** names the impl's target under the impl's substitution: `-> Self` returns, `Self { .. }` constructs."
msgstr ""
"**impl 签名中的 `Self`** 在该 impl 的替换之下指代 impl 的目标：`-> Self` 用于返回，`Self { .. }` 用于构造。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:105
msgid "Dispatch — the two-rule law"
msgstr "分派 —— 双规则法则"


#: src/reference/traits.md:107
msgid ""
"Every method call compiles under exactly one of two rules; the rule is a property of the call site, fixed at compile time."
msgstr "每个方法调用恰好在这两条规则之一之下编译；该规则是调用点的属性，在编译期固定。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:110
msgid ""
"**Static** — the call site names exactly one concrete type; the call binds directly to the impl's method, no vtable hop:"
msgstr "**静态** —— 调用点恰好指名一个具体类型；调用直接绑定到 impl 的方法，没有 vtable 跳转："


#: src/reference/traits.md:112
msgid "a concrete receiver — `c.area()` on `c: Circle`;"
msgstr "具体接收者 —— `c: Circle` 上的 `c.area()`；"


#: src/reference/traits.md:113
msgid ""
"a trait-typed local of **single concrete origin** — `let d: Shape = Point { .. }; d.area()` binds straight to `Point`'s impl;"
msgstr ""
"**单一具体来源**的 trait 类型局部变量 —— `let d: Shape = Point { .. }; d.area()` 直接绑定到 `Point` 的 impl；"


#: src/reference/traits.md:116
msgid ""
"a trait-typed **parameter** — the callee specializes per concrete argument type (one clone per argument type — finite, terminating), so a trait parameter _is_ an implicit generic bound;"
msgstr ""
"trait 类型的**参数** —— 被调用方按具体实参类型特化（每个实参类型一个克隆 —— 有限、会终止），因此 trait 参数 _就是_ 隐式泛型约束；"


#: src/reference/traits.md:119
msgid ""
"a monomorphized generic — inside `fn first<T>(..)`, `T`'s members are static per instantiation."
msgstr "单态化的泛型 —— 在 `fn first<T>(..)` 内部，`T` 的成员按实例化静态确定。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:121
msgid ""
"**Vtable** — the receiver is trait-typed with multiple possible concrete origins; the call consults the value's descriptor and its per-(type × trait) method table:"
msgstr "**vtable** —— 接收者是 trait 类型且有多个可能的具体来源；调用查询值的描述符及其每（类型 × trait）方法表："


#: src/reference/traits.md:124
msgid "heterogeneous container elements — `for (s of shapes)` over a `Vec<Shape>`;"
msgstr "异构容器元素 —— 对 `Vec<Shape>` 的 `for (s of shapes)`；"


#: src/reference/traits.md:126
msgid "trait-typed field/element loads;"
msgstr "trait 类型的字段/元素加载；"


#: src/reference/traits.md:127
msgid ""
"branch-merged origins — `let s = if (c) { a } else { b };` where the arms carry different concretes into one trait-typed binding."
msgstr ""
"分支合并的来源 —— `let s = if (c) { a } else { b };` 其中两个分支把不同的具体类型带入同一个 trait 类型绑定。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:130
msgid ""
"Origin counting is conservative: any merge, indirection load, or cross-function flow counts as multiple. Mis-analysis cannot produce wrong code — an uncertain origin costs a vtable hop, never a wrong static bind."
msgstr ""
"来源计数是保守的：任何合并、间接加载或跨函数流动都计为多个。误分析不会产生错误代码 —— 不确定的来源只会付出一次 vtable 跳转，绝不会错误地静态绑定。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:135
msgid ""
"**The use-both gate**: `x.trait_method()` requires **both** the type and the trait to be named at the call site's module — the type by declaration or `use`, the trait by `use`. A call that matches a registered impl whose trait no `use` names is an error: \"use `I` to call its methods on `T`\"."
msgstr ""
"**use-both 门槛**：`x.trait_method()` 要求类型和 trait **两者**都在调用点所在模块被指名 —— 类型通过声明或 `use`，trait 通过 `use`。调用匹配到一个已注册 impl、但没有任何 `use` 指名其 trait 时报错：\"use `I` to call its methods on `T`\"。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:141
msgid ""
"**Widening is nominal and implicit**: a value of `T` widens to `I` exactly where the registry holds a visible `impl I for T` — on assignment, argument passing, and returns. The explicit, greppable form is the trait annotation at the receiving position (`let d: Drawable = s;`). There is no `upcast` builtin. A trait-typed value **cannot be downcast**: use it through the trait, or erase explicitly through `opaque`."
msgstr ""
"**宽化是名义且隐式的**：`T` 的值在注册表中存在可见的 `impl I for T` 的所有位置宽化为 `I` —— 赋值、传参和返回皆是。显式、可 grep 的形式是接收位置的类型注解（`let d: Drawable = s;`）。没有 `upcast` 内置。trait 类型的值**不能向下转型**：要么透过 trait 使用它，要么通过 `opaque` 显式擦除。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:149
msgid "Type tests — `is`"
msgstr "类型测试 —— `is`"


#: src/reference/traits.md:151
msgid ""
"`expr is Type` → `bool`, at relational precedence, non-associative. The right-hand side is a naming position: a concrete type or a bare trait name/instantiation."
msgstr "`expr is Type` → `bool`，关系运算优先级，非结合。右侧是命名位置：具体类型，或裸 trait 名/实例化。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:155
msgid ""
"**Concrete RHS — exact-type test**: true when the value's exact class or struct _is_ `T`. With no inheritance this is a single descriptor lookup."
msgstr "**具体 RHS —— 精确类型测试**：当值的精确类或结构体 _就是_ `T` 时为真。没有继承，这只是一次描述符查找。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:158
msgid ""
"**Trait RHS — capability probe**: true when the value's exact type has a registered impl for that trait (`k is Hashable`)."
msgstr "**trait RHS —— 能力探测**：当值的精确类型注册了该 trait 的 impl 时为真（`k is Hashable`）。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:160
msgid ""
"**No flow sensitivity**: `if (x is Hashable) { .. }` grants nothing — no narrowing, no widening. The keyword answers; it does not admit."
msgstr "**没有流敏感性**：`if (x is Hashable) { .. }` 什么也不授予 —— 不收窄，不宽化。这个关键字只回答问题；不做准入。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:162
msgid ""
"**Static folds**: when the receiver's static type already answers, the result is a compile-time constant, with an always-true/false lint."
msgstr "**静态折叠**：当接收者的静态类型已能回答时，结果是编译期常量，并伴随一条恒真/恒假 lint。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:164
msgid ""
"`is` is total: never traps, yields only `bool`. The same descriptor answers the vtable and the probe — one runtime truth per value."
msgstr "`is` 是全函数：绝不陷阱，只产出 `bool`。同一个描述符同时回答 vtable 和探测 —— 每个值只有一份运行时真相。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:169
msgid "A type is iterable when it registers `impl Iterator<E> for T`:"
msgstr "一个类型注册了 `impl Iterator<E> for T` 即为可迭代的："


#: src/reference/traits.md:171
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ Iterator };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"class CountUp {\n"
"    n: i32;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl CountUp {\n"
"    pub fn new(n: i32) -> Self { return Self { n: n }; }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl Iterator<i32> for CountUp {\n"
"    fn __iterate(self, emit: fn(i32) -> bool) {\n"
"        for (let i = 1; i <= self.n; i += 1) {\n"
"            if (!emit(i)) { return; }\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    for (let v of CountUp.new(3)) {\n"
"        log.info(f\"tick {v}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rutuse core::{ Iterator };use ink::{ Logger };class CountUp {    n: i32;}impl CountUp {    pub fn new(n: i32) -> Self { return Self { n: n }; }}impl Iterator<i32> for CountUp {    fn __iterate(self, emit: fn(i32) -> bool) {        for (let i = 1; i <= self.n; i += 1) {            if (!emit(i)) { return; }        }    }}pub fn main() {    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");    for (let v of CountUp.new(3)) {        log.info(f\"tick {v}\");    }}```"


#: src/reference/traits.md:205
msgid ""
"`for (v of it) { body }` desugars to `it.__iterate(emit)` with a synthetic closure: the body runs, then `emit` returns `true`; `break` returns `false` (stopping the iteration); `continue` returns `true` immediately; a `return` inside the body stops the iteration (not the enclosing function). The loop variable is the closure's parameter — a fresh binding per iteration; captured enclosing locals are copied by value at the desugar, so accumulate through a shared cell or a method. The builtin sequences (`[T]`, `Vec<T>`, `str`, `bytes`) keep their fused index loops and never reach the protocol."
msgstr ""
"`for (v of it) { body }` 脱糖为带合成闭包的 `it.__iterate(emit)`：先运行体，然后 `emit` 返回 `true`；`break` 返回 `false`（停止迭代）；`continue` 立即返回 `true`；体内遇到 `return` 会停止迭代（而不是外围函数）。循环变量是闭包的参数 —— 每次迭代一个新绑定；在脱糖时被捕获的外围局部变量按值复制，因此要透过共享单元或方法来累加。内置序列（`[T]`、`Vec<T>`、`str`、`bytes`）保留其融合的索引循环，永远不会走到该协议。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:215
msgid "Engine contracts"
msgstr "引擎契约"


#: src/reference/traits.md:217
msgid ""
"`builtin trait` names are compiler-backed but **engine-named, not engine-closed** — users implement them through the ordinary nominal path:"
msgstr "`builtin trait` 名称由编译器支撑，但**由引擎命名，不对引擎封闭** —— 用户通过普通的名义路径实现它们："


#: src/reference/traits.md:236
msgid ""
"`impl Future<nil> for CustomFuture` registers in the same registry as any other impl. Every builtin trait is the import-gated `pub builtin` spelling: the ENGINE weaves on the native-trait symbols — async frames, the minted cx, and the fused `for..of` loops never consult user scope — but source that SPELLS a trait name resolves it only through `use core::{ .. }` (`Iterator` for an `impl Iterator<E> for T` or a trait-typed parameter; `Future` for a user impl, a launcher's `f: Future<T>`, or `downcast<Future<..>>`; `RunContext` for a yield signature or an `async fn` head; the `Disposal` pair through `use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext }` — see [Host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md)). See [Async and await](async.md) and [the Rc heap](rc-heap.md)."
msgstr ""
"`impl Future<nil> for CustomFuture` 与任何其他 impl 一样注册进同一个注册表。每个内置 trait 都是导入把守的 `pub builtin` 拼写：引擎在原生 trait 符号上织造——异步帧、铸造的 cx、融合的 `for..of` 循环从不查阅用户作用域——但拼写了 trait 名字的源码只能经 `use core::{ .. }` 解析它（`impl Iterator<E> for T` 或 trait 类型的参数用 `Iterator`；用户 impl、启动器的 `f: Future<T>`、`downcast<Future<..>>` 用 `Future`；yield 签名或 `async fn` 头用 `RunContext`；`Disposal` 对经 `use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext }`——见[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)）。参见[异步与 await](async.md)与 [Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)。"


#: src/reference/traits.md:249
msgid "Equality"
msgstr "相等"


#: src/reference/traits.md:251
msgid ""
"`==` is a builtin operator with no vtable dispatch: primitives by value, `str`/`bytes` by content, everything else by cell identity — see [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md). Field-wise comparison is a `Hashable`\\-style contract implemented per type; it is not connected to `==`."
msgstr ""
"`==` 是没有 vtable 分派的内置运算符：基本类型按值，`str`/`bytes` 按内容，其余一切按单元同一性 —— 参见[Rc、dispose 与同一性](rc-dispose-identity.md)。按字段比较是每个类型分别实现的 `Hashable`\\- 风格契约；它与 `==` 没有任何关联。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:3
msgid ""
"Function declarations, anonymous closures, and monomorphized generics with admission-only bounds."
msgstr "函数声明、匿名闭包，以及带仅准入约束的单态化泛型。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:6 src/reference/stdlib.md:31
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "函数"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:8
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 {\n"
"    return a + b;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{add(2, 3)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 {\n"
"    return a + b;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{add(2, 3)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:25
msgid ""
"Parameters are `name: Type`; a mutable parameter declares `mut name` — the callee's permission to mutate the caller's object (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md))."
msgstr ""
"参数写作 `name: Type`；可变参数声明 `mut name` —— 这是被调用方修改调用方对象的许可（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:28
msgid ""
"A function without a result arrow returns `nil`; `return;` (or falling off the end) is its return."
msgstr "没有结果箭头的函数返回 `nil`；`return;`（或执行到末尾自然结束）就是它的返回。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:30
msgid ""
"Methods are functions in impl blocks: the first parameter spelled `self` (or `mut self`) makes it an instance method; absence of `self` makes it a class method (see [Classes and constructors](classes.md))."
msgstr ""
"方法是 impl 块中的函数：第一个参数写作 `self`（或 `mut self`）使它成为实例方法；没有 `self` 则是类方法（参见[类与构造器](classes.md)）。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:34
msgid ""
"`entry fn` publishes a function to the embedder (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)); `async fn` declares a suspending function (see [Async and await](async.md))."
msgstr ""
"`entry fn` 把函数发布给嵌入方（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）；`async fn` 声明一个可挂起的函数（参见[异步与 await](async.md)）。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:37
msgid ""
"Function types are first-class: `fn apply(f: fn(i32) -> i32, v: i32) -> i32`."
msgstr "函数类型是一等公民：`fn apply(f: fn(i32) -> i32, v: i32) -> i32`。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:39
msgid "Closures"
msgstr "闭包"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:41
msgid "The closure spelling is an **anonymous fn** — block bodies, no arrow form:"
msgstr "闭包的写法是**匿名 fn** —— 块体，没有箭头形式："


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:44
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let add = fn (a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 { return a + b; };\n"
"    let area_of = fn (r: f32) -> f32 {\n"
"        let sq = r * r;\n"
"        return sq * 3.14159265f32;\n"
"    };\n"
"    log.info(f\"add={add(1, 2)} area={area_of(1)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let add = fn (a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 { return a + b; };\n"
"    let area_of = fn (r: f32) -> f32 {\n"
"        let sq = r * r;\n"
"        return sq * 3.14159265f32;\n"
"    };\n"
"    log.info(f\"add={add(1, 2)} area={area_of(1)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:62
msgid ""
"An anonymous fn inhabits `fn(P..) -> R` directly — it is a value of the function type, copyable like a primitive."
msgstr "匿名 fn 直接栖居于 `fn(P..) -> R` —— 它就是函数类型的值，像基本类型一样可复制。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:64
msgid ""
"Closures capture **by reference** to the enclosing bindings: mutation through a captured `let mut` binding is visible to the definer. Refcounting keeps captures alive; a closure is itself a shared cell value."
msgstr "闭包**按引用**捕获外围绑定：透过被捕获的 `let mut` 绑定做出的修改对定义者可见。引用计数让捕获保持存活；闭包本身是一个共享单元值。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:68
msgid ""
"Closures are not transferable across isolates (a worker boundary transfers values, not closures)."
msgstr "闭包不能跨隔离单元转移（worker 边界转移的是值，不是闭包）。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:73
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn first<T>(xs: [T], fallback: T) -> T {\n"
"    if (xs.len() == 0) { return fallback; }\n"
"    return xs[0];\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let head = first([10, 20], -1);      // first<i32>   — monomorphized\n"
"    let name = first([\"a\", \"b\"], \"?\");   // first<str>   — separate instance\n"
"    log.info(f\"{head} {name}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"fn first<T>(xs: [T], fallback: T) -> T {\n"
"    if (xs.len() == 0) { return fallback; }\n"
"    return xs[0];\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let head = first([10, 20], -1);      // first<i32>   — monomorphized\n"
"    let name = first([\"a\", \"b\"], \"?\");   // first<str>   — separate instance\n"
"    log.info(f\"{head} {name}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:93
msgid ""
"**Generics monomorphize at compile time**: each instantiation emits its own typed code. `T` infers from the arguments; explicit type arguments may be spelled at call sites, including method calls: `self.st.get<T>(self)`."
msgstr ""
"**泛型在编译期单态化**：每个实例化发出自己的类型化代码。`T` 从实参推断；显式类型实参可以写在调用点，包括方法调用：`self.st.get<T>(self)`。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:97
msgid ""
"Trait-typed arguments are ordinary arguments: a `T` instantiated at a trait type becomes a handle slot, satisfying no bound."
msgstr "trait 类型的实参是普通实参：在 trait 类型上实例化的 `T` 成为一个句柄槽，不满足任何约束。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:99
msgid ""
"**Generic parameters are unconstrained by default** — you cannot call methods on a bare `T`. Pass values in, or take an `I`\\-typed parameter instead of a generic."
msgstr "**泛型参数默认不受约束** —— 你不能在裸 `T` 上调用方法。要么把值传进去，要么改用 `I`\\- 类型的参数而不是泛型。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:102
msgid ""
"There are no const-generic user parameters. The builtin surfaces fix their shapes (`[T]` is one type; lengths are runtime values)."
msgstr "没有常量泛型用户参数。内置接口面固定了它们的形状（`[T]` 是一个类型；长度是运行期值）。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:105
msgid "Inline bounds — `requires`"
msgstr "内联约束 —— `requires`"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:112
msgid ""
"`fn f<T requires A | B>(x: T)` — an **admission-only** bound on fn, method, and class generic parameters (struct and trait generic parameters reject `requires`):"
msgstr ""
"`fn f<T requires A | B>(x: T)` —— fn、方法和类泛型参数上的**仅准入**约束（struct 与 trait 泛型参数拒绝 `requires`）："


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:116
msgid ""
"The bound gates which instantiations compile: enforcement is at every substitution-completing site (free-fn calls, method instantiation, impl-method enqueue). A failing instantiation diagnoses with the bound spelled out — \"`bool` does not satisfy `T` requires `i32 | str`\"."
msgstr ""
"约束把关哪些实例化可以编译：在每一个完成替换的位置强制执行（自由函数调用、方法实例化、impl 方法入队）。失败的实例化会带着写明的约束诊断 —— \"`bool` does not satisfy `T` requires `i32 | str`\"。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:121
msgid ""
"Members may be concrete type names (satisfied by exact type identity), aliases (expanded first — see [Type aliases and union bounds](type-aliases.md)), a single trait (satisfied via the impl registry), or a **type union** of concrete names/aliases. A trait member inside a union spelling is invalid — a trait bound stands alone."
msgstr ""
"成员可以是具体类型名（按精确类型同一性满足）、别名（先展开 —— 参见[类型别名与联合约束](type-aliases.md)）、单个 trait（经 impl 注册表满足），或具体名/别名的**类型联合**。联合写法内部的 trait 成员无效 —— trait 约束必须独立成立。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:127
msgid ""
"**Trait objects satisfy nothing**: a `T` instantiated at a trait type fails any bound — only a concrete type with a registered impl admits."
msgstr "**trait 对象不满足任何约束**：在 trait 类型上实例化的 `T` 无法通过任何约束 —— 只有带已注册 impl 的具体类型才获准入。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:129
msgid ""
"A non-union bound **proves the widening**: the body may widen a `T`\\-typed value into a bound-member-typed slot (`let w: Labeled = x;`), but gains no method calls on bare `T`."
msgstr ""
"非联合约束**证明宽化成立**：体内可以把 `T` 类型的值宽化为约束成员类型的槽（`let w: Labeled = x;`），但对裸 `T` 得不到任何方法调用。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:132
msgid ""
"A **union bound** carries the whole-bound contract: a method call on a union-bounded value requires **every** member to provide the method — even a member that is never actually instantiated. Dispatch is untouched: each instantiation still binds the concrete member's own impl."
msgstr ""
"**联合约束**携带整个约束的契约：对联合约束值的方法调用要求**每个**成员都提供该方法 —— 即使是永远不会真正实例化的成员。分派不受影响：每个实例化仍绑定具体成员自己的 impl。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:137
msgid ""
"Bounds may reference the item's other generics: `fn hold<T, U requires [T]>(x: U)`."
msgstr "约束可以引用条目的其他泛型：`fn hold<T, U requires [T]>(x: U)`。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:139
msgid ""
"Generic **classes** take bounds on their parameters — the bound records on the class descriptor and admits every instantiation: `pub class HashMap<K requires i8 | .. | bytes, V>` (see [Builtin generic types](builtin-generic-types.md))."
msgstr ""
"泛型**类**在其参数上带约束 —— 该约束记录在类描述符上并准入每个实例化：`pub class HashMap<K requires i8 | .. | bytes, V>`（参见[内置泛型类型](builtin-generic-types.md)）。"


#: src/reference/functions-closures-generics.md:144
msgid ""
"The trailing `where` clause does not exist: `where` is an ordinary identifier, and a stray clause diagnoses with the inline replacement."
msgstr "尾随 `where` 子句不存在：`where` 是普通标识符，游离的子句会以内联替代方案诊断报错。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:3
msgid ""
"`opaque` is the erasure-box engine primitive: a concrete type whose values box any value — **forgetting the static type and keeping the runtime type for downcast only**. Erasure is a call you write; the static type system never loosens, and rut has no cast syntax for it (`as` is the numeric cast only)."
msgstr ""
"`opaque` 是擦除盒引擎基本类型：一种具体类型，其值可以装盒任何值 —— **忘掉静态类型，保留运行时类型仅供向下转型**。擦除是你写出的调用；静态类型系统从不松动，rut 也没有用于此的转换语法（`as` 只是数值转换）。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:11
msgid ""
"`opaque` is a declared engine primitive, **ambient** — no `use` gates it. Its entire API:"
msgstr "`opaque` 是一个声明的引擎基本类型，**环境自带** —— 无需 `use` 把关。它的全部 API："


#: src/reference/opaque.md:16
msgid "`opaque(v)`"
msgstr "`opaque(v)`"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:16
msgid "erasure: box any value; answers the `opaque` box"
msgstr "擦除：装盒任何值；应答 `opaque` 盒"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:17
msgid "`opaque.downcast<T>(o) -> ?T`"
msgstr "`opaque.downcast<T>(o) -> ?T`"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:17
msgid "checked recovery: the box's inner cell on a match, `nil` on a mismatch"
msgstr "受检恢复：匹配时返回盒的内层单元，不匹配时返回 `nil`"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:18
msgid "`x is opaque`"
msgstr "`x is opaque`"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:18
msgid "the ordinary concrete test for the box type itself"
msgstr "对盒类型本身进行的普通具体测试"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:20
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"enum Flavor { Sour, Sweet }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let box1 = opaque(Point { x: 1, y: 2 });   // erasure = call of the type name\n"
"    let p = opaque.downcast<Point>(box1);      // ?Point — the nullable\n"
"    when (p != nil) {\n"
"        true -> { log.info(f\"point {p.x} {p.y}\"); },\n"
"        else  -> { log.info(\"point: nil\"); },\n"
"    }\n"
"    let wrong = opaque.downcast<i32>(opaque(Flavor.Sour));  // nil, no trap\n"
"    log.info(f\"wrong == nil: {wrong == nil}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"enum Flavor { Sour, Sweet }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let box1 = opaque(Point { x: 1, y: 2 });   // erasure = call of the type name\n"
"    let p = opaque.downcast<Point>(box1);      // ?Point — the nullable\n"
"    when (p != nil) {\n"
"        true -> { log.info(f\"point {p.x} {p.y}\"); },\n"
"        else  -> { log.info(\"point: nil\"); },\n"
"    }\n"
"    let wrong = opaque.downcast<i32>(opaque(Flavor.Sour));  // nil, no trap\n"
"    log.info(f\"wrong == nil: {wrong == nil}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:46
msgid ""
"**Construction is erasure.** Every value can become `opaque`. Under the all-cells regime, boxing is **zero-copy**: the box stores the payload's cell handle, so mutations through the original name are visible through the box (the alias law, see [By-reference and nullable](by-reference-and-nullable.md)). A primitive payload copies the bits — value semantics where aliasing is unobservable:"
msgstr ""
"**构造即擦除。** 每个值都能变成 `opaque`。在全单元体制下，装盒是**零复制**的：盒存储载荷的单元句柄，因此透过原始名称做出的修改透过盒可见（别名法则，参见[按引用与可空](by-reference-and-nullable.md)）。基本类型载荷复制位 —— 在别名不可观测的场合保持值语义："


#: src/reference/opaque.md:54
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let mut n = 5;\n"
"    let b = opaque(n);    // a prim payload COPIES the bits\n"
"    n = 9;                // ...so the source moving stays out\n"
"    log.info(f\"{opaque.downcast<i32>(b)} vs {n}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let mut n = 5;\n"
"    let b = opaque(n);    // a prim payload COPIES the bits\n"
"    n = 9;                // ...so the source moving stays out\n"
"    log.info(f\"{opaque.downcast<i32>(b)} vs {n}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:70
msgid ""
"**A match is the box's own inner cell.** The recovered `?T` shares the box: writes through the recovery are the source's, in both directions, through every holder. A primitive payload reads the copied value."
msgstr ""
"**匹配返回的是盒自己的内层单元。** 恢复出的 `?T` 与盒共享：透过恢复值做出的写入就是源头的写入，双向成立，透过每个持有者皆然。基本类型载荷读到的是复制出的值。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:73
msgid ""
"**A mismatch is `nil`.** There is no flag and no zero value — the miss is the nullable's null; an unguarded dereference traps `NilDeref`, never a silent zero."
msgstr ""
"**不匹配即 `nil`。** 没有标志位，也没有零值 —— 未命中就是可空类型的空；未加守护的解引用触发 `NilDeref` 陷阱，绝不是无声的零。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:76
msgid ""
"**The type argument must be concrete.** A trait-typed type argument (`opaque.downcast<Drawable>`) is a compile error — trait-typed values have no recovery path by design."
msgstr ""
"**类型实参必须是具体类型。** trait 类型的类型实参（`opaque.downcast<Drawable>`）是编译错误 —— 按设计，trait 类型的值没有恢复路径。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:79
msgid ""
"**The opaque-is law: `is` names the box, never the payload.** `o is T` and `o is I` answer **by the box** — false for every payload type, concrete and trait alike. The one check that names what it is — `o is opaque` — is `true`. Recovery is `downcast<T>` only. On a non-box receiver, `x is opaque` is the ordinary concrete test for the box type."
msgstr ""
"**opaque-is 法则：`is` 指名盒，绝不指名载荷。** `o is T` 与 `o is I` **按盒**回答 —— 对所有载荷类型都为 false，具体类型与 trait 一视同仁。唯一指名其身份的检查 —— `o is opaque` —— 是 `true`。恢复只有 `downcast<T>` 一条路。在非盒接收者上，`x is opaque` 是对盒类型的普通具体测试。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:86
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let b = opaque(\"hello\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{b is str} {opaque.downcast<str>(b) != nil}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let b = opaque(\"hello\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{b is str} {opaque.downcast<str>(b) != nil}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:100
msgid ""
"**Boxes are never equal unless identical**: `opaque(v) == opaque(v)` is `false` — two boxes, two cells. Box once, compare boxes."
msgstr "**盒永不相等，除非同一**：`opaque(v) == opaque(v)` 是 `false` —— 两个盒，两个单元。装一次盒，比较盒。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:102
msgid ""
"**Trait-typed values cannot be boxed**: erasure takes a concrete value. Fixed arrays box fine; their identity covers the element type."
msgstr "**trait 类型的值不能装盒**：擦除接受具体值。定长数组可以装盒；其同一性覆盖元素类型。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:105
msgid "Composition and costs"
msgstr "组合与成本"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:107
msgid ""
"`opaque` is a concrete primitive, not a lattice node: it composes in every type position trivially — `Vec<opaque>`, `[opaque]`, fields, returns, parameters."
msgstr ""
"`opaque` 是具体基本类型，不是格上的节点：它在任何类型位置的组合都平凡 —— `Vec<opaque>`、`[opaque]`、字段、返回值、参数。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:111
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"use pouch::{ Vec };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let boxes: [opaque] = [opaque(Point { x: 3, y: 4 }), opaque(\"two\")];\n"
"    let vec: Vec<opaque> = Vec.from([opaque(5)]);\n"
"    log.info(f\"{boxes.len()} {vec.len()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"use pouch::{ Vec };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let boxes: [opaque] = [opaque(Point { x: 3, y: 4 }), opaque(\"two\")];\n"
"    let vec: Vec<opaque> = Vec.from([opaque(5)]);\n"
"    log.info(f\"{boxes.len()} {vec.len()}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:129
msgid ""
"The rut-side box is one small cell: the erased value rides inline in the box, and cell churn is recycled by the heap arena. Heap accounting charges the box's cell, as always (see [Reified types and layout](reified-types.md))."
msgstr ""
"rut 一侧的盒是一个小单元：被擦除的值内联存放于盒中，单元的反复创建由堆 arena 回收。堆记账照常记在盒的单元上（参见[具体化类型与布局](reified-types.md)）。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:133
msgid ""
"The host side of the same surface: an embedder can mint the box over host data with no static rut shape. rut sees only the box — `o is opaque` is `true`, `o is T` misses for every rut `T`, and `opaque.downcast<T>` answers `nil` for every `T` (the miss is checked, never a trap). The host borrows the payload back typed, call-scoped and borrow-guarded."
msgstr ""
"同一接口面的宿主一侧：嵌入方可以在宿主数据上铸造盒，无需静态 rut 形状。rut 只看到盒 —— `o is opaque` 是 `true`，`o is T` 对每个 rut `T` 都未命中，`opaque.downcast<T>` 对每个 `T` 应答 `nil`（未命中是受检的，绝不是陷阱）。宿主以带类型的方式借回载荷，限定在调用作用域并受借用守卫保护。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:139
msgid ""
"Crossing isolates is allowed iff the boxed value's type is crossable, checked at runtime via the type descriptor."
msgstr "跨越隔离单元是允许的，当且仅当被装盒值的类型是可跨越的，在运行时经由类型描述符检查。"


#: src/reference/opaque.md:141
msgid ""
"An `opaque` box can do nothing until it is recovered — no methods, no fields, no format-string rendering. That is the difference from gradual typing: the erased-storage type for a hot loop is a smell; lints flag downcasts inside loop bodies and `opaque` parameters/returns on non-storage functions."
msgstr ""
"`opaque` 盒在被恢复之前什么也做不了 —— 没有方法，没有字段，没有格式化字符串渲染。这正是它与渐进类型的差别：热循环中的擦除存储类型是一种坏味道；lint 会对循环体内的向下转型以及非存储函数上的 `opaque` 参数/返回值报警。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:3
msgid ""
"Every value's type is available at runtime as a type descriptor. Slots are untagged 8-byte values; bytecode is typed, so hot paths carry no tags. This page is the language-facing contract; the descriptor itself is VM data, not a script value."
msgstr ""
"每个值的类型在运行时都以类型描述符的形式可用。槽是不带标签的 8 字节值；字节码是类型化的，因此热路径不携带标签。本页是面向语言的契约；描述符本身是 VM 数据，不是脚本值。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:8
msgid "Where reification is language-facing"
msgstr "具体化面向语言的场合"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:10 src/reference/string-views.md:8
msgid "Surface"
msgstr "接口面"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:10
msgid "Mechanism"
msgstr "机制"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:12
msgid "`is` type tests — concrete and trait RHS"
msgstr "`is` 类型测试 —— 具体与 trait 右侧"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:12
msgid "the value cell's descriptor (see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md))"
msgstr "值单元的描述符（参见[trait 与分派](traits.md)）"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:13
msgid "`opaque.downcast<T>` recovery"
msgstr "`opaque.downcast<T>` recovery"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:13
msgid ""
"the box's recorded runtime type (see [opaque — erasure and downcast](opaque.md))"
msgstr "盒记录的运行时类型（参见[opaque —— 擦除与向下转型](opaque.md)）"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:14 src/reference/reified-types.md:18
msgid "`type_id<T>()`"
msgstr "`type_id<T>()`"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:14
msgid "the compile-time type-identity constant"
msgstr "编译期类型同一性常量"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:15
msgid "host boundary checks"
msgstr "宿主边界检查"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:15
msgid "every crossing is checked against the declared parameter type"
msgstr "每一次跨越都对照声明的参数类型检查"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:16
msgid "diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:16
msgid "stack traces and host tooling read the same descriptors"
msgstr "栈回溯与宿主工具读取同一批描述符"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:20
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let TID_POINT: u32 = type_id<Point>();\n"
"    log.info(f\"{TID_POINT} eq={type_id<Point>() == TID_POINT}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let TID_POINT: u32 = type_id<Point>();\n"
"    log.info(f\"{TID_POINT} eq={type_id<Point>() == TID_POINT}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:36
msgid ""
"`type_id<T>() -> u32` — the identity of the **instantiated** type: unique per VM run, stable across modules, comparable only. `Vec<f32>` ≠ `Vec<f64>`; `Point` = `Point` wherever declared."
msgstr ""
"`type_id<T>() -> u32` —— **实例化后**类型的同一性：每次 VM 运行唯一，跨模块稳定，仅可比较。`Vec<f32>` ≠ `Vec<f64>`；`Point` 无论在哪里声明都等于 `Point`。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:39
msgid ""
"It is a **compile-time constant** — a load-time expression (legal in module-level `let` initializers, see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)), folded from the type table, never executed."
msgstr ""
"它是**编译期常量** —— 一个加载期表达式（可用于模块级 `let` 初始化式，参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)），从类型表折叠而来，从不执行。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:43
msgid ""
"There is no `size_of<T>()` / `align_of<T>()` and no runtime payload footprint accessor: value size and alignment are implementation details, not a language surface."
msgstr "没有 `size_of<T>()` / `align_of<T>()`，也没有运行期载荷占用访问器：值的大小与对齐是实现细节，不是语言接口面。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:46
msgid ""
"Constructing a value _from_ raw bytes is deliberately not provided: it could forge private fields and class invariants."
msgstr "刻意不提供从原始字节 _构造_ 值的能力：它可能伪造私有字段和类不变量。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:49
msgid "Value representation — slot arrays"
msgstr "值表示 —— 槽数组"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:51
msgid ""
"Every struct and class value lives in a heap **cell**: header + (vtable, when the type has impls) + the payload."
msgstr "每个结构体和类值生活在堆**单元**中：头部 +（vtable，当该类型有 impl 时）+ 载荷。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:54
msgid ""
"The payload is a **slot array: one untagged 8-byte slot per field, in declaration order**. Primitive fields are widened into their slot (sign/zero-extended; a float is stored at the canonical 64-bit width); composite fields are cell-handle slots."
msgstr ""
"载荷是**槽数组：每个字段一个不带标签的 8 字节槽，按声明顺序**。基本类型字段宽化进自己的槽（符号/零扩展；浮点以规范的 64 位宽度存储）；复合字段是单元句柄槽。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:58
msgid ""
"Visibility, generic parameters, and impl blocks add **nothing** — the payload depends only on the field list. Field access is by index; heap accounting charges `fields × 8` bytes."
msgstr "可见性、泛型参数和 impl 块不增加**任何东西** —— 载荷只取决于字段列表。字段访问按索引进行；堆记账记 `fields × 8` 字节。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:61
msgid ""
"Buffers of primitive elements (`Vec<f32>`, `[i32]`) stay **flat**, packed to the element's machine width; composite elements are one handle slot each — `Vec<Point>` stores one handle per element."
msgstr ""
"基本类型元素的缓冲（`Vec<f32>`、`[i32]`）保持**扁平**，按元素的机器宽度紧排；复合元素各占一个句柄槽 —— `Vec<Point>` 每个元素存储一个句柄。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:64
msgid ""
"Enums are tagged cells (a tag slot plus a payload slot); dataless enum variants are immortal singleton cells."
msgstr "枚举是带标签的单元（一个标签槽加一个载荷槽）；无数据的枚举变体是不朽的单例单元。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:66
msgid ""
"Nullable `?prim` element storage inside sequence backings is the raw payload plus a one-byte nil tag — no per-element cell."
msgstr "序列后备存储中的可空 `?prim` 元素存储是原始载荷加一个单字节 nil 标签 —— 没有逐元素单元。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:68
msgid ""
"`bytes` at the engine level is a `u8` array cell; a `str` is an immutable, COW-shared UTF-8 block, and a slice of it is a small view cell (see [String slicing and views](string-views.md))."
msgstr ""
"引擎层面的 `bytes` 是一个 `u8` 数组单元；`str` 是不可变、COW 共享的 UTF-8 块，它的切片是一个小视图单元（参见[字符串切片与视图](string-views.md)）。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:72
msgid "Cells and vtables"
msgstr "单元与 vtable"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:79
msgid ""
"The **exact runtime type** lives in the cell (via the vtable when present, the header otherwise). Every cell is minted at construction with its vtable already attached."
msgstr "**精确运行时类型**存放在单元中（有 vtable 时经由 vtable，否则经由头部）。每个单元在构造时铸造，vtable 已附上。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:82
msgid ""
"Trait method ids are assigned **globally per trait instantiation** at compile time (`Slice<Point>` ≠ `Slice<str>`); a type's vtable fills every slot of every trait instantiation it has an impl for — user impl blocks, auto-fills, and registry entries alike."
msgstr ""
"trait 方法 id 在编译期**按 trait 实例化全局分配**（`Slice<Point>` ≠ `Slice<str>`）；一个类型的 vtable 会填满它拥有 impl 的每个 trait 实例化的每个槽 —— 用户 impl 块、自动填充和注册表条目皆然。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:86
msgid ""
"Widening a composite to a trait `I` **reuses the same cell and vtable**: the trait-typed value is the handle plus the vtable pointer — no allocation, no copy. The vtable reserves no base-prefix room: there is no inheritance."
msgstr ""
"把复合值宽化为 trait `I` 会**复用同一个单元与 vtable**：trait 类型的值就是句柄加上 vtable 指针 —— 不分配，不复制。vtable 不保留基类前缀空间：没有继承。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:90
msgid ""
"A call through a trait object is two loads and an indirect jump (the receiver's vtable, the method slot). Trait members never devirtualize; inherent calls bind directly:"
msgstr "透过 trait 对象的调用是两次加载和一次间接跳转（接收者的 vtable，方法槽）。trait 成员永不去虚化；固有调用直接绑定："


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:94
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Op::CallTrait { recv, slot: 3, args }   // d.draw(g) — vtable slot 3\n"
"Op::Call     { func: \"Circle$area\", recv, args }   // c.area() — inherent\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Op::CallTrait { recv, slot: 3, args }   // d.draw(g) — vtable slot 3\n"
"Op::Call     { func: \"Circle$area\", recv, args }   // c.area() — inherent\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:99
msgid "The type test"
msgstr "类型测试"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:101
msgid ""
"`is` with a concrete right-hand side lowers to: load the object's exact type id, compare — a compile-time constant comparison when the static type already answers. The trait-RHS capability probe is: exact-type compare, then a flat scan of the descriptor's registered impls — no inheritance chain to walk (see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md))."
msgstr ""
"带具体右侧的 `is` 降格为：加载对象的精确类型 id，比较 —— 当静态类型已能回答时就是编译期常量比较。trait 右侧的能力探测是：先做精确类型比较，再对描述符上已注册的 impl 做一次平坦扫描 —— 没有继承链可走（参见[trait 与分派](traits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:108
msgid ""
"`opaque` interacts with exactly one of these reads: `is` reads the **box's** own type, so every payload probe misses; only `opaque.downcast<T>`'s match test keeps reading the payload — the one legitimate see-through."
msgstr ""
"`opaque` 与其中恰好一种读取交互：`is` 读取**盒**自身的类型，因此所有载荷探测都未命中；只有 `opaque.downcast<T>` 的匹配测试继续读取载荷 —— 这是唯一合法的看穿。"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:113
msgid "Boxing"
msgstr "装盒"


#: src/reference/reified-types.md:115
msgid ""
"Storing a value into an erasure box widens by the slot discipline: an integer box stores the 64-bit sign/zero-extended value, a float the 64-bit width. A kind check plus `opaque.downcast<i64>()` / `downcast<f64>()` / `downcast<bool>()` / `downcast<str>()` is therefore total in-branch: within the successful branch the value's type is the exact concrete type, and everything downstream optimizes as if the value had never been erased."
msgstr ""
"把值存入擦除盒按槽位纪律宽化：整数盒存储 64 位符号/零扩展后的值，浮点存储 64 位宽度。因此一次类别检查加上 `opaque.downcast<i64>()` / `downcast<f64>()` / `downcast<bool>()` / `downcast<str>()` 在分支内是完全的：在成功的分支内，值的类型就是精确的具体类型，下游一切都像该值从未被擦除一样优化。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:3
msgid ""
"`s.slice(from, to)` — the O(1) string window. A slice is a **view**: no octets move or copy; the new `str` cell retains the original and records a byte window. Slicing is safe because `str` is immutable — a view can never observe mutation, so no pointer spelling is needed."
msgstr ""
"`s.slice(from, to)` —— O(1) 的字符串窗口。切片是**视图**：没有任何字节移动或复制；新的 `str` 单元保留原始字符串并记录一个字节窗口。切片是安全的，因为 `str` 不可变 —— 视图永远观察不到修改，因此不需要任何指针写法。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:10
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let s = \"hello world\";\n"
"    let w = s.slice(6, 11);        // \"world\" — no copy\n"
"    log.info(w);\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let s = \"hello world\";\n"
"    let w = s.slice(6, 11);        // \"world\" — no copy\n"
"    log.info(w);\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:25
msgid ""
"`from`/`to` are **codepoint indices**, `from <= to <= s.len()`; bounds violations trap (same as an out-of-range index)."
msgstr "`from`/`to` 是**码点索引**，`from <= to <= s.len()`；越界陷阱（与超出范围的索引相同）。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:27
msgid ""
"The window is recorded internally in **byte offsets** — codepoint bounds are resolved once at slice time (a UTF-8 walk only when the string is non-ASCII)."
msgstr "窗口内部以**字节偏移**记录 —— 码点边界在切片时一次性解析（只有字符串非 ASCII 时才走一遍 UTF-8）。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:30
msgid ""
"The result is an ordinary `str`: it prints, compares by content (`==`), iterates (`for (c of w)`), renders in f-strings, and `len()` counts its own codepoints. **There is no separate view type on the surface** — a slice of a `str` _is_ a `str`."
msgstr ""
"结果是普通的 `str`：它可以打印、按内容比较（`==`）、迭代（`for (c of w)`）、在 f-string 中渲染，`len()` 统计它自己的码点。**接口面上没有单独的视图类型** —— `str` 的切片 _就是_ `str`。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:34
msgid ""
"Binding the slice shares it like every cell (see [By-reference and nullable](by-reference-and-nullable.md)); `str` has no clone — a materializing copy happens only where an operation needs one (the append fast path, the host crossing)."
msgstr ""
"绑定切片与其他单元一样共享（参见[按引用与可空](by-reference-and-nullable.md)）；`str` 没有 clone —— 只有当某个操作需要时才发生实体化复制（追加快速路径、宿主跨越）。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:39
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let accented = \"héllo!\";\n"
"    log.info(f\"{accented.len()} {accented.encode().len()} {accented.slice(1, 2)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let accented = \"héllo!\";\n"
"    log.info(f\"{accented.len()} {accented.encode().len()} {accented.slice(1, 2)}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:53
msgid "The view cell"
msgstr "视图单元"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:55
msgid ""
"A slice mints a small view cell: `{ parent, off, len, ascii }` — a **retained** handle to the owned parent string plus byte offsets into its block."
msgstr ""
"切片铸造一个小的视图单元：`{ parent, off, len, ascii }` —— 一个指向被拥有父字符串的**被保留**（retained）句柄，加上其块内的字节偏移。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:59
msgid ""
"The view charges only its own header (~32 bytes) against the heap budget; the parent's octets stay alive as long as any view does (deterministic destruction: view rc-0 → parent release)."
msgstr "视图只把自身的头部（约 32 字节）计入堆预算；只要还有任何视图存在，父字符串的字节就保持存活（确定性销毁：视图引用计数归零 → 释放父串）。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:62
msgid ""
"**View-of-view flattens**: slicing a view combines offsets onto the root, so the parent is always an owned string and reads never chain."
msgstr "**视图的视图会展平**：对视图切片会把偏移合并到根上，因此父串始终是被拥有的字符串，读取永不链式。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:64
msgid ""
"The ascii flag is inherited from the root at slice time (a window of an ASCII string is ASCII)."
msgstr "ascii 标志在切片时从根继承（ASCII 字符串的窗口仍是 ASCII）。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:67
msgid "Reads go through, writes never do"
msgstr "读取穿透，写入绝不"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:69
msgid ""
"Every string operation reads through views transparently: content equality, codepoint count, indexing, iteration, f-string rendering, `encode`, and the host boundary (which copies the window's bytes out)."
msgstr "每个字符串操作都透过视图透明地读取：内容相等、码点计数、索引、迭代、f-string 渲染、`encode`，以及宿主边界（把窗口的字节复制出去）。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:73
msgid ""
"The in-place append fast path (the `out = f\"{out}..\"` accumulator) is gated to **owned, uniquely-referenced** cells. Concatenating a view copies its bytes out — `f\"{view}!\"` yields a fresh owned string, and the view (and its parent) are unchanged. No operation can ever mutate through a string view. The accumulator is linear in the total output — core ships no string-builder class; a long-lived builder is the `strbuild` package's `StringBuilder` ([stdlib](stdlib.md))."
msgstr ""
"就地追加快速路径（`out = f\"{out}..\"` 累加器）只对**被拥有且唯一引用**的单元开放。拼接视图会复制出它的字节 —— `f\"{view}!\"` 产生一个全新的被拥有字符串，而视图（及其父串）不变。任何操作都绝不能透过字符串视图做出修改。累加器在总输出上量级为线性 —— core 不内置字符串构建类；长寿的构建器是 `strbuild` 包的 `StringBuilder`（[标准库](stdlib.md)）。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:81
msgid "Cost model"
msgstr "成本模型"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:83
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:83
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "成本"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:85
msgid "`s.slice(a, b)`"
msgstr "`s.slice(a, b)`"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:85
msgid "O(1) — one small cell + one retain (UTF-8 walk only for non-ASCII bounds)"
msgstr "O(1) —— 一个小单元 + 一次保留（仅非 ASCII 边界需要 UTF-8 遍历）"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:86
msgid "read/compare/render a view"
msgstr "读取/比较/渲染视图"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:86
msgid "O(window) — same as any str"
msgstr "O(window) —— 与任何 str 相同"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:87
msgid "concat out / the host crossing"
msgstr "就地拼接 / 宿主跨越"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:87
msgid "O(window) — the materializing copy"
msgstr "O(window) —— 实体化复制"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:88
msgid "parsing a 1 KiB line out of a 1 MiB buffer"
msgstr "从 1 MiB 缓冲中解析出 1 KiB 的行"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:88
msgid "one 32-byte cell, zero copies"
msgstr "一个 32 字节单元，零复制"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:90
msgid ""
"Digest-style workloads (splitting, tokenizing, windowing) stop copying entirely; peak heap reports the buffer once instead of per-piece."
msgstr "摘要类工作负载（拆分、词法切分、开窗）完全停止复制；峰值堆只报告缓冲区一次，而不是每个片段各报一次。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:93
msgid "`[T]` windows"
msgstr "`[T]` 窗口"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:95
msgid ""
"`v.slice(from, to)` on a `Vec<T>` (and on `[T]`) mints a fixed-length window over the backing array, boxed as **`?Vec<T>`** (the `T → ?T` coercion — see [Builtin generic types](builtin-generic-types.md)). The window **is** the shared cell:"
msgstr ""
"在 `Vec<T>`（以及 `[T]`）上的 `v.slice(from, to)` 会在后备数组上铸造一个定长窗口，装盒为 **`?Vec<T>`**（`T → ?T` 强制转换 —— 参见[内置泛型类型](builtin-generic-types.md)）。窗口**就是**共享单元："


#: src/reference/string-views.md:100
msgid ""
"reads: `w[i]`, `w.len()`, `for (x of w)` — auto-deref the nullable and go through the window (element `i` is `parent[off + i]`, bounds are the window's);"
msgstr ""
"读取：`w[i]`、`w.len()`、`for (x of w)` —— 自动解引用可空并透过窗口进行（元素 `i` 是 `parent[off + i]`，边界是窗口的）；"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:103
msgid "writes: `w[i] = x` (and compound assignment) **hit the parent**;"
msgstr "写入：`w[i] = x`（以及复合赋值）**命中父序列**；"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:104
msgid ""
"**fixed-length**: `push`/`pop` through a view trap — copy the elements out to grow (a `for`\\-push loop does it);"
msgstr "**定长**：透过视图的 `push`/`pop` 会陷阱 —— 把元素复制出来再增长（一个 `for`\\-push 循环即可做到）；"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:106
msgid "reslicing flattens onto the root backing (`w.slice(a, b)`);"
msgstr "重新切片会展平到根后备（`w.slice(a, b)`）；"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:107
msgid ""
"parent growth **detaches**: `push` re-backs the `Vec` with a fresh array; the window keeps pinning the old backing — the same aliasing rule Go slices have;"
msgstr "父序列增长会**分离**：`push` 用新数组为 `Vec` 重新提供后备；窗口继续钉住旧后备 —— 与 Go 切片相同的别名规则；"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:110
msgid ""
"iteration yields the stored elements as-is under the sharing law: a cell element shares its cell, so a write through the loop variable hits the parent; primitive elements copy out as slots always do."
msgstr "迭代在共享法则下原样产出存储的元素：单元元素共享其单元，因此透过循环变量写入会命中父序列；基本类型元素照常按槽复制出来。"


#: src/reference/string-views.md:114
msgid ""
"The asymmetry is deliberate: `str`/`bytes` are immutable, so their views carry no mutability law — purely an optimization plus a nicer parsing surface. Array windows change what writes mean, which is why they surface as an explicit `?Vec<T>` value while the string view is invisible."
msgstr ""
"这种不对称是有意的：`str`/`bytes` 不可变，因此它们的视图不携带可变性法则 —— 纯粹是一项优化加上更好的解析接口面。数组窗口会改变写入的含义，这正是它们以显式的 `?Vec<T>` 值出现、而字符串视图不可见的原因。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:3
msgid ""
"`type X = A;` — the transparent alias. `type X = A | B;` — the bound-only union. `fn f<T requires A | B>(..)` — the inline admission-only bound. All three are compile-time gates: no IR, no runtime representation."
msgstr ""
"`type X = A;` —— 透明别名。`type X = A | B;` —— 仅约束的联合。`fn f<T requires A | B>(..)` —— 内联的仅准入约束。三者都是编译期门槛：没有 IR，没有运行时表示。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:8
msgid "Type aliases"
msgstr "类型别名"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:14
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"type Meters = i64;\n"
"type Km = Meters;             // chains expand: Km is Meters is i64\n"
"type Row = [i32];\n"
"\n"
"let trip: Km = 1500;          // Km is Meters is i64 — all one type\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let plain: Meters = trip;     // no conversion: the alias IS the target\n"
"    log.info(f\"{trip} {plain}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"type Meters = i64;\n"
"type Km = Meters;             // chains expand: Km is Meters is i64\n"
"type Row = [i32];\n"
"\n"
"let trip: Km = 1500;          // Km is Meters is i64 — all one type\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let plain: Meters = trip;     // no conversion: the alias IS the target\n"
"    log.info(f\"{trip} {plain}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:34
msgid ""
"**Transparency by construction**: `X` resolves to the target's type identity everywhere — params, fields, returns, lets, bounds. A value of the alias and a value of the target are the same type; there is no conversion and no wrapper."
msgstr ""
"**构造上即透明**：`X` 在所有地方都解析为目标类型的同一性 —— 参数、字段、返回值、let、约束。别名的值与目标的值是同一个类型；没有转换，也没有包装。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:38
msgid ""
"Chains expand through resolution; `type A = B; type B = A;` is a \"recursive type alias\" error. Forward references are legal."
msgstr "链在解析中展开；`type A = B; type B = A;` 是“递归类型别名”错误。前向引用合法。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:40
msgid ""
"The alias **target validates at declaration**: `type Foo = NotAType;` is an error whether or not `Foo` is used."
msgstr "别名**目标在声明时校验**：`type Foo = NotAType;` 是错误，无论 `Foo` 是否被使用。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:42
msgid ""
"**Non-generic**: the head admits no members. `type Vec2<T> = Vec<T>;` is not expressible — a generic alias would be a type constructor, not a transparent name."
msgstr "**非泛型**：头部不接受成员。`type Vec2<T> = Vec<T>;` 无法表达 —— 泛型别名会是类型构造器，而不是透明名称。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:45
msgid ""
"**One name = one type**: an alias may not share its name with an alias, enum, struct, class, or trait in the same module — the duplicate-name check is symmetric and fires in both orders."
msgstr "**一个名字 = 一个类型**：别名不得与同一模块中的别名、枚举、结构体、类或 trait 共享名称 —— 重名检查是对称的，两种顺序都会触发。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:48
msgid ""
"Visibility: `pub`, `pub(mod)`, `pub(super)`, `pub(self)` all parse on `type` (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)). Like every name, the alias is usable in a consumer only when the consumer's `use` names it."
msgstr ""
"可见性：`pub`、`pub(mod)`、`pub(super)`、`pub(self)` 都能用在 `type` 上（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）。与每个名称一样，只有当使用方的 `use` 指名它时，别名才能被使用方使用。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:53
msgid "Union aliases — bound-only"
msgstr "联合别名 —— 仅约束"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:55
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"unionalias := typealias   // with Type spelled `A | B`\n"
"bound      := Type ('|' Type)*\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"unionalias := typealias   // with Type spelled `A | B`\n"
"bound      := Type ('|' Type)*\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:60
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"type Num = i32 | str;    // legal — here and in requires bounds ONLY\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"type Num = i32 | str;    // legal — here and in requires bounds ONLY\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:64
msgid ""
"The union exists only in the type **grammar**; the compiler never interns a union runtime kind. There is no runtime union value, no subtyping, and no `is`/`when` support over unions (heterogeneous data goes through traits — see [Traits and dispatch](traits.md) — or enums, see [Enums](enums.md))."
msgstr ""
"联合只存在于类型**文法**中；编译器从不登记联合运行时类别。没有运行时联合值，没有子类型化，联合上也没有 `is`/`when` 支持（异构数据走 trait —— 参见[trait 与分派](traits.md) —— 或枚举，参见[枚举](enums.md)）。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:69
msgid ""
"**Value positions reject unions**: a union (or a union-alias name) in a param/field/return/let/`is` position is diagnosed as _bound-only_."
msgstr "**值位置拒绝联合**：参数/字段/返回/let/`is` 位置中的联合（或联合别名名称）会被诊断为 _仅约束_。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:71
msgid ""
"`|` continues a completed type as a union only where unions are legal — the alias target and `requires` bounds — so `x as u32 | y` keeps spelling the binary operator."
msgstr ""
"`|` 只在联合合法的场合把已完成的类型延续成联合 —— 别名目标和 `requires` 约束 —— 因此 `x as u32 | y` 仍按二元运算符解析。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:74
msgid ""
"Union aliases are **module-local**: never exported; a cross-module use fails as an unknown type."
msgstr "联合别名是**模块局部**的：绝不导出；跨模块使用会作为未知类型失败。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:77
msgid "Inline `requires` — the admission-only bound"
msgstr "内联 `requires` —— 仅准入的约束"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:83
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"trait Labeled { fn label(self) -> str; }\n"
"struct Ridge { depth: i32; }\n"
"struct Trench { depth: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"impl Labeled for Ridge { fn label(self) -> str { return \"ridge\"; } }\n"
"\n"
"fn name<T requires Labeled>(x: T) -> str {\n"
"    let w: Labeled = x;      // the widening compiles BECAUSE the bound holds\n"
"    return w.label();\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn kind<T requires Ridge | Trench>(x: T) -> str { return \"geo\"; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{name(Ridge { depth: 3 })} {kind(Trench { depth: 1 })}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"trait Labeled { fn label(self) -> str; }\n"
"struct Ridge { depth: i32; }\n"
"struct Trench { depth: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"impl Labeled for Ridge { fn label(self) -> str { return \"ridge\"; } }\n"
"\n"
"fn name<T requires Labeled>(x: T) -> str {\n"
"    let w: Labeled = x;      // the widening compiles BECAUSE the bound holds\n"
"    return w.label();\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn kind<T requires Ridge | Trench>(x: T) -> str { return \"geo\"; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"{name(Ridge { depth: 3 })} {kind(Trench { depth: 1 })}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:109
msgid ""
"Members may be concrete type names (satisfied by exact type identity at instantiation), aliases (expanded before detection), or a **type union** of those. **Type names only in a union**: a trait member inside a union spelling parses but diagnoses at admission — a trait bound must stand alone."
msgstr ""
"成员可以是具体类型名（在实例化时按精确类型同一性满足）、别名（在检测前展开），或它们的**类型联合**。**联合中只能是类型名**：联合写法内部的 trait 成员可以解析，但在准入时诊断报错 —— trait 约束必须独立成立。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:114
msgid ""
"**Enforcement at every substitution-completing site**: free-fn calls, direct and instance method instantiation, and impl-method enqueue. A failing instantiation diagnoses with the bound spelled out: \"`bool` does not satisfy `T` requires `i32 | str` — no matching type or impl is registered\"."
msgstr ""
"**在每个完成替换的位置强制**：自由函数调用、直接与实例方法实例化、impl 方法入队。失败的实例化带着写明的约束诊断：\"`bool` does not satisfy `T` requires `i32 | str` — no matching type or impl is registered\"。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:119
msgid ""
"**Trait objects satisfy nothing**: instantiating `T` at a trait type fails any bound — only a concrete type with a registered impl admits."
msgstr "**trait 对象不满足任何约束**：在 trait 类型上实例化 `T` 无法通过任何约束 —— 只有带已注册 impl 的具体类型才获准入。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:121
msgid ""
"**Bounds may reference the item's other generics**: `fn hold<T, U requires [T]>(x: U)` — members resolve under the call-site substitution."
msgstr "**约束可以引用条目的其他泛型**：`fn hold<T, U requires [T]>(x: U)` —— 成员在调用点替换之下解析。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:124
msgid ""
"**Admission-only — except the union's whole-bound contract.** A non-union bound grants NO method calls on bare `T`; what it proves is the widening into a bound-member-typed slot. A **union bound** carries the whole-bound method contract: a method call on a union-bounded value is checked against the WHOLE bound — every member must provide the method through its own impls — even when the offending member is never instantiated. Dispatch is untouched: each instantiation still binds the concrete member's own impl."
msgstr ""
"**仅准入 —— 联合的整体约束契约除外。** 非联合约束不授予对裸 `T` 的任何方法调用；它证明的是宽化为约束成员类型的槽。**联合约束**携带整体约束的方法契约：对联合约束值的方法调用对照**整个**约束检查 —— 每个成员都必须通过自己的 impl 提供该方法 —— 即使违规成员永远不会被实例化。分派不受影响：每个实例化仍绑定具体成员自己的 impl。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:132
msgid ""
"**Provenance** — a value is known to carry a union-bounded type when it is: a generic parameter, a `let` whose annotation spells the generic, a copy of either, or a direct `self.f` field whose declared type spells the generic. Provenance rides inlining and is cleared when the name rebinds. Documented holes (the gate under-fires, never over-fires): closure bodies compile with fresh provenance; destructuring carries none; a shadowing rebind resets it."
msgstr ""
"**来源（provenance）** —— 当一个值满足下列条件之一时，它被认定携带联合约束类型：它是一个泛型参数；它是一个注解写明该泛型的 `let`；它是以上两者的副本；或者它是一个声明类型写明该泛型的直接 `self.f` 字段。来源随内联传播，并在名称重新绑定时清除。已记录的空洞（门槛只会少报，绝不会多报）：闭包体以全新来源编译；解构不携带来源；遮蔽性重绑定会重置它。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:139
msgid ""
"**`where` is removed.** The trailing clause is gone; `where` is an ordinary identifier, and a stray clause diagnoses with the inline replacement: `fn f<T requires B>(..)`."
msgstr ""
"**`where` 已移除。** 尾随子句没有了；`where` 是普通标识符，游离的子句以内联替代方案诊断：`fn f<T requires B>(..)`。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:142
msgid "**Class generics take bounds; struct/trait/surface generics do not**:"
msgstr "**类泛型可以带约束；struct/trait/接口面泛型不能**："


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:148
msgid ""
"The bound records on the class descriptor and admits every instantiation: a key type outside the set fails **at the instantiation site** (see [Builtin generic types](builtin-generic-types.md)). Inside the class's method bodies the union contract applies through the class's own `requires`."
msgstr ""
"约束记录在类描述符上并准入每个实例化：集合之外的键类型**在实例化点**失败（参见[内置泛型类型](builtin-generic-types.md)）。在类的方法体内，联合契约通过类自己的 `requires` 适用。"


#: src/reference/type-aliases.md:155
msgid ""
"See also [Functions, closures, and generics](functions-closures-generics.md) for the bound grammar in context."
msgstr "另见[函数、闭包与泛型](functions-closures-generics.md)了解上下文中的约束文法。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:3
msgid ""
"The sharing regime, the nullable `?T`, identity `==`, and the one copy escape hatch. These laws landed together and they are not optional: every other page assumes them."
msgstr "共享体制、可空 `?T`、同一性 `==`，以及唯一的复制逃生口。这些法则是一起落地的，而且不可选择：其他每一页都建立在它们之上。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:7
msgid "The sharing regime"
msgstr "共享体制"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:9
msgid ""
"**Primitives and `fn` values copy** (immediate slots): `u8..u64`, `i8..i64`, `f32`/`f64`, `bool`, and closures' function values."
msgstr "**基本类型与 `fn` 值复制**（立即数槽）：`u8..u64`、`i8..i64`、`f32`/`f64`、`bool`，以及闭包的函数值。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:11
msgid ""
"**Every cell type shares its cell**: `str`, `bytes`, struct/class records, `[T]` arrays, enums, trait objects, `opaque` boxes, closures' captured cells, and `?T` boxes."
msgstr ""
"**每个单元类型共享其单元**：`str`、`bytes`、struct/class 记录、`[T]` 数组、枚举、trait 对象、`opaque` 盒、闭包捕获的单元，以及 `?T` 盒。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:14
msgid ""
"`let b = a` — any cell type — is an O(1) handle move (retain new, release old). Mutation through any alias is visible through all of them."
msgstr ""
"`let b = a` —— 任意单元类型 —— 是一次 O(1) 句柄移动（retain 新的，release 旧的）。透过任何别名做出的修改透过所有别名可见。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:18
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let mut p = Point { x: 1, y: 2 };\n"
"    let q = p;              // SHARE: one cell, two names — no copy\n"
"    p.x = 4;                // q.x is 4 now\n"
"    log.info(f\"{q.x}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Point { x: i32; y: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let mut p = Point { x: 1, y: 2 };\n"
"    let q = p;              // SHARE: one cell, two names — no copy\n"
"    p.x = 4;                // q.x is 4 now\n"
"    log.info(f\"{q.x}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:36
msgid ""
"Writing is gated by the **`mut`\\-binding law**, never by the sharing: a `let` binding is a read-only view; `let mut` grants write access to the object it holds (see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)). Parameters declare the same intent: `fn step(mut p: Point)` writes the caller's point; `fn area(p: Point)` promises not to."
msgstr ""
"写入由 **`mut`\\- 绑定法则**把关，而不是由共享把关：`let` 绑定是只读视图；`let mut` 授予对其所持有对象的写访问权（参见[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）。参数声明同样的意图：`fn step(mut p: Point)` 写入调用方的点；`fn area(p: Point)` 承诺不这样做。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:42
msgid ""
"A `T` stored into a `?T` slot boxes once — the box **aliases** the payload's cell (a share); primitives and `nil` copy the bits. There is no deref-on-load/box-on-store special case anywhere."
msgstr ""
"存入 `?T` 槽的 `T` 装一次盒 —— 盒**别名**载荷的单元（共享）；基本类型与 `nil` 复制位。任何地方都没有加载时解引用/存储时装盒的特例。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:45
msgid ""
"Primitive elements in a `[T]` stay flat slots; composite elements are handle slots. `for (let x of xs)` yields the **shared** element, not a per-element copy — a cell element writes through to the sequence."
msgstr ""
"`[T]` 中的基本类型元素保持扁平槽；复合元素是句柄槽。`for (let x of xs)` 产出**共享的**元素，而不是逐元素复制 —— 单元元素的写入直接穿透到序列。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:48
msgid ""
"The repeat `[v; n]` retains the handle `n` times: every slot aliases the one cell. The repeat never copies."
msgstr "重复形式 `[v; n]` 把句柄保留 `n` 次：每个槽都是同一单元的别名。重复绝不复制。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:51
msgid ""
"Copy-by-value is unobservable except through the two legal effects: **aliasing** (writes visible through every binding) and `==` (below)."
msgstr "按值复制是不可观测的，除非透过两个合法效应：**别名**（写入透过每个绑定可见）与 `==`（见下）。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:54
msgid "`?T` — the nullable type"
msgstr "`?T` —— 可空类型"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:56
msgid ""
"`?T` is a nil-able cell — a one-slot box. `nil` is the null literal; dereferencing it traps `NilDeref` — never a silent read."
msgstr "`?T` 是可为 nil 的单元 —— 一个单槽盒。`nil` 是空字面量；对它解引用触发 `NilDeref` 陷阱 —— 绝不是无声读取。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:59
msgid "Grammar — prefix only, binds tightest"
msgstr "文法 —— 仅为前缀，结合最紧"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:66
msgid "the same runtime box, unwrapped transitively"
msgstr "同一个运行时盒，传递性地逐层解包"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:68
msgid ""
"There is no postfix `T?` and no `*T` — each is a diagnosed error naming `?T`. In expression position, `*x`/`&x` diagnose: \"bindings share by reference now — pass `x` directly\" (binary `*`/`&` operators are untouched)."
msgstr ""
"没有后缀 `T?`，也没有 `*T` —— 每个都是指名 `?T` 的诊断错误。在表达式位置，`*x`/`&x` 会诊断：\"bindings share by reference now — pass `x` directly\"（二元 `*`/`&` 运算符不受影响）。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:73
msgid "Coercions and uses"
msgstr "强制转换与用法"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:75
msgid ""
"**`T → ?T` boxes; `?T → T` derefs** — both implicit at the expected-type position, transitive through `??T`:"
msgstr "**`T → ?T` 装盒；`?T → T` 解引用** —— 两者在期望类型位置都是隐式的，经过 `??T` 传递："


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:80
msgid ""
"`p == nil` / `p != nil` compare against the null slot; guard before use. The trap is the bug-catcher, not the semantics."
msgstr "`p == nil` / `p != nil` 与空槽比较；使用前先守护。陷阱是抓 bug 的工具，不是语义。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:82
msgid ""
"A `?T` binding IS the cell reference: writes through it hit the shared cell (a `nudge(mut pt: ?Point)` moves the caller's point)."
msgstr "`?T` 绑定本身就是单元引用：透过它写入命中共享单元（`nudge(mut pt: ?Point)` 会移动调用方的点）。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:84
msgid ""
"`nil` typing: a context-free `nil` has type `nil`; in an expected-`?T` position it types as that `?T` — so `let p: ?Node = nil` and a `left: nil` field in a literal just work. Absence reads plainly: a lookup returns `?V`, and `nil` means \"not found\"."
msgstr ""
"`nil` 的类型：无上下文的 `nil` 类型为 `nil`；在期望 `?T` 的位置它被定为该 `?T` —— 因此 `let p: ?Node = nil` 与字面量中的 `left: nil` 字段直接可用。缺失读起来直白：查找返回 `?V`，`nil` 表示“未找到”。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:89
msgid ""
"When the cell's refcount reaches zero, the engine runs the type's `Disposal` impl — the cell-death hook (see [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md))."
msgstr ""
"单元引用计数归零时，引擎运行该类型的 `Disposal` impl——单元死亡的钩子（参见[Rc、dispose 与同一性](rc-dispose-identity.md)）。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:92
msgid ""
"Across the host boundary `?T` crosses nil-flattened when its element crosses — an `entry fn -> (?T, err)` is a first-class host answer."
msgstr ""
"跨越宿主边界时，`?T` 的跨越方式是 nil 展平：元素跨越的同时它随之展平 —— `entry fn -> (?T, err)` 是一等公民的宿主应答。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:95
msgid "`==` — identity for cells, content for text"
msgstr "`==` —— 单元用同一性，文本用内容"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:99
msgid "IEEE 754 for floats (`NaN != NaN`, `-0.0 == 0.0`)"
msgstr "浮点遵循 IEEE 754（`NaN != NaN`、`-0.0 == 0.0`）"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:102
msgid ""
"everything else — records, arrays, enums, closures, trait objects, `opaque`, `?T`"
msgstr "其余一切 —— 记录、数组、枚举、闭包、trait 对象、`opaque`、`?T`"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:104
msgid ""
"`[1, 2] == [1, 2]` is **false** — two cells. Identity is O(1) with no deep walk; compare content where content is the contract (a loop, or a hash/eq trait contract for keys). `?T == ?T` is slot identity: two `nil`s are equal, a null and a box are not. See [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md) for the full law and the lint on obviously-fresh composites."
msgstr ""
"`[1, 2] == [1, 2]` 是 **false** —— 两个单元。同一性是 O(1) 的，没有深度遍历；在内容即契约的场合比较内容（循环，或用于键的 hash/eq trait 契约）。`?T == ?T` 是槽位同一性：两个 `nil` 相等，空槽与盒不相等。完整法则与针对明显崭新复合值的 lint 见[Rc、dispose 与同一性](rc-dispose-identity.md)。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:111
#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:121
msgid "`bytes.clone()` — the one copy escape hatch"
msgstr "`bytes.clone()` —— 唯一的复制逃生口"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:113
msgid ""
"`b.clone() -> bytes` mints a fresh buffer with `b`'s octets — a one-shot deep copy, the **only copy syntax in the language**. `bytes.from(a)` also deep-copies. There is no generic `clone(x)` and no `own`: every other type shares on binding, and a divergent value of any other type is unreachable — build a new one instead."
msgstr ""
"`b.clone() -> bytes` 铸造一个带 `b` 字节的新缓冲 —— 一次性深复制，是**这门语言唯一的复制语法**。`bytes.from(a)` 同样深复制。没有泛型 `clone(x)`，也没有 `own`：其他每个类型在绑定时都共享，任何其他类型的分歧值都不可达 —— 需要不同值就新建一个。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:119
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let header = bytes.from([1, 2, 3]);\n"
"    let alias = header;              // shares: one buffer, two names\n"
"    let diverged = header.clone();   // a fresh buffer, same octets\n"
"    log.info(f\"{alias == header} {diverged == header}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let header = bytes.from([1, 2, 3]);\n"
"    let alias = header;              // shares: one buffer, two names\n"
"    let diverged = header.clone();   // a fresh buffer, same octets\n"
"    log.info(f\"{alias == header} {diverged == header}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:135
msgid "Removed spellings"
msgstr "已移除的写法"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:137
msgid "Removed"
msgstr "已移除"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:137
msgid "Replacement"
msgstr "替代"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:139
msgid "`own(x)`"
msgstr "`own(x)`"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:139
msgid "bindings share by reference; `bytes.clone()` is the one copy"
msgstr "绑定按引用共享；`bytes.clone()` 是唯一的复制"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:140
msgid "`make_ptr(v)` / `*T` / `T?`"
msgstr "`make_ptr(v)` / `*T` / `T?`"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:140
msgid "write `?T`: a `T` widens into `?T` on assignment, `nil` is the null"
msgstr "写 `?T`：`T` 在赋值时宽化为 `?T`，`nil` 即空值"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:141
msgid "`*x` / `&x` in expressions"
msgstr "`*x` / `&x` in expressions"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:141
msgid "pass `x` directly — sharing needs no spelling"
msgstr "直接传 `x` —— 共享无需写法"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:142 src/reference/stdlib.md:113
msgid "`Option<T>` / `Result<T, E>`"
msgstr "`Option<T>` / `Result<T, E>`"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:142
msgid "absence is `nil` on a `?T`; errors are the `(?T, err)` pair"
msgstr "缺失是 `?T` 上的 `nil`；错误是 `(?T, err)` 二元组"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:144
msgid "Containers under sharing"
msgstr "共享之下的容器"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:146
msgid ""
"`Vec<T>` backs on `buf: [?T]` — `[nil; cap]` is the generic zero (`nil` is the slot's zero); `push` takes the `T → ?T`\\-boxed handle; loads yield the `?T` (uses auto-deref). See [Builtin generic types](builtin-generic-types.md)."
msgstr ""
"`Vec<T>` 以 `buf: [?T]` 为后备 —— `[nil; cap]` 是泛型零值（`nil` 就是槽的零）；`push` 接受 `T → ?T`\\- 装盒后的句柄；加载产出 `?T`（使用自动解引用）。参见[内置泛型类型](builtin-generic-types.md)。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:150
msgid ""
"Keyed collections: `get(k) -> ?V` — `nil` = absent, a hit answers the **stored cell** (the aliasing law: two gets of one key name one cell until a replace re-stores)."
msgstr ""
"键控集合：`get(k) -> ?V` —— `nil` = 不存在，命中应答**存储的单元**（别名法则：对同一个键的两次 get 命名同一个单元，直到某次 replace 重新存储）。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:153
msgid ""
"Array windows (`v.slice(a, b) -> ?Vec<T>`) are the shared cell: writes through the window hit the parent (see [String slicing and views](string-views.md))."
msgstr ""
"数组窗口（`v.slice(a, b) -> ?Vec<T>`）就是共享单元：透过窗口写入命中父序列（参见[字符串切片与视图](string-views.md)）。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:156
msgid ""
"Erasure rides the same laws: `opaque(v)` aliases the payload's cell, and `opaque.downcast<T>(o)`'s match is the box's own inner cell (see [opaque — erasure and downcast](opaque.md))."
msgstr ""
"擦除遵循同样的法则：`opaque(v)` 别名载荷的单元，`opaque.downcast<T>(o)` 的匹配就是盒自己的内层单元（参见[opaque —— 擦除与向下转型](opaque.md)）。"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:160
msgid "The answer channel"
msgstr "应答通道"


#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:162
msgid ""
"**`(?T, err)` — concretely `(value, ok)` / `(T, str)` — is THE answer channel.** The convention is law: empty err + a value = success; empty err + `nil` = \"not found\"; non-empty err = \"failed\". The err channel disambiguates a legitimately-absent value from a failure. The exactly-one-non-nil invariant is the caller's convention — the engine types the components and decodes them; it does not police the combination. A return-position destructure (`let (v, ok) = f();`) is optimized so the pair mints no cell where it is used as a pair."
msgstr ""
"**`(?T, err)` —— 具体为 `(value, ok)` / `(T, str)` —— 唯一的应答通道。**这一约定就是法则：空 err + 一个值 = 成功；空 err + `nil` = “未找到”；非空 err = “失败”。err 通道把合理缺失的值与失败区分开。恰好一个非 nil 的不变量是调用方的约定 —— 引擎给组件定类型并解码它们；它不监督组合。返回位置的解构（`let (v, ok) = f();`）经过优化，当二元组仅作为二元组使用时不铸造单元。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:3
msgid ""
"rut's heap is **reference-counted**. When an object's strong count reaches zero it is destroyed **immediately**, at a deterministic point in the program. There is no collector: strong cycles leak by design — [weak references](weak-refs.md) are the answer. Every VM owns one heap on one thread and nothing is shared between isolates ([workers and channels](workers-and-channels.md)), so the counters are plain cells with no atomics and no locks."
msgstr ""
"rut 的堆是**引用计数**的。当对象的强计数归零时，它**立即**被销毁，发生在程序中一个确定的点。没有收集器：强循环按设计会泄漏 —— [弱引用](weak-refs.md)是答案。每个 VM 在一个线程上拥有一个堆，隔离单元之间不共享任何东西（[worker 与通道](workers-and-channels.md)），因此计数器就是普通单元，没有原子操作，也没有锁。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:11
msgid "The cell model"
msgstr "单元模型"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:13
msgid "Everything except primitives and `fn` values is a heap cell:"
msgstr "除基本类型与 `fn` 值之外，一切都是堆单元："


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:15
msgid "Inline (moved by plain copy)"
msgstr "内联（按普通复制移动）"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:15
msgid "Heap cells (refcounted handles)"
msgstr "堆单元（引用计数的句柄）"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:17
msgid "`u8..u64`, `i8..i64`, `u`/`isize`, `f32`, `f64`, `bool`, `nil`"
msgstr "`u8..u64`, `i8..i64`, `u`/`isize`, `f32`, `f64`, `bool`, `nil`"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:17
msgid ""
"`str`, `bytes`, `Vec<T>`, `[T]`, enums, structs, classes, trait objects, `opaque` boxes, host boxes, `?T` boxes, coroutine frames"
msgstr ""
"`str`, `bytes`, `Vec<T>`, `[T]`, enums, structs, classes, trait objects, `opaque` boxes, host boxes, `?T` boxes, coroutine frames"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:19
msgid ""
"Assignment, argument passing, and returning copy the **handle** (retain), never the bytes. Mutation through one alias is visible through every alias — reference semantics is the one default regime; there is no eager copy anywhere. `bytes.clone()` is the **only** copy escape hatch."
msgstr ""
"赋值、传参和返回复制的是**句柄**（retain），绝不是字节。透过一个别名做出的修改透过每个别名可见 —— 引用语义是唯一的默认体制；任何地方都没有急切复制。`bytes.clone()` 是**唯一的**复制逃生口。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:24
msgid ""
"There is no borrow syntax and no lifetimes: a handle simply keeps its referent alive, so nothing dangles. Uniqueness matters only when transferring buffers across isolates, where it is detected at runtime (`rc == 1`) — never proven statically."
msgstr ""
"没有借用语法，也没有生命周期：句柄只是让它的被引用对象保持存活，所以没有任何东西悬垂。唯一性只在跨隔离单元转移缓冲时才重要，在那里它在运行时被检测（`rc == 1`）—— 绝不静态证明。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:29
msgid "Refcounting rules"
msgstr "引用计数规则"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:31
msgid ""
"The compiler knows the static type of every register, so ref-aware ops are emitted only where a reference can flow:"
msgstr "编译器知道每个寄存器的静态类型，因此只在引用可能流动的地方发出引用感知的操作："


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:34
msgid "Primitives and `fn` values move with a plain move — no counting."
msgstr "基本类型与 `fn` 值以普通移动方式移动 —— 不计数。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:35
msgid ""
"References move with a ref move — retain the new, release the old; both steps are exact."
msgstr "引用以引用移动方式移动 —— retain 新的，release 旧的；两步都是精确的。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:37
msgid ""
"Function boundaries pass references in registers; call/return sequences emit the paired inc/dec. A loop over a `Vec<f64>` does no per-element counting."
msgstr "函数边界在寄存器中传递引用；call/return 序列发出成对的 inc/dec。对 `Vec<f64>` 的循环不做逐元素计数。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:40
msgid ""
"**Overflow**: an increment past `u32::MAX` _immortalizes_ the object — the count is pinned to the `0` sentinel (the same value interned literals use) — a deliberate, logged leak instead of unsoundness."
msgstr ""
"**溢出**：超过 `u32::MAX` 的递增会 _不朽化_ 该对象 —— 计数被钉在 `0` 哨兵值上（与驻留字面量使用的值相同）—— 这是刻意的、有日志的泄漏，而不是不健全。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:43
msgid ""
"Debug builds assert the full counter discipline: retain/release pairing, no underflow, no double destruction."
msgstr "Debug 构建断言完整的计数器纪律：retain/release 配对，无下溢，无双重销毁。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:46
msgid "Destruction — `Disposal`"
msgstr "销毁——`Disposal`"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:48
msgid ""
"A type opts into destructor code by implementing the core trait `Disposal` (see [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md) for the trait surface):"
msgstr ""
"类型通过实现核心 trait `Disposal` 来获得析构代码（trait 表面见[Rc、dispose 与同一性](rc-dispose-identity.md)）："


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:52
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Audit { log: Logger; n: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"impl Disposal for Audit {\n"
"    fn dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext) {\n"
"        self.log.info(f\"released {self.n} octets\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn work() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"work\");\n"
"    let buf = Audit { log: log, n: 4 };\n"
"    log.info(\"working — 4 octets in flight\");\n"
"}   // buf's count reaches zero here\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    work();   // the boundary drains: dispose runs after main's body\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Audit { log: Logger; n: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"impl Disposal for Audit {\n"
"    fn dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext) {\n"
"        self.log.info(f\"released {self.n} octets\");\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn work() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"work\");\n"
"    let buf = Audit { log: log, n: 4 };\n"
"    log.info(\"working — 4 octets in flight\");\n"
"}   // buf's count reaches zero here\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    work();   // the boundary drains: dispose runs after main's body\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:80 src/reference/tasks.md:27
#: src/reference/reflection.md:97
msgid "Laws:"
msgstr "法则："


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:82
msgid ""
"The engine calls `dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext)` exactly once per cell death — when the strong count reaches zero. Types without a `Disposal` impl release straight to the field walk."
msgstr ""
"引擎在每个单元死亡时恰好调用一次 `dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext)`——在强计数归零时。没有 `Disposal` impl 的类型直接进入字段释放。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:85
msgid ""
"The call runs **at a call boundary**, not re-entrantly inside the release: death pins the cell and queues it, and the interpreter drains the queue at its call boundaries — the root call's end for sync code, each drive for the async weave — passing the pinned cell as `self` with a freshly minted `cx`."
msgstr ""
"调用**在调用边界**运行，不在释放内部重入：死亡把单元钉住并排入队列，解释器在它的调用边界排空队列——同步代码是根调用的结束，异步编织是每次驱动——把钉住的单元作为 `self` 传入，并配一个新铸造的 `cx`。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:90
msgid ""
"A dispose body may itself release references (a field walk that kills a child whose own `dispose` is next): the drain loops until the queue stays empty."
msgstr ""
"dispose 函数体自身可以释放引用（一次字段释放可能杀死一个子对象，而它自己的 `dispose` 排在下一个）：排空会不断循环，直到队列保持为空。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:93
msgid ""
"The context `cx` is engine-minted and empty today; it grows additively, never by touching the trait signature."
msgstr "上下文 `cx` 是引擎铸造的，今天还是空的；它以增量方式成长，绝不触碰 trait 签名。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:95
msgid ""
"Cancellation drops locals at the suspension point through the same machinery ([tasks](tasks.md)) — no special case."
msgstr "取消在挂起点透过同一机制丢弃局部变量（[任务](tasks.md)）—— 没有特例。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:98
msgid ""
"Note the difference from finalizer-based runtimes: `dispose` always runs, exactly once, at a knowable point. There is no \"later or never\"."
msgstr "注意这与基于 finalizer 的运行时的差别：`dispose` 总会运行，恰一次，在一个可知的时点。没有“稍后或永不”。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:101
msgid "Destruction order"
msgstr "销毁顺序"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:103
msgid "When a cell's strong count reaches zero:"
msgstr "当单元的强计数归零："


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:105
msgid ""
"Every `Weak` box watching the cell is nulled **before any user code runs** — a dispose body that calls `upgrade()` sees `nil`, deterministically ([weak references](weak-refs.md))."
msgstr ""
"每个注视该单元的 `Weak` 盒都在**任何用户代码运行之前**被置空——调用 `upgrade()` 的 dispose 函数体确定性地看到 `nil`（[弱引用](weak-refs.md)）。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:108
msgid ""
"The type's queued `dispose` body runs for cells whose type implements `Disposal` (pinned cell, then released)."
msgstr "对类型实现了 `Disposal` 的单元，排队的 `dispose` 函数体运行（先钉住单元，然后释放）。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:110
msgid ""
"Ref-typed children are released **recursively**: record fields in declaration order, sum payloads, array elements, `opaque` box inners, closure captures. The walk is driven by a per-type release plan built once from the type table."
msgstr ""
"引用类型的子节点**递归**释放：按声明顺序的记录字段、sum 载荷、数组元素、`opaque` 盒内层、闭包捕获。这一遍历由一个按类型构建一次的释放计划驱动，计划来自类型表。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:114
msgid ""
"Host box payloads run their Rust `Drop` at the same point — sockets, files, and textures die with the last handle, not \"sometime later\". An opt-in `finalize` hook (no-op default) runs _before_ the payload's `Drop`; a rut value the payload held releases through the same walk."
msgstr ""
"宿主盒载荷在同一个点运行它们的 Rust `Drop` —— 套接字、文件和纹理随最后一个句柄死亡，而不是“过段时间”。可选加入的 `finalize` 钩子（默认空操作）在载荷的 `Drop` _之前_ 运行；载荷持有的 rut 值透过同一遍历释放。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:118
msgid ""
"The block store frees the cell's variable-size payload; the slot returns to the arena free list and is reused by the next mint ([the VM heap](vm-heap.md))."
msgstr "块存储释放单元的可变大小载荷；槽返回 arena 空闲列表，被下一次铸造复用（[VM 堆](vm-heap.md)）。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:122
msgid "Buffers, strings, and views"
msgstr "缓冲、字符串与视图"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:124
msgid ""
"**Primitive-element `[T]` buffers stay flat**: a `[T]` over numeric or `bool` element types stores raw values inline behind the header. Element copies in and out are plain moves — no counting. This is the one place the everything-is-a-cell law does not reach."
msgstr ""
"**基本类型元素的 `[T]` 缓冲保持扁平**：数值或 `bool` 元素类型的 `[T]` 在头部之后内联存储原始值。元素的复制进出是普通移动 —— 不计数。这是“一切皆单元”法则唯一够不到的地方。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:128
msgid ""
"**`Vec<T>` is not flat**: its backing is `buf: [?T]`, so element traffic crosses nullable handles. `push`/`pop`/`set` emit the paired retain/release."
msgstr ""
"**`Vec<T>` 不是扁平的**：它的后备是 `buf: [?T]`，因此元素流量跨越可空句柄。`push`/`pop`/`set` 发出成对的 retain/release。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:131
msgid ""
"**Composite-element buffers store handles**: `[Point]` and `Vec<Point>` hold one cell pointer per element; the buffer itself is the counted unit."
msgstr "**复合元素缓冲存储句柄**：`[Point]` 与 `Vec<Point>` 每个元素持有一个单元指针；缓冲本身是被计数的单位。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:134
msgid ""
"`[T]` is a fixed-length cell; `N` is a compile-time constant and part of the type's identity. Fixed-array literals that fold at compile time become immortal constant-pool cells."
msgstr "`[T]` 是定长单元；`N` 是编译期常量，是类型同一性的一部分。在编译期折叠的定长数组字面量成为不朽的常量池单元。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:137
msgid ""
"**`Slice<T>` view cells** hold a handle to their owner plus `off`/`len` — never a pointer into the data block. Views dispatch through the owner, so growth keeps existing views valid; indexing bounds-checks against `len ∩ owner len` and **traps** out of range instead of reading garbage. Slices are born only from implicit widening at an argument site; they are not nameable or constructible in script."
msgstr ""
"**`Slice<T>` 视图单元**持有一个指向所有者的句柄加上 `off`/`len` —— 绝不是指向数据块的指针。视图透过所有者分派，因此增长保持现有视图有效；索引对 `len ∩ owner len` 做边界检查，越界时**陷阱**而不是读取垃圾。切片只在实参位置因隐式宽化而产生；在脚本中不可命名、不可构造。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:143
msgid ""
"**`str` is immutable**: interned literals live in the module's constant pool (immortal); runtime-built strings are ordinary cells whose buffers are internally copy-on-write — an implementation detail no program can observe, because `str` has no mutation API."
msgstr ""
"**`str` 不可变**：驻留字面量生活在模块的常量池中（不朽）；运行期构建的字符串是普通单元，其缓冲内部是写时复制 —— 这是任何程序都无法观察的实现细节，因为 `str` 没有修改 API。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:147
msgid ""
"**No interior pointers exist anywhere**, which is what keeps every heap walk a simple typed walk."
msgstr "**任何地方都不存在内部指针**，这正是让每次堆遍历都是简单的类型化遍历的原因。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:150
msgid "Internals"
msgstr "内部结构"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:152
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Header:  rc: u32        // strong count; u32::MAX = immortal sentinel\n"
"         ty: u32        // index into the type table\n"
"         bytes: u32     // accounted bytes, refunded on release\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Header:  rc: u32        // strong count; u32::MAX = immortal sentinel\n"
"         ty: u32        // index into the type table\n"
"         bytes: u32     // accounted bytes, refunded on release\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:158
msgid ""
"The weak lists (referent slot word → its `WeakBox` cells) and the disposal-armed markers (cells whose `dispose` is queued or has run) are arena side tables, not header words."
msgstr ""
"弱列表（被引用者的槽字 → 指向它的 `WeakBox` 单元）与处置武装标记（`dispose` 已入队或已运行的单元）是 arena 的旁侧表，不是头部字。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:162
msgid ""
"Cell kinds: string, vec (growable), array (fixed), slice view, record (every user struct/class — vtable + payload slots), enum (tag + payload slots; dataless variants are immortal singletons), opaque box, weak box, and the coroutine frames the async weave mints. Reified layouts are covered in [reified types and layout](reified-types.md)."
msgstr ""
"单元类别：string、vec（可增长）、array（定长）、slice 视图、record（每个用户 struct/class —— vtable + 载荷槽）、enum（标签 + 载荷槽；无数据变体是不朽单例）、opaque 盒、weak 盒，以及异步编织铸造的协程帧。具体化布局见[具体化类型与布局](reified-types.md)。"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:168
msgid "The engine's two counting ops are exact and total:"
msgstr "引擎的两个计数操作是精确且全函数的："


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:171
msgid "/* rc += 1 */"
msgstr "/* rc += 1 */"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:174
msgid ""
"// underflow is a bug: assert\n"
msgstr ""
"// underflow is a bug: assert\n"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:176
msgid ""
"// order above; no suspect list\n"
msgstr ""
"// order above; no suspect list\n"


#: src/reference/rc-heap.md:180
msgid ""
"Destruction is fully deterministic under the virtual clock, so a drop order reproduces exactly in tests. Identity and equality semantics for cell values are covered in [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md)."
msgstr ""
"销毁在虚拟时钟下完全确定，因此 drop 顺序在测试中可以精确复现。单元值的同一性与相等语义见[Rc、dispose 与同一性](rc-dispose-identity.md)。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:3
msgid ""
"Reference counting frees an object when its strong count reaches zero ([the Rc heap](rc-heap.md)). A strong cycle never reaches zero — so **strong cycles leak until the `Vm` is dropped**. rut states this as a rule instead of hiding it behind a collector: the heap stays trivially simple, destructors stay exactly deterministic, and `Weak<T>` gives the two shapes that cause accidental cycles — back-pointers and caches — a first-class answer."
msgstr ""
"引用计数在对象的强计数归零时释放它（[Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)）。强循环永远不会归零 —— 因此**强循环会一直泄漏，直到 `Vm` 被丢弃**。rut 把这一点作为规则陈述出来，而不是把它藏在收集器背后：堆保持平凡地简单，析构器保持完全确定，而 `Weak<T>` 为造成意外循环的两种形状 —— 反向指针与缓存 —— 提供了一等公民的答案。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:11
msgid "Cycle policy"
msgstr "循环策略"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:13
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "规则"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:13
msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:15
msgid "No collector"
msgstr "没有收集器"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:15
msgid ""
"No mark bits, no colors, no pauses beyond destructor chains. What leaks leaks wholly and predictably."
msgstr "没有标记位，没有颜色，除析构器链之外没有停顿。泄漏的东西整块且可预测地泄漏。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:16
msgid "Resource holders"
msgstr "资源持有者"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:16
msgid ""
"Classes holding resources (`Disposal` impls, host boxes) must **not** participate in strong cycles."
msgstr "持有资源的类（`Disposal` impl、宿主盒）绝**不**参与强循环引用。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:17
msgid "Back-pointers"
msgstr "反向指针"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:17
msgid "Parent/child and observer shapes take a `Weak` back-pointer."
msgstr "父/子与观察者形状采用 `Weak` 反向指针。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:18
msgid "Pure-data cycles"
msgstr "纯数据循环"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:18
msgid "Harmless — memory only, freed wholesale at teardown."
msgstr "无害 —— 只涉及内存，在拆卸时整体释放。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:19
msgid "Lints"
msgstr "lint"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:19
msgid ""
"The compiler may warn on obvious self-reference (a value stored into its own field through a handle path); general cycle detection stays out of scope."
msgstr "编译器可能对明显的自引用报警（一个值透过句柄路径存入自己的字段）；一般性的循环检测不在范围内。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:21
msgid ""
"Cycles are possible through ordinary dataclass fields (`next: ?Node` back-pointers) as well as through collections."
msgstr "循环可能透过普通数据类字段（`next: ?Node` 反向指针）产生，也可能透过集合产生。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:24 src/reference/stdlib.md:74
msgid "`Weak<T>`"
msgstr "`Weak<T>`"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:26
msgid ""
"`Weak` is a builtin generic class with one member. A weak box is a side cell holding the referent's slot word, **unretained** — a weak never keeps anything alive, and a path through a `Weak` does not close a strong cycle."
msgstr ""
"`Weak` 是一个只有一个成员的内置泛型类。弱盒是一个侧单元，持有被引用对象的槽字，**不保留**（unretained）—— 弱引用绝不会让任何东西存活，经过 `Weak` 的路径不会闭合强循环。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:31
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"class Node {\n"
"    value: u32;\n"
"    next: ?Node;          // strong — keeps the tail alive\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl Node {\n"
"    pub fn new(value: u32) -> Self { return Self { value: value, next: nil }; }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn use_node(n: Node) {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"node {n.value}\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let n = Node.new(1);\n"
"    let w = Weak.new(n);        // Weak<Node>; T infers from n\n"
"    let b = w.upgrade();        // ?Node — a live handle\n"
"    if (b != nil) {\n"
"        use_node(b);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"class Node {\n"
"    value: u32;\n"
"    next: ?Node;          // strong — keeps the tail alive\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl Node {\n"
"    pub fn new(value: u32) -> Self { return Self { value: value, next: nil }; }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"fn use_node(n: Node) {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    log.info(f\"node {n.value}\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let n = Node.new(1);\n"
"    let w = Weak.new(n);        // Weak<Node>; T infers from n\n"
"    let b = w.upgrade();        // ?Node — a live handle\n"
"    if (b != nil) {\n"
"        use_node(b);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:62
msgid "Construction — `Weak.new(v)`"
msgstr "构造 —— `Weak.new(v)`"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:64
msgid ""
"Construction is a **class method** with admission at the instantiation: `T` must be a **reference type**. `Weak<i32>` and `Weak.new(some_fn)` diagnose; primitives and `fn` values refuse. (The retired type-call spelling — a bare call of the type name — does not compile; the diagnostic names `Weak.new(v)`.)"
msgstr ""
"构造是**类方法**，在实例化时准入：`T` 必须是**引用类型**。`Weak<i32>` 与 `Weak.new(some_fn)` 会被诊断；基本类型与 `fn` 值拒绝。（已废弃的类型调用写法 —— 直接调用类型名 —— 无法编译；诊断会指明 `Weak.new(v)`。）"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:69
msgid ""
"Works over **any cell**: a class, dataclass, `Vec`, `[T]`, enum, `str`, `bytes`, a user `opaque` box, or a host box."
msgstr "适用于**任何单元**：类、数据类、`Vec`、`[T]`、枚举、`str`、`bytes`、用户 `opaque` 盒，或宿主盒。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:71
msgid "`Weak.new(nil)` traps (\"weak on nil\")."
msgstr "`Weak.new(nil)` 陷阱（\"weak on nil\"）。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:72
msgid ""
"**`Weak.new(v)` consumes the argument's temporary** and nulls its register (the engine's one consuming op): the weak observes the _binding's_ lifetime, never a temporary's. `Weak.new(make())` watches a referent that dies as soon as the temporary is released — `upgrade()` answers `nil`. Bind the value first:"
msgstr ""
"**`Weak.new(v)` 消费实参的临时值**并将其寄存器置空（引擎唯一的消费操作）：弱引用观察的是 _绑定_ 的生命周期，绝不是临时值的。`Weak.new(make())` 注视的被引用对象在临时值释放时立即死亡 —— `upgrade()` 应答 `nil`。先绑定值："


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:78
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Payload { n: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"fn make() -> Payload { return Payload { n: 1 }; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let v = make();\n"
"    let w = Weak.new(v);  // watches the binding v — lives as long as v does\n"
"    log.info(f\"{w.upgrade() != nil}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"struct Payload { n: i32; }\n"
"\n"
"fn make() -> Payload { return Payload { n: 1 }; }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let v = make();\n"
"    let w = Weak.new(v);  // watches the binding v — lives as long as v does\n"
"    log.info(f\"{w.upgrade() != nil}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:97
msgid ""
"Two `Weak.new(v)` of one `v` are distinct boxes; `==` on weak boxes is identity, and two weaks of the same referent are not equal to each other."
msgstr "对同一个 `v` 的两个 `Weak.new(v)` 是不同的盒；弱盒上的 `==` 是同一性，同一被引用对象的两个弱引用彼此不相等。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:101
msgid "Upgrade — `w.upgrade() -> ?T`"
msgstr "升级 —— `w.upgrade() -> ?T`"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:103
msgid ""
"A dead-check plus retain: a live referent is retained into a fresh `?T` handle; a dead one answers the **null slot** — true `nil`, never a box containing nil."
msgstr ""
"一次死亡检查加 retain：存活的被引用对象被保留进一个新的 `?T` 句柄；已死的应答**空槽** —— 真正的 `nil`，绝不是装着 nil 的盒。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:106
msgid ""
"On `Weak<?U>` (legal) the answer is `??U` — the sticky-`?` law ([by-reference and nullable](by-reference-and-nullable.md))."
msgstr ""
"在 `Weak<?U>`（合法）上答案是 `??U` —— 粘性 `?` 法则（[按引用与可空](by-reference-and-nullable.md)）。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:108
msgid ""
"`upgrade()` on nil traps (\"upgrade on nil\"); on a non-weak value it traps (\"upgrade on non-weak\")."
msgstr "对 nil 的 `upgrade()` 陷阱（\"upgrade on nil\"）；对非弱值则陷阱（\"upgrade on non-weak\"）。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:111
msgid "Deterministic ordering"
msgstr "确定性顺序"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:113
msgid ""
"The referent's death **nulls every weak box before anything that runs user code** — before the dispose pin, before payload teardown. A dispose body that calls `upgrade()` sees `nil`, with no window:"
msgstr ""
"被引用对象的死亡**在任何运行用户代码的东西之前把每个弱盒置为 nil** —— 在 dispose 钉住之前，在载荷拆卸之前。调用 `upgrade()` 的 dispose 函数体看到 `nil`，没有窗口期："


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:117
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext };\n"
"\n"
"class Node  { child: ?Node; }\n"
"class Child { back: ?Weak<Node>; }   // the observer's weak back-pointer\n"
"\n"
"impl Disposal for Child {\n"
"    fn dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext) {\n"
"        // the parent's death released self through the field walk,\n"
"        // and the parent's weak list was nulled before any of that\n"
"        // user code ran — the back-pointer reads nil from in here:\n"
"        if (self.back.upgrade() == nil) { /* always taken here */ }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext };\n"
"\n"
"class Node  { child: ?Node; }\n"
"class Child { back: ?Weak<Node>; }   // the observer's weak back-pointer\n"
"\n"
"impl Disposal for Child {\n"
"    fn dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext) {\n"
"        // the parent's death released self through the field walk,\n"
"        // and the parent's weak list was nulled before any of that\n"
"        // user code ran — the back-pointer reads nil from in here:\n"
"        if (self.back.upgrade() == nil) { /* always taken here */ }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:133
msgid ""
"Weak references are **not** destructors — they observe; they never run code. They exist for caches, observers, and back-pointers."
msgstr "弱引用**不是**析构器 —— 它们观察；它们从不运行代码。它们为缓存、观察者和反向指针而生。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:136
msgid "Leak reporting"
msgstr "泄漏报告"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:138
msgid ""
"**rc discipline** is asserted in debug builds: retain/release pairing, no underflow, no double destruction."
msgstr "**引用计数纪律**在 debug 构建中断言：retain/release 配对，无下溢，无双重销毁。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:140
msgid ""
"**Shutdown leak report**: at `Vm::drop`, surviving non-immortal objects are reported grouped by type, with allocation sites in debug builds — the primary tool for finding leaked cycles. Deterministic execution means a leak reproduces exactly."
msgstr ""
"**关闭时泄漏报告**：在 `Vm::drop` 时，按类型分组报告存活的非不朽对象，debug 构建中附带分配点 —— 这是找到泄漏循环的首要工具。确定性执行意味着泄漏可以精确复现。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:144
msgid ""
"The host can read live usage at any time (`vm.heap_usage()`, [resource limits](resource-limits.md))."
msgstr "宿主可以随时读取活跃用量（`vm.heap_usage()`，[资源限制](resource-limits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:146
msgid ""
"Fuzz targets assert no crash and that destructor counts match allocations minus reported survivors."
msgstr "fuzz 目标断言不崩溃，并且析构器计数等于分配数减去报告的存活者。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:149
msgid ""
"Status: the `Weak<T>` surface above is shipped; the shutdown report and per-type live counts are the specified diagnostics tier."
msgstr "状态：上面的 `Weak<T>` 接口面已发布；关闭报告与按类型的活跃计数是规格中的诊断层（tier）。"


#: src/reference/weak-refs.md:152
msgid ""
"If real code ever demands more, a collector could return only as a separate, opt-in module — the heap assumes nothing of it today."
msgstr "如果真实代码有一天需要更多，收集器只能作为一个单独的、可选加入的模块回归 —— 今天的堆对它不做任何假设。"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:3
msgid ""
"Host Rust code may use `std` freely. The VM's heap is the exception: **every byte that backs a rut value comes from the VM's own heap manager** — accounted, budgeted, pooled, and freed wholesale at `Vm` drop. No rut allocation is an untracked `Box`/`Vec` somewhere in Rust land. The point of the discipline:"
msgstr ""
"宿主 Rust 代码可以自由使用 `std`。VM 的堆是例外：**支撑 rut 值的每一个字节都来自 VM 自己的堆管理器** —— 记账、预算、池化，并在 `Vm` 丢弃时整体释放。没有任何 rut 分配是 Rust 世界里某个不受追踪的 `Box`/`Vec`。这份纪律的意义："


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:9
msgid ""
"**Caps** — an embedder says \"this script gets N bytes\" and gets a resumable `OutOfMemory` trap, not an OS abort ([resource limits](resource-limits.md))."
msgstr ""
"**上限** —— 嵌入方说“这个脚本得到 N 字节”，然后得到一个可恢复的 `OutOfMemory` 陷阱，而不是操作系统中止（[资源限制](resource-limits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:12
msgid ""
"**Answers** — `vm.heap_usage()` is exact only if every allocation is accounted."
msgstr "**应答** —— `vm.heap_usage()` 只有在每次分配都被记账时才是精确的。"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:14
msgid ""
"**Teardown** — `Vm::drop` frees the heap in slab units; nothing per-object leaks past the VM."
msgstr "**拆卸** —— `Vm::drop` 按 slab 单位释放堆；没有任何对象级的泄漏能逃过 VM。"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:16
msgid ""
"**Leak reporting** — the shutdown leak report ([weak references](weak-refs.md)) walks the heap's own headers, which requires that every value have one."
msgstr "**泄漏报告** —— 关闭泄漏报告（[弱引用](weak-refs.md)）遍历堆自己的头部，这要求每个值都有一个头部。"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:20
msgid "What the VM manages"
msgstr "VM 管理什么"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:22
msgid "Managed by the VM heap"
msgstr "VM 堆管理"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:22
msgid "The host's business"
msgstr "宿主的事务"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:24
msgid ""
"every cell — structs, classes, enums, `opaque` boxes, weak boxes ([the Rc heap](rc-heap.md))"
msgstr "每个单元 —— struct、class、enum、`opaque` 盒、weak 盒（[Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)）"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:24
msgid "module binaries and maps (read zero-copy, never copied into the heap)"
msgstr "模块二进制与映射（零拷贝读取，绝不复制进堆）"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:25
