msgstr "可变大小载荷块 —— `Vec`/`[T]` 数据、字符串缓冲"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:25
msgid "the shared type table"
msgstr "共享类型表"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:26
msgid "coroutine frames and register blocks ([async and await](async.md))"
msgstr "协程帧与寄存器块（[异步与 await](async.md)）"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:26
msgid "native-module state"
msgstr "原生模块状态"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:27
msgid "the ready ring, the frame pool, the timer wheel"
msgstr "就绪环、帧池、定时器轮"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:27
msgid "host-side handles, caches, futures, channel buffers at the boundary"
msgstr "边界处的宿主侧句柄、缓存、future、通道缓冲"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:29
msgid "Host-side Rust state is the host's memory, charged to the host."
msgstr "宿主侧的 Rust 状态是宿主的内存，记在宿主的账上。"


#: src/reference/vm-heap.md:31
msgid "The manager surface"
msgstr "管理器接口面"


