#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:16
msgid "The heap budget"
msgstr "堆预算"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:20
msgid "**What counts**"
msgstr "计入什么"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:20
msgid ""
"everything the VM heap tracks: cell headers + payloads, buffer blocks, string blocks, frames and register blocks, `opaque` store entries"
msgstr "VM 堆追踪的一切：单元头部 + 载荷、缓冲块、字符串块、帧与寄存器块、`opaque` 存储条目"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:21
msgid "**What does not**"
msgstr "不计入什么"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:21
msgid "module binaries, the shared type table, host-side Rust state"
msgstr "模块二进制、共享类型表、宿主侧 Rust 状态"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:22
msgid "**Check points**"
msgstr "检查点"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:22
msgid ""
"every `Heap::alloc` route: cell mint, `Vec` growth (`push` reallocation), string concat, frame-pool growth, host crossing mints"
msgstr "每条 `Heap::alloc` 路径：单元铸造、`Vec` 增长（`push` 重新分配）、字符串拼接、帧池增长、宿主跨越铸造"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:23
msgid "**On failure**"
msgstr "失败时"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:23
msgid ""
"`Trap::OutOfMemory` — the check runs **before any write**, so the heap is byte-identical to its pre-op state; nothing is half-initialized"
msgstr "`Trap::OutOfMemory` —— 检查**在任何写入之前**运行，因此堆与操作前的状态字节级一致；没有任何东西被半初始化"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:24
msgid "**Resumption**"
msgstr "恢复"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:24
msgid ""
"the frame is parked: raise the limit (`Heap::set_limit`), drop references and retry, or drop the VM"
msgstr "帧被停放：提高上限（`Heap::set_limit`）、丢弃引用并重试，或丢弃 VM"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:25
msgid "**Observability**"
msgstr "可观测性"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:25
msgid "`vm.heap_usage()` (live), `vm.heap_peak()` (high-water)"
msgstr "`vm.heap_usage()`（活跃）、`vm.heap_peak()`（高水位）"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:27
msgid ""
"`Vec` growth charges the budget before the write; shrinking is never refunded (v1 overcounts rather than undercounts)."
msgstr "`Vec` 增长在写入之前计入预算；收缩绝不退款（v1 宁可多计，不少计）。"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:30
msgid "Fuel"
msgstr "燃料"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:32
msgid ""
"One unit per executed op; `fuel` counts **down**. The counter is decremented and checked on **every** op — `interrupt_every` meters the separate interrupt lane, not fuel."
msgstr ""
"每执行一个操作计一个单位；`fuel` 向**下**计数。计数器在**每个**操作上递减并检查——`interrupt_every` 计量的是独立的中断链路，不是燃料。"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:35
msgid ""
"`Trap::OutOfFuel` parks the frame exactly like any resumable stop: nothing is unwound. Resumption is `vm.add_fuel(n)` then `vm.resume()` — the frame _is_ the loop state. Fuel is chosen at construction: `add_fuel` is a no-op on an unbounded machine, and there is no `set_fuel` twin — by design."
msgstr ""
"`Trap::OutOfFuel` 像任何可恢复停止一样停放帧：没有任何东西被展开。恢复是 `vm.add_fuel(n)` 然后 `vm.resume()` —— 帧 _就是_ 循环状态。燃料在构造时选定：`add_fuel` 在无界机器上是空操作，也没有 `set_fuel` 这样的孪生方法——有意为之。"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:40
msgid ""
"Fuel is the **deterministic** budget: the same program with the same fuel dies at the same op, every run — reproducible reports and hang proofs in tests."
msgstr "燃料是**确定性**的预算：同样的程序带着同样的燃料在同一个操作处死亡，每次运行都如此 —— 测试中可复现的报告与挂起证明。"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:43
msgid ""
"**Native fns run outside fuel.** A hanging native is a host bug: keep native bodies non-blocking, or push blocking work to a thread through the host-futures lane ([the host futures bridge](host-futures.md))."
msgstr ""
"**原生 fn 在燃料之外运行。** 挂起的原生函数是宿主 bug：保持原生函数体非阻塞，或透过宿主 future 链路把阻塞工作推给线程（[宿主 future 桥接](host-futures.md)）。"


