msgstr ""
"// re-enters at the parked pc\n"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:69
msgid ""
"The async layer's resume granularity is the **checkpoint**, not the op: a drive that runs out of fuel parks the future's frame, and a re-drive re-enters at the frame's checkpoint state ([async and await](async.md))."
msgstr ""
"异步层的恢复粒度是**检查点**，不是操作：燃料耗尽的驱动会停放 future 的帧，重新驱动会从帧的检查点状态重新进入（[异步与 await](async.md)）。"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:74
msgid "Hang detection"
msgstr "挂起检测"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:76
msgid "The host owns time; the recipes differ by embedder:"
msgstr "时间由宿主管；配方因嵌入方而异："


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:78
msgid "Host"
msgstr "宿主"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:78
msgid "Recipe"
msgstr "配方"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:80
msgid "UI / game"
msgstr "UI / 游戏"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:80
msgid ""
"drain the ready queue inside the frame loop; grant fuel per frame so a runaway script starves at the next check"
msgstr "在帧循环内排空就绪队列；每帧授予燃料，让失控的脚本在下一次检查时饥饿"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:81
msgid "wasm page"
msgstr "wasm 页面"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:81
msgid ""
"grant finite fuel; a watchdog stops refueling — the parked frame dies at its next check"
msgstr "授予有限燃料；看门狗停止补充燃料 —— 被停放的帧在下一次检查时死亡"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:82
msgid "desktop service"
msgstr "桌面服务"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:82
msgid ""
"a watchdog thread flips a flag the host honors between `resume()` calls; no joins, no signals"
msgstr "看门狗线程翻转一个标志，宿主在 `resume()` 调用之间尊重它；没有 join，没有信号"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:83
msgid "tests"
msgstr "测试"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:83
msgid ""
"finite fuel + the virtual clock (`vm.set_now`) → fully deterministic hang proofs"
msgstr "有限燃料 + 虚拟时钟（`vm.set_now`）→ 完全确定性的挂起证明"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:85
msgid ""
"Anything blocking that cannot be bounded by fuel (IO, locks) belongs on a worker thread answering a `Completer` — the VM thread never blocks on it ([the host futures bridge](host-futures.md))."
msgstr ""
"无法用燃料约束的任何阻塞操作（IO、锁）属于 worker 线程上应答 `Completer` 的工作 —— VM 线程绝不在其上阻塞（[宿主 future 桥接](host-futures.md)）。"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:89
msgid "Workers"
msgstr "worker"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:91
msgid ""
"A worker VM is constructed with **its own `Limits`**; argument transfers are counted against the _child_ budget before the worker starts, so a worker cannot OOM its parent ([workers and channels](workers-and-channels.md))."
msgstr ""
"worker VM 以**自己的 `Limits`** 构造；实参转移在 worker 启动之前对照 _子_ 预算计数，因此 worker 无法让父 VM OOM（[worker 与通道](workers-and-channels.md)）。"


#: src/reference/resource-limits.md:96
msgid ""
"Within one VM, the ready ring is round-robin: one greedy launched future cannot starve the rest of a queue drain indefinitely — each frame runs to its next park or completion, and fuel bounds each of those runs."
msgstr ""
"在单个 VM 内，就绪环是轮转的：一个贪婪的已启动 future 不能无限期地饿死队列排空的其余部分 —— 每个帧都运行到它的下一个停放点或完成点，而燃料为其中每次运行设限。"


#: src/reference/async.md:3
msgid ""
"rut's concurrency is **pull-based**. An `async fn` compiles into an `impl Future<T>` for a hidden frame type — a **cold future** that only progresses when driven. There are no promises, no microtask queue, and no implicit scheduling: **the host owns time**. One noun (`Future<T>`), one consume law (`await` **or** launch — exactly one), one pender (`sleep`; an embedder may mount its own)."
msgstr ""
"rut 的并发是**拉取式**的。`async fn` 会为一个隐藏的帧类型编译出一个 `impl Future<T>`——一个**冷的 future**，只有被驱动时才会前进。没有 promise，没有微任务队列，没有隐式调度：**时间由宿主掌握**。一个名词（`Future<T>`），一条消费法则（`await` **或** launch——恰好其一），一个 pender（`sleep`；嵌入方可以挂载自己的）。"


#: src/reference/async.md:10
msgid "Push (promises)"
msgstr "推送式（promise）"


#: src/reference/async.md:10
msgid "rut (poll)"
msgstr "rut（轮询）"


#: src/reference/async.md:12
msgid "starts executing on the next microtask"
msgstr "在下一个微任务上开始执行"


#: src/reference/async.md:12
msgid "**cold** — nothing runs until awaited or launched"
msgstr "**冷**——在被 await 或启动之前什么也不运行"


#: src/reference/async.md:13
msgid "completion"
msgstr "完成"


#: src/reference/async.md:13
msgid "pushes callbacks through a job queue"
msgstr "经由作业队列推送回调"


#: src/reference/async.md:14
msgid "allocation"
msgstr "分配"


#: src/reference/async.md:14
msgid "promise + reactions per `then`"
msgstr "每个 `then` 一个 promise 加若干 reaction"


#: src/reference/async.md:14
msgid "one hidden frame record per call; locals are cell-backed"
msgstr "每次调用一个隐藏帧记录；局部变量以单元支撑"


#: src/reference/async.md:15
msgid "abort flag / never settles"
msgstr "abort 标志 / 永不落定"


#: src/reference/async.md:15
msgid "`abort()` flags the frame; the probe at its checkpoint runs the drop path"
msgstr "`abort()` 给帧打上标志；其检查点处的探针运行 drop 路径"


#: src/reference/async.md:16
msgid "the host polls the VM: `run_ready()`, `next_deadline()`"
msgstr "宿主轮询 VM：`run_ready()`、`next_deadline()`"


#: src/reference/async.md:20
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ RunContext };\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"use async_host::{ launch_future, sleep };\n"
"\n"
"async fn countdown(cx: RunContext, n: u32) -> u32 {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"count\");\n"
"    let mut i = n;\n"
"    while (i > 0) {\n"
"        await sleep(1000);            // the ONLY suspension point\n"
"        i -= 1;\n"
"        log.info(f\"tick {i}\");\n"
"    }\n"
"    return i;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    launch_future(countdown(3));      // trigger; receipt ignored\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rutuse core::{ RunContext };use ink::{ Logger };use async_host::{ launch_future, sleep };async fn countdown(cx: RunContext, n: u32) -> u32 {    let log = Logger.new(\"count\");    let mut i = n;    while (i > 0) {        await sleep(1000);            // the ONLY suspension point        i -= 1;        log.info(f\"tick {i}\");    }    return i;}pub fn main() {    launch_future(countdown(3));      // trigger; receipt ignored}```"


#: src/reference/async.md:47 src/reference/host-futures.md:17
#: src/reference/host-fns.md:67
msgid "Rules:"
msgstr "规则："


#: src/reference/async.md:49
msgid ""
"The **first parameter is the cx**: `async fn f(cx: RunContext, ..)`. The engine mints it at call sites and per drive — call sites do not pass it. The spelled `RunContext` name is core's (`pub builtin`, import-gated): `use core::{ RunContext }` brings it in — the weave itself never needs the import, only the spelled name does."
msgstr ""
"**第一个参数是 cx**：`async fn f(cx: RunContext, ..)`。引擎在调用点和每次驱动时铸造它——调用点不传它。拼写的 `RunContext` 名字属于 core（`pub builtin`，导入把守）：`use core::{ RunContext }` 把它带进来——织造本身从不需要导入，需要它的是拼写的名字。"


#: src/reference/async.md:54
msgid ""
"`async fn f(..) -> T` describes a value that widens to `Future<T>`. **Calling it runs nothing** (cold). It runs when the future is `await`ed or launched."
msgstr ""
"`async fn f(..) -> T` 描述的是一个可宽化为 `Future<T>` 的值。**调用它什么也不运行**（冷）。它在这个 future 被 `await` 或被启动时才运行。"


#: src/reference/async.md:57
msgid ""
"`await` is legal only inside an `async fn`. In this build it targets **engine-woven futures** — async-fn results and `sleep`."
msgstr ""
"`await` 只在 `async fn` 体内合法。在这个构建里它面向**引擎织入的 future**——async fn 的结果和 `sleep`。"


#: src/reference/async.md:59
msgid ""
"A future is awaited or launched by **exactly one driver**; each path consumes it. Driving one frame from two paths is a disclosed misuse, not a soundness hole."
msgstr "一个 future 恰好被**一个驱动者** await 或启动；每条路径都消费它。从两条路径驱动同一帧是一次明示的误用，而不是健全性漏洞。"


#: src/reference/async.md:62
msgid ""
"`launch_future(launch_future(f))` is a **type error**: the receipt is not a `Future` ([tasks](tasks.md))."
msgstr ""
"`launch_future(launch_future(f))` 是一个**类型错误**：回执不是 `Future`（[任务](tasks.md)）。"


#: src/reference/async.md:64
msgid ""
"Async **methods** are not woven in this build — async points are free fns. A sync method may mint the future internally and return it typed `Future<T>` (the standard HTTP face does exactly this)."
msgstr ""
"在这个构建里 async **方法**不被织入——异步点是自由函数。同步方法可以在内部铸造 future 并以 `Future<T>` 类型返回它（标准 HTTP 门面正是这样做的）。"


#: src/reference/async.md:67
msgid ""
"Cancellation-by-drop: the probe at the resumed checkpoint branches to a drop path that releases the frame's cell-backed locals (their `Disposal` impls run, [the Rc heap](rc-heap.md)), retires the state, and returns."
msgstr ""
"基于 drop 的取消：恢复后的检查点处的探针分支到一条 drop 路径，释放帧里以单元支撑的局部变量（它们的 `Disposal` impl 会运行，[Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)），让状态退役，然后返回。"


