#: src/reference/tasks.md:19
msgid "The receipt — `LaunchedFutureHandle<T>`"
msgstr "回执——`LaunchedFutureHandle<T>`"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:29
msgid ""
"The receipt is **not a `Future`**: `await h` diagnoses — the type system rejects it, never a runtime check."
msgstr "回执**不是 `Future`**：`await h` 会被诊断——类型系统拒绝它，绝不是运行时检查。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:31
msgid ""
"It is **not re-launchable**: `launch_future(h)` is a type error for the same reason. A future is consumed exactly once — by `await` or by `launch_future`, never both, never twice."
msgstr ""
"它**不可再次启动**：出于同样的原因，`launch_future(h)` 是类型错误。一个 future 恰好被消费一次——被 `await` 或被 `launch_future`，绝不同时，绝不两次。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:34
msgid ""
"One member: `abort()` — `true` if the frame was flagged and re-enqueued, `false` when it had already finished (a repeat abort is stable and harmless)."
msgstr ""
"只有一个成员：`abort()`——如果帧被打了标志并重新入队则返回 `true`，已经结束则返回 `false`（重复 abort 是稳定且无害的）。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:38
msgid "Cancellation"
msgstr "取消"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:40
msgid ""
"`abort()` flags the frame's cancellation and re-enqueues it. **The probe at its next checkpoint is the only place cancellation becomes observable** — it never interrupts mid-expression."
msgstr "`abort()` 给帧打上取消标志并把它重新入队。**它的下一个检查点处的探针是取消变得可观察的唯一地点**——它绝不会在表达式中途打断。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:44
msgid "At the probe, the frame runs its **drop path**:"
msgstr "在探针处，帧运行自己的 **drop 路径**："


#: src/reference/tasks.md:46
msgid "the pending edge is cleared — a pending `sleep` dies with the frame;"
msgstr "pending 边被清除——一个 pending 中的 `sleep` 随帧一同消亡；"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:47
msgid ""
"every local releases **deterministically, in reverse declaration order** (`Disposal` impls run, [the Rc heap](rc-heap.md));"
msgstr "每个局部变量都以**确定性的、声明相反的顺序**释放（`Disposal` impl 会运行，[Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)）；"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:49
msgid "the state retires (null) — later `abort()` calls answer `false`."
msgstr "状态退役（null）——之后的 `abort()` 调用应答 `false`。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:51
msgid ""
"Inside a future impl, `cx.cancelled()` reads the same flag as data, so a hand-written frame can honor cancellation at its own pace ([the host futures bridge](host-futures.md)). Cancellation is synchronous at the engine level (flag + re-enqueue); a frame parked on a host future only observes the flag when the loop drives it again."
msgstr ""
"在 future impl 内部，`cx.cancelled()` 把同一个标志作为数据读取，因此手写的帧可以按自己的节奏响应取消（[宿主 future 桥](host-futures.md)）。取消在引擎层面是同步的（打标志 + 重新入队）；停放在宿主 future 上的帧只有在循环再次驱动它时才会观察到该标志。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:57
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext, RunContext };\n"
"\n"
"class Drops {\n"
"    n: u32;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"impl Disposal for Drops {\n"
"    fn dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext) { self.n += 1; }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"async fn job(cx: RunContext, seen: ?Drops) -> nil {\n"
"    let buf = Drops { n: 0 };\n"
"    await sleep(5000);\n"
"    // if `job` is aborted while parked here, the probe at the sleep\n"
"    // checkpoint runs the drop path: buf's dispose fires, then the\n"
"    // locals release in reverse declaration order\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rutuse core::{ Disposal, DisposalContext, RunContext };class Drops {    n: u32;}impl Disposal for Drops {    fn dispose(mut self, cx: DisposalContext) { self.n += 1; }}async fn job(cx: RunContext, seen: ?Drops) -> nil {    let buf = Drops { n: 0 };    await sleep(5000);    // if `job` is aborted while parked here, the probe at the sleep    // checkpoint runs the drop path: buf's dispose fires, then the    // locals release in reverse declaration order}```"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:77
msgid "Join (specified)"
msgstr "join（已规定）"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:79
msgid ""
"There is no `spawn` and no `Task<T>`. The receipt is the join surface: `await h` joins the launched future and produces its completion value. Until the join tier lands, `await h` diagnoses with the join law and the receipt stays non-awaitable."
msgstr ""
"没有 `spawn`，也没有 `Task<T>`。回执就是 join 表面：`await h` join 已启动的 future 并产出其完成值。在 join 层落地之前，`await h` 会以 join 法则被诊断，回执保持不可 await。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:84
msgid ""
"Planned laws: joining an already-cancelled receipt yields the cancelled case, never a trap; join re-enqueues the awaiter the same way an in-body `await` parks, so the value surfaces on the driving loop, not through a callback."
msgstr ""
"计划中的法则：join 一个已取消的回执得到的是已取消情形，绝不是陷阱；join 以体内 `await` 停放的同样方式重新入队 awaiter，因此值是在驱动循环上浮现的，而不是经由回调。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:89
msgid "`select` (specified)"
msgstr "`select`（已规定）"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:98
msgid ""
"`await select { .. }` races futures; the **winner's value drives its arm**; the losers are dropped — which means **cancelled** (their drop paths run, pending sleeps die with them)."
msgstr ""
"`await select { .. }` 让 future 竞速；**胜者的值驱动它所在的分支**；败者被 drop——这意味着**被取消**（它们的 drop 路径运行，pending 中的 sleep 随之消亡）。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:101
msgid ""
"Arms use `->` like `when`: `fut -> expr` discards the resolved value; `fut x -> expr` binds it to `x` (arm-local binding)."
msgstr ""
"分支像 `when` 一样使用 `->`：`fut -> expr` 丢弃已解析的值；`fut x -> expr` 把它绑定到 `x`（分支局部绑定）。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:103
msgid ""
"`select_all(futs)` (stdlib, built on `select`) resolves with the first ready value."
msgstr "`select_all(futs)`（标准库，构建于 `select` 之上）以第一个就绪的值解析。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:106
msgid ""
"The grammar parses today; the semantics are gated with \"`await select` is not in this build\"."
msgstr "语法今天就能解析；语义被门控，诊断为 \"`await select` is not in this build\"。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:109
msgid "Structure and fairness"
msgstr "结构与公平性"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:111
msgid ""
"v1 tasks are **unstructured**: aborting a frame does not abort frames it awaits. Structured scopes — `scope { .. }` cancelling children on exit — are the specified remedy."
msgstr ""
"v1 任务是**非结构化的**：abort 一个帧不会 abort 它所 await 的帧。结构化作用域——`scope { .. }` 在退出时取消子任务——是已规定的补救。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:114
msgid ""
"The ready ring is **round-robin**: each drive runs a frame to its next park or completion, so one greedy future cannot starve the queue. Task priorities are not in the model."
msgstr ""
"就绪环是**轮转（round-robin）**的：每次驱动把一个帧运行到它的下一次停放或完成，因此一个贪婪的 future 无法饿死队列。任务优先级不在模型之中。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:117
msgid ""
"`vm.pending_tasks()` counts ready frames, armed timers, and host futures parked on Completers — the embedder's idle test ([async and await](async.md))."
msgstr ""
"`vm.pending_tasks()` 统计就绪帧、已布防定时器以及停放在 Completer 上的宿主 future——这是嵌入方的空闲判据（[异步与 await](async.md)）。"


#: src/reference/tasks.md:120
msgid ""
"A trap inside a launched future propagates out of `run_ready()` / `drive()`; the frame is retired either way, and its locals ran their drop path."
msgstr ""
"已启动 future 内部的陷阱会传播出 `run_ready()` / `drive()`；无论哪种情况帧都会退役，其局部变量已运行过 drop 路径。"


#: src/reference/host-futures.md:3
msgid ""
"Native Rust code can back a rut async fn. The contract is one closure per operation: spawn the work, hand out a **`Completer<T>`**, and settle it from anywhere. The engine weaves the future; the embedder never touches a frame."
msgstr ""
"原生 Rust 代码可以为 rut async fn 提供后盾。契约是每个操作一个闭包：把工作 spawn 出去，发出一个 **`Completer<T>`**，然后从任何地方落定它。引擎负责织出 future；嵌入方从不触碰帧。"


#: src/reference/host-futures.md:8
msgid "Declaring a host async fn"
msgstr "声明宿主 async fn"


#: src/reference/host-futures.md:10
msgid "In a declaration package ([host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md)):"
msgstr "在一个声明包里（[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)）："


#: src/reference/host-futures.md:12
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"/// fetch `url`; the answer is the response body\n"
"pub host async fn fetch(url: str) -> bytes;\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
