msgid ""
"Concrete crossing signatures only — no generic host async fns; parameter and answer types come from the crossing set ([the host boundary](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md))."
msgstr ""
"只有具体的跨越签名——没有泛型宿主 async fn；参数与应答类型来自跨越集合（[宿主边界](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-futures.md:22
msgid "Arity 0–8."
msgstr "元数 0–8。"


#: src/reference/host-futures.md:23
msgid ""
"Calling one **runs nothing**: the call site mints a cold engine-woven `Future<T>` frame whose state field holds the host cell. The body is driven by `await` or `launch_future` exactly like any other future."
msgstr ""
"调用它**什么也不运行**：调用点铸造一个冷的引擎织入 `Future<T>` 帧，其状态字段持有宿主单元。函数体由 `await` 或 `launch_future` 驱动，与其他任何 future 完全一样。"


