msgid ""
"The declared name itself is **never dispatched** — calling through it traps with a teaching message (\"the weave mints the future at the call site\")."
msgstr ""
"被声明的名字本身**绝不会被分派**——经由它调用会触发一个带教学消息的陷阱（\"the weave mints the future at the call site\"）。"


