#: src/reference/host-futures.md:47
msgid ""
"**Thread law**: the VM stays single-threaded. Worker threads touch only the completer's atomics + mutex; every rut cell is minted on the VM thread when the answer is marshaled."
msgstr ""
"**线程法则**：VM 保持单线程。worker 线程只触碰 completer 的原子量 + 互斥锁；每个 rut 单元都在应答被编组时铸造于 VM 线程之上。"


#: src/reference/host-futures.md:51
msgid ""
"**Late answers are disclosed best-effort**: after a cancellation the thread runs to its blocking completion and the result is simply never taken."
msgstr "**迟到答案按尽力而为明示**：取消之后线程仍会运行到它的阻塞式完成，而结果只是永远不会被取走。"


