msgid "**not transferable** — compile-time error at the `send`/`spawn_worker` site"
msgstr "**不可转移**——在 `send`/`spawn_worker` 处是编译期错误"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:58
msgid "anything else (receipts, wakers)"
msgstr "其余一切（回执、waker）"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:58
msgid "compile-time error at the call site"
msgstr "在调用点是编译期错误"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:60
msgid "Enforcement is two-layered:"
msgstr "强制检查分两层："


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:62
msgid ""
"**Static** at the send/spawn site — the checker knows `T` and rejects non-crossable types (closures, unregistered host types)."
msgstr "发送/生成处的**静态**检查——检查器知道 `T`，会拒绝不可跨越的类型（闭包、未注册的宿主类型）。"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:64
msgid ""
"**Runtime** on the receiving heap — `transfer_into` detects uniqueness: an `rc == 1` buffer is _adopted_ (the raw block moves, no copy); anything shared is deep-copied through a descriptor-driven walk."
msgstr ""
"接收堆上的**运行时**检查——`transfer_into` 检测唯一性：`rc == 1` 的缓冲区被_收养_（原始内存块直接移动，无复制）；任何被共享的东西都经由一次描述符驱动的遍历深复制。"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:69
msgid ""
"Transfers move **accounting**, not just pointers: a moved buffer's bytes are charged to the child heap at the transfer ([the VM heap](vm-heap.md))."
msgstr "转移移动的是**记账**，而不只是指针：被移动缓冲区的字节在转移时记入子堆的账（[VM 堆](vm-heap.md)）。"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:73
msgid "Worker lifecycle"
msgstr "worker 生命周期"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:75
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"let w = spawn_worker(\"workers/fetch\", (url, ch.sender()));\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"let w = spawn_worker(\"workers/fetch\", (url, ch.sender()));\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:79
msgid "`spawn_worker(module, args)` is a host hook:"
msgstr "`spawn_worker(module, args)` 是一个宿主钩子："


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:81
msgid ""
"construct a child `Vm` sharing the **type table and loader — never the heap** ([the VM heap](vm-heap.md));"
msgstr "构造一个共享**类型表与加载器——绝不共享堆**的子 `Vm`（[VM 堆](vm-heap.md)）；"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:83
msgid "load the module;"
msgstr "加载模块；"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:84
msgid ""
"transfer the args into the child heap — charged to the **child** budget before the worker starts, so a worker cannot OOM its parent ([resource limits](resource-limits.md));"
msgstr ""
"把实参转移进子堆——在 worker 启动之前记入**子**预算，因此 worker 不可能 OOM 它的父级（[资源限制](resource-limits.md)）；"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:87
msgid ""
"run the worker's entry to completion on its own thread; entry parameters **are** the transferred args;"
msgstr "在 worker 自己的线程上把入口运行到完成；入口参数**就是**被转移的实参；"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:89
msgid ""
"return a `Worker` handle; `worker.join() -> Future<Result<(), Trap>>` completes when the entry returns."
msgstr "返回一个 `Worker` 句柄；`worker.join() -> Future<Result<(), Trap>>` 在入口返回时完成。"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:92
msgid "Isolation laws"
msgstr "隔离法则"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:94
msgid ""
"**A trap inside a worker kills only that worker**: `join()` answers the trap and the host decides — restart it, surface it, ignore it. The parent VM and its other workers are untouched."
msgstr ""
"**worker 内部的陷阱只杀死该 worker**：`join()` 应答这个陷阱，由宿主决定——重启它、呈现它、忽略它。父 VM 与它的其他 worker 毫发无损。"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:97
msgid ""
"**The main VM blocks on nothing**: `join()` is a future, channel receives are awaits; the parent's driving loop keeps running while workers compute."
msgstr "**主 VM 不阻塞在任何东西上**：`join()` 是一个 future，通道接收是 await；worker 计算时，父方的驱动循环继续运行。"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:100
msgid ""
"**No data races by construction**: nothing is shared, so there is nothing to lock. Two isolates communicate only through transferred values and channel messages."
msgstr "**构造上就不存在数据竞争**：没有任何东西被共享，因此没有任何东西需要加锁。两个隔离体只经由被转移的值和通道消息通信。"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:103
msgid ""
"A worker's exit does not close channels it received senders from — the shutdown signal is the _drop_ of the sender endpoints, which falls out of the worker's heap teardown."
msgstr "worker 退出并不关闭它从中收到发送端的那些通道——关停信号是发送端端点的 _drop_，这会随 worker 堆的拆除自然发生。"


#: src/reference/workers-and-channels.md:107
msgid ""
"Open surface: bounded channels and MPMC; cross-isolate sharing of immutable data; receive fairness across multiple awaiting receivers (FIFO per channel proposed)."
msgstr "开放表面：有界通道与 MPMC；跨隔离体共享不可变数据；多个等待中的接收端之间的接收公平性（提议为每通道 FIFO）。"


#: src/reference/embedding.md:3
msgid ""
"The host is a Rust program. It owns the VM, mounts packages, binds native function **bodies** to declared **surfaces**, and drives rut entry points. Compiling and type-checking rut code never requires any Rust: surfaces are declared in rut source ([host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md)), and the boot join proves every referenced native member has a bound, signature-equal implementation before the first instruction runs."
msgstr ""
"宿主是一个 Rust 程序。它拥有 VM、挂载包、把原生函数**体**绑定到已声明的**表面**上，并驱动 rut 入口点。编译与类型检查 rut 代码从不需要任何 Rust：表面在 rut 源码里声明（[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)），而启动 join 会在第一条指令运行之前证明每个被引用的原生成员都有一个已绑定的、签名相等的实现。"


#: src/reference/embedding.md:10
msgid ""
"There is no load-time execution: loading verifies and links; the host runs entry points explicitly."
msgstr "没有加载期执行：加载只做校验和链接；入口点由宿主显式运行。"


