#: src/reference/embedding.md:95
msgid ""
"The embedder owns exactly three things: the fs policy (\\[`Source`\\]), the remote policy (\\[`DepRemote`\\]), and its own runtime. The door is the **`Loader`** — non-generic, no remote default, and the check is LAZY: `build()` validates only the path shape; the remote matters only when the dep walk actually reaches a url row, and the panic fires there (naming the dep, the url, and the fix). Url-free projects and `.rutbundle`s are closed — they load with no remote named at all."
msgstr ""


