#: src/reference/embedding.md:206
msgid ""
"the url-dep contract: `fetch(&self, url) -> Pin<Box<dyn Future<Output = Result<Vec<u8>, RemoteError>> + '_>>` (required), `lookup`, `write` — the call site owns HOW bytes arrive (transport, cache, offline policy). Dyn-compatible (hand-rolled boxing, no async-trait), deliberately **not** `+ Send`: a browser `fetch` bridge is `!Send`, and sync impls (cache hits, fixtures) are first-class"
msgstr ""
"url 依赖契约：`fetch(&self, url) -> Pin<Box<dyn Future<Output = Result<Vec<u8>, RemoteError>> + '_>>`（必选）、`lookup`、`write`——调用方拥有字节如何到达（传输、缓存、离线策略）。dyn 兼容（手写装箱，不用 async-trait），刻意**不** `+ Send`：浏览器的 `fetch` 桥是 `!Send` 的，同步实现（缓存命中、夹具）是一等公民"


