#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:3
msgid ""
"The one place tagged values exist: the host boundary. Inside the VM, registers are untagged slots ([the VM heap](vm-heap.md)); crossing into Rust materializes a checked, borrow-guarded value. The currency of the boundary is **typed Rust**: the registered closure's parameter types and the `vm.call` return type are the whole contract. The crate-internal marshaling formats (`Value`, `Slot`) never leave the VM crate."
msgstr ""
"带标记的值唯一存在的地方：宿主边界。VM 内部，寄存器是不带标记的槽位（[VM 堆](vm-heap.md)）；跨越进 Rust 时会具体化出一个经过检查、带借用守卫的值。边界的通货是**带类型的 Rust**：注册闭包的参数类型与 `vm.call` 的返回类型就是全部契约。crate 内部的编组格式（`Value`、`Slot`）绝不离开 VM crate。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:12
msgid ""
"What may cross is a **compile-time property of the surface**. A violation is a compile error on the declaration or binding — never a call-time failure."
msgstr "什么可以跨越，是**表面的编译期属性**。违例是声明或绑定上的编译错误——绝不是调用时的失败。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:15
msgid ""
"**Parameters** cross over: the primitives (`i8`–`i64`, `u8`–`u64`, `f32`, `f64`, `bool`), `str`, `bytes`, and `opaque`."
msgstr ""
"**参数**可以跨越：基本类型（`i8`–`i64`、`u8`–`u64`、`f32`、`f64`、`bool`）、`str`、`bytes` 和 `opaque`。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:17
msgid ""
"**Returns** cross over the same set **plus** the answer optionals `?str`, `?bytes`, `?opaque`."
msgstr "**返回值**可以跨越同一集合**外加**应答可空类型 `?str`、`?bytes`、`?opaque`。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:19
msgid "Tuples cross field-by-field; each field must itself cross."
msgstr "元组逐字段跨越；每个字段自身必须可跨越。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:20
msgid ""
"Entry fns follow the same rule in both directions: `?T` crosses iff `T` crosses, decoded nil-flattened."
msgstr "入口 fn 在两个方向遵循同一规则：`?T` 可跨越当且仅当 `T` 可跨越，解码时 nil 展平。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:22
msgid ""
"Everything else — dataclasses, classes, `Vec<T>`, `[T]`, trait-typed values, closures — stays inside the VM. Seal polymorphic values in the erasure box: `opaque(v)` at the call, `opaque.downcast<T>(v)` after ([opaque — erasure and downcast](opaque.md))."
msgstr ""
"其余一切——dataclass、类、`Vec<T>`、`[T]`、trait 类型的值、闭包——都留在 VM 内部。把多态的值封进擦除盒：调用时 `opaque(v)`，调用后 `opaque.downcast<T>(v)`（[opaque —— 擦除与向下转型](opaque.md)）。"


