#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:52
msgid "Borrows and copies"
msgstr "借用与复制"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:54
msgid ""
"`&str`/`&[u8]` params read the block store directly. The handler bound is higher-ranked over the borrow's lifetime, so a borrowed param **cannot outlive its call** — smuggling one out is a type error, not a runtime check. Owned `String`/`Vec<u8>` params are the explicit \"I keep this data\" copy."
msgstr ""
"`&str`/`&[u8]` 参数直接读取块存储。处理器 bound 相对借用的生命周期是高阶的，因此被借用的参数**不可能活得比它的调用更久**——把它偷带出去是类型错误，而不是运行时检查。持有的 `String`/`Vec<u8>` 参数则是明示的\"我要留下这份数据\"式复制。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:60
msgid "Borrow guards, the whole rule:"
msgstr "借用守卫，完整规则："


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:62
msgid ""
"A borrow is **call-scoped**. The Rust lifetime prevents storing it past return; the object's guard flag additionally excludes conflicting access."
msgstr "借用以**调用为作用域**。Rust 生命周期阻止把它存到返回之后；对象的守卫标志还额外排除冲突的访问。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:64
msgid ""
"While an exclusive borrow is held, a re-entrant `vm.call` that touches the same box traps `borrowed by an outer host call` instead of aliasing."
msgstr ""
"独占借用被持有期间，触碰同一个盒的重入 `vm.call` 会触发 `borrowed by an outer host call` 陷阱，而不是产生别名。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:66
msgid "Shared borrows stack; an active exclusive borrow excludes them."
msgstr "共享借用可以叠加；活跃的独占借用排除它们。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:67
msgid "Guards clear on return. To keep data, the host copies."
msgstr "守卫在返回时清除。想留下数据，宿主就复制。"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:69
msgid "The two-channel law"
msgstr "双通道法则"


#: src/reference/value-boundary.md:71
msgid ""
"A rut entry typed `-> (?T, err)` decodes positionally as `(Option<T>, String)` — or generically as `Value::Tuple([Nil|payload, Str(err)])`:"
msgstr ""
