"**结构化读取**——要对任意记录做反射（字段名、类型、按索引的子节点），使用反射表面（[反射](reflection.md)）。它基于描述符且只读；它从不暴露原始内存。"


#: src/reference/repr-c.md:50
msgid "Why there is no shared-layout contract"
msgstr "为什么没有共享布局契约"


#: src/reference/repr-c.md:52
msgid ""
"The boundary's crossing set is deliberately scalars, immutable buffers, and `opaque` handles; a borrowed user structure with host-writable fields would reintroduce aliasing the borrow guards exist to prevent."
msgstr "边界的跨越集合刻意只含标量、不可变缓冲区和 `opaque` 句柄；一个带宿主可写字段的、被借用的用户结构会重新引入借用守卫本为防止的别名。"


#: src/reference/repr-c.md:55
msgid ""
"Records are shared cells, not values: two bindings alias one record, so a `&mut` C view would race with rut-side mutation."
msgstr "记录是共享单元，不是值：两个绑定别名同一个记录，因此 `&mut` 的 C 视图会与 rut 侧的变更竞争。"


#: src/reference/repr-c.md:57
msgid ""
"Layout stability belongs to the module binary and its type table ([module binary and verification](module-binary.md)) — a compile-checked, versioned artifact — not to a C header."
msgstr ""
"布局的稳定性属于模块二进制及其类型表（[模块二进制与校验](module-binary.md)）——一个经编译检查、带版本的产物——而不是 C 头文件。"


#: src/reference/repr-c.md:61
msgid "Record values at the boundary"
msgstr "边界处的记录值"


#: src/reference/repr-c.md:63
