msgstr ""
"`extern` 不存在：rut→rut 的名字经由 use 路径解析（[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)）；host→rut 的入口点是 `entry fn`（[加载与嵌入循环](loading.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:14
msgid ""
"Surfaces live in **declaration files** — `.d.rut` — so compiling rut code never requires any Rust, and a published package can ship its compiled bodies plus a hand-written surface."
msgstr ""
"表面住在**声明文件**里——`.d.rut`——因此编译 rut 代码从不需要任何 Rust，而已发布的包可以随编译好的函数体一起交付一份手写的表面。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:18
msgid "Host pkgs"
msgstr "宿主包"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:20
msgid ""
"A package directory whose manifest declares `type = \"host\"` is a **host pkg** — pure surface, no rut source:"
msgstr "清单里声明了 `type = \"host\"` 的包目录就是一个**宿主包**——纯表面，没有 rut 源码："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:23
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"// server/rut.jsonc\n"
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"server\",\n"
"  \"type\": \"host\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"type\": \"./server.d.rut\" }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:32
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"// server/server.d.rut\n"
"pub host fn subscribe(bus: opaque, topic: str, handler: str) -> nil;\n"
"pub host fn emit(bus: opaque, topic: str, payload: str) -> nil;\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"// server/server.d.rut\n"
"pub host fn subscribe(bus: opaque, topic: str, handler: str) -> nil;\n"
"pub host fn emit(bus: opaque, topic: str, payload: str) -> nil;\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:38
msgid "Consumers reach a host pkg two ways:"
msgstr "消费方以两种方式抵达一个宿主包："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:40
msgid ""
"declared in the manifest's `deps` ([project structure](project-structure.md), [dependency kinds](dependency-kinds.md)); resolution is recursive, **first mount wins**;"
msgstr ""
"声明在清单的 `deps` 里（[项目结构](project-structure.md)、[依赖种类](dependency-kinds.md)）；解析是递归的，**先挂载者胜**；"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:43
msgid ""
"mounted programmatically: `rut_driver::mount_dir(&mut session, dir)` ([embedding and native modules](embedding.md))."
msgstr ""
"以编程方式挂载：`rut_driver::mount_dir(&mut session, dir)`（[嵌入与原生模块](embedding.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:46
msgid ""
"The loader lowers the declared signatures into the mounted surface at load time; the compiler type-checks calls against them. A host pkg packs into a `.rutbundle` like any dep ([module bundles](bundles.md))."
msgstr ""
"加载器在加载时把声明的签名下降进已挂载的表面；编译器对照它们对调用做类型检查。宿主包和任何依赖一样能打包进 `.rutbundle`（[模块捆绑包](bundles.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:50
msgid "The surface grammar"
msgstr "表面文法"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:52
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"host fn name(params) -> T;            // concrete signature; generics are a\n"
"                                      // compile error — a generic parameter\n"
"                                      // has no shape the boundary checks\n"
"host struct Name { fields }           // flat record; every field a crossing\n"
"                                      // type; no methods, no field\n"
"                                      // initializers — the shape IS the\n"
"                                      // whole surface\n"
"prelude builtin fn name<T>(params) -> T;   // engine fn, compiler-lowered\n"
"prelude builtin class Name<T> { .. }       // engine type member contract\n"
"prelude builtin trait Name<T> { .. }       // engine-woven contract\n"
"prelude builtin impl i32 { .. }            // engine methods on a primitive\n"
"pub builtin trait Name<T> { .. }           // the import-gated twin (below)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"host fn name(params) -> T;            // concrete signature; generics are a\n"
"                                      // compile error — a generic parameter\n"
"                                      // has no shape the boundary checks\n"
"host struct Name { fields }           // flat record; every field a crossing\n"
"                                      // type; no methods, no field\n"
"                                      // initializers — the shape IS the\n"
"                                      // whole surface\n"
"prelude builtin fn name<T>(params) -> T;   // engine fn, compiler-lowered\n"
"prelude builtin class Name<T> { .. }       // engine type member contract\n"
"prelude builtin trait Name<T> { .. }       // engine-woven contract\n"
"prelude builtin impl i32 { .. }            // engine methods on a primitive\n"
"pub builtin trait Name<T> { .. }           // the import-gated twin (below)\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:69
msgid ""
"**The crossing set** — `host fn` signatures are concrete over: nil, the primitives, `str`, `bytes`, `opaque`, tuples/`?T` whose elements cross, and `host struct` records whose fields all cross. Returns may additionally use the answer optionals `?str` / `?bytes` / `?opaque`. Everything else (user classes, `Vec<T>`, `[T]`, trait objects, closures) is a compile error on the declaration ([value boundary](value-boundary.md))."
msgstr ""
"**跨越集合**——`host fn` 签名在以下类型上是具体的：nil、基本类型、`str`、`bytes`、`opaque`、元素可跨越的元组/`?T`，以及字段全部可跨越的 `host struct` 记录。返回值还可以使用应答可空类型 `?str` / `?bytes` / `?opaque`。其余一切（用户类、`Vec<T>`、`[T]`、trait 对象、闭包）都是声明上的编译错误（[值边界](value-boundary.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:76
msgid ""
"**`any` is not in the language.** The word is no longer reserved — an `any` spelling now fails at resolution as an unknown type — but there is no `any` type to write. Seal polymorphic values with `opaque(v)` / `opaque.downcast<T>(v)` ([opaque](opaque.md))."
msgstr ""
"**`any` 不在这门语言里。**这个词已不再是保留字 —— 写出 `any` 现在会在名称解析阶段以未知类型失败 —— 但也不存在可写的 `any` 类型。用 `opaque(v)` / `opaque.downcast<T>(v)` 封存多态值（[opaque](opaque.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:80
msgid ""
"**`builtin` is the engine's reservation** — spelled only in the toolchain's own decl files (`core`, `calc`). A `builtin` in an embedder decl is a compile error. Users implement builtin traits with ordinary `impl` blocks; library contracts stay plain `trait` ([traits and dispatch](traits.md))."
msgstr ""
"**`builtin` 是引擎的保留**——只出现在工具链自己的声明文件里（`core`、`calc`）。嵌入方声明中的 `builtin` 是编译错误。用户用普通的 `impl` 块实现 builtin trait；库契约保持为普通的 `trait`（[trait 与分派](traits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:85
msgid ""
"**`builtin` is a contextual keyword**: `.d.rut`\\-only; elsewhere it is a legal identifier."
msgstr "**`builtin` 是一个上下文关键字**：仅限 `.d.rut`；在其他地方它是合法的标识符。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:88
msgid "The two builtin spellings"
msgstr "两种内建拼写"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:90
msgid ""
"A `builtin` decl spells one of two strict forms — a bare `builtin` diagnoses _\"`builtin` must be spelled `prelude builtin` (ambient) or `pub builtin` (import-gated)\"_:"
msgstr ""
"`builtin` 声明拼写成两种严格形式之一——裸写 `builtin` 会得到诊断 _“`builtin` must be spelled `prelude builtin` (ambient) or `pub builtin` (import-gated)”_："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:94
msgid ""
"**`prelude builtin`** — the **ambient** engine surface: the name binds in every compilation unit, no `use` needed. The primitives and their `builtin impl` methods, `opaque`, `Weak`, `StackTrace`, and `panic`/`string_join`/ `capture_stacktrace` are all ambient."
msgstr ""
"**`prelude builtin`**——**环境自带**的引擎表面：名字在每个编译单元绑定，无需 `use`。基本类型及其 `builtin impl` 方法、`opaque`、`Weak`、`StackTrace`，以及 `panic`/`string_join`/`capture_stacktrace`，全是环境自带。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:99
msgid ""
"**`pub builtin`** — the **import-gated** engine surface: the name resolves only through `use core::{ .. }`, the way a package's names do. Today's rows are every builtin trait — `Iterator`, `Future`, `RunContext` — and the disposal pair, `Disposal` and `DisposalContext` ([traits](traits.md), [async and await](async.md), [the Rc heap](rc-heap.md)). The engine's weave never consults the gate — it keys on the native-trait symbols — so a module with no imports still iterates, awaits, and launches; only spelling a name in source gates."
msgstr ""
"**`pub builtin`**——**导入把守**的引擎表面：名字只能经 `use core::{ .. }` 解析，与包名的方式一样。如今的行是每个内置 trait——`Iterator`、`Future`、`RunContext`——以及单元死亡对 `Disposal` 与 `DisposalContext`（[trait](traits.md)、[异步与 await](async.md)、[Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)）。引擎的织造从不查阅这道门——它以原生 trait 符号为键——因此一个没有任何导入的模块仍然可以迭代、await 与启动；把守只落在源码里拼写的名字上。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:109
msgid ""
"Using a `pub builtin` name without the use line is a resolution miss that names the fix, never a bare \"unknown name\":"
msgstr "不写 use 行就使用 `pub builtin` 名字，是一次会说出修法的解析失败，绝不是一句光秃秃的“unknown name”："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:116
msgid ""
"The split is per name: a unit that imports one gated name still sees every ambient name for free, and an unused name in a `use core` line stays a lint, not an error."
msgstr ""
"这个划分按名字进行：导入了一个被把守名字的单元依然免费看到每个环境自带名字，而 `use core` 行里未被使用的名字仍然只是一个 lint，不是错误。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:120
msgid ""
"**`opaque` wraps native state; there is no host class.** rut wraps the handle in a class of its own — the wrapper-class pattern ([native containers API surface](native-containers.md)). Destructors still run deterministically: when a box's rc hits 0, the payload's finalize hook runs, then Rust `Drop` ([the Rc heap](rc-heap.md))."
msgstr ""
"**`opaque` 包装原生状态；没有宿主类。**rut 把句柄包装在自己的类里——包装类模式（[原生容器 API 表面](native-containers.md)）。析构器依然确定性地运行：当一个盒的 rc 降到 0，先运行载荷的 finalize 钩子，然后是 Rust `Drop`（[Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:125
msgid ""
"**Workers**: an `opaque` box crosses isolates only if the host registered the boxed type as `send` — checked at the transfer, by type ([workers and channels](workers-and-channels.md))."
msgstr ""
"**worker**：`opaque` 盒只有在宿主把被装盒的类型注册为 `send` 时才能跨越隔离体——在转移时按类型检查（[worker 与通道](workers-and-channels.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:129 src/reference/frontend.md:158
#: src/reference/cli.md:159
msgid "Declaration mode"
msgstr "声明模式"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:131
msgid ""
"A `.d.rut` is parsed in **declaration mode**: declarations only, each complete as a surface."
msgstr "`.d.rut` 以**声明模式**解析：只有声明，每个声明都自身完整地成为一个表面。"


