"visibility exactly as in a module; non-exported decls are known inside the file, nameable nowhere else"
msgstr "可见性与模块中完全一致；未导出的声明在文件内可知，在其他任何地方都不可提名"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:137
msgid "with load-time constant initializers"
msgstr "带加载期常量初始化器"


