msgstr "仅限工具链的声明文件——上面的两种拼写"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:144
msgid ""
"Forbidden — the parser errors _\"implementation in a declaration file\"_: any fn/class body, statements. Symmetrically, a `.rut` file that spells `host` errors _\"belongs in a `.d.rut`\"_."
msgstr ""
"禁止——解析器报错 _\"implementation in a declaration file\"_：任何 fn/类函数体、语句都是。对称地，写出 `host` 的 `.rut` 文件会报错 _\"belongs in a `.d.rut`\"_。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:148
msgid "Signatures are derived, not hand-written"
msgstr "签名是推导的，不是手写的"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:150
msgid ""
"The registered callable's Rust shape **is** the `.d.rut` row. The **installer lane** is a `HostPkg` builder per pkg — rows under bare names, the scope (the pkg's name) spelled once — installed through `HostRegistry::install_host_pkg`:"
msgstr ""
"注册可调用物的 Rust 形状**就是** `.d.rut` 行。**安装者车道**是每包一个 `HostPkg` 构建器——行用裸名，作用域（即包名）只拼写一次——经 `HostRegistry::install_host_pkg` 安装："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:156
msgid ""
"// one builder per host pkg; the scope string appears exactly once\n"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:158
msgid "\"make\""
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:162
msgid ""
"// the session's mount snapshot — built once, owned, shared by every install\n"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:169
msgid ""
"`pkg_async_fn!` is the async twin: one row spelling emits the five-row family (`__start`/`__yield`/`__take`/`__cancel` + the decl-row trap), the same expansion the ctx declares. The raw macros — `register!` / `register_async!` on the bare registry (see [embedding and native modules](embedding.md)) — remain the escape hatch (hand-spelled `<scope>::<name>` strings, the flat table's own responsibility); everything above them is the same derived-signature machinery:"
msgstr ""
"`pkg_async_fn!` 是异步孪生：一次行拼写发射五行家族（`__start`/`__yield`/`__take`/`__cancel` + 声明行陷阱），与 ctx 声明的展开相同。原生宏——裸注册表上的 `register!` / `register_async!`（见[嵌入与原生模块](embedding.md)）——仍是逃生口（手写 `<scope>::<name>` 字符串，扁平表自己负责）；它们之上的一切都是同一套派生签名机制："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:181
msgid "\"server::make\""
msgstr "\"server::make\""


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:185
msgid ""
"The signature is a fixed array of type ids derived from the closure's parameter and return types; a param type with no crossing impl is a **compile error at the register site**."
msgstr "签名是从闭包的参数与返回类型推导出的一个固定类型 id 数组；没有跨越 impl 的参数类型是**注册点的编译错误**。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:188
msgid ""
"Both body shapes fit: `-> R` (infallible) and `-> Result<R, Trap>` (fallible). Errors travel an explicit trap channel — a trapped body propagates as `Err(Trap)` with a rut backtrace ([embedding and native modules](embedding.md))."
msgstr ""
"两种函数体形状都适用：`-> R`（不会失败）与 `-> Result<R, Trap>`（可能失败）。错误走一条显式的陷阱通道——被陷阱打断的函数体以 `Err(Trap)` 连同 rut 回溯传播（[嵌入与原生模块](embedding.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:192
msgid ""
"`&str` / `&[u8]` params are zero-copy borrows scoped to exactly the call ([value boundary](value-boundary.md))."
msgstr "`&str` / `&[u8]` 参数是以恰好这一次调用为作用域的零复制借用（[值边界](value-boundary.md)）。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:194
msgid ""
"One installer per pkg: a duplicate row name inside a builder panics, a second `install_host_pkg` for the same scope panics, and a pkg cannot spell another pkg's rows — the scope comes solely from `HostPkg::new`."
msgstr ""
"每包一个安装者：构建器内重复的行名会 panic，对同一作用域第二次 `install_host_pkg` 会 panic，且一个包不能拼写另一个包的行——作用域只来自 `HostPkg::new`。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:199
msgid "The load-time contract — asymmetric, by design"
msgstr "加载期契约——非对称，有意为之"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:201
msgid ""
"Mounting a host pkg **declares**; the embedding Rust **binds**. The `install_host_pkg` call checks the two sides against each other, per pkg, against the mount snapshot (`session.host_pkg_context()`):"
msgstr ""
"挂载宿主包是**声明**；嵌入的 Rust 是**绑定**。`install_host_pkg` 调用按包、对照挂载快照（`session.host_pkg_context()`）互查两侧："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:205
msgid ""
"**scope mounted, a declared row never bound** — a panic naming the pkg (the installer left it out), and the `Vm` constructor refuses a boot naming it again when the installer never ran at all;"
msgstr "**作用域已挂载，声明行从未绑定**——panic 并点名该包（安装者漏了它）；安装者从未运行时，`Vm` 构造器拒绝再次点名它的启动；"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:208
msgid ""
"**signature drift** on a declared row — a panic; this is the only drift gate on the boot path;"
msgstr "**已声明行上的签名漂移**——panic；这是启动路径上唯一的漂移门；"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:210
msgid ""
"**scope NOT mounted** — the whole pkg merges **inert**: no panic, no gate. Blanket installs are legal (the CLI installs all of them; a program that mounts a subset carries the rest as dead bindings), and rows the decl does not name ride as inert extras."
msgstr ""
"**作用域未挂载**——整个包按**惰性**合并：不 panic，无门。整表安装是合法的（CLI 就全部安装；只挂载子集的程序把其余行作为死绑定携带），声明未点名的行作为惰性额外物随行。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:215
msgid ""
"The raw lane's `verify_against(&ctx.flatten())` — or `session.expected_host_fns()` — re-checks the whole flat table and panics on all three mismatch classes:"
msgstr ""
"原生车道的 `verify_against(&ctx.flatten())`——或 `session.expected_host_fns()`——重查整张扁平表，对全部三类不匹配 panic："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:219
msgid "**declared but unbound** — a rut call would trap mid-run;"
msgstr "**已声明未绑定**——rut 调用会在运行中途触发陷阱；"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:220
msgid "**bound but undeclared** — no surface declares what the host installed;"
msgstr "**已绑定未声明**——没有任何表面声明宿主安装的东西；"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:221
msgid ""
"**signature drift** — the decl says `(opaque, str, str) -> nil`, the binding took `(opaque, i64, str)`."
msgstr "**签名漂移**——声明写的是 `(opaque, str, str) -> nil`，绑定收的却是 `(opaque, i64, str)`。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:224
msgid ""
"The law follows the mount: **mount what you bind** — with the asymmetry the mount law needs: rut-declares-but-host-never-binds is loud; host-binds-but-rut-never-declares rides inert."
msgstr ""
"法则随挂载：**绑定你所挂载的**——带着挂载法则需要的不对称：rut 声明了而宿主从不绑定，是响亮的错误；宿主绑定了而 rut 从未声明，按惰性随行。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:228
msgid "Slots, not strings"
msgstr "槽位，而不是字符串"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:230
msgid ""
"Compiling a declaration file assigns every host fn a **stable slot id** in declaration order; the module binary carries the slot table. Calls compile to `callnat { slot }` — names are binding-time labels, resolved once at boot, never dispatch keys, never in IR. A typo'd binding is a startup error, never a runtime one. IR cannot inline into native bodies; if a body should be optimizable, it is rut source — the wrapper class is exactly that place."
msgstr ""
"编译声明文件会按声明顺序给每个宿主函数分配一个**稳定槽位 id**；模块二进制携带槽位表。调用编译成 `callnat { slot }`——名字是绑定期的标签，启动时解析一次，绝不是分派键，也绝不出现在 IR 里。拼错的绑定是启动错误，绝不是运行时错误。IR 不能内联进原生函数体；如果某个函数体应当是可优化的，那它就该是 rut 源码——包装类正是那个地方。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:238
msgid "Async host fns"
msgstr "异步宿主函数"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:240
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"// http_host.d.rut — an async row expands into a five-row family\n"
"pub host async fn http_send(c: opaque, method: str, url: str,\n"
"                            headers: str, body: bytes) -> opaque;\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"// http_host.d.rut — an async row expands into a five-row family\n"
"pub host async fn http_send(c: opaque, method: str, url: str,\n"
"                            headers: str, body: bytes) -> opaque;\n"
"```"


