msgid ""
"The embedder binds the family with one spelling; the closure spawns the work, hands out a completer clone, and returns. On the installer lane the row names are bare and the scope prefixes at the install:"
msgstr "嵌入方用一次拼写绑定整个家族；闭包生成工作、交出 completer 克隆并返回。在安装者车道上行名是裸名，作用域在安装时加前缀："


