msgstr "仅限 VM 线程；`fail` 消息成为 `await` 处的陷阱"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:294
msgid ""
"Thread law: the VM stays single-threaded; workers touch only the completer. Cancellation is best-effort — a worker runs to its blocking completion and the late answer is discarded. See [the host futures bridge](host-futures.md) and [async and await](async.md)."
msgstr ""
"线程法则：VM 保持单线程；worker 只触碰 completer。取消是尽力而为的——worker 跑到它的阻塞式完成，迟到的答案被丢弃。见[宿主 future 桥](host-futures.md)与[异步与 await](async.md)。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:299
msgid "Declaration files as artifacts"
msgstr "作为产物的声明文件"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:301
msgid "A published package ships:"
msgstr "已发布的包交付："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:303
msgid "artifact"
msgstr "产物"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:303 src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:26
msgid "role"
msgstr "角色"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:305
msgid "`mod.rutc`"
msgstr "`mod.rutc`"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:305
msgid ""
"the compiled module binary: bodies + the surface, the linking truth ([module binary and verification](module-binary.md))"
msgstr "编译好的模块二进制：函数体 + 表面，链接的真相（[模块二进制与验证](module-binary.md)）"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:306
msgid "`mod.d.rut`"
msgstr "`mod.d.rut`"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:306
msgid ""
"the surface text — hand-written, editable, publishable (humans, LSP); documentation only, never the loader's source of truth"
msgstr "表面文本——手写、可编辑、可发布（面向人类与 LSP）；仅作文档，绝不是加载器的真相来源"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:308
msgid ""
"The surface rides the binary: a consumer binds `p`'s exports from `mod.rutc` alone. Nothing is rebuilt from `.d.rut` text — impl-to-fn ids, trait-table indices, and namespace/host rows are not derivable from text without guesswork."
msgstr ""
"表面随二进制同行：使用方仅凭 `mod.rutc` 就能绑定 `p` 的导出。没有任何东西会从 `.d.rut` 文本重建——impl 到 fn 的 id、trait 表索引、命名空间/宿主行，都无法靠猜测从文本推导。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:312
msgid ""
"Link compares the consumer's bound surface against the binary's export table — a pure data compare. Drift is a load error naming both modules, never a runtime surprise."
msgstr "链接把使用方绑定到的表面与二进制的导出表做比较——一次纯粹的数据比对。漂移是点出两个模块的加载错误，绝不会是运行时的惊吓。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:315
msgid ""
"Publishing is not encryption: bodies are compiled and local names are stripped (`--release` drops member-name strings), but code is recoverable with effort. What publishing guarantees is API discipline."
msgstr "发布不是加密：函数体被编译、本地名字被剥离（`--release` 丢弃成员名字符串），但花力气仍可复原代码。发布所保证的是 API 纪律。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:319
msgid "Surface resolution during compilation"
msgstr "编译期间的表面解析"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:321
msgid ""
"When module `M` uses package `p`, the compiler resolves `p`'s surface, first hit wins:"
msgstr "当模块 `M` 使用包 `p` 时，编译器解析 `p` 的表面，先命中者胜："


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:324
msgid "**source** — `p`'s rut source on the source path: compile it normally;"
msgstr "**source**——源码路径上 `p` 的 rut 源码：正常编译它；"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:325
msgid ""
"**bundle** — a mounted `.rutbundle`: its compiled `.rutc` (bodies + surface on the wire) — or its bundled source for a splice-needed group; explicit mounts outrank stray sources, never dev source;"
msgstr ""
"**捆绑包**——一个已挂载的 `.rutbundle`：它编译好的 `.rutc`（函数体 + 线上的表面）——需要拼接的组则是它随包的源码；显式挂载压过散落的源码，但绝不压过开发源码；"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:328
msgid ""
"**host registry** — for host pkgs, the `.d.rut` the embedder ships beside the registered implementation."
msgstr "**host registry**——对宿主包而言，嵌入方随注册实现一起交付的那份 `.d.rut`。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:331
msgid ""
"Bodies resolve only at link/run. Compiling `M` against a package whose implementation is absent is legal and complete — checking passes; only running requires the bodies."
msgstr "函数体只在链接/运行时解析。针对一个实现缺席的包编译 `M` 是合法且完整的——检查通过；只有运行才需要函数体。"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:335
msgid "End-to-end shape"
msgstr "端到端形状"


#: src/reference/host-fns.md:337
msgid ""
"The chat-bus plugin is the canonical walkthrough: a Rust server binds `server::subscribe`/`server::emit` over its own `EventBus` box, the plugin subscribes rut export names per topic, and every `emit` re-enters rut to format the wire line — see [03 — Plugin](../examples/03-plugin.md). For a full application host with mounted std packages and an async entry, see [06 — GitHub viewer CLI](../examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md)."
msgstr ""
"聊天总线插件是规范的完整演练：一个 Rust 服务器在自己 `EventBus` 盒之上绑定 `server::subscribe`/`server::emit`，插件按主题订阅 rut 导出名，而每次 `emit` 都重入 rut 来格式化线上报文——见 [03 — 插件](../examples/03-plugin.md)。要看一个挂载了标准包、带异步入口的完整应用宿主，见 [06 — GitHub 查看器 CLI](../examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md)。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:3
msgid ""
"A \"native container\" is host state rut can hold: a Rust value boxed as an `opaque` handle, with a set of **host fns** as its API and a **wrapper class** on the rut side. No second class system, no per-instantiation machinery: the declaration is host fns with concrete signatures over `opaque` ([host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md)), and the wrapper is ordinary rut source the compiler can optimize around."
msgstr ""
"\"原生容器\"是 rut 能持有的宿主状态：一个装盒成 `opaque` 句柄的 Rust 值，以一组**宿主函数**作为它的 API，rut 侧则配一个**包装类**。没有第二套类系统，没有逐实例化的机器：声明就是在 `opaque` 之上带具体签名的宿主函数（[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)），而包装就是编译器可以围绕它做优化的普通 rut 源码。"


