msgstr "**链接**"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:88
msgid "boot"
msgstr "启动"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:88
msgid ""
"every host fn referenced by rut code has a bound, signature-equal impl — a pure data compare ([host fns](host-fns.md))."
msgstr "rut 代码引用的每个宿主函数都有绑定的、签名相等的 impl——一次纯粹的数据比较（[宿主函数](host-fns.md)）。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:88
msgid "loader / embedder"
msgstr "加载器 / 嵌入方"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:90
msgid ""
"A name bound that no decl declares is an embedder startup error (typo guard). Drift between the halves never reaches a rut runtime."
msgstr "绑定了一个没有任何声明宣布的名字，是嵌入方的启动错误（防拼写错误护栏）。两半之间的漂移永远不会抵达 rut 运行时。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:93
msgid "What crosses"
msgstr "什么可以跨越"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:95
msgid ""
"The crossing rule is the whole story ([value boundary](value-boundary.md)): primitives, `str` (hashed host-side by **content**), `bytes`, tuples and `?T` over those, and `opaque`. Map **values** cross as `opaque` — `set` stores the box unopened, `get` hands it back. Nothing native re-enters the VM through a vtable, and no native signature has a type parameter."
msgstr ""
"跨越规则就是全部故事（[值边界](value-boundary.md)）：基本类型、`str`（由宿主按**内容**哈希）、`bytes`、其上的元组与 `?T`，以及 `opaque`。映射的**值**以 `opaque` 跨越——`set` 不打开盒子直接存入，`get` 原样交回。没有任何原生代码经由 vtable 重入 VM，也没有任何原生签名带类型参数。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:101
msgid "The typed box view"
msgstr "带类型的盒视图"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:105
msgid "mint a box; shallow `size_of::<T>()` charged to the heap budget"
msgstr "铸造一个盒；浅层 `size_of::<T>()` 记入堆预算"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:106
msgid "opt the payload into a `finalize(heap)` release hook"
msgstr "让载荷选择加入 `finalize(heap)` 释放钩子"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:107
msgid "the checked view; a wrong payload `T` traps naming both sides"
msgstr "经过检查的视图；载荷 `T` 不符时触发陷阱并点名双方"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:108
msgid "shared borrow; nested `with`s stack"
msgstr "共享借用；嵌套的 `with` 可以叠加"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:109
msgid ""
"exclusive borrow; a re-entrant call touching the same box traps `borrowed by an outer host call`"
msgstr "独占借用；触碰同一个盒的重入调用触发 `borrowed by an outer host call` 陷阱"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:110
msgid "the erased `OpaqueRef` to hand back to rut"
msgstr "交还给 rut 的被擦除 `OpaqueRef`"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:112
msgid ""
"Guards live on the store entry and clear on return; to keep data, copy ([value boundary](value-boundary.md))."
msgstr "守卫位于存储表项上，返回时清除；想留下数据就复制（[值边界](value-boundary.md)）。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:117
msgid ""
"**Hashing**: `str` keys hash by content — a registered builtin impl. Structured keys are the rut wrapper's business (stringify, or a wrapper defined strategy); no user hashing contract crosses."
msgstr ""
"**哈希**：`str` 键按内容哈希——一个注册的 builtin impl。结构化键是 rut 包装类的事务（stringify，或由包装类定义的策略）；没有任何用户哈希契约跨越。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:120
msgid ""
"**Containers do not cross**: `Vec`/`[T]` stay inside the VM. Iterate via per-element fns, keep the index rut-side, or pack into `bytes`."
msgstr "**容器不跨越**：`Vec`/`[T]` 留在 VM 内部。经由逐元素函数迭代，把索引留在 rut 侧，或打包进 `bytes`。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:122
msgid ""
"**Builtin answers flow back natively**: a fn may return an optional built host-side (`?str`/`?bytes`/`?opaque` answer lanes); rut cannot tell it was not written in rut."
msgstr ""
"**内建应答原生地流回**：函数可以返回一个在宿主侧构建的可空值（`?str`/`?bytes`/`?opaque` 应答链路）；rut 无法分辨它不是用 rut 写的。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:125
msgid ""
"**Memory**: the instance lives in the box; at rc-0 the payload's `finalize` hook runs first, then Rust `Drop` — dropping the container releases every stored handle deterministically, with no collector involvement ([the Rc heap](rc-heap.md)). An `OpaqueRef`'s own `Drop` releases its reference; dropping a stored handle is the release."
msgstr ""
"**内存**：实例住在盒里；rc 降到 0 时，先运行载荷的 `finalize` 钩子，然后是 Rust `Drop`——drop 容器会确定性地释放每一个存入的句柄，无需收集器参与（[Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)）。`OpaqueRef` 自己的 `Drop` 释放它持有的引用；释放存入的句柄，就是释放本身。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:131
msgid "In-tree consumers"
msgstr "树内消费方"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:133
msgid ""
"**the logger** — `ink_host`'s two host fns behind `ink`'s `Logger` wrapper class ([core and the swappable packages](stdlib.md))."
msgstr ""
"**logger**——`ink_host` 的两个宿主函数藏在 `ink` 的 `Logger` 包装类之后（[核心与可换装包](stdlib.md)）。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:135
msgid ""
"**`nmapset`** — `HashMap`/`HashSet` over a native key table: every method is one host call, keys are the closed typed set, values are sealed boxes, and each key carries a stable host-side handle ([core and the swappable packages](stdlib.md))."
msgstr ""
"**`nmapset`**——架在原生键表之上的 `HashMap`/`HashSet`：每个方法一次宿主调用，键是封闭的类型化集合，值是封存的盒，每个键携带一个稳定的宿主侧句柄（[core 与可换包](stdlib.md)）。"


#: src/reference/native-containers.md:139
msgid ""
"**`json`**'s peer-gated container impls ride the same packages from the rut side ([core and the swappable packages](stdlib.md))."
msgstr "**`json`** 的 peer 门控容器 impl 从 rut 侧搭载同样的包（[core 与可换包](stdlib.md)）。"


#: src/reference/templates.md:3
msgid ""
"Status: this page specifies the template surface; it is not yet wired into the engine. The format-literal behavior it extends is live ([literals and inference](literals-and-inference.md))."
msgstr ""
"状态：本页规定的是模板表面；它尚未接入引擎。它所扩展的格式化字面量行为已可用（[字面量与推断](literals-and-inference.md)）。"


#: src/reference/templates.md:7
msgid ""
"A format literal normally renders to a `str` at the call site — it desugars to a string concatenation, and the structure of the interpolated values is gone. Hosts that need the **structure** — localization, structured logging, analytics — must not re-parse strings."
msgstr ""
"格式化字面量通常在调用点渲染成一个 `str`——它脱糖为字符串拼接，插值的结构随即消失。需要**结构**的宿主——本地化、结构化日志、分析——绝不该重新解析字符串。"


#: src/reference/templates.md:12
msgid ""
"`Template` is the answer: a builtin value type built **only** by format literals, chosen by expected type."
msgstr "`Template` 就是答案：一个**只**由格式化字面量构建的内建值类型，由期望类型选择。"


#: src/reference/templates.md:15
msgid "One literal, two behaviors"
msgstr "一个字面量，两种行为"


#: src/reference/templates.md:17
msgid "expected type"
msgstr "期望类型"


#: src/reference/templates.md:19
msgid ""
"the ordinary desugaring to concatenation — zero new cost on the hot path, output identical to the plain formatting path"
msgstr "普通的脱糖为拼接——热路径上零新增开销，输出与普通格式化路径完全一致"


#: src/reference/templates.md:20
msgid ""
"the literal compiles to a **template construction**: literal chunks and boxed values, not pre-rendered text"
msgstr "字面量编译成一次**模板构建**：字面量块与装盒的值，而不是预先渲染好的文本"


#: src/reference/templates.md:22
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"pub host fn label(t: Template) -> nil;      // a host fn taking structure\n"
"\n"
"fn work(name: str, n: i32) -> nil {\n"
"    let s = f\"hi {name}, n={n}\";            // str position: rendered text\n"
"    let t: Template = f\"hi {name}, n={n}\";  // Template position: structure\n"
"    label(t);\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"pub host fn label(t: Template) -> nil;      // a host fn taking structure\n"
"\n"
"fn work(name: str, n: i32) -> nil {\n"
"    let s = f\"hi {name}, n={n}\";            // str position: rendered text\n"
"    let t: Template = f\"hi {name}, n={n}\";  // Template position: structure\n"
"    label(t);\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/templates.md:32
msgid "The value"
msgstr "这个值"


#: src/reference/templates.md:34
msgid ""
"A `Template` is `{ parts: [str], args: [opaque] }` — the literal chunks, and the interpolated values **boxed with their runtime types** through the erasure box ([opaque — erasure and downcast](opaque.md)). Construction is an internal native call; there is no user-spellable constructor and no other way to mint one."
msgstr ""
"一个 `Template` 就是 `{ parts: [str], args: [opaque] }`——字面量块，以及**连同运行时类型一起装盒**、穿过擦除盒的插值（[opaque —— 擦除与向下转型](opaque.md)）。构建是一次内部原生调用；没有用户可书写的构造器，也没有铸造它的其他方式。"


#: src/reference/templates.md:42
msgid "`t.str() -> str`"
msgstr "`t.str() -> str`"


#: src/reference/templates.md:42
msgid "render with rut's own formatting rules — byte-identical to the `str` path"
msgstr "用 rut 自己的格式化规则渲染——与 `str` 路径逐字节一致"


#: src/reference/templates.md:43
msgid "`t.parts() -> [str]`"
msgstr "`t.parts() -> [str]`"


#: src/reference/templates.md:43
msgid "the literal chunks"
msgstr "字面量块"


#: src/reference/templates.md:44
msgid "`t.args() -> [opaque]`"
msgstr "`t.args() -> [opaque]`"


#: src/reference/templates.md:44
msgid "the boxed arguments, in order"
msgstr "依次排列的装盒实参"


#: src/reference/templates.md:45
msgid "`t.type_id(i) -> u32`"
msgstr "`t.type_id(i) -> u32`"


#: src/reference/templates.md:45
msgid "argument `i`'s runtime type id"
msgstr "实参 `i` 的运行时类型 id"


#: src/reference/templates.md:47
msgid ""
"Nothing else. Like `opaque`, a template cannot do anything until someone renders it: recover an argument with `opaque.downcast<T>(a)` — `i64` stays `i64`, so locale decimal separators and number formats are the renderer's choice, never baked into a pre-rendered string."
msgstr ""
"仅此而已。和 `opaque` 一样，模板在有人渲染它之前什么也做不了：用 `opaque.downcast<T>(a)` 取回一个实参——`i64` 仍是 `i64`，因此本地化小数分隔符与数字格式都是渲染方的选择，绝不会预先烘焙进一个渲染好的字符串。"


#: src/reference/templates.md:52
msgid "At the boundary"
msgstr "在边界处"


#: src/reference/templates.md:54
msgid ""
"A `Template` parameter arrives as `{ parts, args }` — the chunks and the typed args:"
msgstr "`Template` 参数以 `{ parts, args }` 的形态抵达——那些块与带类型的实参："


#: src/reference/templates.md:58 src/reference/templates.md:84
msgid "\"app::label\""
msgstr "\"app::label\""


#: src/reference/templates.md:60
msgid ""
"// per-locale formatting: reorder placeholders, re-render numbers\n"
msgstr ""
"// per-locale formatting: reorder placeholders, re-render numbers\n"


#: src/reference/templates.md:66
msgid "Example: locale-aware rendering"
msgstr "示例：感知区域设置的渲染"


#: src/reference/templates.md:68
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"// app.d.rut\n"
"pub host fn label(t: Template) -> nil;\n"
"\n"
"pub fn checkout(item: str, price: f64, n: i32) -> nil {\n"
"    label(f\"{item}: {n} x {price}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"// app.d.rut\n"
"pub host fn label(t: Template) -> nil;\n"
"\n"
"pub fn checkout(item: str, price: f64, n: i32) -> nil {\n"
"    label(f\"{item}: {n} x {price}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/templates.md:77
msgid ""
"The literal in `label`'s argument position compiles to the template — parts `[\"\", \": \", \" x \", \"\"]`, args boxed in order. The host renders per locale: reorder the placeholders, format `price` with the locale's decimal separator, pluralize around the `n` arg — `i64`/`f64` arrive as typed values, so none of that is baked into a pre-rendered string:"
msgstr ""
"`label` 实参位置上的字面量编译成模板——parts `[\"\", \": \", \" x \", \"\"]`，实参按序装盒。宿主按区域设置渲染：重排占位符、按该区域的小数分隔符格式化 `price`、围绕 `n` 实参做复数处理——`i64`/`f64` 以带类型的值抵达，因此这一切都不会被烘焙进预先渲染的字符串："


#: src/reference/templates.md:87
msgid ""
"// emit chunk; if the locale grammar needs arg i, recover it:\n"
"            // let n: i64 = opaque.downcast-like read on the host side\n"
msgstr ""
"// emit chunk; if the locale grammar needs arg i, recover it:\n"
"            // let n: i64 = opaque.downcast-like read on the host side\n"


#: src/reference/templates.md:94
msgid "Laws"
msgstr "法则"


#: src/reference/templates.md:96
msgid ""
"The expected type chooses the behavior; a literal never renders \"twice\". The `str` path and `Template.str()` are byte-identical by construction."
msgstr "期望类型选择行为；字面量绝不会渲染\"两次\"。`str` 路径与 `Template.str()` 由构造保证逐字节一致。"


#: src/reference/templates.md:99
msgid ""
"Arguments are retained by the template's boxes; a template keeps its args alive as any cell does ([the Rc heap](rc-heap.md))."
msgstr "实参由模板的盒所保留；模板像任何单元一样让它的实参保持存活（[Rc 堆](rc-heap.md)）。"


#: src/reference/templates.md:101
msgid ""
"A `Template` crosses the host boundary, and crosses isolate channels like any builtin ([workers and channels](workers-and-channels.md)) — a worker may return one where the main VM expects `Template`."
msgstr ""
"`Template` 可以跨越宿主边界，也像任何内建类型一样跨越隔离体通道（[worker 与通道](workers-and-channels.md)）——在主 VM 期望 `Template` 的地方，worker 可以返回一个。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:3
msgid ""
"Reflection is a **trait**, not a keyword privilege. `Reflectable` is the mechanism protocol; compiler auto-implementations (dataclasses, enums) and builtin-impl registry entries (enums, records, `Vec`, `[T]`) fill it for the data world; classes opt in by hand with a **curated** view. Libraries layer contracts on top and take trait-object-typed consumers or bounded producers. Nothing in the language names a builtin; no strings are matched; nothing changes under `--release` stripping. Userland serde is the proving application."
msgstr ""
"反射是一个 **trait**，不是关键字特权。`Reflectable` 是机制协议；编译器自动实现（dataclass、枚举）与 builtin-impl 注册表条目（枚举、记录、`Vec`、`[T]`）为数据世界填上它；类则以**策展的**视图手工选择加入。库在其上分层叠加契约，接受 trait 对象类型的消费方或受约束的生产方。语言里没有任何东西指名某个内建类型；不匹配任何字符串；`--release` 剥离不改变任何东西。用户态 serde 是那个用来证明的应用。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:12
msgid ""
"Status: this page specifies the reflection surface; the protocols are not yet wired into the engine. The surfaces it builds on — traits, [opaque](opaque.md), reified descriptors ([reified types](reified-types.md)) — are live."
msgstr ""
"状态：本页规定的是反射表面；这些协议尚未接入引擎。它所依托的表面——trait、[opaque](opaque.md)、具体化描述符（[具体化类型](reified-types.md)）——已可用。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:17
msgid "The protocols"
msgstr "协议"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:19
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"// reflect/reflect.d.rut\n"
"pub trait Reflectable {                     // the mechanism protocol\n"
"    fn reflect(self) -> opaque;             // exact descriptor handle\n"
"    fn arity(self) -> i32;                  // children of THIS value\n"
"    fn child(self, i: i32) -> ?opaque;      // i-th child, boxed\n"
"}\n"
"pub trait Deserializable requires Reflectable { }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"// reflect/reflect.d.rut\n"
"pub trait Reflectable {                     // the mechanism protocol\n"
"    fn reflect(self) -> opaque;             // exact descriptor handle\n"
"    fn arity(self) -> i32;                  // children of THIS value\n"
"    fn child(self, i: i32) -> ?opaque;      // i-th child, boxed\n"
"}\n"
"pub trait Deserializable requires Reflectable { }\n"
"```"


