#: src/reference/reflection.md:92
msgid ""
"`FieldInfo`/`SumVariant` accessors over their own handles: `name: str`, `ty: TypeInfo` box, `default: ?opaque` (the folded load-time initializer — the parse-time default), payload ordinals (`[]` for C-like enums, `[T]`\\-shaped for `Some`/`None`/`Ok`/`Err`)."
msgstr ""
"`FieldInfo`/`SumVariant` 在各自句柄之上的访问器：`name: str`、`ty: TypeInfo` 盒、`default: ?opaque`（折叠后的加载期初始化器——解析期默认值）、载荷序数（C 风格枚举为 `[]`，`Some`/`None`/`Ok`/`Err` 为 `[T]` 形状）。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:99
msgid ""
"No builtin is named anywhere. `Option`/`Result` appear only as sum-shaped descriptors (`Some/None` is a `{0,1}` sum, `Ok/Err` a `{1,1}` sum; a C-like enum is an all-payloadless sum)."
msgstr ""
"任何地方都不指名内建类型。`Option`/`Result` 只以和类型形状的描述符出现（`Some/None` 是一个 `{0,1}` 和类型，`Ok/Err` 是一个 `{1,1}` 和类型；C 风格枚举是全无载荷的和类型）。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:102
msgid ""
"Composite children box the **cell handle** — a child of a record field _aliases_ the parent's field, so mutation through the original is observable in the box. Walkers treat them as their own Record/Sum nodes via the box's descriptor."
msgstr ""
"复合子节点装盒的是**单元句柄**——记录字段的子节点_别名_父级的字段，因此经由原件做出的变更在盒中可见。遍历器经由盒的描述符把它们当作自己的 Record/Sum 节点。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:106
msgid ""
"**Boxing widens**: an `opaque` of an int stores i64 sign/zero-extended; a float, f64. A `Leaf` branch + `downcast<i64>` / `downcast<f64>` / `downcast<bool>` / `downcast<str>` is therefore total ([opaque](opaque.md))."
msgstr ""
"**装盒即宽化**：整数的 `opaque` 以 i64 符号扩展/零扩展存储；浮点数则存为 f64。因此 `Leaf` 分支加 `downcast<i64>` / `downcast<f64>` / `downcast<bool>` / `downcast<str>` 是全函数（[opaque](opaque.md)）。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:110
msgid ""
"**No string identity**: field/variant names are descriptor data, never symbols — stripping native names never touches them. Sum policy dispatches on **payload structure**, never variant-name matching."
msgstr ""
"**没有字符串同一性**：字段/成员名字是描述符数据，绝不是符号——剥离原生名字从不触及它们。和类型策略依据**载荷结构**分派，绝不依据成员名字匹配。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:113
msgid ""
"Accessors are total; optional/`i32` results signal mismatch. There is no field setter: children alias their source cells, so v1 reflection is **read-only**."
msgstr "访问器是全函数；可空/`i32` 结果表示不匹配。没有字段 setter：子节点别名其源单元，因此 v1 反射是**只读**的。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:117
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "规则"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:119
msgid ""
"**Engine admission**: the structural symbols (`reflect<T>`, `type_of`, `TypeInfo`, `FieldInfo`, `SumVariant`) resolve only in modules declaring at least one `impl ReflectEngine for T`; the violation is a compile error naming the fix. Calling `stringify`/`deserialize` needs no engine — the argument type or the bound carries the contract. The `is` keyword is likewise ungated: it answers the capability bit, while descriptor _walking_ stays behind admission — probing and walking are different powers."
msgstr ""
"**引擎准入**：结构符号（`reflect<T>`、`type_of`、`TypeInfo`、`FieldInfo`、`SumVariant`）只在声明了至少一个 `impl ReflectEngine for T` 的模块中解析；违例是点名修复方式的编译错误。调用 `stringify`/`deserialize` 不需要引擎——实参类型或约束携带契约。`is` 关键字同样不受限：它回答能力位，而描述符_遍历_仍留在准入之后——探查与遍历是不同的权力。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:127
msgid ""
"**Walkability = implements the protocol** (auto, registry, or manual). Entries may demand a contract (`Serializable`) or a capability (an inline `requires Deserializable` bound on a generic — admission-only; it grants no method calls on bare `T`). Nested nodes are gated by the descriptor `is_a(Reflectable)` query; misses are value-shaped errors, never traps."
msgstr ""
"**可遍历 = 实现了协议**（自动、注册表或手工）。条目可以要求一个契约（`Serializable`）或一项能力（泛型上的内联 `requires Deserializable` 约束——仅管准入；它不授予对裸 `T` 的方法调用）。嵌套节点由描述符的 `is_a(Reflectable)` 查询把门；未命中是值形状的错误，绝不是陷阱。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:134
msgid "The walker"
msgstr "遍历器"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:136
msgid "Every call below exists in the tables above — this trace is the API's test:"
msgstr "下面每次调用都存在于上文的表格里——这条轨迹就是这个 API 的测试："


#: src/reference/reflection.md:139
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"pub fn stringify(v: Serializable) -> (str, err) {\n"
"    return write_val(v.reflect(), v);    // vtable reflect(); descends to opaque\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn deserialize<T requires Deserializable>(v: str) -> (?T, err) {\n"
"    let t = reflect<T>();                // guaranteed descriptor-backed by\n"
"    let (tree, e1) = parse_tree(v);      // the bound — no runtime pre-check\n"
"    if (e1 != nil) { return (nil, e1); }\n"
"    let (built, e2) = build(t, tree);\n"
"    if (e2 != nil) { return (nil, e2); }\n"
"    let opt = opaque.downcast<T>(built); // monomorphized type compare -> ?T\n"
"    if (opt == nil) { return (nil, construction_failed(t)); }\n"
"    return (opt, nil);                   // refined to exact T in this branch\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"pub fn stringify(v: Serializable) -> (str, err) {\n"
"    return write_val(v.reflect(), v);    // vtable reflect(); descends to opaque\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub fn deserialize<T requires Deserializable>(v: str) -> (?T, err) {\n"
"    let t = reflect<T>();                // guaranteed descriptor-backed by\n"
"    let (tree, e1) = parse_tree(v);      // the bound — no runtime pre-check\n"
"    if (e1 != nil) { return (nil, e1); }\n"
"    let (built, e2) = build(t, tree);\n"
"    if (e2 != nil) { return (nil, e2); }\n"
"    let opt = opaque.downcast<T>(built); // monomorphized type compare -> ?T\n"
"    if (opt == nil) { return (nil, construction_failed(t)); }\n"
"    return (opt, nil);                   // refined to exact T in this branch\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:156
msgid ""
"`write_val`: Record → fields + children joined; Seq → arity/child loop (`Vec` and `[T]` alike); Sum → all-payloadless renders the variant name, a `{0,1}` sum renders `null`/the payload, otherwise \"unwrap first\"; Leaf → downcast the widened scalars; a Leaf class → `is_a(Reflectable)` query, then the positional walk or an error. `build`: Record → member lookup, absent → the field's folded default, then `construct`; Sums → `construct_variant`; Seq → `make_vec`; Leaves → `opaque(v)`."
msgstr ""
"`write_val`：Record → 字段 + 子节点拼接；Seq → 元数/子节点循环（`Vec` 与 `[T]` 一视同仁）；Sum → 全无载荷的渲染成员名，`{0,1}` 和类型渲染 `null`/载荷，否则\"先拆包\"；Leaf → 向下转型被宽化的标量；Leaf 类 → `is_a(Reflectable)` 查询，然后按位置遍历或报错。`build`：Record → 成员查找，缺席 → 字段折叠后的默认值，然后 `construct`；Sum → `construct_variant`；Seq → `make_vec`；Leaf → `opaque(v)`。"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:164
msgid "Reflection vs the shipped `json`"
msgstr "反射与随树交付的 `json`"


#: src/reference/reflection.md:166
msgid ""
"The in-tree `json` package does **not** ride reflection — its traits are direct, nominal, and container impls live in the package itself, which measures decisively faster for schema-driven decode ([core and the swappable packages](stdlib.md)). Reflection is the right tool for generic tooling: debug walkers, schema printers, generic editors, and userland serde where flexibility outranks raw throughput."
msgstr ""
"树内的 `json` 包**不**搭载反射——它的 trait 是直接的、名义的，容器 impl 就住在包自己体内，这在模式驱动的解码上测得显著更快（[core 与可换包](stdlib.md)）。反射才是通用工具的正确之器：调试遍历器、模式打印器、通用编辑器，以及灵活性压过原始吞吐量的用户态 serde。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:3
msgid "The standard library splits in two:"
msgstr "标准库一分为二："


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:5
msgid ""
"**`core`** — the only standard. The prelude surface, uniformly engine-implemented: it registers **no** host bodies and needs no mount beyond the base one."
msgstr "**`core`**——唯一的标准。前奏表面，清一色由引擎实现：它注册**零**个宿主函数体，除基础挂载之外不需要任何挂载。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:8
msgid ""
"**the swappable packages** — in-tree rut/host packages that a module declares in its manifest `deps` ([project structure](project-structure.md)). The community may replace any of them wholesale; nothing in the engine knows their names."
msgstr ""
"**可换包**——模块在自己的清单 `deps` 里声明的树内 rut/宿主包（[项目结构](project-structure.md)）。社区可以整体替换其中任何一个；引擎里没有任何东西知道它们的名字。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:13
msgid ""
"Anything else — `gfx`, `imaging`, your own `my_map` — is an **embedder package**: a declaration file plus Rust bodies registered the same way ([embedding and native modules](embedding.md))."
msgstr ""
"其余的一切——`gfx`、`imaging`、你自己的 `my_map`——都是**嵌入方包**：一份声明文件加若干 Rust 函数体，以同样的方式注册（[嵌入与原生模块](embedding.md)）。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:17
msgid "core — the prelude surface"
msgstr "core——前奏表面"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:19
msgid ""
"The builtin fns, primitives, and containers are in scope in every compilation unit; no `use` is needed. A `use core::{ … };` statement stays legal but is redundant for them. The exceptions — the **import-gated** spellings, resolving only through `use core::{ .. }`: the const `NAN`, the `Disposal` pair (`Disposal`, `DisposalContext`), and every engine-woven trait (`Iterator`, `Future`, `RunContext`) — the engine's weave itself never needs the import, only source that spells the names (an `impl` block, a trait-typed signature, a `downcast<Future<..>>`). The two builtin spellings (ambient vs import-gated) are documented in [Host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md)."
msgstr ""
"内置函数、基本类型与容器在每个编译单元都在作用域内；无需 `use`。对它们而言 `use core::{ … };` 语句仍合法但多余。例外——**导入把守**的拼写，只能经 `use core::{ .. }` 解析：常量 `NAN`、`Disposal` 对（`Disposal`、`DisposalContext`），以及每个引擎织入的 trait（`Iterator`、`Future`、`RunContext`）——引擎的织造本身从不需要导入，需要它的是拼写了名字的源码（一个 `impl` 块、一个 trait 类型的签名、一个 `downcast<Future<..>>`）。两种内置拼写（环境自带 vs 导入把守）记录在[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)。"


