#: src/reference/stdlib.md:188
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"pub class HashMap<K requires i8 | i16 | i32 | i64 | u8 | u16 | u32 | u64 | bool | str | bytes, V> {\n"
"    pub fn new() -> Self;\n"
"    pub fn with_capacity(n: i32) -> Self;\n"
"    pub fn put(mut self, k: K, v: V) -> bool;      // true = newly inserted\n"
"    pub fn get(self, k: K) -> ?V;                  // the STORED cell, not a copy\n"
"    pub fn has(self, k: K) -> bool;\n"
"    pub fn remove(mut self, k: K) -> bool;\n"
"    pub fn len(self) -> i32;\n"
"}\n"
"pub class HashSet<T requires ..same key set..> { new, with_capacity, put, has, remove, len }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"pub class HashMap<K requires i8 | i16 | i32 | i64 | u8 | u16 | u32 | u64 | bool | str | bytes, V> {\n"
"    pub fn new() -> Self;\n"
"    pub fn with_capacity(n: i32) -> Self;\n"
"    pub fn put(mut self, k: K, v: V) -> bool;      // true = newly inserted\n"
"    pub fn get(self, k: K) -> ?V;                  // the STORED cell, not a copy\n"
"    pub fn has(self, k: K) -> bool;\n"
"    pub fn remove(mut self, k: K) -> bool;\n"
"    pub fn len(self) -> i32;\n"
"}\n"
"pub class HashSet<T requires ..same key set..> { new, with_capacity, put, has, remove, len }\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:201
msgid ""
"Laws: the key set is closed (no floats — no stable equality; encode a custom key canonically to `bytes`); `get` answers the stored cell, so two gets of one key name one value until a replace; values release host-side. `str` keys hash by content; `str` keys also carry `*_range(parent, off, len)` members keyed by a byte range of the parent string — a range key is the same key as its content, with no key cell minted on a probe ([string views](string-views.md))."
msgstr ""
"法则：键集合是封闭的（没有浮点数——没有稳定的相等契约；自定义键以规范编码成 `bytes` 的方式破例）；`get` 应答的是存储的单元，因此对同一个键的两次 get 在替换之前指名同一个值；值在宿主侧释放。`str` 键按内容哈希；`str` 键还携带以父串字节范围为键的 `*_range(parent, off, len)` 成员——范围键与其内容是同一个键，探查时不铸造任何键单元（[字符串视图](string-views.md)）。"


