"    log.info(f\"{d} {a} {hf}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:230
msgid ""
"Functions (each with an `_f` f32 twin): `sqrt`, `floor`, `ceil`, `round`, `trunc`, `exp`, `ln`, `log2`, `log10`, `sin`, `cos`, `tan`, `asin`, `acos`, `atan`, `sinh`, `cosh`, `tanh`, `pow`, `atan2`, `hypot`, `copysign`, `fma`, plus the float helpers `abs`, `min`, `max`, `signum`. Constants: `Math.PI`, `TAU`, `E`, `SQRT_2`, `LN_2`, `LN_10`, `LOG2_E`, `LOG10_E`, `INFINITY`, `NEG_INFINITY`, `EPSILON`, `MAX`, `MIN`, `MIN_POSITIVE`. Integer numeric methods are core's, not `calc`'s."
msgstr ""
"函数（各带一个 `_f` 的 f32 孪生）：`sqrt`、`floor`、`ceil`、`round`、`trunc`、`exp`、`ln`、`log2`、`log10`、`sin`、`cos`、`tan`、`asin`、`acos`、`atan`、`sinh`、`cosh`、`tanh`、`pow`、`atan2`、`hypot`、`copysign`、`fma`，外加浮点辅助 `abs`、`min`、`max`、`signum`。常量：`Math.PI`、`TAU`、`E`、`SQRT_2`、`LN_2`、`LN_10`、`LOG2_E`、`LOG10_E`、`INFINITY`、`NEG_INFINITY`、`EPSILON`、`MAX`、`MIN`、`MIN_POSITIVE`。整数的数值方法是 core 的，不是 `calc` 的。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:238
msgid "`json` — the serde package"
msgstr "`json`——serde 包"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:240
msgid ""
"Pure rut, `inline = true`, zero host fns — a json mount adds no host bindings."
msgstr "纯 rut，`inline = true`，零宿主函数——挂载 json 不添加任何宿主绑定。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:252
msgid ""
"**The pair law**: `(?T, ?E)` with exactly one nil — success = `(value, nil)`, failure = `(nil, err)`. Encode returns `?EncodeJsonError` because a cyclic structure is expected, recoverable data, not a trap."
msgstr ""
"**对偶法则**：`(?T, ?E)` 恰好一个 nil——成功 = `(value, nil)`，失败 = `(nil, err)`。Encode 返回 `?EncodeJsonError`，因为循环结构被预期为可恢复的数据，而不是陷阱。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:255
msgid ""
"**Direct decode**: no intermediate document; a type's `decode` reads its expectations straight off the cursor. A `Vec<Row>` decode mints exactly the program's values, once."
msgstr ""
"**直接解码**：没有中间文档；类型的 `decode` 直接从游标上读取它期望的东西。一次 `Vec<Row>` 解码恰好铸造程序需要的值，且只铸一次。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:258
msgid ""
"**Numbers**: `i64` accepts integer lexemes only (overflow/decimal lexeme = `WrongType`, never a silent wrap); `f64` parses IEEE-exact in the common range, ±1 ulp beyond (disclosed); encode renders the shortest round-trip decimal."
msgstr ""
"**数字**：`i64` 只接受整型词素（溢出/带小数点的词素 = `WrongType`，绝不无声回绕）；`f64` 在常见范围内按 IEEE 精确解析，范围之外误差 ±1 ulp（明示）；encode 渲染最短往返十进制。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:262
msgid ""
"**Depth**: capped at 128 both directions, recoverable (`DecodeErrorKind::Depth` / `EncodeErrorKind::Depth`)."
msgstr ""
"**深度**：两个方向都以 128 封顶，可恢复（`DecodeErrorKind::Depth` / `EncodeErrorKind::Depth`）。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:264
msgid ""
"**Errors**: payloadless kind enums + fixed-field structs — `DecodeErrorKind { Unexpected, Truncated, InvalidUtf8, WrongType, Depth, Trailing }`, `EncodeErrorKind { Depth, NotFinite, KeyUnsupported }`; decode details carry `at`/`got`/`expected`, encode details carry `at` and the lazily built `$.rows[3].name` path."
msgstr ""
"**错误**：无载荷的种类枚举 + 固定字段结构体——`DecodeErrorKind { Unexpected, Truncated, InvalidUtf8, WrongType, Depth, Trailing }`、`EncodeErrorKind { Depth, NotFinite, KeyUnsupported }`；decode 细节携带 `at`/`got`/`expected`，encode 细节携带 `at` 和惰性构建的 `$.rows[3].name` 路径。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:269
msgid "`decodeJsonBytes` is strict UTF-8 (`InvalidUtf8`), never lossy."
msgstr "`decodeJsonBytes` 是严格 UTF-8（`InvalidUtf8`），绝不有损。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:270
msgid ""
"**Ownership**: json owns the traits; all container impls live in json, gated by peer groups — `Vec` rows activate when `pouch` is anywhere in the consumer's closure, the map/set rows when `nmapset` is ([dependency kinds](dependency-kinds.md)). A consumer without the peers mounts json light."
msgstr ""
"**所有权**：trait 归 json 所有；所有容器 impl 都住在 json 里，由 peer 组把门——当 `pouch` 出现在消费方闭包的任何角落时 `Vec` 行激活，`nmapset` 在场时 map/set 行激活（[依赖种类](dependency-kinds.md)）。没有这些 peer 的消费方挂载的是轻量版 json。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:275
msgid ""
"The writer accumulates through `strbuild`'s `StringBuilder`; the reader rides the core `str.scan`/`starts_with` primitives and O(1) string views."
msgstr ""
"写入器经由 `strbuild` 的 `StringBuilder` 累积；读取器搭载 core 的 `str.scan`/`starts_with` 原语和 O(1) 字符串视图。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:279
msgid "`strbuild` — the builder"
msgstr "`strbuild`——构建器"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:281
msgid ""
"The builder is a host package now (the `ink`/`Logger` pattern): the `strbuild_host` decl pkg declares the five rows (`sb_new` / `sb_push` / `sb_push_code` / `sb_len` / `sb_finish`, registered under the pkg-name scope), and the `strbuild` package wraps them in the `StringBuilder` class. Core ships no string-building machinery; a strbuild mount pairs with the bodies:"
msgstr ""
"构建器现在是一个宿主包（`ink`/`Logger` 模式）：`strbuild_host` 声明包声明五个行（`sb_new` / `sb_push` / `sb_push_code` / `sb_len` / `sb_finish`，以包名作用域注册），`strbuild` 包把它们包进 `StringBuilder` 类。核心不内置任何字符串构建机制；挂载 strbuild 即与函数体配对："


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:288
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"use strbuild::{ StringBuilder };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let k = \"name\";\n"
"    let mut b = StringBuilder.with_cap(1024);   // octet hint\n"
"    b.append(f\"{k}=\");\n"
"    b.append_code(0x21);\n"
"    let s = b.build();                          // the ONE materialization\n"
"    log.info(s);\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"use strbuild::{ StringBuilder };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"t\");\n"
"    let k = \"name\";\n"
"    let mut b = StringBuilder.with_cap(1024);   // octet hint\n"
"    b.append(f\"{k}=\");\n"
"    b.append_code(0x21);\n"
"    let s = b.build();                          // the ONE materialization\n"
"    log.info(s);\n"
"}\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:309
msgid "`new()`"
msgstr "`new()`"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:309
msgid "grow from small"
msgstr "从小处开始增长"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:310
msgid "`with_cap(cap: i32)`"
msgstr "`with_cap(cap: i32)`"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:310
msgid ""
"pre-size to an octet hint (negative traps; the hint is advisory — identical behavior for every cap)"
msgstr "按八位组提示预定尺寸（负数触发陷阱；提示仅供参考 —— 每个容量值的行为完全相同）"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:311
msgid "`append(mut self, value: str)`"
msgstr "`append(mut self, value: str)`"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:311
msgid "amortized O(\\|s\\|), in place"
msgstr "均摊 O(\\|s\\|)，就地追加"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:312
msgid "`append_code(mut self, cp: u32)`"
msgstr "`append_code(mut self, cp: u32)`"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:312
msgid "one codepoint; invalid scalars mint U+FFFD"
msgstr "一个码点；无效标量铸造 U+FFFD"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:313
msgid "codepoints so far, O(1)"
msgstr "迄今为止的码点数，O(1)"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:314
msgid "`build() -> str`"
msgstr "`build() -> str`"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:314
msgid "fresh immutable str; the builder keeps its buffer"
msgstr "全新的不可变 str；构建器保留自己的缓冲区"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:316
msgid ""
"Sharing is the default: appends through an alias (or a `mut` parameter) land in the caller's document; copies happen at exactly two engineered points — `build`'s materialization and growth's prefix move. Growth consults the embedder's heap budget BEFORE growing (the geometric next-capacity is charged), so the wasm 4 MiB cap governs builder growth exactly as it governs engine allocations."
msgstr ""
"共享是默认：经由别名（或 `mut` 参数）做出的追加落进调用方的文档；复制恰好发生在两个刻意设计的位置——`build` 的实体化和增长时的前缀搬移。增长在发生之前先询问嵌入方的堆预算（几何下一容量按记账收取），因此 wasm 的 4 MiB 上限对构建器增长的约束与对引擎分配完全一致。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:323
msgid ""
"Embedder side: `hosts.install_host_pkg(&ctx, rut_std::strbuild::pkg())`. Mounting `strbuild` pulls `strbuild_host` along (`deps`); mounting `json` pulls both (its writer rides the builder)."
msgstr ""
"嵌入方一侧：`hosts.install_host_pkg(&ctx, rut_std::strbuild::pkg())`。挂载 `strbuild` 顺带拉来 `strbuild_host`（`deps`）；挂载 `json` 则两个都来（它的 writer 骑在构建器上）。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:328
msgid ""
"For the common accumulator shape no builder is needed at all: `out = f\"{out}{t}\"` appends in place, linear in the total output ([f-strings](literals-and-inference.md))."
msgstr ""
"对常见的累加器形状，完全不需要构建器：`out = f\"{out}{t}\"` 就地追加，总输出量级为线性（[f 字符串](literals-and-inference.md)）。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:332
msgid "`calc`'s company: `async` and `http`"
msgstr "`calc` 的同伴：`async` 与 `http`"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:334
msgid ""
"`async_engine` declares the engine rows (`__launch`, `__abort`, `__sleep`, `__sleep_yield`); `async_host` restores the typed surface: `launch_future(f: Future<T>) -> LaunchedFutureHandle<T>`, `LaunchedFutureHandle.abort() -> bool`, `sleep(ms: u32) -> Future<nil>`. Each embedder mounts the pair **and** installs `rut_std::async_host::pkg()`; a session that mounts neither has no launcher ([tasks](tasks.md), [host futures](host-futures.md))."
msgstr ""
"`async_engine` 声明引擎行（`__launch`、`__abort`、`__sleep`、`__sleep_yield`）；`async_host` 还原类型化面：`launch_future(f: Future<T>) -> LaunchedFutureHandle<T>`、`LaunchedFutureHandle.abort() -> bool`、`sleep(ms: u32) -> Future<nil>`。每个嵌入方都挂载这对**并**安装 `rut_std::async_host::pkg()`；两者皆未挂载的会话没有启动器（[任务](tasks.md)、[宿主 future](host-futures.md)）。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:341
msgid ""
"`http_host` declares the transport rows (three async, five sync readbacks); `http` wraps them in `HttpClient` / `RequestBuilder` / `Request` / `Response` / `ByteStream` — async only at the points that really wait:"
msgstr ""
"`http_host` 声明传输各行（三个异步，五个同步读回）；`http` 把它们包装成 `HttpClient` / `RequestBuilder` / `Request` / `Response` / `ByteStream`——只在真正等待的点是异步的："


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:346
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use http::{ HttpClient, ClientQueryMethod };\n"
"\n"
"let resp = await HttpClient.new().request()\n"
"    .method(ClientQueryMethod.Post)\n"
"    .url(\"https://example.com/api\")\n"
"    .header(\"Accept\", \"application/json\")\n"
"    .body(payload)\n"
"    .build()\n"
"    .send(cx);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use http::{ HttpClient, ClientQueryMethod };\n"
"\n"
"let resp = await HttpClient.new().request()\n"
"    .method(ClientQueryMethod.Post)\n"
"    .url(\"https://example.com/api\")\n"
"    .header(\"Accept\", \"application/json\")\n"
"    .body(payload)\n"
"    .build()\n"
"    .send(cx);\n"
"```"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:358
msgid ""
"`send` resolves at headers; `body(cx)` drains the wire; `byte_stream()`/`next(cx)` walk it in chunks. Status `0` is reserved for transport failure. The reqwest lane is native-only."
msgstr ""
"`send` 在响应头处解析；`body(cx)` 排干线上的响应体；`byte_stream()`/`next(cx)` 逐块行走。状态 `0` 保留给传输失败。reqwest 链路仅限原生构建。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:362
msgid "Mounting"
msgstr "挂载"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:364
msgid ""
"`mount_std` mounts `core` + `calc`; `mount_std_async` adds the async pair. Swappable packages mount by directory or bundle ([module bundles](bundles.md)); the `rut` CLI mounts the tree packages a loose file names by `use` ([the rut CLI](cli.md))."
msgstr ""
"`mount_std` 挂载 `core` + `calc`；`mount_std_async` 加上异步那一对。可换包按目录或捆绑包挂载（[模块捆绑包](bundles.md)）；`rut` CLI 会为散文件挂载它按 `use` 点名的树内包（[rut CLI](cli.md)）。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:368
msgid ""
"`inline = true` packages (ink, pouch, nmapset, json, strbuild, async_host) are source-inlined into each consumer — required for class-method surfaces, whose inherent impls cross no module link boundary yet ([the frontend](frontend.md))."
msgstr ""
"`inline = true` 的包（ink、pouch、nmapset、json、strbuild、async_host）以源码形式内联进每个消费方——类方法表面需要如此，其固有 impl 尚不能跨模块链接边界（[前端](frontend.md)）。"


#: src/reference/stdlib.md:372
msgid ""
"Generic exports link on their own: instantiation happens where the body lives, consumers request it, and `Vec<i64>` is one type program-wide ([the compiler pipeline](compiler.md))."
msgstr ""
"泛型导出自行链接：实例化发生在函数体所在之处，消费方发出请求，`Vec<i64>` 在全程序是同一个类型（[编译器流水线](compiler.md)）。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:3
msgid ""
"The frontend turns source text into a checked-syntax tree: source (UTF-8) → [lexer](#the-lexer) → tokens → [parser](#the-parser) → AST, with one diagnostics model flowing out of every stage. It has no type knowledge — resolution and checking begin in [the compiler pipeline](compiler.md)."
msgstr ""
"前端把源文本变成一棵受检的语法树：源码（UTF-8）→ [词法分析器](#the-lexer) → 记号 → [语法分析器](#the-parser) → AST，一个统一的诊断模型从每个阶段流出。它没有类型知识——解析与检查从[编译器流水线](compiler.md)开始。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:8
msgid ""
"The implementation is three crates: `rut-lexer` (`span`, `token`, `lexer`, `diag`), `rut-ast` (the arena tree and its dumper), and `rut-parser` (the frame machine and its expression engine). Everything is `no_std`\\-clean and wasm-compatible, so the same code runs in the CLI, the LSP, the formatter, and the browser playground."
msgstr ""
"实现是三个 crate：`rut-lexer`（`span`、`token`、`lexer`、`diag`）、`rut-ast`（arena 树及其转储器）和 `rut-parser`（帧机及其表达式引擎）。一切都是 `no_std`\\- 干净且 wasm 兼容的，因此同一份代码运行在 CLI、LSP、格式化器和浏览器 Playground 里。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:14
msgid "The contract"
msgstr "契约"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:16
msgid "Four invariants hold for any input, hostile included:"
msgstr "四条不变式对任何输入都成立，包括敌意输入："


#: src/reference/frontend.md:18
msgid "invariant"
msgstr "不变式"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:18 src/reference/frontend.md:122
msgid "mechanism"
msgstr "机制"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:20
msgid "C1"
msgstr "C1"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:20
msgid ""
"**Flat AST** — nodes are records in one arena; children are `NodeId`s, never boxed pointers, built bottom-up. Drop/clone are flat `Vec` ops."
msgstr ""
"**扁平 AST**——节点是同一个 arena 里的记录；子节点是 `NodeId`，绝不是装盒的指针，自底向上构建。Drop/clone 是扁平的 `Vec` 操作。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:20
msgid "[AST](#the-ast)"
msgstr "[AST](#the-ast)"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:21
msgid "C2"
msgstr "C2"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:21
msgid ""
"**No native recursion** — an explicit frame stack handles structure; expressions use an iterative operator/operand engine. Host stack use is constant regardless of input."
msgstr "**没有原生递归**——一个显式的帧栈处理结构；表达式使用一个迭代式的运算符/操作数引擎。无论输入如何，宿主栈的使用量都是常数。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:21
msgid "[parser](#the-parser)"
msgstr "[parser](#the-parser)"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:22
msgid "C3"
msgstr "C3"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:22
msgid ""
"**Depth budget, not stack exhaustion** — nesting over the budget is a normal diagnostic, never a host crash."
msgstr "**深度预算，而非栈耗尽**——超预算的嵌套是一条正常诊断，绝不是宿主崩溃。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:22
msgid "[budgets](#nesting-budgets)"
msgstr "[budgets](#nesting-budgets)"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:23
msgid "C4"
msgstr "C4"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:23
msgid ""
"**Lookahead discipline** — local decisions peek at most 4 tokens; the two decisions that need more use read-only balancing scans. The cursor is monotone non-decreasing for the whole parse, recovery included — there is no checkpoint/rollback."
msgstr ""
"**前瞻纪律**——局部决策最多窥探 4 个记号；需要更多的两个决策使用只读的配平扫描。在整个解析过程中——包括错误恢复——游标单调不减；不存在检查点/回滚。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:23
msgid "[lookahead](#lookahead)"
msgstr "[lookahead](#lookahead)"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:25
msgid ""
"The lexer and parser are pure functions — `lex(src) -> (Vec<Token>, Vec<Diag>)` and `parse(src, mode) -> (Ast, Vec<Diag>)` — so they are fuzzable and reusable in an LSP or formatter with no VM present."
msgstr ""
"词法分析器和语法分析器是纯函数——`lex(src) -> (Vec<Token>, Vec<Diag>)` 与 `parse(src, mode) -> (Ast, Vec<Diag>)`——因此它们可被模糊测试，也能在没有 VM 的场合（LSP、格式化器）复用。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:29
msgid "The lexer"
msgstr "词法分析器"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:31
msgid ""
"One flat `Tok` enum for literals, punctuation, and operators. Keywords are ordinary `Ident`s; the parser matches them by interner name. **Reserved words are rejected by the lexer** with a message naming the rut replacement (`interface`, `dataclass`, `private`, `void`, `in`); `?.` and `??` are punctuation-level rejections, a separate mechanism."
msgstr ""
"一个扁平的 `Tok` 枚举覆盖字面量、标点和运算符。关键字就是普通的 `Ident`；语法分析器按驻留名匹配它们。**保留字由词法分析器拒绝**，消息会指明 rut 的替代写法（`interface`、`dataclass`、`private`、`void`、`in`）；`?.` 与 `??` 是标点层面的拒绝，属于另一套机制。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:36
msgid ""
"Maximal munch with an explicit longest-match table; `/` vs `//` vs `/*` resolves with one lookahead. Compound assignment operators are one token each (`+=`, `<<=`, `&&=`, …), so there is no munch ambiguity."
msgstr ""
"最大吞噬（maximal munch）配一张显式的最长匹配表；`/` 与 `//` 与 `/*` 用一次前瞻解决。复合赋值运算符各自是单个记号（`+=`、`<<=`、`&&=`……），因此没有吞噬歧义。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:39
msgid ""
"Numeric literals: `0x`/`0b`/`0o`, `_` separators, and per-width suffixes (`u8..u64`, `i8..i64`, `f32`/`f64`). Unsuffixed integers default to `i32`, unsuffixed floats to `f32`."
msgstr ""
"数字字面量：`0x`/`0b`/`0o`、`_` 分隔符，以及按宽度的后缀（`u8..u64`、`i8..i64`、`f32`/`f64`）。无后缀整数默认 `i32`，无后缀浮点数默认 `f32`。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:42
msgid ""
"Comments are dropped (doc comments are re-attached by the formatter's gap-scan, below)."
msgstr "注释被丢弃（文档注释由下文的格式化器间隙扫描重新附着）。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:45
msgid "Format strings"
msgstr "格式化字符串"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:47
msgid ""
"`f\"...\"` is the one construct the lexer must understand structurally, because placeholders hold expressions, not strings:"
msgstr "`f\"...\"` 是词法分析器必须在结构上理解的唯一构造，因为占位符装的是表达式，不是字符串："


#: src/reference/frontend.md:53
msgid ""
"// decoded like a plain string; {{ }} -> { }\n"
msgstr ""
"// decoded like a plain string; {{ }} -> { }\n"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:54
msgid ""
"// a FULLY LEXED token stream, `}`-terminated\n"
msgstr ""
"// a FULLY LEXED token stream, `}`-terminated\n"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:58
msgid ""
"The lexer enters hole mode after `{` (not `{{`), balances braces, and lexes normally until depth 0. Holes are re-lexed, not stored as text, so placeholder expressions carry real spans inside the literal's span. A hole may contain any expression except a string literal — a quote inside a hole is a lex error with a _bind it to a name first_ note. See [Templates](templates.md) for the surface semantics."
msgstr ""
"词法分析器在 `{`（而非 `{{`）之后进入洞模式，配平花括号，并正常进行词法分析直到深度 0。洞会被重新做词法分析，而不是作为文本存储，因此占位符表达式在字面量的 span 之内携带真实的 span。洞里可以放除字符串字面量之外的任何表达式——洞里的引号是一个词法错误，并附注 _先把它绑定到一个名字_。表面语义见[模板](templates.md)。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:65
msgid ""
"Raw strings `r\"...\"` carry everything up to the closing `\"` literally; `\\\"` inside a raw string does not close it."
msgstr "原始字符串 `r\"...\"` 逐字携带直到闭合 `\"` 为止的一切；原始字符串里的 `\\\"` 不会闭合它。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:68
msgid "Nesting budgets"
msgstr "嵌套预算"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:70
msgid "Two budgets make C3 a law:"
msgstr "两个预算让 C3 成为法则："


#: src/reference/frontend.md:72
msgid ""
"`NEST_MAX = 1024` — the lexer's bracket depth budget (`rut-lexer/span.rs`). Exceeding it is one clean diagnostic at the offending opener."
msgstr "`NEST_MAX = 1024`——词法分析器的括号深度预算（`rut-lexer/span.rs`）。超出它会在肇事的开启符处产生一条干净的诊断。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:74
msgid ""
"`EXPR_MAX = 64` — the parser's expression-nesting budget. The frame machine itself has no host-stack cost, but downstream recursive walks (AST dump, typecheck) do; the cap keeps the trees they visit shallow."
msgstr ""
"`EXPR_MAX = 64`——语法分析器的表达式嵌套预算。帧机本身没有宿主栈开销，但下游的递归遍历（AST 转储、类型检查）有；这个上限让它们访问的树保持浅。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:78
msgid ""
"Both produce the same diagnostic — _nesting too deep_ — and neither can overflow the host stack."
msgstr "两者产生同一条诊断——_嵌套过深_——而且谁也不会溢出宿主栈。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:81
msgid "The parser"
msgstr "语法分析器"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:83
msgid "One loop over the token slice drives two mechanisms:"
msgstr "一个循环扫过记号切片，驱动两个机制："


#: src/reference/frontend.md:85
msgid ""
"A **frame stack** handles structure — one frame kind per grammar rule (`Module`, `Item`, `Block`, `TypeArgList`, `Pattern`, `Arm`, `Impl`, …). A rule that needs a child pushes a frame; a completed frame pops and hands its `NodeId` to the parent."
msgstr ""
"一个**帧栈**处理结构——每条文法规则一种帧（`Module`、`Item`、`Block`、`TypeArgList`、`Pattern`、`Arm`、`Impl`……）。需要子节点的规则压入一个帧；完成的帧弹出，把它的 `NodeId` 交给父级。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:89
msgid ""
"An embedded **Pratt engine** handles expressions — an operator stack plus an operand stack of `NodeId`s. Binary and assignment steps push an operator; reductions pop operands and push one node, bottom-up."
msgstr ""
"一个内嵌的 **Pratt 引擎**处理表达式——一个运算符栈加一个 `NodeId` 操作数栈。二元与赋值步骤压入运算符；归约弹出操作数并压入一个节点，自底向上。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:93
msgid ""
"There is no grammar generator and no left-recursion handling. Binding powers, loosest to tightest:"
msgstr "没有文法生成器，也没有左递归处理。结合力从最松到最紧："


