#: src/reference/frontend.md:116
msgid "Lookahead"
msgstr "前瞻"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:118
msgid ""
"rut's grammar makes shallow peeking enough: statements are keyword-led, `{` never starts an expression, imports are flat, and paths are `.`\\-dotted."
msgstr "rut 的文法让浅层窥探就足够：语句以关键字开头，`{` 绝不开启一个表达式，导入是扁平的，路径用 `.`\\- 点号相连。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:122
msgid "decision"
msgstr "决策"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:124
msgid "item dispatch"
msgstr "条目分派"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:124
msgid "peek 1 (`use` `let` `enum` `struct` `class` `trait` `impl` `fn`)"
msgstr "窥探 1（`use` `let` `enum` `struct` `class` `trait` `impl` `fn`）"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:125
msgid "statement vs expression-statement"
msgstr "语句 vs 表达式语句"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:125
msgid "peek 1 (leading keyword)"
msgstr "窥探 1（起始关键字）"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:126
msgid "`for`\\-of vs C-style `for`"
msgstr "`for`\\-of 与 C 风格 `for`"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:126
msgid "peek 4: `for ( let Ident <of or =>`"
msgstr "窥探 4：`for ( let Ident <of or =>`"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:127
msgid "instance vs class method"
msgstr "实例方法 vs 类方法"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:127
msgid "peek 4: `fn Ident ( <mut? self? …>`"
msgstr "窥探 4：`fn Ident ( <mut? self? …>`"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:128
msgid "struct literal vs path expression"
msgstr "结构体字面量 vs 路径表达式"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:128
msgid "peek 2: `Ident {` ⇒ literal (classes have no instance literal)"
msgstr "窥探 2：`Ident {` ⇒ 字面量（类没有实例字面量）"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:129
msgid "`when`\\-arm body form"
msgstr "`when`\\- 分支体形式"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:129
msgid "peek 1 after `->` (`{` ⇒ block arm, else expression arm)"
msgstr "在 `->` 之后窥探 1（`{` ⇒ 块分支，否则表达式分支）"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:130
msgid "postfix loop step"
msgstr "后缀循环步"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:130
msgid "peek 1 (`.` `(` `[` `?`)"
msgstr "窥探 1（`.` `(` `[` `?`）"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:131
msgid "assignment target"
msgstr "赋值目标"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:131
msgid "no lookahead — parse, then validate"
msgstr "无前瞻——先解析，再校验"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:133
msgid ""
"Two decisions need more than 4 tokens and use **scans** — read-only, commit-once, never a guess:"
msgstr "两个决策需要 4 个以上的记号，它们使用**扫描**——只读、一次性提交、绝不是猜测："


#: src/reference/frontend.md:136
msgid ""
"**Lambda vs parenthesized expression.** Scan to the matching `)`; it is a lambda iff the tokens form a valid parameter list and `=>` follows (an optional `-> Type` may sit between). Otherwise a comma inside the parens errors at the comma — rut has no tuples-as-expressions spelling — with a note: _if you meant a lambda, add `=>`_."
msgstr ""
"**lambda 与括号表达式之辨。**扫描到配对的 `)`；当且仅当记号构成合法的参数表且其后跟着 `=>`（中间可以有一个可选的 `-> Type`），它才是 lambda。否则括号里的逗号会在逗号处报错——rut 没有\"元组作表达式\"的写法——并附注：_如果你想要的是 lambda，请加上 `=>`_。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:141
msgid ""
"**Generic call vs `<` comparison** (`Vec<f32>(n)` vs `a < b > (c)`). Scan from the `<` tracking angle depth; a `>>`/`<<` consumed where a closer/opener is expected counts as two, so `Vec<Vec<i32>>` needs no re-lexing. Generic arguments commit iff depth returns to 0 on a `>` and the very next token is `(`. `a < b > (c)` is not expressible unparenthesized — write `(a < b) > (c)`."
msgstr ""
"**泛型调用与 `<` 比较之辨**（`Vec<f32>(n)` 与 `a < b > (c)`）。从 `<` 开始扫描并追踪尖括号深度；在期待闭合/开启符之处消费的 `>>`/`<<` 记作两个，因此 `Vec<Vec<i32>>` 无需重新做词法分析。当且仅当深度在某个 `>` 上回到 0 且紧随其后的记号是 `(`，泛型实参才提交。`a < b > (c)` 不加括号无法表达——请写 `(a < b) > (c)`。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:148
msgid ""
"Scans never mutate parser state. Peeking at arbitrary distance is allowed; checkpoint/rollback is not — the API does not exist, so the monotone-cursor invariant (debug-asserted) cannot be violated, even during error recovery."
msgstr ""
"扫描从不改变语法分析器状态。允许任意距离的窥探；检查点/回滚则不允许——这个 API 根本不存在，因此单调游标不变式（调试断言）不可能被违反，错误恢复期间也不例外。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:152
msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "恢复"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:154
msgid ""
"Within a file the parser resynchronizes at `;`, `}`, or the token after a balanced block and keeps parsing — a file yields many diagnostics, not one. Resync only ever skips forward."
msgstr "在单个文件内，语法分析器在 `;`、`}` 或一个配平块之后的记号处重新同步并继续解析——一个文件产出许多条诊断，而不是一条。重新同步只会向前跳。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:160
msgid ""
"The mode is chosen by file extension: `Mode::Impl` for `.rut`, `Mode::Decl` for `.d.rut`. Both share one grammar; declaration mode adds the surface declarations — `host fn`, `host struct`, and the builtin rows (`prelude builtin` / `pub builtin`, see [Host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md)) — and **forbids bodies**: any block, impl blocks included, is rejected with _implementation in a declaration file_. Implementation mode rejects `host`/`builtin` with the mirror message. The full surface and how bodies bind at load time live in [Host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md)."
msgstr ""
"模式由文件扩展名选择：`.rut` 用 `Mode::Impl`，`.d.rut` 用 `Mode::Decl`。两者共享同一语法；声明模式增加了表面声明——`host fn`、`host struct`，以及内建行（`prelude builtin` / `pub builtin`，参见[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)）——并**禁止函数体**：任何块（包括 impl 块）都会以_实现出现在声明文件中_被拒绝。实现模式以镜像消息拒绝 `host`/`builtin`。完整表面及函数体在加载时如何绑定见[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:171
msgid ""
"Declarations-only module scope is enforced by the parser itself: a statement at module top level is a syntax error, not a semantic one. The grammar itself is specified in [Lexical structure](lexical-structure.md) and [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)."
msgstr ""
"只含声明的模块作用域由语法分析器自己强制：模块顶层的语句是语法错误，不是语义错误。文法本身在[词法结构](lexical-structure.md)与[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)中规定。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:176
msgid "The AST"
msgstr "AST"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:178
msgid ""
"Nodes are plain records in one arena; children are `NodeId`s into it. Spans sit on every node; there are no `String` keys — names are `IdentId`s into an interner that lives in `rut-core`, shared by the AST, the type table, and the module binary's name table. The interner pre-interns a fixed well-known table (`rut_core::sym`: `self`, `Self`, `nil`, `main`, `__iterate`, the builtin members, the primitives, …), so ids below `well_known_len` mean the same name in every interner instance and special names compare as `IdentId` equality, never by text."
msgstr ""
"节点是同一个 arena 里的普通记录；子节点是指向它的 `NodeId`。每个节点都带 span；没有 `String` 键——名字是指入一个驻留器的 `IdentId`，该驻留器住在 `rut-core` 里，被 AST、类型表和模块二进制的名字表共享。驻留器预驻留一张固定的知名表（`rut_core::sym`：`self`、`Self`、`nil`、`main`、`__iterate`、各内建成员、各基本类型……），因此低于 `well_known_len` 的 id 在每个驻留器实例中都意味着同一个名字，特殊名字以 `IdentId` 相等比较，绝不按文本比较。"


