#: src/reference/frontend.md:218
msgid ""
"Stable `NodeId`s are the rest of the pipeline's currency: the checker keys side tables by node id, diagnostics reach spans through them, and the LSP, formatter, and dumper hold copyable references with no reparenting."
msgstr ""
"稳定的 `NodeId` 是流水线其余部分的通货：检查器以节点 id 为旁表建键，诊断经由它们抵达 span，而 LSP、格式化器和转储器持有可复制的引用，无需重新挂靠父节点。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:222
msgid ""
"What the AST does **not** contain: no `new`, no `switch`/`case`, no `?.` or `??` — the lexer rejects those words before parsing. There are no paren nodes either: the parse's grouping _is_ the tree."
msgstr ""
"AST **不**包含的东西：没有 `new`，没有 `switch`/`case`，没有 `?.` 或 `??`——这些词在解析之前就被词法分析器拒绝。也没有括号节点：解析的分组_就是_树本身。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:226
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:233
msgid ""
"One renderer serves every frontend stage: a primary line with a caret span, secondary labels, and notes, all over byte offsets (`rut_lexer::diag::render_diags`). Rendering sorts by span so multi-file output is stable. Suggestions are part of the message set: _did you mean `when`?_ for `switch`/`match`; _bind it to a name first_ for string literals in format-string holes; _classes have no instance literal — use `Circle(..)`_ for `Circle { .. }` on a class."
msgstr ""
"一个渲染器服务所有前端阶段：带插入符 span 的主行、次级标签和附注，全部基于字节偏移（`rut_lexer::diag::render_diags`）。渲染按 span 排序，因此多文件输出是稳定的。建议是消息集的一部分：对 `switch`/`match` 提示 _did you mean `when`?_；对格式化字符串洞里的字符串字面量提示 _先把它绑定到一个名字_；对类上的 `Circle { .. }` 提示 _类没有实例字面量——请用 `Circle(..)`_。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:241
msgid ""
"The compile stops before IR if any diagnostic exists — a module with diagnostics never produces bytecode. See [Diagnostics, traces, and symbolication](diagnostics.md) for the runtime half of the story."
msgstr "只要存在任何诊断，编译就在 IR 之前停止——带诊断的模块绝不产出字节码。运行时的那一半故事见[诊断、追踪与符号化](diagnostics.md)。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:246
msgid "The formatter"
msgstr "格式化器"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:248
msgid ""
"`rut fmt` (crate `rut-fmt`, CLI subcommand) reprints a parsed-clean module from the AST:"
msgstr "`rut fmt`（crate `rut-fmt`，CLI 子命令）从 AST 重排一个解析干净的模块："


#: src/reference/frontend.md:251
msgid ""
"**Comment gap-scan** — comments live in the byte gaps between token spans, so the formatter recovers every `//` and block comment with zero lexer/parser changes: trailing runs go on their element's line, own-line runs at the enclosing indent."
msgstr ""
"**注释间隙扫描**——注释住在记号 span 之间的字节间隙里，因此格式化器在不改动词法/语法分析器的前提下找回每一条 `//` 与块注释：尾随的注释归到所属元素那一行，独占一行的注释按外围缩进放置。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:255
msgid ""
"**Parens and literals re-derived** — the printer re-parens only where flat precedence would invert the tree, re-spells floats shortest round-trip from their bits, and re-quotes strings by the exact inverse of the lexer's escape set (`0xff` legitimately becomes `255`)."
msgstr ""
"**括号与字面量重新推导**——打印器只在扁平优先级会颠倒树的地方重新加括号，从比特重新以最短往返形式书写浮点数，并按词法分析器转义集合的精确逆运算重新给字符串加引号（`0xff` 名正言顺地变成 `255`）。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:259
msgid ""
"**Tested invariants** — every corpus file formats, reparses clean, and is idempotent (`fmt(fmt(x)) == fmt(x)`); probe programs run through the full pipeline before and after formatting and log identical output."
msgstr ""
"**经受测试的不变式**——每个语料文件都能格式化、重新解析干净，并且幂等（`fmt(fmt(x)) == fmt(x)`）；探针程序在格式化前后各跑一遍完整流水线，并记录到相同的输出。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:262
msgid ""
"**Refusal law** — a source with diagnostics is refused: rendered diagnostics, exit 1, nothing rewritten. The formatter never guesses."
msgstr "**拒绝法则**——带诊断的源码会被拒绝：渲染诊断、以 1 退出、不重写任何东西。格式化器从不猜测。"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:264
msgid ""
"**Style is the package's** — the nearest ancestor `rut.jsonc`'s `style` block sets `indent_width` (1–8, default 4) and `max_width` (≥ 20, default 100); no manifest means defaults. See [Project structure and rut.jsonc](project-structure.md)."
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/frontend.md:269
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"


#: src/reference/frontend.md:271
msgid ""
"The corpus is the conformance suite: every `examples/**/*.rut`, `examples/**/*.d.rut`, and playground classic must parse with zero diagnostics. Parser invariant tests include 100k-deep `((((`, `[[[[`, `{{{{`, unary chains, and nested generic arguments — each yields exactly one _nesting too deep_ diagnostic — and fuzz targets assert no host stack overflow and no cursor rollback. Formatter tests pin the round-trip and idempotence laws above."
msgstr ""
"语料就是一致性套件：每个 `examples/**/*.rut`、`examples/**/*.d.rut` 和 Playground 经典用例都必须以零诊断解析。语法分析器不变式测试包括 10 万层深的 `((((`、`[[[[`、`{{{{`、一元链和嵌套泛型实参——每个恰好产出一条 _嵌套过深_ 诊断——模糊测试目标断言不溢出宿主栈、游标不回滚。格式化器测试钉住上述往返与幂等法则。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:3
msgid ""
"Compilation is AOT, in-process, and deterministic. There is no JIT and no deoptimization: whatever the checker proves is final, and the emitted bytecode is the whole story."
msgstr "编译是 AOT 的、进程内的、确定性的。没有 JIT，也没有反优化：检查器证明的东西就是最终定论，发出的字节码就是全部故事。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:17
msgid ""
"The unit of compilation is the module. A `.d.rut` declaration surface runs through resolve/typecheck and stops there — it has no bodies, so it publishes a signature surface, never code."
msgstr "编译的单位是模块。`.d.rut` 声明表面走过解析/类型检查就停在那里——它没有函数体，因此它发布的是签名表面，绝不是代码。"


