#: src/reference/compiler.md:35
msgid ""
"The middle stages are deliberately **one crate**: the checker's monomorphization queue drives the body compiler and the body compiler reports new instantiations back through the checking context. The fusion keeps instantiation admission exact — every substitution-completing call site is checked against its inline `requires` bounds as it is compiled."
msgstr ""
"中间这些阶段刻意同属**一个 crate**：检查器的单态化队列驱动函数体编译器，而函数体编译器经由检查上下文把新实例化报回来。这种融合让实例化准入保持精确——每个补全替换的调用点在编译时就对照其内联 `requires` 约束接受检查。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:41
msgid "Resolve"
msgstr "解析"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:43
msgid "Name resolution walks the AST and binds every path to a symbol:"
msgstr "名称解析遍历 AST，把每条路径绑定到一个符号："


#: src/reference/compiler.md:45
msgid ""
"`use` imports resolve against the mounted session — exact, single-step: a use path resolves only if a module with that name is mounted. Missing modules diagnose against the consumer manifest (see [Loading](loading.md) and [Dependency kinds](dependency-kinds.md))."
msgstr ""
"`use` 导入对照已挂载的会话解析——精确、单步：一条 use 路径只有在同名模块已挂载时才解析。缺失的模块对照消费方清单诊断（见[加载](loading.md)与[依赖种类](dependency-kinds.md)）。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:49
msgid ""
"`Self` binds inside impls; `pub` visibility is checked per [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md)."
msgstr "`Self` 在 impl 内部绑定；`pub` 可见性按[模块与可见性](modules-and-visibility.md)检查。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:51
msgid ""
"Struct-vs-class is decided here: literals are legal only for structs; classes construct through their class methods."
msgstr "结构体与类之辨在这里裁决：字面量只对结构体合法；类经由自己的类方法构造。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:53
msgid ""
"`is` expressions resolve their right-hand side to a concrete type or a trait instantiation id; `is` on an erasure-typed receiver answers by the box (see [opaque — erasure and downcast](opaque.md))."
msgstr ""
"`is` 表达式把右侧解析成一个具体类型或一个 trait 实例化 id；擦除类型接收者上的 `is` 按盒作答（见 [opaque —— 擦除与向下转型](opaque.md)）。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:56
msgid ""
"`host`/`extern` surface references resolve against the declaration surfaces of the packages the module imports, with slot ids attached to every member reference."
msgstr "`host`/`extern` 表面引用对照模块所导入包的声明表面解析，每个成员引用都附带槽位 id。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:60
msgid "Typecheck"
msgstr "类型检查"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:62
msgid ""
"Bidirectional inference: expected types flow down, literal types flow up. Every expression node is decorated with a type id (an index into the module's type table). Generic calls get their instantiation inferred or take it explicitly (`downcast<Point>(o)`)."
msgstr ""
"双向推断：期望类型向下流，字面量类型向上流。每个表达式节点都装饰着一个类型 id（模块类型表里的一个索引）。泛型调用的实例化要么被推断出来，要么显式给出（`downcast<Point>(o)`）。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:67
msgid "Laws enforced here:"
msgstr "在这里强制执行的法则："


#: src/reference/compiler.md:69
msgid ""
"**The `==` law** — primitives and `str` compare by value; every other cell type compares by identity; nullable `?T` operands and tuple operands are a compile error (_pattern-match instead_ — destructure the pair). A lint flags `==` between two obviously fresh composites."
msgstr ""
"**`==` 法则**——基本类型和 `str` 按值比较；其余每个单元类型按同一性比较；可空的 `?T` 操作数与元组操作数是编译错误（_请改用模式匹配_——解构那个对偶）。lint 会标记两个明显崭新的复合值之间的 `==`。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:73
msgid ""
"**`is` folding** — when the receiver's static type already answers the question (a concrete receiver, `d: I is I`), the expression folds to a constant and an always-true/false lint fires."
msgstr ""
"**`is` 折叠**——当接收者的静态类型已经能回答这个问题时（具体接收者、`d: I is I`），表达式折叠成一个常量，并触发一个恒真/恒假 lint。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:76
msgid ""
"**Union bounds** — a generic parameter's `requires T1 | T2` bound is checked at every site that completes the substitution ([Type aliases and union bounds](type-aliases.md))."
msgstr ""
"**并集约束**——泛型参数的 `requires T1 | T2` 约束在每个补全替换的位置检查（[类型别名与并集约束](type-aliases.md)）。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:79
msgid ""
"**The crossing rule** — an `entry fn`'s published signature may only use types that cross the host boundary: primitives, `str`, `bytes`, `opaque`, `?T` over a crossing type (nil-flattened), and tuples of crossing types. A violation is a compile error, so a bad surface never reaches the embedder at load time ([The host boundary](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md))."
msgstr ""
"**跨越规则**——`entry fn` 发布的签名只能使用能跨越宿主边界的类型：基本类型、`str`、`bytes`、`opaque`、跨越类型之上的 `?T`（nil 展平），以及跨越类型的元组。违例是编译错误，因此坏表面绝不会在加载时抵达嵌入方（[宿主边界](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md)）。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:84
msgid ""
"**The orphan rule** — `impl Trait for Type` is legal only in a package that defines the trait or the type. Trait impls for foreign pairs are a compile-time rejection, not a link-time surprise ([Traits and dispatch](traits.md))."
msgstr ""
"**孤儿规则**——`impl Trait for Type` 只在定义了该 trait 或该类型的包里合法。外来组合的 trait impl 在编译期就被拒绝，而不是链接时的意外（[trait 与分派](traits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:89
msgid "Monomorphization"
msgstr "单态化"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:91
msgid ""
"Generic functions never reach a binary. The checker's instantiation queue compiles one concrete copy per substitution; the queue closes because instantiating a body can enqueue more. Instantiation names (`[i32]`, `Vec<f32>`) are synthesized into the shared interner, and `type_id<T>()` folds to a constant from the type table at this point — it never executes at runtime."
msgstr ""
"泛型函数绝不进入二进制。检查器的实例化队列为每个替换编译一份具体副本；队列会闭合，因为实例化一个函数体可能入队更多。实例化名字（`[i32]`、`Vec<f32>`）被合成进共享驻留器，而 `type_id<T>()` 在此刻就从类型表折叠成常量——它绝不在运行时执行。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:98
msgid ""
"The same law fixes WHERE an instantiation compiles: where the body lives. `Vec<i64>` is one type program-wide — the declaring package owns every instantiation of its generics, and consumers request them: a consumer's spelling lays out the concrete shape and routes the bodies to the declaring package's compile, so a linked library's `make() -> Vec<i64>` and the consumer's own `Vec<i64>` are one row, and the binary ships one copy of each instantiation's code."
msgstr ""
"同一条法则规定了实例化在哪里编译：在函数体所在之处。`Vec<i64>` 是全程序唯一的类型——声明包拥有其泛型的每一个实例化，消费方则发起请求：消费方的书写铺排出具体形状，并把函数体路由到声明包的编译里，因此被链接库的 `make() -> Vec<i64>` 与消费方自己的 `Vec<i64>` 是同一行，二进制里每个实例化的代码也只有一份。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:106
msgid ""
"That leaves `inline = true` for packages whose methods live on class bodies (inherent impls cross no surface yet): the graph compiler splices their source into every consumer instead of linking them (`ink`, `json`, `nmapset`, `strbuild`, `async_host`, `http`, `pouch`). See [Project structure and rut.jsonc](project-structure.md)."
msgstr ""
"于是 `inline = true` 留给了那些方法写在类体里的包（固有 impl 尚不能跨表面）：图编译器把它们的源码拼接进每个消费方，而不是链接它们（`ink`、`json`、`nmapset`、`strbuild`、`async_host`、`http`、`pouch`）。见[项目结构与 rut.jsonc](project-structure.md)。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:112
msgid "The type lattice"
msgstr "类型格"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:114
msgid ""
"In a no-JIT VM, compile-time type knowledge is the only knowledge. The IR tracks a per-value lattice:"
msgstr "在没有 JIT 的 VM 里，编译期类型知识是唯一的知识。IR 为每个值追踪一个格："


#: src/reference/compiler.md:121
msgid "**Exact types** compile to direct calls and known layouts."
msgstr "**精确类型**编译成直接调用与已知布局。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:122
msgid ""
"**Trait-typed values** (`d: Drawable`) are unsized: the payload lives in a heap cell and the slot stores the cell handle. One indirect vtable call per multi-origin use; fields are inaccessible; no inlining without evidence. The cost is per-call, never per-field — and when a call's receiver is statically concrete (a sealed impl set, a monomorphic body), the call devirtualizes at body-compile time and the dispatch overhead is zero."
msgstr ""
"**trait 类型的值**（`d: Drawable`）是不定长的：载荷住在堆单元里，槽位存储单元句柄。每个多来源使用一次间接 vtable 调用；字段不可访问；没有证据就不内联。开销按调用计，绝不按字段计——而当某个调用的接收者在静态上是具体的（一个封闭的 impl 集、一个单态函数体），该调用在函数体编译期去虚化，分派开销为零。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:129
msgid ""
"**Erasure sits off the lattice.** The `opaque` primitive is reached only through the type-call `opaque(v)`, and `opaque.downcast<T>(o)` is the refinement: the successful branch re-enters the _exact_ lattice position, so downstream code optimizes as if nothing was erased. Downcast checks are pure dataflow — repeated checks CSE, invariant ones hoist, and a chain over one cell folds to a type-id switch. What the compiler must **not** assume is the type inside a box at a given program point; speculative devirtualization through `opaque` is JIT behavior and does not exist."
msgstr ""
"**擦除位于格之外。**`opaque` 基本类型只能经由类型调用 `opaque(v)` 抵达，而 `opaque.downcast<T>(o)` 就是那个精化：成功的分支重新进入_精确_的格位置，因此下游代码优化起来就像什么都没被擦除。向下转型检查是纯粹的数据流——重复的检查被 CSE，不变的检查被外提，同一单元上的链折叠成一个类型 id 分支。编译器**绝不**能假设的是给定程序点上盒内的类型；经由 `opaque` 的投机性去虚化是 JIT 行为，并不存在。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:138
msgid ""
"**The slice tier** parallels trait widening: `Array<T, N> | Vec<T> (concrete)  >  Slice<T> view (unsized)`. `N` is part of the type's identity; slices are never boxed or erased."
msgstr ""
"**切片层**与 trait 宽化平行：`Array<T, N> | Vec<T> (concrete)  >  Slice<T> view (unsized)`。`N` 是类型同一性的一部分；切片绝不被装盒或擦除。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:142
msgid ""
"The intended program shape: exact types on the hot path, trait-typed values where polymorphism is real, `opaque` only inside heterogeneous storage. Lints flag `downcast` in loop bodies and erasure crossing non-storage function boundaries."
msgstr ""
"预期的程序形状：热路径上用精确类型，多态真实存在的地方用 trait 类型的值，`opaque` 只出现在异构存储内部。lint 会标记循环体内的 `downcast`，以及跨越非存储函数边界的擦除。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:147
msgid "Optimization"
msgstr "优化"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:149
msgid "A fixed pipeline with no flags:"
msgstr "一条无开关的固定流水线："


#: src/reference/compiler.md:151
msgid ""
"**Folding** — constant arithmetic, `type_id<T>()`, `Array<T, N>.len()` → the constant `N` (with const-index bounds checks folded against it), statically-decided `is` probes, dead branches."
msgstr ""
"**折叠**——常量算术、`type_id<T>()`、`Array<T, N>.len()` → 常量 `N`（常量索引的边界检查对照它折叠）、静态可判的 `is` 探查、死分支。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:154
msgid ""
"**Inlining** — single-callee calls and small bodies (a callee op-count budget). Cross-module inlining after linking is future work; v1 binaries carry no cross-function inlined code."
msgstr "**内联**——单一被调用者的调用与小函数体（按被调用者的操作数预算）。链接后的跨模块内联是未来工作；v1 二进制不携带跨函数内联代码。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:157
msgid ""
"**CSE / LICM** over pure operations — type-id loads, downcast checks, field loads on immutable records."
msgstr "对纯操作做 **CSE / LICM**——类型 id 加载、向下转型检查、不可变记录的字段加载。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:159
msgid ""
"**Peephole + SROA** — the rewriters re-intern operand pools on register remap, so pool sharing stays consistent (see [Typed bytecode](typed-bytecode.md)). SROA declines a record whose class implements `Disposal`: the cell's death is observable (dispose runs at refcount zero), so its mint is never deleted."
msgstr ""
"**窥孔 + SROA**——重写器在寄存器重映射时重新驻留操作数池，因此池共享保持一致（见[类型化字节码](typed-bytecode.md)）。SROA 拒绝其类实现了 `Disposal` 的记录：单元的死亡是可观察的（dispose 在引用计数归零时运行），因此它的铸造绝不会被删除。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:164
msgid ""
"**Pattern lowering** — downcast chains become one type-id load plus a jump table; `when` on enums lowers to `brtable` over the member value."
msgstr "**模式下降**——向下转型链变成一次类型 id 加载加一张跳转表；枚举上的 `when` 下降为对成员值的 `brtable`。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:167
msgid ""
"The pipeline is honest by construction: there is no tier-2 to fall back on, so the emitted code must be right the first time. Every gate measures against the example programs and the benchmark corpus."
msgstr "这条流水线从构造上就是诚实的：没有 tier-2 可以退而求其次，因此发出的代码必须第一次就对。每道门禁都对照示例程序与基准语料测量。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:171 src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:170
msgid "Async lowering"
msgstr "异步下降"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:173
msgid ""
"`async fn` compiles to a state machine: each `await` is a checkpoint state in the hidden frame, resume dispatch is the existing jump-table op, locals become frame fields, and suspension is a plain return. The op set grows zero rows for this — the driven half is an ordinary trait-vtable call through the future's `yield` row. The full protocol lives in [Async and await](async.md) and [Tasks](tasks.md)."
msgstr ""
"`async fn` 编译成一个状态机：每个 `await` 是隐藏帧里的一个检查点状态，恢复分派是现有的跳转表操作，局部变量成为帧字段，挂起是一次普通的返回。为此操作集零新增——被驱动的那一半是一次普通的 trait-vtable 调用，走 future 的 `yield` 行。完整协议见[异步与 await](async.md)与[任务](tasks.md)。"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:180 src/reference/module-binary.md:102
msgid "Determinism"
msgstr "确定性"


#: src/reference/compiler.md:182
msgid ""
"Same source + same dependency versions + same compiler version ⇒ byte-identical output. Serialization is ordered and little-endian everywhere, and the graph compiles dependencies in a fixed post-order before flattening. This is what makes compile caches content-addressable, bundles diffable, and trace restoration by recompilation possible ([Diagnostics, traces, and symbolication](diagnostics.md))."
msgstr ""
"相同源码 + 相同依赖版本 + 相同编译器版本 ⇒ 逐字节相同的输出。序列化处处有序且小端序，图在展平之前按固定后序编译依赖。正因为如此，编译缓存可以按内容寻址、捆绑包可以 diff、追踪可以靠重新编译还原（[诊断、追踪与符号化](diagnostics.md)）。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:3
msgid ""
"The compiler's output — and the VM's input — is **LIR**: a flat op stream per function over typed registers. Every register has a static type recorded in the function's signature, and the load-time verifier re-checks all of it ([Module binary and verification](module-binary.md)). The op definitions live in `rut-core/src/ops.rs`; the VM that executes them in [VM core](vm-core.md)."
msgstr ""
"编译器的输出——也是 VM 的输入——是 **LIR**：每个函数一条扁平的操作流，架在带类型的寄存器之上。每个寄存器都有记录在函数签名里的静态类型，加载期校验器会重新检查这一切（[模块二进制与校验](module-binary.md)）。操作定义在 `rut-core/src/ops.rs`；执行它们的 VM 在 [VM 核心](vm-core.md)。"


