#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:138
msgid ""
"**Nothing polymorphic, nothing named.** A trait-typed receiver gets exactly one op (`CallI`) through its vtable. Slice-view indexing and `len` are ordinary vtable calls through the view's builtin impl. The erasure primitive's names lower to primitives — the type-call `opaque(v)` to the `Box` op, `opaque.downcast<T>(o)` to prelude code (below) — and both are ambient: no `use` gates them ([opaque — erasure and downcast](opaque.md))."
msgstr ""
"**多态的、具名的都不做。**trait 类型的接收者恰好经由它的 vtable 得到一个操作（`CallI`）。切片视图的索引和 `len` 是经由视图内建 impl 的普通 vtable 调用。擦除基本类型的名字下降为原语——类型调用 `opaque(v)` 下降为 `Box` 操作，`opaque.downcast<T>(o)` 下降为前奏代码（见下）——而且两者都是环境自带的：没有 `use` 把门（[opaque —— 擦除与向下转型](opaque.md)）。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:146
msgid ""
"**Concrete memory + control + the type machine's two readbacks.** Ops touch memory only through compile-time-known layouts (inline blocks, cells with known headers), plus control flow and calls — and the two readbacks reification needs: `TidOf` (what is it?) and `Unbox` (the payload, guarded)."
msgstr ""
"**具体内存 + 控制 + 类型机器的两个读回。**操作只经由编译期已知的布局触碰内存（内联块、带已知头的单元），外加控制流和调用——以及具体化需要的两个读回：`TidOf`（它是什么？）与 `Unbox`（载荷，受守卫）。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:152
msgid "`is` and `downcast` lowering"
msgstr "`is` 与 `downcast` 的下降"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:154
msgid ""
"`x is T` with concrete `T`: one `TidOf` + an integer compare. On an erasure box, `is` answers **by the box** — it misses for every payload type; `downcast` is the only see-through."
msgstr ""
"具体 `T` 的 `x is T`：一次 `TidOf` 加一次整数比较。在擦除盒上，`is` **按盒作答**——对每个载荷类型都不命中；`downcast` 是唯一的透视。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:157
msgid ""
"`x is I` with trait `I`: one `IsTrait` descriptor scan — pure in `(recv, want)`, so repeated probes CSE and invariant ones hoist."
msgstr ""
"trait `I` 的 `x is I`：一次 `IsTrait` 描述符扫描——在 `(recv, want)` 上是纯的，因此重复的探查被 CSE，不变的探查被外提。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:159
msgid ""
"`opaque.downcast<T>(o)` (yielding `?T`): `TidOf`; branch on the compare against `T`'s id; `Unbox` on the hit arm, a nil box on the miss. The check is visible dataflow — the compiler CSEs repeated checks, hoists invariant ones, and folds a downcast chain over one cell into a single `TidOf` + `BrTable`. The compiler always guards `Unbox` with the branch; an unguarded one still verifies but traps on mismatch — the safety net, like a bounds check."
msgstr ""
"`opaque.downcast<T>(o)`（产出 `?T`）：`TidOf`；对照 `T` 的 id 比较并分支；命中臂上 `Unbox`，未命中给一个 nil 盒。这个检查是可见的数据流——编译器对重复检查做 CSE、外提不变的检查，并把同一单元上的向下转型链折叠成单个 `TidOf` + `BrTable`。编译器总是用分支守卫 `Unbox`；未守卫的仍能通过校验，但会在不匹配时触发陷阱——那是安全网，如同边界检查。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:167
msgid ""
"Statically-answered `is` expressions never emit an op — the checker folded them ([The compiler pipeline](compiler.md))."
msgstr "静态可判的 `is` 表达式绝不发出操作——检查器已把它们折叠（[编译器流水线](compiler.md)）。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:172
msgid "`async fn` compiles to a state machine with **zero extra opcodes**:"
msgstr "`async fn` 编译成状态机，**零额外操作码**："


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:174
msgid ""
"Each `await` is a checkpoint state — one enum-member-style singleton per suspension point, stored in the hidden frame's state field."
msgstr "每个 `await` 是一个检查点状态——每个挂起点一个枚举成员式的单例，存放在隐藏帧的状态字段里。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:176
msgid "Resume dispatch is the existing `BrTable` over that state."
msgstr "恢复分派就是现有的、以该状态为索引的 `BrTable`。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:177
msgid "Locals live across suspension as cell-backed frame fields (`GetF`/`SetF`)."
msgstr "局部变量以单元支撑的帧字段（`GetF`/`SetF`）跨挂起存活。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:179
msgid ""
"The driven half is an ordinary `CallI` through the future's `yield` vtable row; suspension is a plain `Ret`."
msgstr "被驱动的那一半是一次普通的 `CallI`，走 future 的 `yield` vtable 行；挂起是一次普通的 `Ret`。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:182
msgid ""
"The wire format is untouched by the async plan — bundles and binaries from the same compiler version stay compatible. The driving loop that wakes these frames is [VM core](vm-core.md)'s scheduler; the surface semantics are [Async and await](async.md)."
msgstr ""
"线上格式不被异步计划触动——同一编译器版本的捆绑包与二进制保持兼容。唤醒这些帧的驱动循环是 [VM 核心](vm-core.md)的调度器；表面语义在[异步与 await](async.md)。"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:187
msgid "Budget hooks in the stream"
msgstr "流中的预算钩子"


#: src/reference/typed-bytecode.md:189
msgid ""
"The only budget artifacts in the op stream are `LoopHead` markers: loop back-edges are natural checkpoints where fuel is accounted ([Resource limits and fuel](resource-limits.md)). Everything else — fuel countdown, heap checks at allocation, interrupt slices — lives in the interpreter loop, not in the code."
msgstr ""
"操作流中仅有的预算产物是 `LoopHead` 标记：循环回边是天然的检查点，燃料在此记账（[资源限制与燃料](resource-limits.md)）。其余一切——燃料倒计数、分配时的堆检查、中断切片——都住在解释器循环里，不在代码里。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:3
msgid ""
"The compiled module artifact — a `.rutc` file — is a versioned, deterministic, hash-stable serialization of a linked program. Encoder and decoder live in `rut-core/src/binary.rs`; this page is the layout, the verification contract, and the constant-pool rules. The loader that runs verification is [Loading and the embed loop](loading.md)."
msgstr ""
"编译好的模块产物——一个 `.rutc` 文件——是链接后程序的带版本、确定性、哈希稳定的序列化。编码器与解码器住在 `rut-core/src/binary.rs`；本页是布局、校验契约与常量池规则。执行校验的加载器见[加载与嵌入循环](loading.md)。"


