#: src/reference/module-binary.md:32
msgid ""
"The `Surface` is the export record — functions, constants, types, traits, impl registrations, and the builtin names `core` publishes. It is how a _using_ module binds a _used_ module's members at compile time; since v16 it is part of the wire format too — the surface section rides after `exports`, and decode validates every row against the tables above it."
msgstr ""
"`Surface` 是导出记录——函数、常量、类型、trait、impl 注册，以及 `core` 发布的内建名字。_使用方_模块在编译期就是靠它绑定_被使用_模块的成员；自 v16 起它也是线上格式的一部分——surface 节跟在 `exports` 之后，解码会对照上方的各个表校验它的每一行。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:38
msgid "Wire layout"
msgstr "线上布局"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:40
msgid ""
"The format is little-endian, everywhere — encoded words, hash inputs, checksums. The first byte of a byte range is the least significant byte of word 0; this is a law pinned by unit tests, not an accident of the host."
msgstr "这个格式处处小端序——编码的字、哈希输入、校验和。一个字节范围的首字节就是第 0 个字的最低有效字节；这是由单元测试钉住的法则，不是宿主的偶然。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:45
msgid ""
"```\n"
"offset  field\n"
"0       magic \"RUTC\"                      # 4 bytes\n"
"4       version: u32                      # refuses any other value\n"
"8       name: str\n"
"        name table: u32 count, then count × str\n"
"        types: u32 count, then per type { name: IdentId, kind }\n"
"        traits: u32 count, then per trait { name, methods[] }\n"
"        trait slots: u32 count, then (trait: u32, method: u32) pairs\n"
"        vtables: u32 entries, then per entry { ty, [(slot, func)] }  # sparse\n"
"        disposal rows: u32 entries, then (ty, func) pairs            # sparse\n"
"        consts: u32 count, then tag + payload (below)\n"
"        funcs: u32 count, then per func (below)\n"
"        exports: u32 count, then (name: IdentId, func: u32) pairs\n"
"        instantiation ledger: type rows, then fn identities   # v17, below\n"
"        surface: namespace, funcs, consts, types + scope blocks + type\n"
"                 exports, traits, impls (both ABI lists), the reserved\n"
"                 inherent-impl table, native rows   # v16, below\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```offset  field0       magic \"RUTC\"                      # 4 bytes4       version: u32                      # refuses any other value8       name: str        name table: u32 count, then count × str        types: u32 count, then per type { name: IdentId, kind }        traits: u32 count, then per trait { name, methods[] }        trait slots: u32 count, then (trait: u32, method: u32) pairs        vtables: u32 entries, then per entry { ty, [(slot, func)] }  # sparse        disposal rows: u32 entries, then (ty, func) pairs            # sparse        consts: u32 count, then tag + payload (below)        funcs: u32 count, then per func (below)        exports: u32 count, then (name: IdentId, func: u32) pairs        instantiation ledger: type rows, then fn identities   # v17, below        surface: namespace, funcs, consts, types + scope blocks + type                 exports, traits, impls (both ABI lists), the reserved                 inherent-impl table, native rows   # v16, below```"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:65
msgid ""
"**Name table.** Names are interner ids everywhere — type names, field names, enum members, trait/method names, function names, exports. The binary carries only the interner's _non-well-known tail_; the fixed well-known prefix (`self`, `nil`, the builtin members, the primitives, …) is implied by the format. Decoding rebuilds the interner, so a decoded program is self-contained; at link, each module's tail merges into the linked program's table with the same rebase the type ids get."
msgstr ""
"**名字表。**名字处处都是驻留器 id——类型名、字段名、枚举成员、trait/方法名、函数名、导出。二进制只携带驻留器的_非知名尾部_；固定的知名前缀（`self`、`nil`、各内建成员、各基本类型……）由格式隐含。解码会重建驻留器，因此解码出的程序是自包含的；链接时，每个模块的尾部以与类型 id 相同的重定基合并进链接后程序的表。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:72
msgid ""
"**Type kinds** encode as a one-byte tag: nil, primitives, `str`, `bytes`, arrays, enums (member + value pairs), records (field table), trait objects, `opaque`, fn types, `?T`, trace, string builder, `Weak<T>`."
msgstr ""
"**类型种类**编码为一个单字节标签：nil、基本类型、`str`、`bytes`、数组、枚举（成员 + 值对）、记录（字段表）、trait 对象、`opaque`、fn 类型、`?T`、trace、字符串构建器、`Weak<T>`。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:75
msgid ""
"**Const tags**: `0` i64, `1` f64, `2` bool, `4` str, `5` type id. Retired tags fail decode loudly rather than being reinterpreted."
msgstr ""
"**常量标签**：`0` i64、`1` f64、`2` bool、`4` str、`5` 类型 id。已退役的标签会让解码响亮地失败，而不是被重新解释。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:77
msgid ""
"**Funcs** serialize in full: name, param/ret types, `is_method`, capture count, the typed register table, both operand pools, the op stream, the span table, the parallel `(line, col)` position table, and the host-fn binding id when the function is a bodyless thunk."
msgstr ""
"**函数**完整序列化：名字、参数/返回类型、`is_method`、捕获计数、带类型的寄存器表、两个操作数池、操作流、span 表、平行的 `(line, col)` 位置表，以及函数为无体 thunk 时的宿主函数绑定 id。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:81
msgid ""
"**Instantiation ledger** (v17): the owner-anchored identity of every instantiation the program compiled — type rows `(owner, decl, arguments, type id)` first, then fn identities (the kind, the substitution values, and the local fn id). Instantiation is owned by the declaring package, and link unifies rows sharing a key into ONE program-wide row; a consumer resolves its requests against a packaged binary's ledger. Type exports carry their generic parameter lists beside this (see the surface below)."
msgstr ""
"**实例化台账**（v17）：程序编译过的每个实例化的属主锚定身份——先是类型行 `(owner, decl, arguments, type id)`，再是函数身份（种类、替换值、局部 fn id）。实例化归声明包所有，链接把共享同一键的行统一为全程序唯一的一行；消费方针对打包二进制的台账解析自己的请求。类型导出在其旁携带自己的泛型参数表（见下方表面）。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:89
msgid ""
"**Surface** (v16): the exported surface rides after `exports` — the namespace head, funcs (with their async/host rows), consts, the carried type descriptors + scope blocks + type exports (generic exports carry their parameter names in order, v17), trait decls, impl registrations in both ABI lists, a reserved length-prefixed inherent-impl table (zero rows until class methods link), and the native rows with their ambient bits. Names are ids into the name table above; decode rejects any id its tables cannot resolve."
msgstr ""
"**表面**（v16）：导出的表面随行在 `exports` 之后——命名空间头、函数（带 async/host 行）、常量、携带的类型描述符 + 作用域块 + 类型导出（泛型导出按序携带参数名，v17）、trait 声明、两个 ABI 列表的 impl 注册、一张保留的定长前缀固有 impl 表（类方法可链接之前为零行），以及带环境位的原生行。名字是上文名字表里的 id；解码拒绝任何其表无法解析的 id。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:97
msgid ""
"**Versioning policy**: the version `u32` must equal the toolchain's exactly — there is no migration or best-effort decode. A byte that changes observable behavior bumps the version; artifacts from older compilers are refused with the standard version error."
msgstr ""
"**版本策略**：版本 `u32` 必须与工具链的完全相等——没有迁移，也没有尽力而为的解码。任何改变可观察行为的字节都会提升版本；来自旧编译器的产物以标准的版本错误被拒绝。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:104
msgid ""
"Same AST + same dependency versions + same compiler version ⇒ byte-identical bytes. Serialization order is fixed (mount order, manifest order, pool order), so binaries are cacheable by content hash, two builds diff to nothing, and a trace captured against one binary can be restored against a locally rebuilt one ([Diagnostics, traces, and symbolication](diagnostics.md))."
msgstr ""
"相同 AST + 相同依赖版本 + 相同编译器版本 ⇒ 逐字节相同。序列化顺序是固定的（挂载顺序、清单顺序、池顺序），因此二进制可按内容哈希缓存，两次构建 diff 为零，而针对一个二进制捕获的追踪可以针对本地重建的二进制还原（[诊断、追踪与符号化](diagnostics.md)）。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:111
msgid "Strip levels"
msgstr "剥离级别"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:113
msgid ""
"The symbolication data rides in every function: the `spans` table (pc → byte offset) and the parallel `pos` table (pc → line/col). A build that skips filling `pos` produces a binary whose traces still capture and render, degrading to pc-only text. Names ride the interner; dropping name strings is a publishing choice, and stripped traces restore through recompilation-by-determinism (see [Diagnostics, traces, and symbolication](diagnostics.md))."
msgstr ""
"符号化数据随每个函数走：`spans` 表（pc → 字节偏移）与平行的 `pos` 表（pc → 行/列）。跳过填充 `pos` 的构建产出的二进制，其追踪仍能捕获并渲染，只是退化为仅 pc 的文本。名字随驻留器走；丢弃名字字符串是发布时的选择，被剥离的追踪经由确定性重编译还原（见[诊断、追踪与符号化](diagnostics.md)）。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:121
msgid ""
"Both strippable halves are format-legal encodings, not special cases: tail strings are opaque to the format (rewriting them to mangled `%N` names touches no id, opcode, or table), and `0`/empty `pos` is the documented stripped encoding — a stripped binary decodes and verifies identically, no version bump required. The toolchain lane that produces and restores them — the mangle/keep-set law, the private `.rutsym` sidecar, and `run --symbols` — is [Symbol stripping and `.rutsym` sidecars](symbol-stripping.md)."
msgstr ""
"两个可剥离的部分都是格式合法的编码，不是特例：尾部字符串对格式是透明的（把它们改写成 `%N` 这样的改名不触碰任何 id、操作码或表），而 `0`/空 `pos` 就是有文档记载的已剥离编码——剥离后的二进制照样解码与校验，不需要版本升级。产出并还原它们的工具链车道——改名/保留集法则、私有的 `.rutsym` 旁车、以及 `run --symbols`——见[符号剥离与 `.rutsym` 旁车](symbol-stripping.md)。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:130
msgid "Type ids at rest and at link"
msgstr "静止时与链接时的类型 id"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:132
msgid ""
"Type ids are program-global in a linked binary only because **link** already rebased them. At rest (per module, pre-link) ids are module-local; the boot table — the fixed primitive and builtin prefix — is shared by every module, and each module's remaining types append after it. Every type id reachable from a type descriptor, trait signature, constant, function signature, or op operand is remapped at link, and `type_id<T>()` constants rebase with everything else."
msgstr ""
"类型 id 在链接后的二进制里是程序全局的，只是因为 **link** 已经重定基过它们。静止时（链接前的每模块状态）id 是模块局部的；启动表——固定的基本类型与内建前缀——被每个模块共享，各模块剩余的类型追加在它之后。从类型描述符、trait 签名、常量、函数签名或操作操作数可达的每个类型 id 都在链接时重映射，`type_id<T>()` 常量与其余一切一起重定基。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:140
msgid ""
"`type_id<T>()` values are `u32`, comparable, and unique per _instantiated_ type within a VM run: `Vec<f32>` ≠ `Vec<f64>`, `[i32; 3]` ≠ `[i32; 4]` (the constant length is part of the identity), and `Point` = `Point` across modules — identity is assigned at link ([Reified types and layout](reified-types.md))."
msgstr ""
"`type_id<T>()` 的值是 `u32`，可比较，且在单次 VM 运行内对每个_已实例化_类型唯一：`Vec<f32>` ≠ `Vec<f64>`，`[i32; 3]` ≠ `[i32; 4]`（常量长度是同一性的一部分），而跨模块的 `Point` = `Point`——同一性在链接时分配（[具体化类型与布局](reified-types.md)）。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:146
msgid "Trait and impl tables"
msgstr "trait 与 impl 表"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:148
msgid ""
"Traits serialize with their method signatures; trait ids merge by name at link — a trait imported in one module and declared in another is one trait, and every `IsTrait` probe and vtable slot lands on the same global table."
msgstr ""
"trait 连同其方法签名一起序列化；trait id 在链接时按名字合并——一个模块导入、另一个模块声明的 trait 是同一个 trait，每个 `IsTrait` 探查和 vtable 槽位都落在同一张全局表上。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:152
msgid ""
"Trait-method slots are a global table of `(trait, method)` pairs; vtables are per-type sparse maps slot → function id, merged at link. A trait impl registered in any module reaches every call site."
msgstr ""
"trait 方法槽位是一张 `(trait, method)` 对的全局表；vtable 是每类型的稀疏映射 slot → 函数 id，在链接时合并。在任何模块注册的 trait impl 都能抵达每个调用点。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:155
msgid ""
"**Impl registrations** `(trait, target)` merge at link; a duplicate pair is a **link error** — per-module compiles cannot see each other, so the pair's uniqueness is a link-level law ([Traits and dispatch](traits.md))."
msgstr ""
"**impl 注册** `(trait, target)` 在链接时合并；重复的组合是**链接错误**——每模块编译彼此不可见，因此组合的唯一性是一条链接级法则（[trait 与分派](traits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:160
msgid "Verification (load time)"
msgstr "校验（加载期）"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:162
msgid ""
"Before any code executes, the verifier re-checks every function in the binary:"
msgstr "在任何代码执行之前，校验器会重新检查二进制里的每个函数："


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:165 src/reference/bundles.md:295
msgid "check"
msgstr "检查"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:167
msgid "register range"
msgstr "寄存器范围"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:167
msgid ""
"every register operand \\< the function's register-file size; `NOREG` legal only where an optional operand is defined"
msgstr "每个寄存器操作数 \\< 该函数的寄存器文件大小；`NOREG` 仅在定义了可选操作数之处合法"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:168
msgid "pool spans"
msgstr "池跨度"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:168
msgid "every `(off, argc)` span lands inside its function's `argv` / `labels` pool"
msgstr "每个 `(off, argc)` 跨度都落在其函数的 `argv` / `labels` 池之内"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:169
msgid "type operands"
msgstr "类型操作数"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:169
msgid "every type id names a row of the type table"
msgstr "每个类型 id 都指名类型表的一行"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:170
msgid "jump targets"
msgstr "跳转目标"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:170
msgid "every `jmp`/`br`/`brtable` target is in range"
msgstr "每个 `jmp`/`br`/`brtable` 目标都在范围内"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:171
msgid "call arity"
msgstr "调用元数"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:171
msgid "call argument counts match the callee's declared signature"
msgstr "调用实参数量与被调用者声明的签名匹配"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:172
msgid "enum members"
msgstr "枚举成员"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:172
msgid "`EnumNew` member indices in range, target actually an enum"
msgstr "`EnumNew` 成员索引在范围内，目标确实是枚举"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:173
msgid "host thunks"
msgstr "宿主 thunk"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:173
msgid "bodyless functions are skipped (nothing to verify)"
msgstr "无函数体的函数被跳过（没有可校验的东西）"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:175
msgid ""
"A failed verification is a **load error** naming the module and function — `function name (#i): op @pc: message`. Corrupted binaries never execute. Verification is structural: it re-establishes what the compiler enforced at emit time, so a hand-corrupted or stale artifact fails here instead of misbehaving at runtime."
msgstr ""
"校验失败是一次点名模块与函数的**加载错误**——`function name (#i): op @pc: message`。损坏的二进制绝不执行。校验是结构性的：它重新确立编译器在发出时强制的东西，因此手工损坏或陈旧的产物在这里失败，而不是在运行时行为不端。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:181
msgid "The constant pool and load-time expressions"
msgstr "常量池与加载期表达式"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:183
msgid ""
"Module-level `let` and `static` initializers are **folded at compile time**. The surviving forms are: literals, enum members, operators over constants, record literals (immortal constant-pool cells), fixed-array literals, `Vec<T>(n)` / `Vec.from([...])` blobs, the layout builtins, and `Array<T, N>.len()` with const-index bounds checks. A call to a user function in an initializer is a compile error — there is no deferred evaluation."
msgstr ""
"模块级 `let` 与 `static` 初始化器在**编译期折叠**。存留的形式是：字面量、枚举成员、常量之上的运算符、记录字面量（不朽的常量池单元）、定长数组字面量、`Vec<T>(n)` / `Vec.from([...])` 块、布局内建，以及带常量索引边界检查的 `Array<T, N>.len()`。初始化器里对用户函数的调用是编译错误——没有延迟求值。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:191
msgid ""
"`type_id<T>()` never executes: it folds to a constant from the type table. `debug` position folding and trace symbolication are covered in [Diagnostics, traces, and symbolication](diagnostics.md)."
msgstr ""
"`type_id<T>()` 绝不执行：它从类型表折叠成常量。`debug` 位置折叠与追踪符号化见[诊断、追踪与符号化](diagnostics.md)。"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:195 src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:142
msgid "What is not here"
msgstr "这里没有什么"


#: src/reference/module-binary.md:197
msgid ""
"A `.d.rut` declaration surface does not produce a binary — it has no bodies, so it compiles to a signature surface only ([Host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md)). And a `.rutbundle` is binaries plus their container: the compiled packages ride as `.rutc` binaries (this format), splice-needed packages and host pkgs as source groups ([Module bundles](bundles.md))."
msgstr ""
"`.d.rut` 声明表面不会产出二进制——它没有函数体，只编译为签名表面（[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)）。而 `.rutbundle` 是二进制加它们的容器：编译过的包以 `.rutc` 二进制随行（本格式），需要拼接的包与宿主包则以源码组随行（[模块捆绑包](bundles.md)）。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:3
msgid ""
"A publisher can ship a compiled artifact whose function, type, field, trait, and method names — and source positions — are unreadable, while keeping a private **symbol table** that, when supplied at load time, restores the real names and line/col for [stack-trace symbolication](diagnostics.md). Users holding only the binary see mangled names and pc-only traces; users holding the sidecar see the real thing."
msgstr ""
"发布者可以发布一个编译产物：其中的函数、类型、字段、trait 与方法名字——以及源码位置——都不可读，同时保留一份私有**符号表**；在加载时提供这份符号表，就能为[栈追踪符号化](diagnostics.md)还原真实名字与行/列。只拿到二进制的人看到的是改名后的名字与仅 pc 的追踪；拿到旁车的人看到真实的东西。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:11
msgid ""
"The VM changes nothing: symbolication is lazy, per-index, against the loaded program's interner and position tables — restoring is a matter of what the loaded program carries ([Diagnostics, traces, and symbolication](diagnostics.md))."
msgstr ""
"VM 一行不改：符号化是惰性的、按下标的、对着已加载程序的驻留器与位置表进行的——还原只取决于加载的程序携带了什么（[诊断、追踪与符号化](diagnostics.md)）。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:16
msgid "The model"
msgstr "模型"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:19
msgid ""
"# packed plugins/server -> server.rutbundle (...) + symbol table\n"
msgstr ""
"# packed plugins/server -> server.rutbundle (...) + symbol table\n"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:24
msgid "Two files leave the build:"
msgstr "构建产出两个文件："


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:26 src/reference/cli.md:163
msgid "file"
msgstr "文件"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:28
msgid "`server.rutbundle`"
msgstr "`server.rutbundle`"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:28
msgid ""
"the public artifact — every renameable name mangled, every function's symbolication tables gone"
msgstr "公开产物——每个可改名的名字都改了名，每个函数的符号化表都已抽走"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:29
msgid "`server.rutsym`"
msgstr "`server.rutsym`"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:29
msgid ""
"the private half — mangled → original name rows, and the span/position tables per module"
msgstr "私有的一半——改名 → 原名的行，以及每模块的区间/位置表"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:31
msgid ""
"The sidecar is **never an entry inside the bundle**. It rides beside it, and whoever holds it may restore; whoever holds only the bundle cannot. It is also not encrypted or obfuscated — see the limitations below."
msgstr "旁车**绝不是捆绑包里的一个条目**。它随行在捆绑包旁边：持有它可以还原，只持有捆绑包则不能。它也没有加密或混淆——见下文的限制。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:35
msgid "What is renamed"
msgstr "改什么名"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:37
msgid ""
"Everything name-shaped a binary carries: function names, type names, field names, trait and method names, enum members, and the exported surface rows. Renaming is purely a **tail rewrite**: every name in a `.rutc` is an interned-id index, and the binary serializes only the name table's instance-local tail ([Module binary and verification](module-binary.md)) — rewriting those tail strings touches nothing else. Ids, opcodes, vtables, fn tables, and type layouts are untouched, so **no format-version bump rides this**: a stripped binary decodes and verifies identically, and `0`/empty position tables are the documented stripped encoding."
msgstr ""
"二进制携带的一切名字形状的东西：函数名、类型名、字段名、trait 与方法名、枚举成员，以及导出表面的行。改名纯粹是**尾部重写**：`.rutc` 里的每个名字都是指入驻留器的 id，而二进制只序列化名字表的实例本地尾部（[模块二进制与校验](module-binary.md)）——重写这些尾部字符串不触碰任何其他东西。id、操作码、虚表、函数表、类型布局原封不动，所以**这不需要格式版本升级**：剥离后的二进制照样解码与校验，`0`/空位置表就是有文档记载的已剥离编码。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:48
msgid ""
"Mangled names are **`%0`, `%1`, …** — sequential over the sorted union of renameable names across the whole packed closure (deterministic and collision-free). `%` can never appear in an identifier or a package name, so a mangled string cannot collide with any source-derived name by construction."
msgstr ""
"改名后的名字是 **`%0`、`%1`……**——按整个打包闭包里可改名名字的排序并集顺序编号（确定且无冲突）。`%` 永远不会出现在标识符或包名里，所以改名字符串在构造上就不可能与任何源自源码的名字冲突。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:54
msgid ""
"Mangling is one closure-wide string→string map applied to every compiled group in the bundle — never per-group random names. Bundles link across `.rutc` groups by name text at load (trait merge-by-name, the instantiation-ledger keys), and a consistent map preserves all cross-group identity for free."
msgstr ""
"改名用的是一张闭包级的字符串→字符串映射，应用到捆绑包里的每个编译组——绝不是每组随机的名字。捆绑包在加载时按名字文本跨 `.rutc` 组链接（trait 按名字合并、实例化台账的键），而一致的映射免费保住所有跨组同一性。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:60
msgid "The keep-set"
msgstr "保留集"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:62
msgid "Some names are load-bearing and never rename:"
msgstr "有些名字承重，绝不改名："


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:64
msgid "kept"
msgstr "保留"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:64
msgid "why"
msgstr "为什么"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:66
msgid "well-known names (`main`, the builtin members, the primitives)"
msgstr "知名名字（`main`、各内建成员、各基本类型）"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:66
msgid "never in the serialized tail"
msgstr "从不在序列化的尾部里"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:67
msgid ""
"host-fn registration names (`FuncCode.host_id`, `SurfaceFn.host`, host thunks)"
msgstr "宿主函数的注册名（`FuncCode.host_id`、`SurfaceFn.host`、宿主 thunk）"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:67
msgid "the embedder's registry keys — `ink_host::log`, `rt:log`, …"
msgstr "嵌入方的注册表键——`ink_host::log`、`rt:log`……"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:68
msgid "export names"
msgstr "导出名"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:68
msgid "hosts call by string (`vm.call(\"main\", …)`)"
msgstr "宿主按字符串调用（`vm.call(\"main\", …)`）"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:69
msgid "package specs in instantiation rows"
msgstr "实例化行里的包名"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:69
msgid "load-time unification keys"
msgstr "加载期的合一键"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:71
msgid ""
"`Program::name` (the module's display name in traces) is a plain string field, not an interned name — it stays as-is. Local variable names never exist at runtime (registers only), so there is nothing to strip there."
msgstr ""
"`Program::name`（追踪里模块的显示名）是一个普通字符串字段，不是驻留器名字——原样保留。局部变量名在运行时根本不存在（只有寄存器），所以这里没有可剥离的东西。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:75
msgid "Positions"
msgstr "位置"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:77
msgid ""
"The pc → byte-offset span table and the parallel pc → (line, col) position table leave **together**, per function, and restore together. Without them, `StackTrace.line(i)`/`col(i)` read `0` and `render()` degrades to the pc-only form — the behavior is unchanged, only the diagnostics lose fidelity ([Diagnostics](diagnostics.md))."
msgstr ""
"pc → 字节偏移的区间表与平行的 pc →（行，列）位置表**一起**离开（逐函数），也一起还原。没有它们，`StackTrace.line(i)`/`col(i)` 读到 `0`，`render()` 退化为仅 pc 的形态——行为不变，只有诊断损失保真度（[诊断](diagnostics.md)）。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:83
msgid "The mixed-closure refusal"
msgstr "混合闭包的拒绝"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:85
msgid ""
"`--strip` needs a **fully-compiled** closure. A package riding as a source group (the `inline` flag, or a host declaration) would bind its compiled dependencies' surfaces at load — and those names are mangled. The packer refuses rather than guesses:"
msgstr ""
"`--strip` 需要一个**全编译**的闭包。以源码组随行的包（`inline` 旗标，或宿主声明）会在加载时绑定其编译依赖的表面——而那些名字已改名。打包器拒绝而非猜测："


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:97
msgid ""
"Host and declaration leaf groups have no compiled dependencies and pass trivially. A refused world packs fine without `--strip`."
msgstr "宿主与声明的叶子组没有编译依赖，平凡地通过。被拒绝的世界不加 `--strip` 照样打包。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:100 src/reference/bundles.md:380
msgid "CLI"
msgstr "CLI"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:103
msgid ""
"# + out.rutsym beside it\n"
msgstr ""
"# + out.rutsym beside it\n"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:107
msgid ""
"`--strip` writes the bundle as today plus the sibling sidecar (`mod.rutbundle` → `mod.rutsym`) and prints both paths."
msgstr "`--strip` 照今天一样写出捆绑包，外加旁边的旁车（`mod.rutbundle` → `mod.rutsym`），并打印两个路径。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:109
msgid ""
"`--symbols` is legal only against a compiled `.rutbundle` — the source and directory lanes compile fresh and need no map (a mismatched input is a usage error). The table restores **before** the graph compiles, so linking and every trace see real names. A section naming a module the bundle does not carry draws a warning; a table from a different build simply matches nothing and errors nothing."
msgstr ""
"`--symbols` 只对编译的 `.rutbundle` 合法——源码与目录车道重新编译，不需要映射（不匹配的输入是用法错误）。符号表在图编译**之前**还原，所以链接与每条追踪看到的都是真实名字。命名了捆绑包未携带模块的分节会告警；来自另一次构建的符号表什么都不匹配，也不报错。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:116
msgid ""
"Embedders get the same lane as library calls: the packer's `pack_dir_opts` returns the sidecar bytes beside the bundle, and `apply_symbols_to_session` restores into a mounted session."
msgstr ""
"嵌入方以库调用的形式得到同一条车道：打包器的 `pack_dir_opts` 把旁车字节随捆绑包一起返回，`apply_symbols_to_session` 把它还原进已挂载的会话。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:120
msgid "Determinism and limitations"
msgstr "确定性与限制"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:122
msgid ""
"Same input directory ⇒ byte-identical bundle ⇒ byte-identical sidecar (the mangled numbering is sorted-union based, like everything else in the pack). That determinism is also the honest limitation:"
msgstr "相同输入目录 ⇒ 逐字节相同的捆绑包 ⇒ 逐字节相同的旁车（改名的编号按排序并集，与打包里其他一切一样）。这份确定性也是那条诚实的限制："


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:126
msgid ""
"**String values are data, not names** — string constants in the binary stay exactly as the source wrote them. Stripping hides identifiers; it does not scrub string literals."
msgstr "**字符串值是数据，不是名字**——二进制里的字符串常量与源码所写逐字相同。剥离隐藏标识符；它不清除字符串字面量。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:129
msgid ""
"**The sidecar is the private half, not a secret.** Anyone holding the original source can rebuild the same closure deterministically and regenerate an identical map. Treat `.rutsym` like a `.pdb`: distribute it only to parties who may see names and positions."
msgstr ""
"**旁车是私有的一半，不是秘密。**任何持有原始源码的人都能确定性地重建同一闭包，再生成一份相同的映射。把 `.rutsym` 当作 `.pdb` 对待：只分发给被允许看到名字与位置的一方。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:133
msgid ""
"**Stripping and the generic-source riding law refuse each other.** A compiled pkg whose surface exports generics rides its source (so consumer-spelled shapes compile at the link), and the ridden text would recompile clean-named beside mangled binaries — the packer refuses `--strip` on such a closure and says so. A fully concrete-class closure (no generic exports anywhere) strips as before, and a consumer binding a stripped compiled group's surface later is still a loud unification miss, never a mislink."
msgstr ""
"**剥离与泛型源码承载法则互相拒绝。** 表面导出泛型的编译 pkg 会承载其源码（使消费者拼写的形状在链接处编译），而被承载的文本会在被改名的二进制旁以干净名字重新编译 —— 打包器拒绝在这类闭包上使用 `--strip` 并说明缘由。完全具体类的闭包（任何地方都无泛型导出）照旧剥离，而稍后从源码扩展一个已剥离编译组表面的消费者仍是大声的统一失败，绝非错误链接。"


#: src/reference/symbol-stripping.md:144
msgid ""
"`rut dump` on a `.rutc` with `--symbols`, and auto-keeping the shared surfaces of a mixed closure (so it could strip anyway), are natural follow-ups; neither ships today."
msgstr ""
"对 `.rutc` 的 `rut dump` 支持 `--symbols`，以及混合闭包共享表面的自动保留（让它本来就能剥离），都是自然的后续；今天都不随版本发布。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:3
msgid ""
"One struct, one thread, one heap. The VM (`rut-vm`) interprets [typed bytecode](typed-bytecode.md) over an RC heap with inline destruction — no JIT, no garbage-collection pass, no background threads."
msgstr ""
"一个结构体、一个线程、一个堆。VM（`rut-vm`）在带内联析构的 RC 堆之上解释[类型化字节码](typed-bytecode.md)——没有 JIT，没有垃圾回收趟，没有后台线程。"


