#: src/reference/vm-core.md:26
msgid ""
"A `Vm` is single-threaded by construction: workers are separate VMs ([Workers and channels](workers-and-channels.md)). Saved frames are plain records `{ func, pc, regs, ret_dst }`; calls push, returns pop. Register files are recycled through a pool, and per-function side tables (reference-typed register indices, per-type field layouts, baked type representations) keep the hot loop free of type-table lookups."
msgstr ""
"`Vm` 从构造上就是单线程的：worker 是独立的 VM（[worker 与通道](workers-and-channels.md)）。保存的帧是普通记录 `{ func, pc, regs, ret_dst }`；调用压入，返回弹出。寄存器文件经由一个池回收，而每函数旁表（引用型寄存器索引、每类型字段布局、烘焙好的类型表示）让热循环无需查询类型表。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:33
msgid "The interpreter loop"
msgstr "解释器循环"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:35
msgid ""
"The loop is a `match` over decoded ops — `decode` is a table index, not a byte scan. On native targets the default engine is a **threaded** dispatcher (`rut-vm-threaded`): every op ends by tail-calling the next op's handler, so dispatch is a jump and hot state stays in registers. A portable loop over the same handler methods backs wasm and other targets; behavior is identical, only the dispatch shape differs. Ops the threaded engine does not absorb _bail_ to the match interpreter with the pc pinned at the op."
msgstr ""
"循环是对解码后操作的 `match`——`decode` 是一次表索引，不是字节扫描。在原生目标上，默认引擎是一个**线程化**分派器（`rut-vm-threaded`）：每个操作以尾调用下一个操作的处理例程收尾，因此分派就是一次跳转，热状态留在寄存器里。一个对相同处理例程方法的可移植循环支撑 wasm 及其他目标；行为完全一致，只有分派形状不同。线程化引擎吸收不了的操作会_退回_ match 解释器，pc 钉在该操作上。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:44
msgid "Direct calls are an index + jump; trait calls are two loads (vtable row)"
msgstr "直接调用是一次索引 + 跳转；trait 调用是两次加载（vtable 行）"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:45
msgid "an indirect jump."
msgstr "一次间接跳转。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:46
msgid ""
"Refcount retain/release are inline in the loop; a release to zero nulls the weak list, queues the type's `dispose` body (the `Disposal` contract), and frees ([The Rc heap and destructors](rc-heap.md))."
msgstr ""
"引用计数的保留/释放在循环内联；释放到零会把弱列表置空，把该类型的 `dispose` 函数体排入队列（`Disposal` 契约），然后释放（[Rc 堆与析构器](rc-heap.md)）。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:50
msgid ""
"Fuel is accounted per op, with the fuller budget check amortized every `interrupt_every` ops."
msgstr "燃料按操作记账，更完整的预算检查每 `interrupt_every` 个操作摊销一次。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:55
msgid ""
"The embedder's host-fn binding table (`HostRegistry`) is built **before** the `Vm` exists and is consumed at construction: every host thunk the program declares is resolved against the registry immediately, so a declared-but-unbound host fn is a _construction error_, never a mid-run trap. The join produces one dense dispatch row per function — an adapter code pointer, the body's state word, the declared return type, and its is-reference verdict — so calling a host fn costs one table copy, no name work, no allocation."
msgstr ""
"嵌入方的宿主函数绑定表（`HostRegistry`）在 `Vm` 存在**之前**构建，并在构造时被消费：程序声明的每个宿主 thunk 都立即对照注册表解析，因此声明了却未绑定的宿主函数是一个_构造错误_，绝不是运行中途的陷阱。这次 join 为每个函数产出一条稠密的分派行——一个适配器代码指针、函数体的状态字、声明的返回类型及其是否引用的判定——因此调用一个宿主函数的代价是一次表复制，没有名字工作，没有分配。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:64
msgid ""
"Host bodies are plain Rust functions over `&mut Vm` and slots; arity is capped at 8 (the boundary's tuple law), and signatures are derived from the body's Rust shape, not written by hand."
msgstr ""
"宿主函数体是架在 `&mut Vm` 与槽位之上的普通 Rust 函数；元数上限 8（边界的元组法则），签名从函数体的 Rust 形状推导，不是手写的。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:67
msgid ""
"A host body records a trap in a VM-side channel rather than returning `Result`; the trap fires before any destination register is written."
msgstr "宿主函数体把陷阱记录在一个 VM 侧通道里，而不是返回 `Result`；陷阱在任何目的寄存器被写入之前触发。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:69
msgid ""
"**Re-entrant calls** (a host fn calling back into rut) run the callee on a fresh frame stack under the same budget. The outer cursor is stash/restore: on return or trap the outer frame is exactly as it was, so a propagated nested trap parks the outer frame _at the host op_ and `resume()` re-runs the host fn. A host fn that prefers to handle the situation itself can catch the trap, add fuel, and retry its nested call."
msgstr ""
"**重入调用**（宿主函数回调进 rut）在同一个预算下、用一摞全新的帧栈运行被调用者。外层游标是暂存/恢复式的：返回或陷阱时，外层帧与原先完全一致，因此传播上来的嵌套陷阱会把外层帧停放在_宿主操作处_，`resume()` 会重新运行宿主函数。愿意自行处置局面的宿主函数可以捕获陷阱、补充燃料，然后重试它的嵌套调用。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:76
msgid ""
"The async host-fn lane (`register_async!`) binds a Rust async body to the minted `{scope}::{name}__start/__yield/__take/__cancel` rows the compiler weaves for `host async fn` declarations ([The host futures bridge](host-futures.md))."
msgstr ""
"异步宿主函数链路（`register_async!`）把一个 Rust async 函数体绑定到编译器为 `host async fn` 声明织出的 `{scope}::{name}__start/__yield/__take/__cancel` 铸造行上（[宿主 future 桥](host-futures.md)）。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:81
msgid "Traps"
msgstr "陷阱"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:83
msgid ""
"Bugs are traps, errors are values. Arithmetic overflow, division by zero, indexing out of bounds, nil dereference, `panic(...)`, a failed downcast guard, and budget exhaustion all unwind as `Err(Trap)` — never a Rust panic:"
msgstr ""
"bug 是陷阱，错误是值。算术溢出、除以零、越界索引、nil 解引用、`panic(...)`、失败的向下转型守卫以及预算耗尽，全都以 `Err(Trap)` 的形式展开——绝不是 Rust panic："


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:98
msgid ""
"**Traps are catchable only at the host boundary.** `vm.call(...)` returns `Result`; rut code never catches one — errors in rut are `(T, err)` tuples ([Errors and optionality](../tutorial/errors.md)). On the way out, frames are dropped and destructors run: `dispose` bodies fire, borrow guards release. The `Vm` itself survives a trap — the next call starts clean."
msgstr ""
"**陷阱只在宿主边界可捕获。**`vm.call(...)` 返回 `Result`；rut 代码从不捕获陷阱——rut 里的错误是 `(T, err)` 元组（[错误与可空性](../tutorial/errors.md)）。在出去的路上，帧被丢弃、析构器运行：`dispose` 函数体被触发，借用守卫释放。`Vm` 本身能在陷阱后幸存——下一次调用干净地开始。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:109
msgid ""
"// per-op countdown\n"
msgstr ""
"// per-op countdown\n"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:111
msgid ""
"// default 1024\n"
msgstr ""
"// default 1024\n"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:115
msgid ""
"**Fuel** counts ops down. Exhaustion parks the frame at its pc — the loop state _is_ the frame — so `add_fuel(n)` + `resume()` continues it; nothing is lost or restarted. Loop back-edges carry `LoopHead` markers so tight loops still park."
msgstr ""
"**燃料**按操作倒数。耗尽会把帧停放在它的 pc——循环状态_就是_帧——因此 `add_fuel(n)` + `resume()` 能继续它；没有任何东西丢失或重启。循环回边携带 `LoopHead` 标记，因此紧凑循环也能停放。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:119
msgid ""
"**Heap budget** is checked at every allocation; over-limit allocation traps `OutOfMemory` the same parkable way."
msgstr "**堆预算**在每次分配时检查；超限的分配以同样可停放的方式触发 `OutOfMemory` 陷阱。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:121
msgid ""
"**Heap accounting** is live: `heap_usage()` reports current bytes, `fuel_used` accumulates across resumes."
msgstr "**堆记账**是实时的：`heap_usage()` 报告当前字节数，`fuel_used` 跨恢复累计。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:123
msgid ""
"**Interrupts** are cooperative: the budget check cadence bounds how long any host-requested stop can take. Native (host) bodies run outside the fuel budget and are expected to be fast."
msgstr "**中断**是协作式的：预算检查的节奏为任何宿主请求的停止所需的时间设了上界。原生（宿主）函数体在燃料预算之外运行，并被期望是快的。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:126
msgid ""
"`Vm::new(prog, &limits, hooks, registry)` takes the limits; a default construction uses unbounded fuel and heap — embedders that need budgets pass them explicitly ([Resource limits and fuel](resource-limits.md))."
msgstr ""
"`Vm::new(prog, &limits, hooks, registry)` 接收限制；默认构造使用无界燃料与堆——需要预算的嵌入方显式传入（[资源限制与燃料](resource-limits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:130
msgid "Coroutines and the driving loop"
msgstr "协程与驱动循环"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:132
msgid ""
"Every async entry runs as a task: a root frame parked when `await` returns pending. There is no microtask queue and no job executor — two queues and a virtual clock:"
msgstr ""
"每个异步入口都作为一个任务运行：`await` 返回 pending 时停放的一个根帧。没有微任务队列，也没有作业执行器——只有两条队列和一个虚拟时钟："


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:136
msgid ""
"`ready: VecDeque<Slot>` — launched or woken frames; each entry owns one reference (retained on enqueue, released on pop)."
msgstr "`ready: VecDeque<Slot>`——已启动或已唤醒的帧；每个条目持有一个引用（入队时保留，出队时释放）。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:138
msgid ""
"`timers: BTreeMap<u64, Vec<Slot>>` — sleep deadlines against the VM's **virtual clock** (`now_ms` / `set_now` — deterministic; the host advances it explicitly, or maps it to wall time)."
msgstr ""
"`timers: BTreeMap<u64, Vec<Slot>>`——对照 VM **虚拟时钟**的 sleep 期限（`now_ms` / `set_now`——确定性的；宿主显式推进它，或把它映射到墙上时间）。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:141
msgid ""
"`drive(fut)` — one re-entrant call of a future's `yield` row: a fresh engine context over the frame edge, answering `Done` or `Parked` off the frame's state field. Fuel accounting rides the per-op budget unchanged: an exhausted drive parks the frame at its pc, and a re-drive re-enters at the checkpoint state."
msgstr ""
"`drive(fut)`——对 future 的 `yield` 行的一次可重入调用：跨帧边缘的一个全新引擎上下文，按帧的状态字段应答 `Done` 或 `Parked`。燃料记账照旧搭在按操作预算上：耗尽的驱动把帧停放在它的 pc，再驱动时从检查点状态重新进入。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:146
msgid ""
"`run_ready()` drains the ready queue one drive per entry; `next_deadline()` expires due timers into `ready` and answers the earliest remaining deadline; `pending_tasks()` is the idle test."
msgstr ""
"`run_ready()` 排空就绪队列，每个条目驱动一次；`next_deadline()` 把到期定时器过期进 `ready` 并应答剩余的最早期限；`pending_tasks()` 是空闲判据。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:149
msgid ""
"The wake pair (awaiter edge on the awaited frame, pending edge on the awaiter) is one-directional and cleared on resume — no cycle forms."
msgstr "唤醒对（被 await 帧上的 awaiter 边、awaiter 上的 pending 边）是单向的，并在恢复时清除——不会成环。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:151
msgid ""
"A completed drive re-enqueues the frame's awaiter edge. A parked async frame is simply not in `ready` until its wake edge or timer fires."
msgstr "一次完成的驱动会重新入队帧的 awaiter 边。停放的异步帧就是不在 `ready` 里，直到它的唤醒边或定时器触发。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:154
msgid ""
"The engine never owns a wall clock: sleeps are virtual-clock deadlines, and tests virtualize time by advancing the clock — full determinism ([Async and await](async.md), [Tasks](tasks.md))."
msgstr ""
"引擎从不拥有墙上时钟：sleep 是虚拟时钟期限，测试通过推进时钟来虚拟化时间——完全确定性（[异步与 await](async.md)、[任务](tasks.md)）。"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:158
msgid "Heap integration"
msgstr "堆集成"


#: src/reference/vm-core.md:160
msgid ""
"Allocation, retain, and release are inline loop work. There is **no collection pass at all**: destruction happens at release-to-zero, so nothing ever interrupts a frame. Strong reference cycles leak by design; the weak-reference machinery and the shutdown leak report are the diagnostic surface ([Weak references and the cycle collector](weak-refs.md), [The Rc heap and destructors](rc-heap.md)). Heap layout, cell formats, and the bump allocator are [The VM heap](vm-heap.md)."
msgstr ""
"分配、保留与释放都是循环内的内联工作。**完全没有收集趟**：析构发生在释放到零的时刻，因此没有任何东西会打断一个帧。强引用循环按设计就是泄漏；弱引用机制与关停时的泄漏报告是诊断表面（[弱引用与循环收集器](weak-refs.md)、[Rc 堆与析构器](rc-heap.md)）。堆布局、单元格式与碰撞分配器见 [VM 堆](vm-heap.md)。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:3
msgid ""
"Loading verifies, links, and mounts a program — it **executes nothing**. The host owns time, I/O, and lifetime: the VM never reads the filesystem or a clock on its own, and the host decides when (and whether) any rut code runs."
msgstr ""
"加载做校验、链接与挂载——它**不执行任何东西**。宿主拥有时间、I/O 与生命周期：VM 从不自行读取文件系统或时钟，何时（以及是否）运行 rut 代码由宿主决定。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:8
msgid "From path to machine"
msgstr "从路径到机器"


#: src/reference/loading.md:11
msgid ""
"# a directory with rut.jsonc\n"
msgstr ""
"# a directory with rut.jsonc\n"


#: src/reference/loading.md:15
msgid ""
"The loader side (`rut-driver`) turns a path into a booted `Vm` in five steps:"
msgstr "加载器一侧（`rut-driver`）用五步把一个路径变成一台启动好的 `Vm`："


#: src/reference/loading.md:18
msgid "step"
msgstr "步骤"


#: src/reference/loading.md:18
msgid "what happens"
msgstr "发生什么"


#: src/reference/loading.md:20
msgid "1. mount"
msgstr "1. 挂载"


#: src/reference/loading.md:20
msgid ""
"A **directory is one module**: its `rut.jsonc` names the package (`name`), its entry (`entry.lib` / `entry.type` / `entry.libs`), and its `deps`/`peer-deps`/`dev-deps` ([Project structure and rut.jsonc](project-structure.md)). A `.rutbundle` mounts identically from a zip ([Module bundles](bundles.md)). The graph walks `deps` recursively — cycle guard, first-mount-wins, name-mismatch is an error — then runs one peer gate over the closed set ([Dependency kinds](dependency-kinds.md))."
msgstr ""
"**一个目录就是一个模块**：它的 `rut.jsonc` 指名包（`name`）、入口（`entry.lib` / `entry.type` / `entry.libs`）以及它的 `deps`/`peer-deps`/`dev-deps`（[项目结构与 rut.jsonc](project-structure.md)）。`.rutbundle` 以同样的方式从 zip 挂载（[模块捆绑包](bundles.md)）。图递归走 `deps`——环守卫、先挂载者胜、名字不匹配是错误——然后在封闭集上跑一道 peer 门（[依赖种类](dependency-kinds.md)）。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:21
msgid "2. resolve surfaces"
msgstr "2. 解析表面"


#: src/reference/loading.md:21
msgid ""
"Use paths resolve against mounted modules, exact and single-step: a package name resolves or the diagnostic names the consumer manifest. A `.d.rut` surface compiles through the checker and publishes signatures only."
msgstr "use 路径对照已挂载的模块解析，精确且单步：包名要么解析，要么诊断点名消费方清单。`.d.rut` 表面穿过检查器编译，只发布签名。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:22
msgid "3. compile the graph"
msgstr "3. 编译图"


#: src/reference/loading.md:22
msgid ""
"Each module compiles (sources, in dependency post-order); `inline = true` packages splice into their consumers instead of linking; host packages synthesize bodyless thunks from their declared surfaces; a mounted bundle's compiled packages push their decoded binaries at fresh, rebased scopes ([The compiler pipeline](compiler.md))."
msgstr ""
"每个模块各自编译（源码，按依赖后序）；`inline = true` 的包拼接进其消费者而非链接；宿主包从声明的面合成无体 thunk；已挂载捆绑包的编译包把解码后的二进制推入新鲜的、重定基的作用域（[编译器流水线](compiler.md)）。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:23
msgid "4. link + flatten"
msgstr "4. 链接 + 展平"


#: src/reference/loading.md:23
msgid ""
"Module-local type/function/const ids rebase into the global tables; the shared boot prefix passes through; name tables merge; duplicate `(trait, type)` impl pairs and duplicate module names are link errors. Cyclic use is a compile-graph error, never a runtime event."
msgstr ""
"模块局部的类型/函数/常量 id 重定基进全局表；共享的启动前缀原样通过；名字表合并；重复的 `(trait, type)` impl 组合与重复的模块名是链接错误。循环 use 是编译图错误，绝不是运行时事件。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:24
msgid "5. verify + boot"
msgstr "5. 校验 + 启动"


#: src/reference/loading.md:24
msgid ""
"The load verifier re-checks every function ([Module binary and verification](module-binary.md)); the `Vm` constructor joins the program's host thunks against the embedder's `HostRegistry` — a declared-but-unbound host fn is a boot error."
msgstr ""
"加载校验器重新检查每个函数（[模块二进制与校验](module-binary.md)）；`Vm` 构造器把程序的宿主 thunk 对照嵌入方的 `HostRegistry` 做 join——声明了却未绑定的宿主函数是启动错误。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:26
msgid ""
"Loading a `.rutc` binary (`vm.load_binary`\\-style paths, and the wasm runner) skips steps 2–3 and lands directly in verify + boot."
msgstr "加载 `.rutc` 二进制（`vm.load_binary`\\- 式路径，以及 wasm 运行器）跳过第 2–3 步，直接落在校验 + 启动。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:29
msgid "What the host can call"
msgstr "宿主能调用什么"


#: src/reference/loading.md:31
msgid ""
"Callable names are the program's **`entry fn`s** plus the conventional `main`. Their signatures were checked against the host-crossing rule at compile time — primitives, `str`, `bytes`, `opaque`, `?T` over a crossing type, and crossing tuples — so a bad surface can never surprise the embedder at call time. An `entry fn -> (?T, err)` decodes positionally at `vm.call` as a `(value, err)` pair (below)."
msgstr ""
"可调用的名字是程序的 **`entry fn`** 外加惯常的 `main`。它们的签名在编译期就对照宿主跨越规则检查过——基本类型、`str`、`bytes`、`opaque`、跨越类型之上的 `?T`，以及跨越元组——因此坏表面绝不可能在调用时给嵌入方惊喜。`entry fn -> (?T, err)` 在 `vm.call` 处按位置解码为一个 `(value, err)` 对偶（见下）。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:38
msgid ""
"Use paths never execute anything: importing a package mounts its surface; only the host's calls run code."
msgstr "use 路径绝不执行任何东西：导入一个包只是挂载它的表面；只有宿主的调用才运行代码。"


#: src/reference/loading.md:41
msgid "The embedder surface"
msgstr "嵌入方表面"


#: src/reference/loading.md:43
msgid ""
"Everything the host needs is a method on `Vm` (plus the registries built before it):"
msgstr "宿主需要的一切都是 `Vm` 上的一个方法（外加在它之前构建的那些注册表）："


#: src/reference/loading.md:46
msgid "call"
msgstr "调用"


#: src/reference/loading.md:46 src/reference/cli.md:53
msgid "purpose"
msgstr "用途"


#: src/reference/loading.md:48
msgid "`HostRegistry::register(name, f)`"
msgstr "`HostRegistry::register(name, f)`"


#: src/reference/loading.md:48
msgid "bind a host-fn body; signatures derived from the Rust shape"
msgstr "绑定一个宿主函数体；签名从 Rust 形状推导"


#: src/reference/loading.md:49
msgid ""
"the installer lane: one built `HostPkg` per host pkg, checked against the mount snapshot (`session.host_pkg_context()`)"
msgstr "安装者车道：每个宿主包一个构建好的 `HostPkg`，对照挂载快照检查（`session.host_pkg_context()`）"


#: src/reference/loading.md:50
msgid ""
"the builder's sugar — one spelling → one row / the five-row async family ([embedding and native modules](embedding.md))"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/loading.md:51
msgid ""
"`mount_std_core(session)` / `mount_std(session)` / `mount_std_async(session)`"
msgstr ""
"`mount_std_core(session)` / `mount_std(session)` / `mount_std_async(session)`"


#: src/reference/loading.md:51
