#: src/reference/bundles.md:308
msgid "The std tree on a CDN — the per-package delivery"
msgstr "CDN 上的 std 树——按包交付"


#: src/reference/bundles.md:310
msgid ""
"The std tree (`rut/`) ships as **committed** per-package bundles at `dist/std/<pkg>.rutbundle` — one bundle per package a `deps` row can spell (15 today). jsDelivr's gh lane serves repo files at a ref, so the artifacts ARE the delivery and the publish act is a git tag:"
msgstr ""
"std 树（`rut/`）以**已提交**的按包捆绑包交付于 `dist/std/<pkg>.rutbundle`——`deps` 行能拼写的每个包一个捆绑包（今日 15 个）。jsDelivr 的 gh 车道按 ref 服务仓库文件，所以工件**就是**交付，发布动作是一次 git tag："


#: src/reference/bundles.md:315
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"{\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    \"http\": {\n"
"      \"url\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/hpp2334/rut@<tag>/dist/std/http.rutbundle\",\n"
"      \"sha256\": \"<64-hex>\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/bundles.md:326
msgid ""
"`<tag>`/`<sha256>` are placeholders — real pins live in the examples (anti-rot: docs never rot pins). The laws:"
msgstr "`<tag>`/`<sha256>` 是占位符——真钉住在示例里（防腐：文档永不腐烂钉）。法则："


#: src/reference/bundles.md:329
msgid ""
"**Committed artifacts, immutable tags.** `scripts/pack-std.cjs` packs all 15 (deterministic — same input ⇒ byte-identical, so freshness is a pure equality gate: `--check` repacks and byte-compiles, no network); `--pins` rewrites the example manifests' url/sha256 rows; `--tag` prints the publish commands. Tags advance (`std-vNN`) and are never re-pointed — jsDelivr caches aggressively."
msgstr ""
"**已提交工件，不可变标签。** `scripts/pack-std.cjs` 打包全部 15 个（确定性——同输入 ⇒ 同字节，新鲜度是纯等值门：`--check` 重打包并逐字节比较，不触网）；`--pins` 重写示例清单的 url/sha256 行；`--tag` 打印发布命令。标签只前进（`std-vNN`），永不重指——jsDelivr 缓存很凶。"


#: src/reference/bundles.md:335
msgid ""
"**What a compiled bundle serves.** Instantiation is owner-anchored: a compiled owner carries the generic instantiations its own pack closure spelled in its ledger — and, the generic-source riding law, a compiled pkg whose surface exports generics also rides the source that serves consumer-spelled shapes: at the consumer's link a request the ledger lacks lowers the ridden text in the consumer's session and compiles the monomorphized body under the declaring pkg's spec (one row program-wide, nothing persisted). So the CDN lane delivers **host surfaces** (v10 decl bundles), **concrete-class libs** (`http`, `ink`, `strbuild` — methods cross on the surface's inherent rows), **and the generic owners** (`pouch`, `nmapset`, `json`, `async_host` — `Vec<Todo>`, `Map<K,V>`, `decodeJson<T>` compile at the link from the ridden source). A bundle that predates the riding refuses a consumer-spelled shape loudly and says so (re-pack it), and a bundle-mounted json names its pack-time dev closure in its ledger, so the consumer's closure must contain those names (`pouch`, `nmapset` beside `json` — the six-pin law)."
msgstr ""
"**一个编译的包能服务什么。** 实例化由 owner 锚定：编译的 owner 在其台账中承载其打包期闭包拼写的泛型实例化 —— 加上泛型源码承载法则，表面导出泛型的编译 pkg 还会在二进制旁承载服务消费者拼写形状的源码：在消费者的链接处，台账缺失的请求会在消费者的会话中降低被承载的文本，并以声明 pkg 的 spec 编译单态化代码体（全程序一行，不持久化）。因此 CDN 通道交付**宿主表面**（v10 decl 包）、**具体类库**（`http`、`ink`、`strbuild` —— 方法在表面的固有行上跨越），**以及泛型 owner**（`pouch`、`nmapset`、`json`、`async_host` —— `Vec<Todo>`、`Map<K,V>`、`decodeJson<T>` 在链接处从被承载的源码编译）。早于承载法则的包会大声拒绝消费者拼写的形状并说明缘由（重新打包它），而包装载的 json 在其台账中命名其打包期开发闭包，因此消费者的闭包必须包含那些名字（`json` 旁的 `pouch`、`nmapset` —— 六钉法则）。"


#: src/reference/bundles.md:352
msgid ""
"**Duplicate mounts are safe.** Two archives may carry the same group (`json`'s and `http`'s closures both carry `strbuild`): first-mount-wins mounts one body, and the per-archive ledger namespacing keeps every binary's ids resolving through its own archive's rows. Pin sets stay minimal-top anyway — a closed bundle carries the rest."
msgstr ""
"**重复挂载是安全的。** 两个档案可携带同一组（`json` 与 `http` 的闭包都带 `strbuild`）：先挂载者胜挂载一个体，按档案的台账命名空间化让每个二进制的 id 都经自己档案的行解析。钉集反正保持最小顶——闭合捆绑包会带上其余。"


#: src/reference/bundles.md:359
msgid "Loading"
msgstr "加载"


#: src/reference/bundles.md:361
msgid ""
"A bundle is one more resolution source alongside the directory form — same name resolution, same compile, same splice rules:"
msgstr "捆绑包是目录形式之外的又一个解析来源——同样的名字解析、同样的编译、同样的拼接规则："


#: src/reference/bundles.md:365
msgid ""
"// from a file\n"
msgstr ""
"// from a file\n"


#: src/reference/bundles.md:366
msgid "\"vendor/plugin.rutbundle\""
msgstr "\"vendor/plugin.rutbundle\""


#: src/reference/bundles.md:366
msgid ""
"// from bytes (embedders, tests, wasm)\n"
msgstr ""
"// from bytes (embedders, tests, wasm)\n"


#: src/reference/bundles.md:368
msgid "\"mem\""
msgstr "\"mem\""


#: src/reference/bundles.md:371
msgid ""
"After mounting, the package name resolves exactly as the directory form does — with one difference: a compiled group's body is the decoded program itself. The graph assigns it a fresh scope, rebases its packed ids through the ledger, and pushes it; source groups mount as sources and compile (or splice) exactly as a directory world. Then the normal pipeline takes over ([Loading and the embed loop](loading.md)). Loose directories and loose `.rut` files stay valid share layouts; the bundle packages them, nothing requires it."
msgstr ""
"挂载之后，包名的解析与目录形态分毫不差——只有一处不同：编译组的函数体就是解码后的程序本身。图给它分配全新作用域，经台账重定基它的打包 id，然后推入；源码组作为源码挂载，编译（或拼接）与目录世界一模一样。随后正常流水线接管（[加载与嵌入循环](loading.md)）。松散目录与松散 `.rut` 文件依旧是有效的共享布局；捆绑包打包它们，但什么都不强制。"


#: src/reference/bundles.md:383
msgid ""
"# default output: a sibling of the dir\n"
msgstr ""
"# default output: a sibling of the dir\n"


#: src/reference/bundles.md:387
msgid ""
"The packed form and its directory compile to identical programs — pinned by tests (the linked binaries are equal)."
msgstr "打包形态与其目录编译出完全相同的程序——由测试钉住（链接后的二进制相等）。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:3
msgid ""
"One directory is one module; its `rut.jsonc` names the exact package it answers to and how to reach its surface and body. The manifest is what makes the directory **the runnable unit**: `rut run <dir>` (or its packed `.rutbundle`) is the only run lane — a loose `.rut` file is not a program ([the rut CLI](cli.md)). This page is the manifest grammar, the resolution laws, and where everything lives in the toolchain tree."
msgstr ""
"一个目录就是一个模块；它的 `rut.jsonc` 指名它所对应的确切包，以及如何抵达它的表面与函数体。清单让这个目录成为**可运行单元**：`rut run <dir>`（或其打包的 `.rutbundle`）是唯一的车道——散的 `.rut` 文件不是程序（[rut CLI](cli.md)）。本页是清单文法、解析法则，以及一切在工具链树中的位置。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:11
msgid "The manifest"
msgstr "清单"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:13
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"// rut/pouch/rut.jsonc — a body package\n"
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"pouch\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"lib\": \"./pouch.rut\" }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// rut/calc/rut.jsonc — a pure declaration surface (a host pkg)\n"
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"calc\",\n"
"  \"type\": \"host\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"type\": \"./calc.d.rut\" }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// a consumer (an app directory)\n"
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"app\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"lib\": \"./app.rut\" },\n"
"\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    \"pouch\": { \"path\": \"../pouch\" },\n"
"    \"ink\":   { \"path\": \"../ink\" }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


