msgstr "声明表面：一个 `.d.rut` 文件。在 lib 包上它是文档表面（仅表面的开发态按声明单元挂载；其中的 `host fn` 文本会被拒绝）"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:48 src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:148
msgid "`deps`"
msgstr "`deps`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:48
msgid ""
"the transitively mounted dependencies — one source per descriptor: `pkg = { path = \"...\" }` (relative to this manifest) or `pkg = { url = \"https://…\", sha256 = \"<64-hex>\" }` (a remote `.rutbundle`, the pin optional but recommended) ([Dependency kinds](dependency-kinds.md)). `optional` is rejected here."
msgstr ""
"传递挂载的依赖 — 每个描述符一个来源：`pkg = { path = \"...\" }`（相对本清单）或 `pkg = { url = \"https://…\", sha256 = \"<64-hex>\" }`（远程 `.rutbundle`，固定值可选但推荐）（[依赖种类](dependency-kinds.md)）。此处拒绝 `optional`。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:49
msgid "`peer-deps`"
msgstr "`peer-deps`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:49
msgid ""
"presence-gated peers — descriptors accept `path`, `optional`, `lib` ([Dependency kinds](dependency-kinds.md))"
msgstr "在场门控的 peer——描述符接受 `path`、`optional`、`lib`（[依赖种类](dependency-kinds.md)）"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:50 src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:151
msgid "`dev-deps`"
msgstr "`dev-deps`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:50
msgid "mounted only while building/testing this pkg itself"
msgstr "仅在构建/测试本包自身时挂载"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:51
msgid "`inline`"
msgstr "`inline`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:51
msgid ""
"`true` forces source-inlining into every consumer instead of linking (packages whose class methods must resolve at the call site — inherent impls cross no surface yet; generic exports link on their own, their instantiations owned by the declaring package)"
msgstr ""
"`true` 强制把源码内联进每个消费方而非链接（其类方法必须在调用点解析的包——固有 impl 尚不能跨表面；泛型导出自己就能链接，其实例化归声明包所有）"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:52
msgid "`format`, `format_version`"
msgstr "`format`, `format_version`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:52
msgid ""
"bundle keys — ignored by directory loading, required by `rut pack` ([Module bundles](bundles.md))"
msgstr "捆绑包键——目录加载忽略，`rut pack` 要求（[模块捆绑包](bundles.md)）"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:53
msgid "`style`"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:53
msgid ""
"formatter knobs: `indent_width` (1–8, default 4), `max_width` (≥ 20, default 100). Schema-free at the manifest layer — unknown keys ride; malformed values are formatter errors, never compile errors. Resolution: the nearest ancestor manifest of the formatted file; no manifest → defaults."
msgstr ""
"格式化器旋钮：`indent_width`（1–8，默认 4）、`max_width`（≥ 20，默认 100）。在清单层无模式——未知键放行；畸形值是格式化器错误，绝不是编译错误。解析：被格式化文件最近的祖先清单；没有清单 → 默认值。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:55
msgid ""
"The manifest text is **JSONC** — `//` line comments, `/* */` block comments, and trailing commas are all legal — parsed by `serde_json` behind a syntax-stripping front stage: the comment and comma bytes become spaces before the parser sees them, so a syntax error keeps the parser's own wording under a `line N:` prefix that names the ORIGINAL file's line. The value laws are unchanged. Value errors are path-targeted (`deps.pouch: unknown key 'feats'`). Descriptors are key/value objects; unknown descriptor keys are path-targeted manifest errors. Duplicate keys are last-wins. The old `_`\\-prefixed prose lane (`\"_comment\"`) retired with the JSONC cutover: an `_`\\-key refuses loudly naming the fix — comments are the prose now."
msgstr ""
"清单文本是 **JSONC**——`//` 行注释、`/* */` 块注释以及尾随逗号都合法——由 `serde_json` 在一个语法剥离前级之后解析：注释与逗号的字节在解析器看到之前变成空格，因此语法错误保留解析器自己的措辞，带有一个指出原始文件行的 `line N:` 前缀。值法则不变。值错误按路径定位（`deps.pouch: unknown key 'feats'`）。描述符是键/值对象；未知描述符键是按路径定位的清单错误。重复键后者胜。旧的 `_`\\-前缀散文车道（`\"_comment\"`）随 JSONC 切换退役：`_`\\-键大声拒绝并指出修复——注释才是散文。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:67
msgid "Resolution laws"
msgstr "解析法则"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:69
msgid ""
"**Exact, single-step.** A use path resolves only if a module with that `name` is mounted. Nothing is derived from directories or file layouts."
msgstr "**精确、单步。**一条 use 路径只有在具有该 `name` 的模块已挂载时才解析。任何东西都不从目录或文件布局推导。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:72
msgid ""
"**The walk is recursive, with a cycle guard; first mount wins.** An already-mounted name (the embedder's, the root's, or an earlier dep's) is never overwritten — which is what makes peer presence-by-name sound: the consumer's own path for a package always beats the declarer's `path`."
msgstr ""
"**遍历递归进行，带环守卫；先挂载者胜。**已挂载的名字（嵌入方的、根的、或更早依赖的）绝不被覆盖——这正是让 peer 按名字判在场得以健全的原因：消费方自己为某个包准备的路径永远压过声明者的 `path`。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:77
msgid ""
"**Name mismatch is an error.** A dep whose manifest `name` disagrees with its key fails, naming both."
msgstr "**名字不匹配是错误。**清单 `name` 与其键不一致的依赖会失败，并点名双方。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:79
msgid ""
"**The cross-table law.** A name in `deps` beside `peer-deps` or `dev-deps` is an error naming both rows; peer + dev together is the sanctioned pairing."
msgstr ""
"**跨表法则。**一个名字同时出现在 `deps` 与 `peer-deps` 或 `dev-deps` 里是错误，并点名两行；peer + dev 一起是被认可的组合。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:82
msgid ""
"**`core` needs no `deps`** — the driver mounts it unconditionally; every name still requires `use core::{ .. };` per [core and the swappable packages](stdlib.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`core` 不需要 `deps`**——driver 无条件挂载它；但每个名字仍需 `use core::{ .. };`，见 [core 与可换包](stdlib.md)。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:86
msgid "The multi-lib entry"
msgstr "多库入口"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:88
msgid "A package's body may be split across files:"
msgstr "包的函数体可以拆分到多个文件："


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:90
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"ui\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"lib\": \"./ui.rut\", \"libs\": [\"./store.rut\", \"./t1.rut\"] }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:97
msgid ""
"The loader splices base-first, then `libs` in listed order, newline-joined, into **one module** — one namespace, one visibility scope. A name private to one file is visible to every other file of the package. The manifest is the canonical order (the splice never reads a directory listing — same manifest ⇒ same module). A `libs` row without `lib`, a `.d.rut` element, or a file named twice is a loud manifest error. This is assembly, not a language include form — use paths stay inter-module."
msgstr ""
"加载器以基础文件在前的顺序拼接，然后按列出的顺序拼接 `libs`，以换行连接，拼成**一个模块**——一个命名空间，一个可见性作用域。对一个文件私有的名字，对该包的其他每个文件都可见。清单是规范顺序（拼接从不读取目录列表——相同清单 ⇒ 相同模块）。没有 `lib` 的 `libs` 行、一个 `.d.rut` 元素、或被点名两次的文件，都是响亮的清单错误。这是组装，不是语言层面的 include 形式——use 路径仍限于模块之间。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:105
msgid ""
"Contrast with peer groups: group files are _presence-gated_ and therefore impl-only; multi-lib files are unconditional and full module citizens — types, functions, and `pub` surface are legal in any file."
msgstr ""
"与 peer 分组对比：分组文件是_在场门控_的，因此只含 impl；多库文件是无条件的、完整的模块公民——类型、函数与 `pub` 表面在任何文件里都合法。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:109
msgid "The toolchain tree"
msgstr "工具链树"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:137
msgid ""
"Dependency line: `rut-lexer ← rut-ast ← rut-parser ← rut-driver → rut-lir → rut-core ← rut-vm` (with `rut-vm-threaded` behind it; the driver sits on the vm's `HostPkgContext`/`HostRegistry` for the installer lane), hosts (`rut-std`, `rut-wasm`) on top, and `rut-cli`/`demo` above those. `rut-lsp` sits on the frontend crates only — tokens, diagnostics, and symbols need no VM."
msgstr ""
"依赖线：`rut-lexer ← rut-ast ← rut-parser ← rut-driver → rut-lir → rut-core ← rut-vm`（`rut-vm-threaded` 在其后；驱动坐在 vm 的 `HostPkgContext`/`HostRegistry` 上支撑安装者车道），宿主（`rut-std`、`rut-wasm`）在上，`rut-cli`/`demo` 在最上。`rut-lsp` 只坐在前端 crate 上——token、诊断与符号不需要 VM。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:145
msgid "The in-tree packages"
msgstr "树内包"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:147
msgid ""
"`rut/` carries the standard and swappable packages the CLI mounts on demand:"
msgstr "`rut/` 携带标准包与可换包，CLI 按需挂载它们："


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:152
msgid "`core`"
msgstr "`core`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:152
msgid "the only standard package — the builtin surface, mounted unconditionally"
msgstr "唯一的标准包——内建表面，无条件挂载"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:153
msgid "host pkg: math surface (`mount_calc`)"
msgstr "宿主包：数学表面（`mount_calc`）"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:154
msgid "`ink_host`, `http_host`, `nmap_host`, `async_engine`, `bench_cross`"
msgstr "`ink_host`, `http_host`, `nmap_host`, `async_engine`, `bench_cross`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:154
msgid "host pkgs — pure `.d.rut` surfaces; bodies live in `rut-std`"
msgstr "宿主包——纯 `.d.rut` 表面；函数体住在 `rut-std`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:155
msgid "`ink`, `http`, `strbuild`, `async_host`"
msgstr "`ink`, `http`, `strbuild`, `async_host`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:155
msgid "inline rut wrappers over host rows (`inline = true`)"
msgstr "架在宿主行之上的内联 rut 包装（`inline = true`）"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:156
msgid "the sequence library (plain linked package)"
msgstr "序列库（普通链接包）"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:157
msgid ""
"the base pkg with `peer-deps`/`dev-deps` — the reference consumer of [Dependency kinds](dependency-kinds.md)"
msgstr "带 `peer-deps`/`dev-deps` 的基础包——[依赖种类](dependency-kinds.md)的参考消费方"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:158
msgid "`nmapset`"
msgstr "`nmapset`"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:158
msgid "native-key maps/sets over `nmap_host`"
msgstr "架在 `nmap_host` 之上的原生键 map/set"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:160
msgid ""
"Nothing in the engine knows the swappable packages' names — peers and deps are resolved by name from manifests; a host may replace the non-`core` set wholesale ([Embedding and native modules](embedding.md))."
msgstr ""
"引擎里没有任何东西知道可换包的名字——peer 与依赖都按名字从清单解析；宿主可以整体替换非 `core` 集合（[嵌入与原生模块](embedding.md)）。"


#: src/reference/project-structure.md:166
msgid ""
"`demo/` is a React + rspack + TypeScript page over the wasm build. The wasm ABI is two calls — `compile(src)` returning diagnostics, an AST dump, an IR dump, and an optional binary; `run(binary, budget)` returning output lines, an optional trap, and used fuel/heap. Fuel is off by default (fuel 0 is the ABI's uncapped encoding) and opts in through the page's fuel box; the heap defaults to 4 MiB, and auto-runs keep an internal 1M fuel watchdog so unbounded loops park and resume instead of hanging the page. The served artifact is deployed at <https://playground.rut.hpp2334.com>."
msgstr ""
"`demo/` 是架在 wasm 构建之上的一个 React + rspack + TypeScript 页面。wasm ABI 是两次调用——`compile(src)` 返回诊断、AST 转储、IR 转储和可选的二进制；`run(binary, budget)` 返回输出行、可选的陷阱和已用的燃料/堆。燃料默认关闭（燃料 0 是 ABI 的无上限编码），通过页面的燃料框显式开启；堆默认 4 MiB，自动运行保留内部 1M 燃料的看门狗，让无界循环停驻并可恢复，而不是挂死页面。服务的产物部署在 <https://playground.rut.hpp2334.com>。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:3
msgid ""
"Every package's `rut.jsonc` names the packages it relates to, and the _kind_ of each relation decides how — and whether — it mounts. Three tables, one grammar:"
msgstr "每个包的 `rut.jsonc` 指名与它相关的包，而每种关系的_种类_决定它如何——以及是否——挂载。三张表，一份文法："


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:7
msgid "**`deps`** — the transitively mounted dependencies."
msgstr "**`deps`**——传递挂载的依赖。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:8
msgid ""
"**`peer-deps`** — **required by default**: not transitively pulled; the _consumer_ must supply the peer. With `optional = true`, presence in the consumer's closure mounts the integration; absence is inert."
msgstr ""
"**`peer-deps`**——**默认必填**：不被传递拉取；_消费方_必须提供该 peer。设 `optional = true` 时，peer 出现在消费方闭包中即挂载集成；缺席则保持惰性。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:11
msgid ""
"**`dev-deps`** — mounted only when building/testing the package itself (the program root), never in a consumer's world."
msgstr "**`dev-deps`**——只在构建/测试包自身（程序根）时挂载，绝不出现在消费方的世界里。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:14
msgid ""
"Peers are a _presence_ relation, not a _pull_ relation: the gate looks at what the program's closure already contains and never adds a package. A package is either pulled transitively (`deps`) or required of the consumer / held for development (`peer-deps`/`dev-deps`) — never both."
msgstr ""
"peer 是一种_在场_关系，不是_拉取_关系：门只看程序的闭包里已有什么，从不添加包。一个包要么被传递拉取（`deps`），要么被要求消费方提供 / 为开发而持有（`peer-deps`/`dev-deps`）——绝不同时。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:20
msgid "The grammar"
msgstr "文法"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:22
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"// rut/json/rut.jsonc — the reference shape\n"
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"json\",\n"
"  \"entry\": { \"lib\": \"./json.rut\" },\n"
"  \"inline\": true,\n"
"\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    \"strbuild\": { \"path\": \"../strbuild\" }\n"
"  },\n"
"\n"
"  \"peer-deps\": {\n"
"    \"pouch\":   { \"path\": \"../pouch\",   \"optional\": true, \"lib\": \"./group-pouch.rut\" },\n"
"    \"nmapset\": { \"path\": \"../nmapset\", \"optional\": true, \"lib\": \"./group-nmapset.rut\" }\n"
"  },\n"
"\n"
"  \"dev-deps\": {\n"
"    \"pouch\":   { \"path\": \"../pouch\" },\n"
"    \"nmapset\": { \"path\": \"../nmapset\" }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:45
msgid ""
"Keys are bare package names — the same `[a-zA-Z0-9_]+` law as `name`; a dep-table key outside it is a path-targeted manifest error."
msgstr "键是裸包名——与 `name` 同一条 `[a-zA-Z0-9_]+` 法则；超出它的依赖表键是按行定位的清单错误。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:47
msgid ""
"`peer-deps`/`dev-deps` descriptors accept exactly three keys: `path` (string, directory-time), `optional` (the one bool the inline grammar learns), and `lib` (string; the peer-gated integration file). Anything else is the strict-manifest error. `deps` keeps string-valued descriptors and **rejects** `optional` — it has no options."
msgstr ""
"`peer-deps`/`dev-deps` 描述符恰好接受三个键：`path`（字符串，目录期）、`optional`（内联文法认识的唯一一个布尔）、`lib`（字符串；peer 门控的集成文件）。其他任何键都是严格清单错误。`deps` 保持字符串值描述符并**拒绝** `optional`——它没有选项。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:53
msgid ""
"`optional` defaults to `false` — required by default. The zero-dep spelling `{ path = \"..\" }` is valid in all three tables."
msgstr "`optional` 默认 `false`——默认必填。零依赖写法 `{ path = \"..\" }` 在三张表里都合法。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:55
msgid ""
"A `lib` ending in `.d.rut` is a load error: the integration must be a `.rut` source — a declaration surface does not gate."
msgstr "以 `.d.rut` 结尾的 `lib` 是加载错误：集成必须是 `.rut` 源码——声明表面不能把门。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:57
msgid ""
"**The cross-table law**: a name riding `deps` beside `peer-deps` or `dev-deps` is a manifest error naming both rows — _`pouch` appears in both `deps` and `peer-deps` — a package is either pulled transitively or required of the consumer, never both_. Peer + dev together is the sanctioned pairing: integration-if-present for consumers, always-present while developing the package itself."
msgstr ""
"**跨表法则**：一个名字同时骑在 `deps` 与 `peer-deps` 或 `dev-deps` 上是清单错误，点名两行——_`pouch` 同时出现在 `deps` 与 `peer-deps` 中——一个包要么被传递拉取，要么被要求消费方提供，绝不同时_。peer + dev 一起是被认可的组合：对消费方而言是\"在场即集成\"，对包自身的开发则是始终在场。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:64
msgid "Url dependencies — the second source kind"
msgstr "url 依赖 — 第二种来源"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:66
msgid "A `deps` descriptor may name a remote `.rutbundle` instead of a directory:"
msgstr "`deps` 描述符可以用远程 `.rutbundle` 代替目录："


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:69
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"{\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    \"pouch\": { \"url\": \"https://example.com/pouch.rutbundle\", \"sha256\": \"<64-hex>\" }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:77
msgid ""
"**One descriptor, one source**: `path` or `url`, never both, never neither — a path-targeted manifest error either way. `sha256` is legal only beside `url` and must be exactly 64 hex digits (stored lowercase; the comparison is byte-exact). The url itself must be http(s). `peer-deps`/`dev-deps` stay `path`\\-only — a peer's path is directory-time metadata for the declarer's own build, nothing to fetch."
msgstr ""
"**一个描述符，一个来源**：`path` 或 `url`，二者不可兼得，也不可皆无 — 两种情况都是行定位的清单错误。`sha256` 只能出现在 `url` 旁，且必须恰好是 64 位十六进制数字（存储为小写；比较是逐字节的）。url 本身必须是 http(s)。`peer-deps`/`dev-deps` 保持仅 `path` — 对方的 path 是声明方自身构建的目录期元数据，无可拉取。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:84
msgid ""
"**The layer split.** The _call site_ owns HOW bytes arrive — transport, caching, offline policy — by implementing the `DepRemote` contract (`fetch(url)` — one required method returning a boxed future of bytes — plus optional `lookup`/`write`; the standard `HttpRemote` is cache-first). The _loader_ owns WHAT the bytes are declared to be: the `sha256` pin is manifest law, verified at the mount door on **every** load — fresh fetch, cache hit, vendored map, test fixture. A check the call site performs would be a check the call site could skip; only the mount point holds both the pin and the bytes, so only the mount point can enforce it."
msgstr ""
"**分层裁定。**_调用方_ 拥有字节如何到达 — 传输、缓存、离线策略 — 方式是实现 `DepRemote` 契约（`fetch(url)`——一个必选方法，返回字节的装箱 future——外加可选的 `lookup`/`write`；标准的 `HttpRemote` 是缓存优先的）。_加载器_ 拥有字节被声明成什么：`sha256` 固定值是清单法则，在挂载门于**每次**加载时校验——新拉取、缓存命中、自带映射、测试夹具。调用方自己做的检查就是调用方可以跳过的检查；只有挂载点同时握着固定值与字节，所以只有挂载点能强制执行它。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:95
msgid ""
"**Url deps are leaves.** The `deps` walk never follows them: one fetch brings the whole closure, because **bundles stay closed** — every dep a bundle's manifest declares must be satisfied by an in-archive group, and a bundle that does not satisfy one is refused at the mount door. A url row inside an already-packed bundle is inert metadata; loading a bundle never fetches."
msgstr ""
"**url 依赖是叶子。**`deps` 遍历从不跟随它们：一次拉取带来整个闭包，因为**捆绑包保持封闭** — 捆绑包清单声明的每个依赖都必须由包内组满足，否则在挂载门被拒绝。已打包捆绑包内的 url 行是惰性元数据；加载捆绑包从不拉取。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:101
msgid ""
"**Pin your deps.** An unpinned url compiles from whatever the cache or the network served — a pinned one refuses to load anything else, naming the dep, the url, and both hashes. Pins are what make packs reproducible: same manifest + same pins ⇒ byte-identical bundle."
msgstr ""
"**固定你的依赖。**未固定的 url 从缓存或网络所获的内容编译 — 固定了的则拒绝加载其他任何内容，并指名依赖、url 与两个哈希。固定是可复现打包的前提：相同清单 + 相同固定值 ⇒ 逐字节相同的捆绑包。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:105
msgid ""
"The CLI lane: `rut run`/`rut pack` fetch through the cache-first standard remote (`<project>/.rut/cache`, `$RUT_CACHE_DIR` overrides; a hit never touches the network), and a pin refusal evicts the poisoned cache entry so the next run heals. `rut fetch <dir>` warms the cache without running anything ([The rut CLI](cli.md))."
msgstr ""
"CLI 车道：`rut run`/`rut pack` 经缓存优先的标准远程拉取（`<project>/.rut/cache`，`$RUT_CACHE_DIR` 可覆盖；命中则绝不触碰网络），固定值拒绝会驱逐被污染的缓存条目，让下一次运行自愈。`rut fetch <dir>` 只预热缓存，不运行任何东西（[The rut CLI](cli.md)）。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:112
msgid "The std tree on jsDelivr"
msgstr "jsDelivr 上的 std 树"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:114
msgid ""
"The std tree ships as committed per-package bundles — `https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/hpp2334/rut@<tag>/dist/std/<pkg>.rutbundle`, pinned by sha256 (placeholders here by law: real pins live only in the examples, so docs never rot). Tags advance (`std-vNN`) and are never re-pointed — jsDelivr caches aggressively; the artifacts are committed at `dist/std/`, packed by `scripts/pack-std.cjs` (whose `--check` gate is a pure byte-equality repack — CI never touches the network)."
msgstr ""
"std 树以已提交的按包捆绑包交付——`https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/hpp2334/rut@<tag>/dist/std/<pkg>.rutbundle`，以 sha256 钉住（此处按法则用占位符：真钉只住在示例里，文档永不腐烂）。标签只前进（`std-vNN`），永不重指——jsDelivr 缓存很凶；工件提交在 `dist/std/`，由 `scripts/pack-std.cjs` 打包（其 `--check` 门是纯字节等值的重打包——CI 永不触网）。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:122
msgid ""
"**What a url row can deliver** is the engine's instantiation law, read from the CDN side: a compiled bundle carries the generic instantiations its own pack closure spelled **in its ledger**, and — since the generic-source riding law — a compiled pkg whose surface exports generics **also rides the source that serves consumer-spelled shapes**:"
msgstr ""
"**一条 url 行能交付什么**是从 CDN 一侧读到的引擎实例化法则：编译的包在其台账中承载其打包期闭包拼写的泛型实例化，而且 —— 自泛型源码承载法则起 —— 表面导出泛型的编译 pkg **还会承载服务消费者拼写形状的源码**：\n"
"\n"
"- **宿主表面与具体类库交付** —— `type = \"host\"` 包是一个声明表面（无泛型），具体类的库（`http`、`ink`、`strbuild`）在其表面的固有行上跨越，整个闭包在内部承载；\n"
"- **泛型 owner 也交付** —— `pouch`、`nmapset`、`json`、`async_host` 在二进制旁承载其入口 + 组源码，因此消费者的 `Vec<Todo>` 或 `decodeJson<Vec<Todo>>` 在**消费者的链接处**编译：被承载的文本在消费者的会话中降低，单态化代码体以声明 pkg 的 spec 注册（全程序一行，以 owner 为身份），不持久化任何东西（`.rutc` 缓存保持打包期）。早于承载的包 —— 二进制旁没有源码 —— 会大声拒绝消费者拼写的形状并说明缘由：重新打包它。包装载的 json 还在其台账中命名其打包期开发闭包，因此消费者的闭包必须包含那些名字（`json` 旁的 `pouch`、`nmapset` —— 六钉法则）。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:128
msgid ""
"**host surfaces and concrete-class libs deliver** — a `type = \"host\"` bundle is a declaration surface (no generics), and a lib of concrete classes (`http`, `ink`, `strbuild`) crosses on its surface's inherent rows with its whole closure riding inside;"
msgstr ""
"**宿主面与具体类 lib 可交付**——`type = \"host\"` 捆绑包是声明面（无泛型），具体类的 lib（`http`、`ink`、`strbuild`）在其面的固有行上交叉，整个闭包随行在内；"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:132
msgid ""
"**generic owners deliver too** — `pouch`, `nmapset`, `json`, `async_host` ride their entry + group source beside the binaries, so a consumer's `Vec<Todo>` or `decodeJson<Vec<Todo>>` compiles **at the consumer's link**: the ridden text lowers in the consumer's session, the monomorphized bodies register under the declaring pkg's spec (one row program-wide, identity by owner), and nothing persists (`.rutc` caches stay pack-time). A bundle that predates the riding — no source beside the binary — refuses a consumer-spelled shape loudly and says so: re-pack it. A bundle-mounted json also names its pack-time dev closure in its ledger, so the consumer's closure must contain those names (`pouch`, `nmapset` beside `json` — the six-pin law)."
msgstr ""
"**泛型 owner 也交付** —— `pouch`、`nmapset`、`json`、`async_host` 在二进制旁承载其入口 + 组源码，因此消费者的 `Vec<Todo>` 或 `decodeJson<Vec<Todo>>` 在**消费者的链接处**编译：被承载的文本在消费者的会话中降低，单态化代码体以声明 pkg 的 spec 注册（全程序一行，以 owner 为身份），不持久化任何东西（`.rutc` 缓存保持打包期）。早于承载的包 —— 二进制旁没有源码 —— 会大声拒绝消费者拼写的形状并说明缘由：重新打包它。包装载的 json 还在其台账中命名其打包期开发闭包，因此消费者的闭包必须包含那些名字（`json` 旁的 `pouch`、`nmapset` —— 六钉法则）。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:144
msgid "Semantics"
msgstr "语义"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:146
msgid "table"
msgstr "表"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:146
msgid "who supplies it"
msgstr "由谁提供"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:146
msgid "transitive?"
msgstr "传递拉取？"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:146
msgid "missing behavior"
msgstr "缺席时的行为"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:148
msgid "the declarer's own graph"
msgstr "声明者自己的图"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:148
msgid "yes — walked recursively"
msgstr "是——递归遍历"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:148
msgid "mount error"
msgstr "挂载错误"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:149
msgid "`peer-deps` (required, the default)"
msgstr "`peer-deps`（必填，默认）"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:149
msgid "the **consumer's** closure"
msgstr "**消费方的**闭包"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:149 src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:150
msgid "never pulled"
msgstr "绝不拉取"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:149
msgid "loud resolution error at mount"
msgstr "挂载时响亮的解析错误"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:150
msgid "`peer-deps` with `optional = true`"
msgstr "设 `optional = true` 的 `peer-deps`"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:150
msgid "the consumer's closure, if anywhere"
msgstr "消费方的闭包（若在场）"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:150
msgid "inert; referencing the integration is the dedicated missing-peer diagnostic"
msgstr "惰性；引用集成会触发专门的缺失 peer 诊断"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:151
msgid "the pkg's own self-build"
msgstr "包自身的自构建"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:151
msgid "root only — never walked for a dep"
msgstr "仅根——绝不为依赖遍历"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:151
msgid "n/a (they exist to be there)"
msgstr "不适用（它们的存在就是为了在场）"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:153
msgid "The mount law — four passes, one gate"
msgstr "挂载法则——四趟，一道门"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:155
msgid ""
"All loader-owned; the session stays I/O-free and the compile graph never learns what a peer is."
msgstr "全部由加载器负责；会话保持无 I/O，编译图永远不知道 peer 为何物。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:158
msgid ""
"**The `deps` walk — unchanged.** Recursive, name order, first-mount-wins, cycle guard, name-mismatch error. While walking, the loader records each mounted package's `peer-deps` into the session's peer registry (it reads every dep's manifest anyway)."
msgstr ""
"**`deps` 遍历——不变。**递归、按名字序、先挂载者胜、环守卫、名字不匹配错误。遍历期间，加载器把每个已挂载包的 `peer-deps` 记录进会话的 peer 注册表（反正它要读每个依赖的清单）。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:162
msgid ""
"**The dev pass — root only.** The program root's `dev-deps` mount exactly like `deps`. A dep's dev table is **never** walked — a consumer's world never contains another package's dev table. Embedder mounting (`mount_dir`) offers a package to someone else's program: it mounts no dev-deps and runs no gate (its peer declarations are still recorded)."
msgstr ""
"**dev 趟——仅根。**程序根的 `dev-deps` 与 `deps` 完全一样地挂载。依赖的 dev 表**绝不**被遍历——消费方的世界绝不含另一个包的 dev 表。嵌入方挂载（`mount_dir`）是把一个包提供给别人的程序：它不挂载 dev-deps，也不跑门（它的 peer 声明仍会被记录）。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:168
msgid ""
"**The peer gate — one post-closure pass.** After the full closure exists, for every mounted package and every `peer-deps` entry:"
msgstr "**peer 门——闭包后的一趟。**完整闭包形成之后，对每个已挂载包的每个 `peer-deps` 条目："


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:170
msgid ""
"**required**: the peer must resolve in the session, else the D1 error. Never auto-pulled."
msgstr "**必填**：peer 必须能在会话中解析，否则 D1 错误。绝不自动拉取。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:172
msgid ""
"**optional, present** (any reason): the declarer's group file (the descriptor's `lib`, an impl-only `.rut`) is appended to its `Module.source` — groups in peer-name order after the base. The combined text stays one source string, so every consumer of module sources (the splice, bundles, wasm mounts) is untouched."
msgstr ""
"**可选且在场**（无论何种原因）：声明者的分组文件（描述符的 `lib`，一个只含 impl 的 `.rut`）被追加到它的 `Module.source`——分组按 peer 名字序排在基础文件之后。合并后的文本仍是一个源码字符串，因此模块源码的每个消费方（拼接、捆绑包、wasm 挂载）都不受触动。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:177
msgid "**optional, absent**: inert — the group simply never mounts."
msgstr "**可选且缺席**：惰性——分组就是从不挂载。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:178
msgid ""
"**paths**: the program root's own peer paths are read and name-checked even when dev-deps already supplied presence — a broken path is the loud D3 packaging-bug error at the package's own build. A dep's peer paths are never read: presence is by name, so a broken peer path is inert for an optional peer and unreachable for a required one. The gate is post-closure because a peer may mount after its declarer alphabetically; groups add no package names, so one pass is a fixpoint."
msgstr ""
"**路径**：即使 dev-deps 已经供给了在场，程序根自己的 peer 路径仍会被读取并做名字检查——坏路径在包自身构建时是响亮的 D3 打包 bug 错误。依赖的 peer 路径从不被读取：在场按名字判定，因此坏 peer 路径对可选 peer 是惰性的，对必填 peer 则不可达。这趟门在闭包之后，因为按字母序 peer 可能在其声明者之后才挂载；分组不添加任何包名，因此一趟就是不动点。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:187
msgid ""
"**Compile — unchanged.** The graph splices each compilation unit from its origin-deduplicated leaf list (first position wins, topological order preserved); in the no-collision case the composed text is byte-identical to the pre-peer law."
msgstr ""
"**编译——不变。**图从每个编译单元的去重（按来源）叶列表拼接（先到位置获胜，保留拓扑序）；在无冲突的情形下，拼成的文本与 peer 法则之前逐字节相同。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:192
msgid ""
"**Groups are impl-only.** A group file contains `impl` blocks (and their private helpers); it declares no new public names — the base owns the trait and every public surface. This is what makes the diagnostic matrix total: the only ways to reference the integration are trait-method dispatch or a `use` of the peer's package name, and both have dedicated peer-aware diagnostics. A group appended to a module with no rut body (a `.d.rut` surface) is a load error — declaration surfaces do not gate."
msgstr ""
"**分组只含 impl。**分组文件包含 `impl` 块（及其私有辅助）；它不声明任何新的公开名字——trait 与每个公开表面都归基础文件所有。这正是诊断矩阵得以完备的原因：引用集成的唯一方式是 trait 方法分派或对 peer 包名的 `use`，而两者都有专门的 peer 感知诊断。追加到没有 rut 函数体的模块（一个 `.d.rut` 表面）的分组是加载错误——声明表面不能把门。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:200
msgid "The missing-peer matrix"
msgstr "缺失 peer 矩阵"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:202
msgid "case"
msgstr "情形"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:204
msgid "required peer absent from the consumer's closure"
msgstr "必填 peer 不在消费方闭包中"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:204
msgid ""
"**D1** — loud at mount: names the package, the peer, and the fix. Not silent, not auto-pulled."
msgstr "**D1**——挂载时响亮：点名包、peer 与修复方式。不沉默，也不自动拉取。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:205
msgid "optional peer absent, integration never touched"
msgstr "可选 peer 缺席，集成从未被触及"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:205
msgid "nothing — silent success; that _is_ the feature"
msgstr "无事发生——无声的成功；这_正是_特性本身"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:206
msgid "optional peer absent, integration referenced"
msgstr "可选 peer 缺席，集成被引用"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:206
msgid ""
"**D2** — the dedicated missing-peer diagnostic; never a bare unresolved name"
msgstr "**D2**——专门的缺失 peer 诊断；绝不是光秃秃的 unresolved name"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:207
msgid "peer present (any reason)"
msgstr "peer 在场（无论何种原因）"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:207
msgid "the integration mounts automatically — presence-based resolution"
msgstr "集成自动挂载——基于在场的解析"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:208
msgid "self-build / dev mode"
msgstr "自构建 / dev 模式"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:208
msgid "dev-deps guarantee presence; no missing case exists"
msgstr "dev-deps 保证在场；不存在缺失情形"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:209
msgid "a `peer-deps` path that does not resolve"
msgstr "一个解析不了的 `peer-deps` 路径"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:209
msgid ""
"**D3** — loud manifest error at the pkg's own build; for consumers, required ⇒ D1, optional ⇒ inert"
msgstr "**D3**——包自身构建时响亮的清单错误；对消费方，必填 ⇒ D1，可选 ⇒ 惰性"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:211
msgid ""
"The four diagnostics, verbatim shapes (all load/resolution-time errors, never runtime traps):"
msgstr "四条诊断，逐字形状（全是加载/解析期错误，绝不是运行时陷阱）："


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:214
msgid ""
"**D1** — `pkg \\`json\\` requires the peer \\`nmapset\\`, and \\`nmapset\\` is not in this program's closure — peers are not pulled transitively: add \"nmapset\": { \"path\": \"..\" } to your \\`rut.jsonc\\` \\`deps\\``"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:217
msgid ""
"**D2** — `cannot resolve \\`pouch\\` — \\`json\\`'s pouch integration is not mounted because the optional peer \\`pouch\\` is absent from this program's closure; add \"pouch\": { \"path\": \"..\" } to your \\`rut.jsonc\\` \\`deps\\``. Declaring packages scan in mount order, so the diagnostic is deterministic when several packages declare the same peer. Required peers never reach this path — D1 fires at mount."
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:223
msgid ""
"**D3** — three shapes, all _a packaging bug in json_: cannot read a manifest at the peer path; the manifest there names it `other`; cannot read the group file."
msgstr "**D3**——三种形状，全是 _json 的打包 bug_：读不到 peer 路径处的清单；该处清单把名字写成 `other`；读不到分组文件。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:226
msgid "**D4** — the cross-table collision (both texts quoted above)."
msgstr "**D4**——跨表冲突（两段文本均引用于上文）。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:228
msgid "Interplay"
msgstr "相互作用"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:230
msgid ""
"**Placement and orphans — the gate precedes the check.** The peer gate runs at load; impl placement and pair-uniqueness run at compile/link. Peer absent ⇒ the group text was never assembled ⇒ there is no impl anywhere to place. Peer present ⇒ the group's impl is a trait impl in the declaring package — legal placement, since trait impls may live in any module ([Traits and dispatch](traits.md))."
msgstr ""
"**放置与孤儿——门先于检查。**peer 门在加载时运行；impl 放置与组合唯一性在编译/链接时运行。peer 缺席 ⇒ 分组文本从未被组装 ⇒ 任何地方都没有 impl 可放置。peer 在场 ⇒ 分组的 impl 是声明包里的一个 trait impl——合法放置，因为 trait impl 可以住在任何模块（[trait 与分派](traits.md)）。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:236
msgid ""
"**The duplicate-pair link error is the consumer-side guard**: a consumer who hand-writes the same `impl Trait for Type` in a world where the group mounted gets the link-time duplicate — loud and correct; the group already provides it."
msgstr ""
"**重复组合的链接错误是消费方一侧的守卫**：在分组已挂载的世界里，手写同一个 `impl Trait for Type` 的消费方会得到链接期的重复错误——响亮且正确；分组已经提供了它。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:240
msgid ""
"**Binary format untouched.** Impl-only groups declare no host fns (no binding obligations appear or vanish), add no binary sections, and touch nothing the verifier reads. A consumer's binary differs only by which impls registered — ordinary program content."
msgstr ""
"**二进制格式不受触动。**只含 impl 的分组不声明宿主函数（不出现也不消失任何绑定义务），不添加二进制节，也不触碰校验器读取的任何东西。消费方的二进制只是注册了哪些 impl 有所不同——普通的程序内容。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:244
msgid ""
"**Dev-deps are invisible to bundles-as-consumers.** A packed package carries its peer groups; a consumer packing _their_ app never pulls the package's dev table (pass 2 is root-only), so dev-only convenience packages cannot leak into consumer worlds ([Module bundles](bundles.md))."
msgstr ""
"**对作为消费方的捆绑包而言 dev-deps 不可见。**打包的包携带自己的 peer 分组；打包_自己_应用的消费方从不拉取该包的 dev 表（第 2 趟仅限根），因此纯 dev 的便利包不会泄漏进消费方世界（[模块捆绑包](bundles.md)）。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:249
msgid ""
"**The LSP completes group impls unconditionally.** Peer gating is a resolution-time concept the language server does not model; it embeds the toolchain packages' sources and never parses manifests. Recorded as accepted: the LSP is advisory; the compiler is the law."
msgstr ""
"**LSP 无条件补全分组 impl。**peer 门控是语言服务器不建模的解析期概念；它内嵌工具链包的源码，从不解析清单。记录为已接受：LSP 是建议性的；编译器才是法则。"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:254
msgid "Consuming a peer-gated package"
msgstr "消费一个 peer 门控的包"


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:256
msgid ""
"```jsonc\n"
"// an app that wants json's pouch integration\n"
"{\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    \"json\":  { \"path\": \"vendor/json\" },\n"
"    // presence is the only requirement\n"
"    \"pouch\": { \"path\": \"vendor/pouch\" }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/dependency-kinds.md:267
msgid ""
"The group mounts because `pouch` is anywhere in the closure — no extra declaration beyond having the package. Drop the `pouch` row and `json` mounts light; the first `use pouch::` or trait dispatch into the integration produces D2 instead of a mystery."
msgstr ""
"分组之所以挂载，是因为 `pouch` 出现在闭包的任何角落——除了拥有这个包，无需任何额外声明。删掉 `pouch` 行，`json` 就轻量挂载；第一次 `use pouch::` 或进入集成的 trait 分派会产出 D2，而不是一个谜团。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:3
msgid ""
"The `rut` binary is the toolchain's command-line face. It is also a **full host**: running a program mounts the base packages, binds the standard native bodies, and drives the async loop — the same contract an embedded host implements ([embedding and native modules](embedding.md))."
msgstr ""
"`rut` 二进制是工具链的命令行门面。它同时也是一个**完整宿主**：运行程序时会挂载基础包、绑定标准原生函数体，并驱动异步循环——与嵌入式宿主实现的是同一份契约（[嵌入与原生模块](embedding.md)）。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:8
msgid ""
"It is the **temporary-run** lane: running module directories and bundles, `fmt`, `dump`, `pack`. The intended consumption path is depending on the engine crates from your own project through a Cargo git dependency ([installation](../quick-start/installation.md)) and embedding the VM ([embedding and native modules](embedding.md)) — this page documents the binary itself."
msgstr ""
"它是**临时运行**车道：运行模块目录与捆绑包，`fmt`、`dump`、`pack`。预期的使用方式是通过 Cargo git 依赖，从你自己的项目依赖引擎 crate（[安装](../quick-start/installation.md)）并嵌入 VM（[嵌入与原生模块](embedding.md)）——本页只记录这个二进制本身。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:23
msgid "Running `rut` with no subcommand prints the usage line to stderr."
msgstr "不带子命令运行 `rut` 会把用法行打印到 stderr。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:25 src/reference/cli.md:163
msgid "`run`"
msgstr "`run`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:27
msgid ""
"Compiles and executes. Two input forms — every rut program is a module directory ([project structure](project-structure.md)), so there is no loose-file shape:"
msgstr "编译并执行。两种输入形式——每个 rut 程序都是模块目录（[项目结构](project-structure.md)），所以不存在散文件形态："


#: src/reference/cli.md:31
msgid "input"
msgstr "输入"


#: src/reference/cli.md:31
msgid "pipeline"
msgstr "流水线"


#: src/reference/cli.md:33
msgid "`dir` (a module directory with `rut.jsonc`)"
msgstr "`dir`（带 `rut.jsonc` 的模块目录）"


#: src/reference/cli.md:33
msgid ""
"load the whole graph, compile it, run the root's `main` ([project structure](project-structure.md))"
msgstr "加载整张图，编译它，运行根的 `main`（[项目结构](project-structure.md)）"


#: src/reference/cli.md:34
msgid "`mod.rutbundle`"
msgstr "`mod.rutbundle`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:34
msgid "the packed form of the same contract ([module bundles](bundles.md))"
msgstr "同一契约的打包形态（[模块捆绑包](bundles.md)）"


#: src/reference/cli.md:36
msgid ""
"Anything else is refused at the door (exit 2): a loose `.rut` file is not a runnable unit — give the directory a `rut.jsonc` (`{\"name\": \"…\", \"entry\": {\"lib\": \"./<file>.rut\"}}` — JSONC: `//` comments and trailing commas are legal), or run a packed `.rutbundle`."
msgstr ""
"其他任何输入都会在门口被拒绝（退出码 2）：散的 `.rut` 文件不是可运行单元——给目录一个 `rut.jsonc`（`{\"name\": \"…\", \"entry\": {\"lib\": \"./<file>.rut\"}}`——JSONC：`//` 注释与尾随逗号合法），或运行打包好的 `.rutbundle`。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:42
msgid "Flags and defaults:"
msgstr "旗标与默认值："


#: src/reference/cli.md:44 src/reference/cli.md:148
msgid "item"
msgstr "条目"


#: src/reference/cli.md:46
msgid "`--fuel N`"
msgstr "`--fuel N`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:46
msgid ""
"cap the op budget per turn. Fuel is opt-in: without the flag the run is uncapped; a missing or unparsable value is a loud error (exit 2) — no silent default"
msgstr "为每轮操作预算设上限。燃料需显式开启：不带该旗标时运行不设上限；缺少或无法解析的值是响亮的错误（退出码 2）——没有静默默认值"


#: src/reference/cli.md:47
msgid "`--symbols <file.rutsym>`"
msgstr "`--symbols <file.rutsym>`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:47
msgid ""
"restore a [stripped artifact's](symbol-stripping.md) private symbol table — legal only against a compiled `.rutbundle` (the directory lane compiles fresh and needs no map; anything else is a usage error, exit 2). The table restores before the graph compiles, so linking and every trace see real names; sections naming modules the bundle does not carry warn"
msgstr ""
"还原[已剥离产物](symbol-stripping.md)的私有符号表——只对编译的 `.rutbundle` 合法（目录车道重新编译，不需要映射；其他任何输入都是用法错误，退出码 2）。符号表在图编译之前还原，所以链接与每条追踪看到的都是真实名字；命名了捆绑包未携带模块的分节会告警"


#: src/reference/cli.md:48
msgid "fixed at 64 MiB"
msgstr "固定为 64 MiB"


#: src/reference/cli.md:49
msgid "interrupt check"
msgstr "中断检查"


#: src/reference/cli.md:49
msgid "every 1024 ops"
msgstr "每 1024 个操作"


#: src/reference/cli.md:51
msgid "Bodies bound by `run`:"
msgstr "`run` 绑定的函数体："


#: src/reference/cli.md:53
msgid "installer"
msgstr "安装器"


#: src/reference/cli.md:55
msgid "`calc`'s float fns"
msgstr "`calc` 的浮点函数"


#: src/reference/cli.md:56
msgid "`logger::pkg` (sink: stdout)"
msgstr "`logger::pkg` (sink: stdout)"


#: src/reference/cli.md:56
msgid "the logger; silent no-op unless the program uses `ink`"
msgstr "logger；除非程序使用 `ink`，否则是无声的空操作"


#: src/reference/cli.md:57
msgid "the native key table behind `nmapset`"
msgstr "`nmapset` 背后的原生键表"


#: src/reference/cli.md:58
msgid "the crossing-benchmark rows"
msgstr "跨越基准测试行"


#: src/reference/cli.md:59
msgid "the async launchers"
msgstr "异步启动器"


#: src/reference/cli.md:62
msgid ""
"Execution: `main` is called with no arguments; then the async driving loop runs — drain the ready queue, advance the virtual clock to the next timer deadline, repeat until no frames and no tasks remain. The loop is capped, so a program that never idles fails loudly instead of hanging."
msgstr ""
"执行：`main` 无实参调用；然后异步驱动循环运行——排空就绪队列、把虚拟时钟推进到下一个定时器期限，如此往复，直到没有帧也没有任务残留。循环设有上限，因此永不空闲的程序会响亮失败而不是挂死。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:67
msgid ""
"A `.d.rut` input is refused: a declaration file is a surface, not a runnable module ([host fns and declaration files](host-fns.md))."
msgstr "`.d.rut` 输入会被拒绝：声明文件是表面，不是可运行的模块（[宿主函数与声明文件](host-fns.md)）。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:70 src/reference/cli.md:163
msgid "`fmt`"
msgstr "`fmt`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:77
msgid "The canonical formatter. Behavior:"
msgstr "规范的格式化器。行为："


#: src/reference/cli.md:79
msgid ""
"a **directory** argument is walked recursively; every `.rut` file is collected (sorted) and formatted;"
msgstr "**目录**实参会被递归遍历；每个 `.rut` 文件被收集（排序）并格式化；"


#: src/reference/cli.md:81
msgid ""
"style comes from the nearest ancestor `rut.jsonc`'s `style` block; no manifest → defaults ([project structure](project-structure.md));"
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/cli.md:83
msgid "`.d.rut` files are formatted in declaration mode;"
msgstr "`.d.rut` 文件以声明模式格式化；"


#: src/reference/cli.md:84
msgid ""
"a file that does not parse clean is **refused** (diagnostics listed, nonzero exit) — fmt never reformats on a parse error;"
msgstr "解析不干净的文件会被**拒绝**（列出诊断，非零退出）——fmt 绝不在解析错误时重排；"


#: src/reference/cli.md:86
msgid ""
"default mode rewrites in place and prints `formatted: <path>` per changed file;"
msgstr "默认模式就地重写，并对每个变更文件打印 `formatted: <path>`；"


#: src/reference/cli.md:88
msgid ""
"`--check` writes nothing: it prints `unformatted: <path>` for each would-change file and exits nonzero, or `fmt: N file(s) formatted` when everything is clean."
msgstr ""
"`--check` 不写任何东西：它为每个将要变更的文件打印 `unformatted: <path>` 并以非零码退出；当一切干净时打印 `fmt: N file(s) formatted`。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:92
msgid "`pack`"
msgstr "`pack`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:95
msgid ""
"# packed plugins/server -> server.rutbundle (18304 bytes)\n"
msgstr ""
"# packed plugins/server -> server.rutbundle (18304 bytes)\n"


#: src/reference/cli.md:97
msgid ""
"# packed plugins/server -> plugins/server.rutbundle (...) + symbol table\n"
msgstr ""
"# packed plugins/server -> plugins/server.rutbundle (...) + symbol table\n"


#: src/reference/cli.md:102
msgid ""
"Packs a module directory into a **deterministic** `.rutbundle` — same input, same bytes. Without `-o`, the output is written beside the input as `<dir-name>.rutbundle`. A **lib** pkg packs **compiled** (format_version 9): the root and every linkable package ride as `.rutc` binaries (bodies + surface — the linking truth), splice-needed packages (generic exports, trait-object parameters, `inline`) and host pkgs ride as source groups, and a scope ledger lets any loader rebase the binaries onto its own numbering. A root that cannot link is refused — share the directory instead. A **`type = \"host\"` pkg packs as a v10 decl root** (its `.d.rut` surface riding as source, single-package), `--strip` refuses there (`no symbols to strip`), and `run` accepts either bundle directly — though running a host bundle refuses with intent: bind its rows from the embedder ([module bundles](bundles.md))."
msgstr ""


#: src/reference/cli.md:117
msgid ""
"`--strip` mangles every renameable name and strips the symbolication tables from the emitted binaries, writing the private symbol table at the sibling path `<out-without-ext>.rutsym` — the sidecar is never an entry inside the bundle. It needs a fully-compiled closure: a source group that could bind a compiled group's surface is a pointed refusal. See [Symbol stripping and `.rutsym` sidecars](symbol-stripping.md)."
msgstr ""
"`--strip` 把每个可改名的名字改名，并从产出的二进制里剥离符号化表，把私有符号表写在旁边的路径 `<out-without-ext>.rutsym`——旁车绝不是捆绑包里的一个条目。它需要一个全编译的闭包：可能绑定某编译组表面的源码组会被明确拒绝。见[符号剥离与 `.rutsym` 旁车](symbol-stripping.md)。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:124 src/reference/cli.md:163
msgid "`dump`"
msgstr "`dump`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:130
msgid ""
"Prints the compiler's view of one file: the `== AST ==` section followed by `== IR ==` (per-function typed register tables and op listings). Compilation is the same base-mounted pipeline `run` uses, minus execution and verification. `.d.rut` inputs dump in declaration mode — useful for inspecting a host surface's slots."
msgstr ""
"打印编译器眼中单个文件的样子：`== AST ==` 一节，后跟 `== IR ==`（每函数的带类型寄存器表与操作清单）。编译用的是与 `run` 相同的基础挂载流水线，只是去掉执行与校验。`.d.rut` 输入以声明模式转储——适合检视宿主表面的槽位。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:136
msgid "`fetch`"
msgstr "`fetch`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:139
msgid ""
"# CI: warm the cache while the network is up\n"
msgstr ""
"# CI：趁有网络时预热缓存\n"


#: src/reference/cli.md:142
msgid ""
"Loads a module **directory** with the url-dep remote and discards the session — every `deps` url is fetched (or found in the cache) and pinned, so a later offline `run` hits only the cache. A `.rutbundle` argument is refused: bundles are closed — there is nothing to fetch. The cache and the eviction law are the same lane `run`/`pack` use:"
msgstr ""
"用 url 依赖远程加载模块**目录**并丢弃会话 — `deps` 的每个 url 都被拉取（或命中缓存）并校验固定值，此后的离线 `run` 只命中缓存。`.rutbundle` 参数被拒绝：捆绑包是封闭的 — 无可拉取。缓存与驱逐法则和 `run`/`pack` 用的是同一条车道："


#: src/reference/cli.md:150
msgid "cache root"
msgstr "缓存根目录"


#: src/reference/cli.md:150
msgid ""
"`<project>/.rut/cache` — project-local, hermetic; `$RUT_CACHE_DIR` overrides the root (CLI-side only — the driver never reads env). Entries named `<sha256(url)>.rutbundle`"
msgstr ""
"`<project>/.rut/cache`——工程本地、封闭；`$RUT_CACHE_DIR` 覆盖缓存根（仅 CLI 一侧——驱动从不读环境变量）。条目名为 `<sha256(url)>.rutbundle`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:151
msgid "cache-first"
msgstr "缓存优先"


#: src/reference/cli.md:151
msgid "a hit never touches the network — offline reloads are the point"
msgstr "命中则绝不触碰网络 — 离线重载正是目的"


#: src/reference/cli.md:152
msgid "miss"
msgstr "未命中"


#: src/reference/cli.md:152
msgid ""
"GET (redirects on), non-2xx is a loud error, a size cap refuses without buffering, the write is atomic (tmp + rename)"
msgstr "GET（跟随重定向），非 2xx 是响亮的错误，大小上限不缓冲即拒绝，写入是原子的（tmp + rename）"


#: src/reference/cli.md:153
msgid "poisoned entry"
msgstr "被污染的条目"


#: src/reference/cli.md:153
msgid ""
"the `sha256` pin is the loader's law at the mount door; when it refuses, the CLI maps the url back to its cache path, deletes the entry, and exits 2 — the next run re-fetches and heals"
msgstr "`sha256` 固定值是加载器在挂载门的法则；它拒绝时，CLI 把 url 映射回其缓存路径，删除该条目并以 2 退出 — 下一次运行重新拉取并自愈"


#: src/reference/cli.md:155
msgid ""
"The wire is the driver's `http` feature (default on) — a build with `default-features = false` (the wasm graphs) has no transport at all: a cache miss errors loudly instead of networking."
msgstr ""
"线路是驱动 crate 的 `http` feature（默认开启）——`default-features = false` 的构建（wasm 图）完全没有传输层：缓存未命中时响亮报错，而不是联网。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:161
msgid "The file extension selects the parser mode:"
msgstr "文件扩展名选择解析器模式："


#: src/reference/cli.md:163
msgid "mode"
msgstr "模式"


