msgid "`*.rut`"
msgstr "`*.rut`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:165
msgid "implementation"
msgstr "实现"


#: src/reference/cli.md:165
msgid "runs `main`"
msgstr "运行 `main`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:165
msgid "formats impls"
msgstr "格式化 impl"


#: src/reference/cli.md:165
msgid "AST + IR of the module"
msgstr "模块的 AST + IR"


#: src/reference/cli.md:166
msgid "`*.d.rut`"
msgstr "`*.d.rut`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:166
msgid "declaration"
msgstr "声明"


#: src/reference/cli.md:166
msgid "refused (exit 2)"
msgstr "拒绝（退出码 2）"


#: src/reference/cli.md:166
msgid "formats the surface"
msgstr "格式化表面"


#: src/reference/cli.md:166
msgid "the surface's AST + IR"
msgstr "表面的 AST + IR"


#: src/reference/cli.md:168
msgid "Exit codes"
msgstr "退出码"


#: src/reference/cli.md:170
msgid "code"
msgstr "码"


#: src/reference/cli.md:172
msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:172
msgid "success"
msgstr "成功"


#: src/reference/cli.md:173
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:173
msgid ""
"compile diagnostics; no binary emitted; binary decode or verify failure; VM boot failure; a trap at run; `fmt` refuses a file that does not parse; `fmt --check` found drift; `pack` or output-write failure"
msgstr ""
"编译诊断；未发出二进制；二进制解码或校验失败；VM 启动失败；运行中的陷阱；`fmt` 拒绝解析不了的文件；`fmt --check` 发现漂移；`pack` 或输出写入失败"


#: src/reference/cli.md:174
msgid "`2`"
msgstr "`2`"


#: src/reference/cli.md:174
msgid ""
"usage errors (missing arguments); unreadable input file; `run` on a `.d.rut`; `run` on an input that is neither a module directory nor a `.rutbundle`; `fmt` finds no `.rut` files under a directory; a url dep's `sha256` pin refusal (the poisoned cache entry is evicted)"
msgstr ""
"用法错误（缺参数）；输入文件不可读；对 `.d.rut` 运行 `run`；`run` 的输入既不是模块目录也不是 `.rutbundle`；`fmt` 在目录下找不到 `.rut` 文件；url 依赖的 `sha256` 固定值拒绝（中毒的缓存条目会被驱逐）"


#: src/reference/cli.md:176
msgid "Diagnostics go to stderr; `pack`'s success line goes to stdout."
msgstr "诊断走 stderr；`pack` 的成功行走 stdout。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:180
msgid ""
"The CLI mounts and binds on behalf of the program, but it never injects names the program did not declare: a program that never spells `use ink::` gets no logger; one that never mounts the async packages has no launcher and `await` stays cold-poll inline ([core and the swappable packages](stdlib.md))."
msgstr ""
"CLI 代表程序挂载与绑定，但它绝不注入程序没有声明的名字：从未写出 `use ink::` 的程序得不到 logger；从不挂载异步包的程序没有启动器，`await` 保持内联的冷轮询（[core 与可换包](stdlib.md)）。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:185
msgid "The HTTP lane is native-only: the CLI build carries it, wasm builds do not."
msgstr "HTTP 链路仅限原生：CLI 构建携带它，wasm 构建不携带。"


#: src/reference/cli.md:187
msgid ""
"`run` on a module directory is the deployment path for development; `pack` + `run <bundle>` is the shipping path — both run the identical contract ([loading and the embed loop](loading.md))."
msgstr ""
"对模块目录执行 `run` 是开发期的部署路径；`pack` + `run <bundle>` 是发布路径——两者运行完全相同的契约（[加载与嵌入循环](loading.md)）。"

